<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PSA" style="id">- Guji Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Kitaaba Faaru'uu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kitaaba Faaru'uu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kitaaba Faaru'uu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Far.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Kitaaba Faaru'uu</para>
  <para style="imt">Seensa</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitaab faaru'uu Kitaaba Woyyicha keessatti kitaaba mara caalaa dheerata. Faaruun tun nama tokkoon yookiin nama heddu'uun faarfanti yookiin dubbifanti. Kitaaba kana keessa faaruu dhibba tokkoo fi shantamatti jira. Hedduu isaanii ka barreesse mooticha Daawiti. Faaruun tun bara dheeraa keessatti wolitti qabantee, sirna waaqonfannaa kolbaa Israa'eliitiif teete. Faaruun tokko tokko meya faaru'uu ka attamiitii fi yoyyoma attamii hordofiisa akka malte sooressa faarfattootaa akeekan. Fakkeennaaf faaruun arfeesso'ootii fi faaruun afurtamii shaneesso'oo kana ilaala. Leellisi, galati, dhugeeffannaan, addiin, araara gaafatiisi, addatamummaan Waaqaatii fi qarqaarsi isaa, yaadi gugurdaan Kitaaba Woyyichaa kun faaruu keessatti mudhifamaneeran.</para>
  <para style="ip">Handhurti yaada faaruu tanaa Waaqatti addatiisa. Barreessitooti faaruu tanaa Waaqa galateeffatiisaan yookiin rakkoo ifii himiisaan fedhii ifii ta dhuga'aa dhikeessan.</para>
  <para style="ip">Israa'elii durii keessatti faaruu tana haala adda addaa keessatti itti fayyadamaa turane. Haalli kunille: 1. Waaqa galateeffatiisaaf, faaruu 105:2. Gadda mudhisiisaaf, faaruu 13; 3. Barsiisiisaaf, Faaruu 1; 4. Moototi Israa'elii akka haqa muranu daadimatiisaaf, faaruu 72:5. Waaqi dada mara irratti baallii inni qabu himiisaaf, faaruu 47:6. Yerusaalemiif jaalala mudhisiisaaf, faaruu 122:7. Guyyaa jilaatiif, faaruu 126.</para>
  <para style="ip">Faaruun hedduun kaayoo tokko caalaa qabaatiisa dande'an. Goottaan keenna Yesuus Kiristoos lallabaa fi barsiisa ifii keessatti faaruu tana keessaa yennaa hedduu itti fayyadameera. Barreessitooti Gondooroo Haareyaalle itti deddeebi'anee faaruu tana keessaa fuudhanee barreessaneeran. Wolde'i Kiristaanaa ka jalqabaa Waaqa waaqonfatiisaaf, karaa Yesuus Kiristoosiitiin waan dansaa Waaqi godheef, faaruu tanatti fayyadamaneeran. Fakkeennaaf kitaaba faaru'uu keessaa 118:22 Gondooroo Haareya keessatti yennaa jaa barreeffameera.</para>
  <para style="ipi">Kitaab faaru'uu kutaa shanitti qoodama; kutaa qaraatii fi lammeesso'oo irra caalaa mooticha Daawititti barreesse: Kutaa sadeesso'oo Asaaf yookiin ijoollee Qoraahiititti barreesse:</para>
  <para style="ipi">Faaruun 120—134 faaruu guyyaa jilaa ti: Kutaan faaru'uu shanan:</para>
  <para style="iot">Haadhoo Dubbi'ii</para>
  <para style="io2">Faaruu <char style="ior"><ref loc="PSA 1-41">1—41</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">Faaruu <char style="ior"><ref loc="PSA 42-72">42—72</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io2">Faaruu <char style="ior"><ref loc="PSA 73-89">73—89</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io2">Faaruu <char style="ior"><ref loc="PSA 90-106">90—106</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io2">Faaruu <char style="ior"><ref loc="PSA 107-150">107—150</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PSA 1"/>
  <para style="ms">Kitaaba tokkeesso'oo</para>
  <para style="mr">(<ref loc="PSA 1-41">Far. 1—41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="s1">Karaa Lama</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 1:1"/>Nami gorsa hamaaleyyi'iitiin hin ideenne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:1">ka karaa cubbaaleyyi'ii hin hordonne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:1">ka worra busheeshu woliin tokkummaa hin qanne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:1">ka gammade.<verse eid="PSA 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 1:2"/>Nami akkasii ammoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:2">seera Mootii Waan Maraatiin gammada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:2">halkanii fi guyyaa seeruma isaa yaadata.<verse eid="PSA 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 1:3"/>Inni akka muka laga qarqaratti dhaabamee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:3">yennaa yenna'aan midhaan buusuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:3">ka baalli isaa hin qoorree ti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:3">Wonni inni huju marti isaaf hin teeti.<verse eid="PSA 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 1:4"/>Hamaaleyyiin ammoo akkasii moti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:4">isaan akka hicaacee qilleensi haxowee deemuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 1:5"/>Tanaaf, hamaaleyyiin muraa jalaa hin bayanu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:5">cubbaalleyyiille yaa'ii balchootaa keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:5">hin dhaggamanu.<verse eid="PSA 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 1:6"/>Tanaaf, Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:6">karaa balchootaa hin beeka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:6">karaan hamaaleyyi'ii ammoo hin bada.<verse eid="PSA 1:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PSA 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Mootii Waaqi Filate</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 2:1"/>Gosi biyya adda addaa maaf finqilti?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:1">Kolbaan maaf mala bu'aa hin qanne dhootti?<verse eid="PSA 2:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 2:2"/>Mootii Waan Maraatii fi ka inni muude mormiisaaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:2">moototi lafaa hin kakka'an;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:2">bulchitootille isaan woliin mala isaanitti dhootti.<verse eid="PSA 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 2:3"/>Isaan, «Kowa'a, wodaroo sibiilaa ta isaanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:3">ifi irraa kunnuu ti!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:3">Wodaroo isaaniille ifi irraa gannuu ti» jedhan.<verse eid="PSA 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 2:4"/>Ka ol-gubbaa jiru hin kolla; Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:4">isaanitti hin murga.<verse eid="PSA 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 2:5"/>Achiin duuba Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:5">aari'iin isaan hin xixa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:5">Mufii ifiitiin isaan hin bararassa.<verse eid="PSA 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 2:6"/>Inni, «Ani gaara kiyya woyyicha Xiyoon irratti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:6">mootii kiyya muudeera» jedha.<verse eid="PSA 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 2:7"/>Mootichi, «Ani lassii Mootii Waan Maraa hin lassa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:7">inni anaan, ‹Ati ilma kiyya; ani adha si uumadhe.<verse eid="PSA 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 2:8"/>Na gaafadhu; gosa biyya adda addaa mara sii kenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:8">kolbaan biyya lafaa marti qabeenna keeti hin teeti.<verse eid="PSA 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 2:9"/>Ati ulee bokku'uu ta sibiilaatiin isaan hin bulchita.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:9">Akka okkote'ee isaan hin butuchita› jedhe» jedha.<verse eid="PSA 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 2:10"/>Tanaaf, isin mootoleen qalbeeffadha'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:10">isin bulchitooti biyya lafaa ifi eeggadha'a.<verse eid="PSA 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 2:11"/>Sodaa guddo'oon Mootii Waan Maraa tajaajila'a.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:11">Rommiisaan isaaf ajajama'a.<verse eid="PSA 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 2:12"/>Mufiin isaa ariiti'iin waan dhuttuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:12">isinitti mufatee akka isin hin balleessine,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:12">qulqullumma'aan waaqonfadha'a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 2:12">Worri gara isaa baqatu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:12">ka gammade.<verse eid="PSA 2:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PSA 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Daadimata Ganamaa</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Daawiti yennaa ilma ifii Abiishaalom duraa baqate faarse.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 3:1"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:1">diinoti kiyya attam attam bacatan!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:1">Kolbaan hedduun na irratti kaateerti.<verse eid="PSA 3:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 3:2"/>Worri hedduun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:2">«Waaqi isa hin baasu» anaan jedhan.<verse eid="PSA 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 3:3"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:3">ati ammoo adaala kiyyatti wontee tiyya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:3">ati ulfinna kiyya; ka mataa kiyyalle ol ol qabu si'i.<verse eid="PSA 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 3:4"/>Ani qoonqoo ol qabadhee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:4">gara Mootii Waan Maraa hin iyya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:4">innille gaara woyyicha ifii irraa naa hin dhage'a.<verse eid="PSA 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 3:5"/>Ani irkadhee hin rafa; Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:5">waan na eeguuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:5">deebi'ee hin dammaqa.<verse eid="PSA 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 3:6"/>Ani loltoota kuma hedduu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:6">ka na marsaneeranu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:6">hin sodaadhu.<verse eid="PSA 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 3:7"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa, ka'i!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:7">Waaqa kiyya, koyii na baasi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 3:7">Boqoo diinota kiyyaa dhowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:7">ilkaan isaaniille caccassi.<verse eid="PSA 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 3:8"/>Qarqaarsi Mootii Waan Maraa biraa dhufa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:8">Ee Mootii Waan Maraa, eebbi keeti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:8">kolbaa teeti irra jiraatuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 3:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PSA 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Daadimata Waaqatti Addatiisaan Dhikaatu</para>
  <para style="s2">Sooressa faarfattootaatiif, faaruu Daawitii ta meya ribu'uutiin faarfatante.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 4:1"/>Ee Waaqa balchaa kiyya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:1">yennaa ani si waamu naaf owwaadhu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 4:1">Yennaa ani rakkoo keessa jiru</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:1">ati ammoo bilisa na baacha.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:1">Ammalle naa mararii daadimata kiyya dhage'i.<verse eid="PSA 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 4:2"/>Ee Kolba'a, isin haga yoomii ulfinna kiyya salphittan?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:2">Haga yoomii waan bu'aa hin qanne jaalattan?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:2">Haga yoomii dhara barbaaddan?<verse eid="PSA 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 4:3"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa worra isaaf addatamaa te'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:3">akka filate beeka'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:3">yennaa ani isa waammadhu naaf hin dhage'a.<verse eid="PSA 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 4:4"/>Isin yennaa aartanulle cubbuu hin hujina'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:4">isin yennaa taqee teessan irra jirtanu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:4">cadhisa'aatii qalbii teessan keessatti itti yaadadha'a.<verse eid="PSA 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 4:5"/>Ciincaa sirrii te'e dhikeessa'aatii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:5">Mootii Waan Maraatitti addadha'a.<verse eid="PSA 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 4:6"/>Namooti, «Waan dansaa eentu nutti mudhisa?» jedhanee gaafatanu heddu'u;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:6">ee Mootii Waan Maraa, ifi fuula keetii nu irratti ifuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 4:7"/>Gammada worri dhibiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:7">midhaanii fi woynii ifii irraa dhaggatu caalaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:7">ati na gammachiitteerta.<verse eid="PSA 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 4:8"/>Mootii Waan Maraa, ka nageyaan na eegu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:8">si qofa waan te'eef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:8">ani yennaa irkadhu, nageyaan rafa.<verse eid="PSA 4:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="PSA 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Daadimata Diina Jalaa Bayiisaaf dhikaate</para>
  <para style="s2">Sooressa faarfattootaatiif, faaruu Daawitii ta suusulle'een faarfatante.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 5:1"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa, dubbii tiyya caqasi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:1">aadiisa kiyyalle dhage'i.<verse eid="PSA 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 5:2"/>Mootii kiyya, Waaqa kiyya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:2">ani waan si daadimadhuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:2">iyya tiyya naa dhage'i.<verse eid="PSA 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 5:3"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:3">ganama qoonqoo tiyya hin dhageetta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:3">ganama mara si daadimadhee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:3">deebii si irraa eegadha.<verse eid="PSA 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 5:4"/>Ati Waaqa hammeennatti gammaduu moti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:4">hammeennille si woliin hin le'u.<verse eid="PSA 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 5:5"/>Koorameeyyiin si dura hin dhaabbattu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:5">worra hantuu huju mara hin jibbita.<verse eid="PSA 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 5:6"/>Ati dharaameyyii mara hin balleessita;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:6">worra nama ijjeesuu fi nama sobu hin jibbita.<verse eid="PSA 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 5:7"/>Ani ammoo jaalala keeti ka bara baraatiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:7">gara mana keetii seena;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:7">si sodaatiisalle'een</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:7">gara Dunkaanii Woyyittii teetii garagalee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:7">hin sagada.<verse eid="PSA 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 5:8"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:8">diinota bacaa waan qabuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:8">balchummaa teetiin na sooressi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:8">karaa keeti naaf qajeelchi.<verse eid="PSA 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 5:9"/>Diinoti kiyya dhugaa hin dubbatanu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:9">gadhaan isaanii badi'iin guutameera.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 5:9">Afaan isaanii akka boolla awwaalaa ta banantee ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:9">arraba ifiitiin maltee dubbatan.<verse eid="PSA 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 5:10"/>Ee Waaqa, yakkaa isaanii isaanitti muri;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:10">malli isaaniituu badii isaanitti fiduu ti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 5:10">Isaan si irratti waan ka'aneef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:10">sababa cubbuu isaanii heddu'uutiif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:10">alatti isaan gati.<verse eid="PSA 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 5:11"/>Worri gara keeti baqatu marti ammoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:11">gammaduu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:11">isaan haga bara baraa ilillisanuu ti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 5:11">Worri maqaa keeti jaalatu marti si'itti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:11">gammadee akka firinxiixu isaan eegi.<verse eid="PSA 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 5:12"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:12">ati balchoota hin eebbitta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:12">fedhii teeti dansa'aan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:12">akka wonte'ee isaan marsi.<verse eid="PSA 5:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="PSA 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Daadimata Yennaa Rakkinnaa</para>
  <para style="s2">Sooressa faarfattootaatiif, faaruu Daawitii ta meya ribu'uutiin faarfatante.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 6:1"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa, aari'iin na hin xixin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:1">yookiin mufi'iin na hin adabin.<verse eid="PSA 6:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 6:2"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa, ani dadhabaa waan te'eef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:2">naaf marari;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 6:2">Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:2">lafeen tiyya soda'aan waan na sheephitteef</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:2">na fayyisi.<verse eid="PSA 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 6:3"/>Lubbuun tiyya guddoo na raafanteerti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:3">Ee Mootii Waan Maraa, na qarqaariisaaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:3">ati haga yoomii turta?<verse eid="PSA 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 6:4"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa, deebi'ii na baasi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:4">jaalala keeti ka bara baraatiif jedhii na hamburi.<verse eid="PSA 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 6:5"/>Nami du'ee si qaabatu hin jiru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:5">boolla awwaalaa keessaa ka si leellisu eennu?<verse eid="PSA 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 6:6"/>Ani aadiisaan dadhabeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:6">halkan mara bowaan taqee tiyya maxanqeessee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:6">imimmaaniin boraatii tiyya tortorse.<verse eid="PSA 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 6:7"/>Akka malee waan gaddeef</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:7">ilti tiyya dhagguu dadhaddeerti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:7">sababa diinota kiyya maraatiif</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:7">ilti tiyya caararrootteerti.<verse eid="PSA 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 6:8"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa bowa tiyya waan dhage'eef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:8">isin worri hamaaleyyiin marti na irraa fagaadha'a.<verse eid="PSA 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 6:9"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa iyya tiyya dhage'eera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:9">inni daadimata kiyyaaf deebii hin kenna.<verse eid="PSA 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 6:10"/>Diinoti kiyya marti hin qaanowan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:10">guddoo hin sodaatanille'e;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:10">dedhuma salphatanee, gara duubaa hin deebi'an.<verse eid="PSA 6:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="PSA 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Daadimata Marroo Muraa Haqaa</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Daawitii ta gaddaa, ta inni marroo Kuushii gosa Beniyaaminiitiif, gara Mootii Waan Maraa faarse.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 7:1"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa Waaqa kiyya, ani gara keeti baqadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:1">worra na ari'u jalaa na hamburii, na baasi!<verse eid="PSA 7:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 7:2"/>Yoo akkas hin te'in, addee nami na irraa buusu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:2">hin jirretti na geessanee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:2">akka neenqaa gargar na kukkutan.<verse eid="PSA 7:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 7:3"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa Waaqa kiyya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:3">ani nama tokko yoo yakkee jiraadhe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:3">harka kiyyaan dokonkora yoo hujee jiraadhe,<verse eid="PSA 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 7:4"/>nama nageyaan na woliin le'u hantuu godhee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:4">yookiin diina kiyya sababa malee yoo saamee jiraadhe,<verse eid="PSA 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 7:5"/>diinni kiyya ari'ee na qabuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:5">lafa irratti na irra sirbee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:5">ulfinna kiyya bukuu keessatti lakkisuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 7:6"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa, aarii teetiin ka'i;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:6">worra mufi'iin na irratti ka'e irratti ka'i;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:6">naa dammaqii, muraa haqaa ajaji.<verse eid="PSA 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 7:7"/>Kolbaan biyya adda addaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:7">adaala keetitti wolitti qabamanuu ti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:7">Atille ol-gubbaa irraa isaan bulchi.<verse eid="PSA 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 7:8"/>Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:8">kolbaa biyya adda addaa irratti muraa kenni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:8">akka balchumma'aa fi dhugaammessummaa tiyyaatitti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:8">muraa naaf kenni.<verse eid="PSA 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 7:9"/>Ee Waaqa balcha'a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:9">ka qalbi'ii fi gadhaa nama qorqortu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:9">hammeenna worra hamaaleyyi'ii balleessi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:9">worra balchoolee jabeessii dhaabi.<verse eid="PSA 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 7:10"/>Waaqi wontee tiyya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:10">inni worra gadhaa qajeela'aa hin fayyisa.<verse eid="PSA 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 7:11"/>Waaqi abbaa mura'aa balcha'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:11">Waaqi yennaa mara nama hama'atti hin aara.<verse eid="PSA 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 7:12"/>Nami hamaan hammeenna ifii irraa yoo hin deebi'in,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:12">Waaqi shallaagaa ifii hin qarata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:12">guubee ifii hujee, qopheeffata.<verse eid="PSA 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 7:13"/>Inni meya woraanaa ka ijjeesuu fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:13">daaya ifii ka akka ibiddaa bobe'u hin qopheeffata.<verse eid="PSA 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 7:14"/>Kolbaan hantuun hammeenna yaaddi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:14">daba karoorfattee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:14">dhara dubbatti.<verse eid="PSA 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 7:15"/>Nami boolla namaaf qotu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:15">ifumaafuu keessa bu'a.<verse eid="PSA 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 7:16"/>Hammeenni inni yaadate mataa isaatitti garagala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:16">wonni inni hunnaan nama irratti huje</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:16">matuma isaatitti deebiti.<verse eid="PSA 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 7:17"/>Sababa balchummaa isaatiif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:17">ani Mootii Waan Maraa hin galateessa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:17">maqaa Mootii Waan Maraa Ol Aana'aatiif</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:17">faaruu leellisaa hin faarsa.<verse eid="PSA 7:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="PSA 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Guddinna Waaqaatii Fi Ulfinna Namaa</para>
  <para style="s2">Sooressa faarfattootaatiif, faaruu Daawitii ta suusulle'een faarfatante.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 8:1"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa, Goottaa keenna!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:1">Maqaan keeti lafa maratti attam attam gudda'a!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:1">Ulfinna keeti ol-gubbaa irratti diriirsiteerta.<verse eid="PSA 8:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 8:2"/>Diinota keeti loliisaaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:2">nyaaphotaa fi worra haluu bayu cadhi godhiisaaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:2">afaan ijoolle'eetii fi daa'immaan harma hootuutiin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:2">hunna qopheessite.<verse eid="PSA 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 8:3"/>Ani ol-gubbaa ati dadde,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:3">hujii harka keetii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:3">ji'aa fi urjoota ati dadde</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:3">yennaa ilaalu,<verse eid="PSA 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 8:4"/>akka ati isaaf yaadattuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:4">nami maan inni?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:4">Akka ati isa kunuunsituuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:4">ilmi namaa maan inni?<verse eid="PSA 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 8:5"/>Ati diqquma Waaqa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Diqquma Waaqa isa hanqitte: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hiikkaan afaan Giriikii </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ergantoota Waaqaa isa hanqitte </char><char style="ft" closed="false">jedha.</char></note> isa hanqittee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:5">kallacha guddinnaa fi ulfinnaa itti keette.<verse eid="PSA 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 8:6"/>Hujii harka keetii mara irratti bulchaa isa gootee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:6">waan mara baallii ilma namaatiin jala goote.<verse eid="PSA 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 8:7"/>Hoole'ee fi loon mara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:7">bineensota,<verse eid="PSA 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 8:8"/>sinbirrootaa fi qurxummii mara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:8">dada abbaayaa keessaa mara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:8">baallii ilma namaatiin jala goote.<verse eid="PSA 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 8:9"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa, Goottaa keenna!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:9">Maqaan keeti lafa maratti attam attam gudda'a!<verse eid="PSA 8:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="PSA 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Waaqa Muraa Haqaa Muruuf Galata Dhikaate</para>
  <para style="s2">Sooressa faarfattootaatiif, faaruu Daawitii ta akka yoyyoma faaruu, «Du'a ilmaa» jedhantee beekkantutti faarfatante.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 9:1"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa, ani gadhaa tokkochaan si leellisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:1">baasa ati goote mara hin odeessa.<verse eid="PSA 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 9:2"/>Ani sitti gammadee hin burraaqa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:2">Waaqa Ol Aana'a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:2">ani faaruu leellisaa maqaa keetiif hin faarsa.<verse eid="PSA 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 9:3"/>Diinoti kiyya gara duubaa yennaa deebi'anu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:3">isaan gufatanee fuula keeti duraa badan.<verse eid="PSA 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 9:4"/>Ati haqa kiyyaa fi haajaa kiyya waan ilaalteef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:4">barcumaa mootumma'aa keeti irra teettee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:4">muraa haqaa murteerta.<verse eid="PSA 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 9:5"/>Ati gosa biyya adda addaa xixxee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:5">hamaaleyyii balleessite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:5">maqaa isaaniille bara baraa haga bara baraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:5">haxoottee balleessite.<verse eid="PSA 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 9:6"/>Diinoti keenna haga bara baraa dhumataneeran.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:6">Qachooti gugurdaan isaanii badaneeran;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:6">Duufeyi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:6 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Duufeyi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maqaa addee yaadannoo hujii jannummaa nama tokkoo mudhisiisaaf, meya waan inni tolche san mudhisu itti fannifamee ti.</char></note> isaaniille ijjumaa badeera.<verse eid="PSA 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 9:7"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa ammoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:7">haga bara baraa bulcha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:7">inni mura'aaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:7">barcumaa mootumma'aa ka ifii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:7">jabeessee dhaabbateera.<verse eid="PSA 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 9:8"/>Inni balchumma'aan biyya lafaa hin bulcha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:8">gosa biyya adda addaa haqaan bulcha.<verse eid="PSA 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 9:9"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa worra cunqurfameef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:9">addee itti baqatanu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:9">yennaa rakko'oo dalleya jaba'a.<verse eid="PSA 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 9:10"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:10">ati worra si barbaadu waan hin lakkinneef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:10">worri maqaa keeti beeku sitti addata.<verse eid="PSA 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 9:11"/>Mootii Waan Maraa ka Xiyoon keessa te'ee bulchuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:11">faaruu leellisaa faarsa'a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 9:11">Waan inni godhe mara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:11">gosa biyya adda addaa oddu'utti odeessa'a.<verse eid="PSA 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 9:12"/>Inni dhiiga dhangala'eef haluu hin baya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:12">iyya worra cunqurfameelle hin dedhu.<verse eid="PSA 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 9:13"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa, naaf marari.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:13">Rakkoo diinoti kiyya natti fidanu ilaali;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:13">du'a irraa na hamburi.<verse eid="PSA 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 9:14"/>Achiin duuba ani karra qachaa Xiyoonii<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:14 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Karra qachaa Xiyoonii: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Afaan Ibrootaatiin </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">karra intala Xiyoonii </char><char style="ft" closed="false">jedha.</char></note> keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:14">waan ittiin si leellisu mara isaanitti hin hima.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 9:14">Ati waan na fayyitteef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:14">gammadaan firinxiixa.<verse eid="PSA 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 9:15"/>Gosi biyya adda addaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:15">boolluma ifii qotane bu'ane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:15">miilli isaanii tiyyuma isaan afaneen qabame.<verse eid="PSA 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 9:16"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:16">muraa ifii balchitti'iin ifi beessise;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:16">hamaaleyyiin hujuma harka ifiitiin qabamane.<verse eid="PSA 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 9:17"/>Worri hamaaleyyi'ii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:17">gosi biyya adda addaa ka Waaqa dedhu marti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:17">gara addee worri du'e jiruu gad hin bu'an.<verse eid="PSA 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 9:18"/>Worri rakkataan ammoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:18">yoomille hin dedhamanu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:18">addiin worra hiyyeeyyi'iille</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:18">haga bara baraa baddee hin hattu.<verse eid="PSA 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 9:19"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa, ka'i!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:19">Nami hin mootomin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:19">gosi biyya adda addaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:19">si duratti muraa dhaggattuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 9:20"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:20">akka isaan si sodaatanu godhi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:20">nama foon uffate te'uu isaanii akka beekanu godhi.<verse eid="PSA 9:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="PSA 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Muraa Haqaa dhaggatiisaaf Daadimata Dhikaate</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 10:1"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:1">ati maaf fagaattee dhaabbatta?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:1">Yennaa nuuti rakkannu maaf ifi dhoffatta?<verse eid="PSA 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 10:2"/>Hamaaleyyiin kooraan worra hiyyeeyyii ari'an;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:2">maluma namatti dhowane saniin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:2">ifumaaf qabaman.<verse eid="PSA 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 10:3"/>Nami hamaan halchaa gadhaa ifiitiin koora;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:3">inni worra joljolu eebbisee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:3">Mootii Waan Maraa abaara.<verse eid="PSA 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 10:4"/>Nami hamaan waan kooruuf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:4">Waaqa hin barbaadu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:4">yaada isaa keessa Waaqi hin jiru.<verse eid="PSA 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 10:5"/>Wonni marti isaaf hin teeti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:5">Inni muraa Waaqaa hubatuu hin dande'u;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:5">diinota ifii mara irratti hin murga.<verse eid="PSA 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 10:6"/>Inni gadhaa ifii keessatti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:6">«Wonni na tachoosu hin jiru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:6">dhaloota mara keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:6">rakkinni na hin dhaqqabu» jedhee yaadata.<verse eid="PSA 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 10:7"/>Afaan isaa abaarsaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:7">dharaa fi sodaachisiisaan guutameera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:7">inni arraba ifiitiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:7">maltumma'aa fi waan hantuu dubbata.<verse eid="PSA 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 10:8"/>Inni ollaa cina'atti riphee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:8">worra qarqaarsa hin qanne gaada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:8">worra yakkaa hin qanne hin ijjeesa.<verse eid="PSA 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 10:9"/>Inni akka neenqaa dhokatee gaada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:9">worra hiyyeeyyii qabiisaaf gaada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:9">inni tiyyoo ifiitiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:9">worra qarqaarsa hin qanne qabee harkisa.<verse eid="PSA 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 10:10"/>Worri hiyyeeyyiin jiganee bututan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:10">hunna isaa jalatti hin jigan.<verse eid="PSA 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 10:11"/>Nami hamaan gadhaa ifii keessatti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:11">«Waaqi dedheera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:11">fuula ifii gollateera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:11">inni ijjumaa hin dhaggu» jedha.<verse eid="PSA 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 10:12"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa, ka'i!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:12">Ee Waaqa hunna teeti mudhisi!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:12">Worra qarqaarsa hin qanne hin dedhin.<verse eid="PSA 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 10:13"/>Nami hamaan maaf Waaqa tuffata?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:13">Maaf gadhaa ifii keessatti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:13">«Inni na hin adabu» jedha ree?<verse eid="PSA 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 10:14"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:14">ati ammoo hin dhaggitta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:14">rakkinnaa fi gadda dhaggitee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:14">yennaa mara qarqaarsaaf hin qophootta.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 10:14">Worri rakkataan harka keetitti ifi kennata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:14">atille ijoollee haadhaa fi abbaa hin qanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:14">hin qarqaarta.<verse eid="PSA 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 10:15"/>Hunna nama hama'aa cassi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:15">nami waan hantuu huju</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:15">haganaa achi deebi'ee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:15">waan hantuu akka hin hunye, isa adabi.<verse eid="PSA 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 10:16"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:16">bara baraa haga bara baraa mooti'i;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:16">gosi biyya adda addaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:16">worri waaqota dhibii waaqonsu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:16">lafa isaa irraa hin badan.<verse eid="PSA 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 10:17"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:17">ati daadimata worra gad aana'aa hin dhageetta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:17">ati iyya isaanii caqattee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:17">isaan hin jajjabeessita.<verse eid="PSA 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 10:18"/>Nami lafaa ka foon uffate</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:18">worra dhibii akka hin bararassine,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:18">worra cunqurfameef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:18">ijoollee haadhaa fi abbaa hin qanneef haqa hin murta.<verse eid="PSA 10:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="PSA 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Waaqatti Addatiisa</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Daawitii, sooressa faarfattootaatiif.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 11:1"/>Ani gara Mootii Waan Maraa baqadheera.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:1">Isin attam anaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:1">«Akka simbirre'ee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:1">gara gaara keetii baqadhu!» jettan?<verse eid="PSA 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 11:2"/>Worri hamaaleyyiin guubee qopheeffateera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:2">dukkanaan worra addatama'atti darbatiisaaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:2">daaya ifii itti qajeelfateera.<verse eid="PSA 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 11:3"/>Hundeen waan dansa'aa marti yoo badde,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:3">nami balchaan maan godhuu dande'a ree?<verse eid="PSA 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 11:4"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:4">Dunkaanii Woyyittii ifii keessa jira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:4">ol-gubba'atti barcumaa mootumma'aa ka ifii qaba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 11:4">Inni ilmaan namaa ilaala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:4">ilti isaalle isaan qorqorti.<verse eid="PSA 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 11:5"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa balchoota haga hin ilaala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:5">hamaaleyyi'ii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:5">worra hunnaan nama irratti ka'u ammoo hin jibba.<verse eid="PSA 11:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 11:6"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa hamaaleyyii irratti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:6">kashila ibiddaatii fi dhakaa bobe'u hin roobisiisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:6">qilleensi gubu hiree isaanii hin te'a.<verse eid="PSA 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 11:7"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa balchaa waan te'eef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:7">inni hujii balchootaa hin jaalata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:7">worri hujii balchaa huju fuula isaa hin dhagga.<verse eid="PSA 11:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="PSA 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Daadimata Qarqaarsa Dhaggatiisaaf Dhikaate</para>
  <para style="s2">Sooressa faarfattootaatiif, faaruu Daawitii ta meya ribu'uutiin faarfatante.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 12:1"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:1">nami Waaqa sodaatu waan hin jirreef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:1">nu qarqaar;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:1">nami addatamaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:1">ilmaan namaa oddu'uu dhabameera.<verse eid="PSA 12:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 12:2"/>Tokko tokkoon isaanii dhara wolitti dubbatan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:2">Isaan hidhii kookkisaatiin soba dubbatan.<verse eid="PSA 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 12:3"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:3">hidhii sossobaatii fi arraba koorameessaa kutuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 12:4"/>Isaan, «Nuuti dubbannee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:4">waan feene hin dhagganna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:4">waan feene hin dubbanna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:4">ka nu dhoogguu dande'u hin jiru» jedhan.<verse eid="PSA 12:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 12:5"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa ammoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:5">«Worri hiyyeeyyiin waan cunqurfameef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:5">worri rakkataan waan iyyuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:5">qarqaarsa isaan barbaadanu kenniisaaf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:5">ani hin ka'a» jedha.<verse eid="PSA 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 12:6"/>Dubbiin Mootii Waan Maraa qullu'u;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:6">akka meetii barbada ibiddaatitti baxxee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:6">yennaa torba qulloottee ti.<verse eid="PSA 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 12:7"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa, ati isaan hin gollita;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:7">dhaloota hamaa irraa haga bara baraa nu hin eedda.<verse eid="PSA 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 12:8"/>Yennaa wonni hantuun saadantu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:8">nami marti waan hantuu jaalata.<verse eid="PSA 12:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="PSA 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Daadimata Qarqaarsa Dhaggatiisaaf Dhikaate</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Daawitii, sooressa faarfattootaatiif.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 13:1"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:1">ati haga yoomii na deeta?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:1">Haga bara baraa tii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:1">Haga yoomii fuula keeti na duraa dhoffatta?<verse eid="PSA 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 13:2"/>Haga yoomii rakkoo ciniinnadhee ossadha?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:2">Haga yoomii gadhaan kiyya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:2">halkanii fi guyyaa gaddaan guutama?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:2">Haga yoomii diinoti kiyya na injifatan?<verse eid="PSA 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 13:3"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:3">Waaqa kiyya na ilaalii, deebii naa deebisi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:3">Jabeenna kiyya adde'etti naa deebisi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:3">akka du'u na hin godhin.<verse eid="PSA 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 13:4"/>Diinoti kiyya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:4">«Isa injifanne» jedhanee akka kooranu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:4">nyaapholeen kiyyalle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:4">jinnana kiyyatti akka gammadanu hin godhin.<verse eid="PSA 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 13:5"/>Ani ammoo marartii guddoo sanitti addadheera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:5">gadhaan kiyyalle fayyisiisa keetitti hin gammada.<verse eid="PSA 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 13:6"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:6">waan dansaa waan naa godheef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:6">ani isaaf hin faarfadha.<verse eid="PSA 13:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="PSA 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Hammeenna Namaa</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Daawitii, sooressa faarfattootaatiif.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 14:1"/>Worri gowwooleen, gadhaa ifii keessatti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:1">«Waaqi hin jiru» jedhan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 14:1">Isaan worra bada'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:1">waan gadhee hujan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:1">isaan keessaa ka waan dansaa huju tokkolle hin jiru.<verse eid="PSA 14:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 14:2"/>Worri qarooleen Waaqa barbaadu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:2">yoo jiraate dhaggiisaaf, Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:2">ol-gubbaa irraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:2">gara ilmaan namaa gad ilaala.<verse eid="PSA 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 14:3"/>Isaan martinuu ammoo karaa irraa goranee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:3">martinuu wolumatti worra badaa te'aneeran.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 14:3">Isaan keessaa ka waan dansaa huju hin jiru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:3">tokkolle hin jiru.<verse eid="PSA 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 14:4"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:4">«Worri hamaaleyyiin womaa hin hubatuu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:4">Akkuma nami sagalee nyaatu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:4">worri kolbaa tiyya nyaatu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:4">isaan gara kiyya hin daadimatanu» jedha.<verse eid="PSA 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 14:5"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:5">worra balchoota woliin waan jiruuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:5">worri hamaaleyyiin bararaqa guddaa keessa jiran.<verse eid="PSA 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 14:6"/>Isin hamaaleyyiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:6">karoora worra gad aana'aa hin gufachiittan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:6">Mootiin Waan Maraa ammoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:6">isaaniif addee isaan itti baqatanu.<verse eid="PSA 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 14:7"/>Xiyoon keessaa fayyinni kolbaa Israa'eliitiif</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:7">adoo dhufee jiraatee!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 14:7">Yennaa Mootiin Waan Maraa boojuu kolba'aa deebisu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:7">sanyiin Yaaqoobii hin burraaxxi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:7">kolbaan Israa'elii hin gammaddi.<verse eid="PSA 14:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="PSA 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Waan Waaqi Nama Irraa Barbaadu</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Daawitii.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 15:1"/>Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:1">Dunkaanii Woyyittii teeti keessa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:1">eentu jiraatiisa dande'a?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:1">Kooba keeti woyyicha irra</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:1">eentu le'uu dande'a?<verse eid="PSA 15:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 15:2"/>Worra komii hin qannee fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:2">ka waan balchaa te'e huju,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:2">ka gadhaa ifii keessaa dhugaa dubbatu,<verse eid="PSA 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 15:3"/>ka maqaa namaa hin balleessine,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:3">ka jaalota ifii irratti waan hantuu hin hunye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:3">ka ollaa ifii hin hamanne.<verse eid="PSA 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 15:4"/>Worra hamoolee ka tuffatu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:4">worra Mootii Waan Maraa sodaatu ammoo ka ulfeessu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 15:4">Ta isa miitu teetelle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:4">waan waadaa gale ka muummessu.<verse eid="PSA 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 15:5"/>Beesee ifii dhala malee ka liqeessu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:5">worra balleessaa hin qanne miidhiisaaf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:5">safuu ka hin fudhanne.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 15:5"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 15:5">Nami waan kana godhu ijjumaa hin raafamu.<verse eid="PSA 15:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="PSA 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Waaqatti Addii Godhatiisaaf Daadimata Dhikaate</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Daawitii.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 16:1"/>Ee Waaqa, ani sitti waan baqadhuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:1">ati na eegi.<verse eid="PSA 16:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 16:2"/>Ani Mootii Waan Maraatiin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:2">«Ati Goottaa kiyya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:2">si'iin malee ani waan dansaa hin qabu» jedhe.<verse eid="PSA 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 16:3"/>Worri isaaf woyyoomee lafa irra le'u, ka ulfaate;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:3">ani isaanitti gammada.<verse eid="PSA 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 16:4"/>Worra waaqota dhibii waaqonfatu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:4">gadda gudda'atti isaan dhaqqaba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 16:4">Ani waaqota dharaatiif</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:4">ciincaa dhiigaa hin dhikeessu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:4">afaan kiyyalle'een maqaa isaanii hin dhowu.<verse eid="PSA 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 16:5"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:5">qoodi lafa tiyyaatii fi hireen tiyya si'i.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:5">Qoodi lafa tiyyaa harka keeti keessa jira.<verse eid="PSA 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 16:6"/>Wodaroon tiyya ta meessaa ittiin mikanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:6 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ittiin mikanu: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Hagam akka dheeratu yookiin badhatu ittiin beekanu </char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:6">addee dansaa irra naaf buute;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:6">dhugumaan ani lafa dansaa qaba.<verse eid="PSA 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 16:7"/>Ani Mootii Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:7">ka gorsa naaf kennu hin leellifadha.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:7">Halkan keessalle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:7">wodanaan kiyya ifi na eeggachiisa.<verse eid="PSA 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 16:8"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:8">fuula kiyya dura akka naaf jiru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:8">ani yennaa mara hin beeka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 16:8">Inni midda kiyya waan jiruuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:8">ani hin raafamu.<verse eid="PSA 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 16:9"/>Tanaaf, gadhaan kiyya hin gammada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:9">arrabi kiyya hin ilillisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:9">nafi kiyyalle sodaa malee hin foorfata.<verse eid="PSA 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 16:10"/>Ati addee worri du'e jirutti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:10">waan na hin lakkinneef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:10">ati woyyicha keeti akka shamu hin gootu.<verse eid="PSA 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 16:11"/>Ati daandii jiru'uu natti hin mudhitta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:11">gammadi guutuun fuula keeti dura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:11">wonni haga bara baraa nama gammachiisu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:11">harka keeti middicha keessa jira.<verse eid="PSA 16:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="PSA 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Daadimata Nama Yakkaa Malee Ari'amee</para>
  <para style="s2">Daadimata Daawitii.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 17:1"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:1">gaaffii tiyya ta haqaa dhage'i;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:1">iyya tiyya caqasi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 17:1">Gurra keeti gara daadimata kiyya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:1">ka soba hin te'inii deebifadhu.<verse eid="PSA 17:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 17:2"/>Ilti teeti waan sirrii te'e waan dhaggituuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:2">muraan tiyya si biraa naa dhuttuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 17:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 17:3"/>Gadhaa kiyya yoo qorqorte,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:3">halkaniin gara kiyya dhuttee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:3">yoo haga na ilaalte,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:3">hammeenna na keessatti hin dhaggitu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:3">afaan kiyyalle cubbuu hin dubbatu.<verse eid="PSA 17:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 17:4"/>Jecha afaan keeti keessaa bayuuf ajajamee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:4">waan namooti hujanu irraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:4">karaa isaan hunnaan nama irratti ka'anu irralle'ee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:4">ifi eeggadheera.<verse eid="PSA 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 17:5"/>Ideensi kiyya daandii teeti eegateera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:5">miilli kiyyalle hin fallaanne.<verse eid="PSA 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 17:6"/>Ee Waaqa, ati waan naa dhageettuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:6">ani si waammadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:6">gurra keeti gara kiyya deebifadhuutii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:6">jecha kiyya dhage'i.<verse eid="PSA 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 17:7"/>Worra sitti baqatu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:7">harka keeti middichaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:7">diinota isaanii jalaa isaan ka baachu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:7">jaalala keeti ka bara baraa san</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:7">baasa godhii isaanitti mudhisi.<verse eid="PSA 17:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 17:8"/>Akka ila teetii na eegi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:8">bobaa teetii jalatti na dhossi.<verse eid="PSA 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 17:9"/>Hamaaleyyii hunnaan na irratti ka'ane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:9">diinota kiyya worra hamaa na marsane irraa na eegi.<verse eid="PSA 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 17:10"/>Isaan gadhaa jabaataneeran;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:10">afaan ifiitiin koora dubbatan.<verse eid="PSA 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 17:11"/>Isaan ari'anee na marsaneeran;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:11">lafatti gad na dhowiisaaf, ilaan na qabataneeran.<verse eid="PSA 17:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 17:12"/>Isaan akka neenqa waan adanse kukkutatiisa fedhee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:12">akka neenqa dardaraa ka riphee wo gaaduu ti.<verse eid="PSA 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 17:13"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:13">ka'iitii, lolii isaan gad dhowi!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:13">Shallaagaa keetiin hamaaleyyii jalaa na baasi.<verse eid="PSA 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 17:14"/>Mootii Waan Maraa, harka keetiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:14">worra jiruu biyya lafaa tana keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:14">waan barbaadanu mara qabanu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:14">jalaa na baasi.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 17:14"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 17:14">Ati rakkinna isaaniif kuucheen isaan adabi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:14">rakkinni kun ijoollee isaaniitii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:14">ijoollee ijoollee isaaniitiifille akka te'u godhi.<verse eid="PSA 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 17:15"/>Ani balchumma'aan fuula keeti hin ilaala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:15">ani yennaa dammaqu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:15">bifa keeti dhaggee hin quufa.<verse eid="PSA 17:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="PSA 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Faaruu Injifanno'oo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 22:1-51">2 Sam. 22:1-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="s2">Sooressa faarfattootaatiif, faaruu garbichi Mootii Waan Maraa Daawiti yennaa Mootiin Waan Maraa harka Saa'oliitii fi diinota isaa mara jalaa isa baase Mootii Waan Maraatiif faarfate.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 18:1"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa, ati jabeenna kiyya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:1">ani si jaaladha.<verse eid="PSA 18:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 18:2"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa rassaa kiyya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:2">waan itti golladhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:2">ka na baasulle'e.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 18:2">Waaqi kiyya rassaa kiyya ka ani itti baqadhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:2">inni wontee tiyya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:2">ka akka gaafaa woy na irraa dhooggu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:2">inni waan ani itti golladhu.<verse eid="PSA 18:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 18:3"/>Ani Mootii Waan Maraa leellifamaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:3">hin waammadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:3">innille diinota kiyya jalaa na hin baasa.<verse eid="PSA 18:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 18:4"/>Wodaroon du'aa natti maratte;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:4">danbaliin badi'ii na bararassite.<verse eid="PSA 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 18:5"/>Wodaroon qilee du'aa na xaxxee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:5">tiyyoon du'aa na qabatte.<verse eid="PSA 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 18:6"/>Rakkinna kiyya keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:6">ani Mootii Waan Maraa kiyya waammadhe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:6">akka na qarqaaruuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:6">Waaqa kiyyatti iyye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 18:6">Inni Dunkaanii Woyyittii ifii keessaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:6">qoonqoo tiyya dhage'e;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:6">iyya tiyyalle caqase.<verse eid="PSA 18:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 18:7"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa waan aareef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:7">latti rommitee tachoote;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:7">hundeen gaarotaalle hargufamanee raafamane.<verse eid="PSA 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 18:8"/>Funnaan isaa keessaa aarri baye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:8">afaan isaa keessaa ibiddi luxub godhuu fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:8">kashilli ibiddaa baye.<verse eid="PSA 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 18:9"/>Inni ol-gubbaa dayyaasee gad bu'e;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:9">duumensi gurraachi miila isaa jala jiraayyu.<verse eid="PSA 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 18:10"/>Inni dada ol-gubba'aa ta koola qaddu irra tee'ee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:10">koolaan ka'aa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:10">koola qilleensaa irra tee'ee ariifatee dhufiisatti jira.<verse eid="PSA 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 18:11"/>Inni dukkana gollaa ifii godhatee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:11">dunkaaniin isaa adaala isaa jirtiiyyu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:11">duumensi gurraachi bisaaniin guutame,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:11">isa marseera.<verse eid="PSA 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 18:12"/>Calalaqa fuula isaa dura jiru keessaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:12">dhakaan bokkeyaatii fi kashilli ibiddaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:12">duumensa dayyaasanee bayane.<verse eid="PSA 18:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 18:13"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa ol-gubbaa irraa mandi'e;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:13">Waaqi Ol Aanaan qoonqoo ifii dhageessise.<verse eid="PSA 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 18:14"/>Inni daaya ifii darbatee diinota ifii bittinneesse;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:14">balaqqeessa balaqqeetti'iitiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:14">gara itti goranu isaan wollaalchise.<verse eid="PSA 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 18:15"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa, xixicha keetiin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:15">dhowicha hafuura funnaan keetiitiin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:15">dhooqoti abbaayaa jalaa mudhatane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:15">hundeen lafaa marti qullaa hafane.<verse eid="PSA 18:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 18:16"/>Inni gubbaa irraa gad hiixatee, na qabe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:16">bisaan gugurdaa keessaa harkisee na baase.<verse eid="PSA 18:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 18:17"/>Isaan akka malee hunnaan waan na caalanuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:17">inni diinota kiyya hunnaameyyii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:17">worra na jibbu jalaa na baase.<verse eid="PSA 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 18:18"/>Yennaa ani rakkadhe, isaan na irratti ka'ane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:18">Mootiin Waan Maraa ammoo na qarqaare.<verse eid="PSA 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 18:19"/>Inni gara addee badho'oo na geessee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:19">waan natti gammadeef, na baase.<verse eid="PSA 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 18:20"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:20">akkuma balchummaa tiyyaatitti naaf godhe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:20">inni waan ani yakkaa hin qanneef gatii naa kaffale.<verse eid="PSA 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 18:21"/>Ani karaa Mootii Waan Maraa waan hordofeef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:21">Waaqa kiyya irraa deebi'ee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:21">waan hantuu hin hunye.<verse eid="PSA 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 18:22"/>Ani seera isaa mara muummesseera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:22">seerata isaalle hin didane.<verse eid="PSA 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 18:23"/>Ani isa duratti komii hin qabuuyyu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:23">cubbuu irraalle ifi eeggadheera.<verse eid="PSA 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 18:24"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa akkuma balchummaa tiyyaatitti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:24">ani waan yakkaa hin qanneef gatii naa kaffale.<verse eid="PSA 18:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 18:25"/>Ee, Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:25">ati worra addatama'aaf, ka addatante;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:25">worra komii hin qanneef, ka komii hin qanne.<verse eid="PSA 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 18:26"/>Worra qulqullu'uuf, ati qulqullu'u;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:26">worra dabaalessaaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:26">akka daba isaaniititti gatii isaaniif kennita.<verse eid="PSA 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 18:27"/>Ati worra gad ifi qabu hin baacha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:27">worra kooru ammoo hin salphitta.<verse eid="PSA 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 18:28"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa, ati ifa naaf hin issita;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:28">Waaqa kiyya, ati dukkana tiyya hin issita.<verse eid="PSA 18:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 18:29"/>Qarqaarsa keetiin ani loltoota hin lola;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:29">qarqaarsa Waaqaatiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:29">dalleya gubba'aan utaaluu dande'a.<verse eid="PSA 18:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 18:30"/>Karaan Waaqaa dhidhinna hin qabu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:30">jechi Mootii Waan Maraa dhuga'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:30">worra isatti baqatuuf, inni wonte'e.<verse eid="PSA 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 18:31"/>Waaqa malee Mootiin Waan Maraa eennu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:31">Waaqa keenna malee rassaan eennu?<verse eid="PSA 18:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 18:32"/>Jabeenna ka anaaf kennu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:32">ka karaa naaf qajeelchu Waaqa.<verse eid="PSA 18:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 18:33"/>Inni miila kiyya akka miila gadansaa hin jabeessa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:33">gaarota gubbaa sodaa malee na dhaabbachiisa.<verse eid="PSA 18:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 18:34"/>Guubee sageettu'uu hujuu akka dande'u,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:34">harka kiyyalle lolaaf hin leenjisa.<verse eid="PSA 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 18:35"/>Wontee teeti ta fayyinnaa naa kennitee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:35">harki keeti middichi na qarqaare;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:35">qarqaarsi keeti guddaa na godhe.<verse eid="PSA 18:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 18:36"/>Karaa ideemmaa tiyyaa naaf badhitte;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:36">miilli kiyya hin mucucaanne.<verse eid="PSA 18:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 18:37"/>Ani diinota kiyya ari'ee hin dhaqqaba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:37">ani haga isaan balleessutti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:37">gara duubaa hin deebi'u.<verse eid="PSA 18:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 18:38"/>Akka isaan dande'anee hin kaane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:38">gad isaan hin dhowa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:38">isaan miila kiyya jalatti hin jigan.<verse eid="PSA 18:38"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 18:39"/>Ati lolaaf hunna naaf kennite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:39">diinota kiyya irratti injifannoo naaf kennite.<verse eid="PSA 18:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 18:40"/>Ati diinoti kiyya akka duubatti deebi'anu goote;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:40">ani worra na jibbu balleesse.<verse eid="PSA 18:40"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 18:41"/>Isaan qarqaarsa gaafatiisaaf iyyane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:41">ammoo nami tokkolle isaan hin qarqaarre.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 18:41">Isaan Mootii Waan Maraa waamane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:41">inni ammoo deebii hin kennine.<verse eid="PSA 18:41"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 18:42"/>Akka bukuu qilleensi afuufuu, ani isaan butuche;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:42">akka dhoqqee karaa keessaa, ani isaan irra sirbe.<verse eid="PSA 18:42"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 18:43"/>Ati kolbaa na loltu jalaa na baattee<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:43 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Baattee: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yookiin baache.</char></note>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:43">gosa biyya adda addaa irratti bulchaa na goote;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:43">kolbaan ani hin beenne na tajaajilti.<verse eid="PSA 18:43"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 18:44"/>Isaan akkuma marroo tiyya dhage'aneen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:44">naaf ajajaman;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:44">ormi gad naaf jedhan.<verse eid="PSA 18:44"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 18:45"/>Isaan Sodaatanee addii kutatan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:45">rommanee kushee jadduu ifii lakkisanee bayan.<verse eid="PSA 18:45"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 18:46"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa jiraata'a!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:46">Rassaan kiyya leellifamuu ti!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:46">Waaqi fayyisaan kiyya jajamuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 18:46"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 18:47"/>Inni Waaqa diinota kiyya haluu naa bayu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:47">gosa biyya adda addaa harka kiyya jala galcha.<verse eid="PSA 18:47"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 18:48"/>Inni diinota kiyya jalaa na baasa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:48">Diinota kiyya irratti ol ol na qaba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:48">kolbaa hunnaan na irratti kaatu jalalle'ee na baasa.<verse eid="PSA 18:48"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 18:49"/>Tanaaf, Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:49">gosa biyya adda addaa oddu'utti, ani si leellisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:49">Faaruu leellisaatiin maqaa keeti faarfadha.<verse eid="PSA 18:49"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 18:50"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa mooticha mootii godheef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:50">injifachaa kenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:50">ka ifii muude Daawitii fi sanyii isaatiif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:50">jaalala ifii ka bara baraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:50">itti mudhisa.<verse eid="PSA 18:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="PSA 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Dadi Ulfinna Waaqaa Mudhitti</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Daawitii, sooressa faarfattootaatiif.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 19:1"/>Ol-gubbaan ulfinnaa Waaqaa hinti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:1">gubbaan hujii harka isaa lalladdi.<verse eid="PSA 19:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 19:2"/>Guyyaan guyyaa itti aanutti kanuma dabarsa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:2">halkanille halkan itti aanutti woma kana hima.<verse eid="PSA 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 19:3"/>Dubbiin yookiin jechi hin jiru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:3">qoonqoon isaanii hin dhage'antu;<verse eid="PSA 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 19:4"/>Te'uu malee ergaan isaanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:4">biyya lafaa duudi'itti baatee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:4">haga qaccee biyya lafaa geetti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 19:4">Inni adu'uuf gubbaa irratti dunkaanii dhaabe.<verse eid="PSA 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 19:5"/>Aduun akka waajiba diinqa ifiitii gad bayuu baati;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:5">akkuma nami rukkee wol doggommi'ii rukkisu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:5">gammadaan rukkisu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:5">aduun rukkee wol doggommi'ii rukkisiisaaf gammaddi.<verse eid="PSA 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 19:6"/>Aduun dhuma qaccee gubba'aa taan irraa ol baatee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:6">gara qaccee taanii qaxxaamurti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:6">wonni o'a isi'ii duraa dhokatu hin jiru.<verse eid="PSA 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Seera Mootii Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 19:7"/>Seerri Mootii Waan Maraa dhidhuu hin qabu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:7">lubbuu haaressa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:7">Ajaji Mootii Waan Maraa addatama'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:7">nama gowwaa qaroo godha.<verse eid="PSA 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 19:8"/>Seerri Mootii Waan Maraa sirri'i;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:8">gadhaa nama gammachiisa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 19:8">Ajaji isaa ifa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:8">Ila namaa bana.<verse eid="PSA 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 19:9"/>Mootii Waan Maraa sodaatiis yaada qullicha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:9">yaadi kun haga bara baraa jiraata.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 19:9">Muraan Mootii Waan Maraa marti dhuga'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:9">isiin yennaa mara haqa.<verse eid="PSA 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 19:10"/>Worqii gatii guddo'oo caalaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:10">worqii baqisiisanee qulleessane caala'aayyuu gatii qaddi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 19:10">Damma caalaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:10">nadhii dammaa caalaa mi'ootti.<verse eid="PSA 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 19:11"/>Ani tajaajilaan keeti isi'iin gorfama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:11">isii eegatiisaan gatii guddoo dhaggadha.<verse eid="PSA 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 19:12"/>Ka dokonkora ifii dhaggu eennu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:12">Cubbuu tiyya ta dhokatte irraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:12">na qulqulleessi.<verse eid="PSA 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 19:13"/>Cubbuu beekaa hujanu irraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:13">na garbicha keeti eegi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:13">akka isiin na mootu hin eeyyamin.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 19:13">Yoos ani ka komii hin qannee fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:13">ka yakkaa guddoo hin qanne hin te'a.<verse eid="PSA 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 19:14"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:14">rassaa kiyyaa fi wodoo kiyya!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:14">Jechi afaan kiyyaatii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:14">yaadi gadhaa kiyyaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:14">si duratti fudhatama qabaatanuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 19:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="PSA 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Daadimata Injifannoo Dhaggatiisaaf Dhikaate</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Daawitii, sooressa faarfattootaatiif.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 20:1"/>Guyyaa rakkinna keetii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:1">Mootiin Waan Maraa si'iif dhage'u!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:1">Maqaan Waaqa Yaaqoobii si eegu!<verse eid="PSA 20:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 20:2"/>Inni Dunkaanii Woyyittii ifi keessaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:2">qarqaarsa si'iif ergu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:2">gaara Xiyoonii irraa qarqaarsa siif ergu.<verse eid="PSA 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 20:3"/>Inni kennansa keeti mara fudhatee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:3">ciincaa keeti maratti gammaduu ti.<verse eid="PSA 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 20:4"/>Inni halchaa gadhaa keetii sii kennu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:4">yaada keeti mara sii guutu.<verse eid="PSA 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 20:5"/>Yennaa ati injifatte</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:5">nuuti gammadaan hin ilillinna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:5">Waaqa keenna leellisiisaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:5">baandiraa keenna ol kaafanna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:5">Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:5">waan ati gaafate mara si'iif guutu.<verse eid="PSA 20:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 20:6"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:6">ka ifii muude akka qarqaaru ani hin beeka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:6">inni ol-gubbaa woyyittii ifii keessaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:6">deebii isaaf hin kenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:6">harka ifii middichaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:6">injifachaa guddoo isaaf hin kenna.<verse eid="PSA 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 20:7"/>Worri gariin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:7">garreettaa lolaa ka fardaan harkifamu ifiititti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:7">worri gariin fardoo ifiititti addata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:7">nuuti ammoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:7">maqaa Mootii Waan Maraa Waaqa keennaatitti addanna.<verse eid="PSA 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 20:8"/>Isaan gufatanee hin jigan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:8">nuuti ammoo kaanee jabaannee hin dhaabbanna.<verse eid="PSA 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 20:9"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa! Mooticha injifachiisi!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:9">Yennaa nuuti si waammannu nuuf dhage'i!<verse eid="PSA 20:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="PSA 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Galata Injifachaa Dhagganteef Dhikaate</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Daawitii, sooressa faarfattootaatiif.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 21:1"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:1">mootichi jabeenna keetiin gammada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:1">injifachaa ati isaa kenniteen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:1">gammadi isaa attam attam gudda'a!<verse eid="PSA 21:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 21:2"/>Ati halchaa gadhaa isaa isaaf kenniteerta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:2">waan inni si gaafate ati isa hin dhoogganne.<verse eid="PSA 21:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 21:3"/>Eebba gudda'aan gara isaa waan dhutteef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:3">mataa isaa irra kallacha worqii qullu'uu keetteerta.<verse eid="PSA 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 21:4"/>Inni jiruu si gaafate;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:4">atille bara dheeraa haga bara baraa isaaf kennite.<verse eid="PSA 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 21:5"/>Ati injifachaa waan isaaf kenniteef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:5">ulfinni isaa guddaa te'e;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:5">ati ulfinnaa fi guddinna isaaf kennite.<verse eid="PSA 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 21:6"/>Eebba bara baraa isaaf kennite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:6">ati isa woliin waan jirtuuf, isa gammachiitta.<verse eid="PSA 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 21:7"/>Mootichi Mootii Waan Maraatitti addata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:7">sababa jaalala bara baraa ka Waaqa Ol Aana'aatiif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:7">inni hin raafamu.<verse eid="PSA 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 21:8"/>Harki keeti diinota keeti mara hin dhowa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:8">harki keeti middichi worra si jibbu hin qaba.<verse eid="PSA 21:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 21:9"/>Ati yennaa mudhattu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:9">akka barbada ibiddaa isaan gudda.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 21:9">Mufii teetiin isaan hin fixa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:9">ibiddi isaan luxub godha.<verse eid="PSA 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 21:10"/>Ati sanyii isaanii lafa irraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:10">hiddaa fi hidaada isaanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:10">ilmaan namootaa oddu'uu hin balleessita.<verse eid="PSA 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 21:11"/>Isaan yoo hantuu si irratti yaadane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:11">mala yoo sitti dhowane, isaaniif hin teetu.<verse eid="PSA 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 21:12"/>Ati guubee teeti gara isaanii hin qadda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:12">gara duubaa deebi'anee akka baqatanu hin goota.<verse eid="PSA 21:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 21:13"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa, jabeenna keetiin ka'i!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:13">Nuuti faarfannee hunna teeti hin leellinna.<verse eid="PSA 21:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="PSA 22"/>
  <para style="s1">Iyya Gaddaatii Fi Faaruu Leellisaa</para>
  <para style="s2">Sooressa faarfattootaatiif, faaruu Daawitii ta yoyyoma, «Gadansa dayya'a boru'uu» jedhantuun faarfatante.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 22:1"/>Waaqa kiyya, Waaqa kiyya, maaf na lakkitte?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:1">Ati maaf na qarqaariisa irraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:1">jecha aadiisa kiyyaa irraa fagaatte?<verse eid="PSA 22:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 22:2"/>Waaqa kiyya, ani guyyaa gara keeti iyya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:2">ati ammoo naaf hin deebittu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:2">halkanille hin iyya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:2">ammoo foora hin dhaggadhu.<verse eid="PSA 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 22:3"/>Te'uu malee ati Waaqa woyyicha.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:3">Leellisi worra Israa'elii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:3">barcumaa mootumma'aa keeti marsa.<verse eid="PSA 22:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 22:4"/>Abbootiin teenna ta durii sitti addatte;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:4">isaan si addatanee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:4">atille isaan baache.<verse eid="PSA 22:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 22:5"/>Isaan gara keeti iyyanee bayane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:5">sitti addataneelle hin fokkifanne.<verse eid="PSA 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 22:6"/>Ani ammoo corroqa malee namaa moti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:6">namooti natti murgan; kolbaalle na tuffatti.<verse eid="PSA 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 22:7"/>Ka na dhaggu marti natti murga;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:7">isaan arraba baasanee mataa natti raasaa,<verse eid="PSA 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 22:8"/>«Inni Mootii Waan Maraatitti addateeraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:8">inni isa hamburuu ti me!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:8">Inni waan isa jaalatuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:8">isa baasuu ti me!» naan jedhan.<verse eid="PSA 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 22:9"/>Ati nageyaan akka dhaladhu na gootee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:9">harma haadha tiyyaa irralle'etti na eedde.<verse eid="PSA 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 22:10"/>Gadaamessa haadha tiyyaatii jalqabee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:10">ka na eege si'i;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:10">gadhaa haadha tiyyaatii jalqaddee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:10">ati Waaqa kiyya teeteerta.<verse eid="PSA 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 22:11"/>Rakkinni na dhaqqabiisaaf waan dhikaateef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:11">ka na qarqaarulle waan hin jirreef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:11">na irraa hin fagaatin.<verse eid="PSA 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 22:12"/>Diinoti hedduun akka korommi'ii na marsaneeran;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:12">worri jajjaboon akka korommii Baashaanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:12">na naannessaneeran.<verse eid="PSA 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 22:13"/>Akka neenqa waan adanse kukkutataa dhangaa dhowuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:13">isaan afaan ifii natti banan.<verse eid="PSA 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 22:14"/>Hunni tiyya akka bisaanii jiddeerti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:14">mitikaan lafee tiyyaa marti gargar bayeera.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 22:14">Gadhaan kiyya akka gaga'aa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:14">na baqeera.<verse eid="PSA 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 22:15"/>Afaan kiyya akka basso'oo gogee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:15">arrabi kiyyalle laagada'atti na qabate;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:15">ati akka nama du'ee bukuu keessa na irkitte.<verse eid="PSA 22:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 22:16"/>Worri akka sare'ee na marse;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:16">goliin worra hantuu hujuu na naannessanee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:16">harka kiyyaa fi miila kiyya woraananee fullaasane.<verse eid="PSA 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 22:17"/>Ani huqqadhee lafeen tiyya mudhatte;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:17">diinoti kiyya ila natti qabanee na ilaalane.<verse eid="PSA 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 22:18"/>Woyaa tiyya qoqoodamanee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:18">ruufa kiyyatti hixaa buufatane.<verse eid="PSA 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 22:19"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa kiyya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:19">ati ammoo na irraa hin fagaatin!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:19">Ee qarqaaraa kiyya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:19">na qarqaariisaaf ariifadhuu koy!<verse eid="PSA 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 22:20"/>Lubbuu tiyya shallaagaa jalaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:20">jiruu tiyya hunna saroolee tanaa jalaa baasi.<verse eid="PSA 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 22:21"/>Afaan neenqaa jalaa na hamburi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:21">gaafa gafarsaa jalaa na baasi.<verse eid="PSA 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 22:22"/>Ani guddinna maqaa keetii kolbaa tiyyatti hin hima;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:22">wolde'a gumii isaanii keessatti ani si hin leellisa.<verse eid="PSA 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 22:23"/>Isin worri Mootii Waan Maraa sodaattanu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:23">isa leellisa'a!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 22:23">Isin sanyiin Yaaqoobii marti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:23">isa ulfeessa'a!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 22:23">Isin kolbaan Israa'elii marti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:23">isa saadadha'a!<verse eid="PSA 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 22:24"/>Inni nama rakkate hin tuffanne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:24">inni fuula ifiille isa irraa hin deebifanne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:24">ammoo yennaa inni gara isaa iyye isaaf dhage'e.<verse eid="PSA 22:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 22:25"/>Waan ati hujjeef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:25">gumii guddoo keessatti ani si leellisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:25">worra si sodaatu duratti waan waadaa gale</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:25">ani si'iif hin kenna.<verse eid="PSA 22:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 22:26"/>Worri hiyyeeyyiin nyaatanee hin quufan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:26">worri Mootii Waan Maraa barbaadu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:26">isa hin leellisan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 22:26">Baruma baraan gadhaan keessan gammadaan le'uu ti!<verse eid="PSA 22:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 22:27"/>Kolbaan lafa irraa marti qaabattee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:27">gara Mootii Waan Maraa hin deebiti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:27">maatiin gosa biyya adda addaa marti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:27">isaaf hin sagaddi.<verse eid="PSA 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 22:28"/>Baalliin ta Mootii Waan Maraa waan te'eef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:28">inni gosa biyya adda addaa hin bulcha.<verse eid="PSA 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 22:29"/>Worri dureeyyiin marti isaaf hin sagadan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:29">nami foon uffate marti isa duratti hin jilbiiffatan.<verse eid="PSA 22:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 22:30"/>Dhalooti hegerii isa hin tajaajilan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:30">dhaloota dhufutti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:30">marroon waan Mootii Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:30">itti hin himama.<verse eid="PSA 22:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 22:31"/>Isaan dhufanee hujii balchummaa isaa lassaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:31">balchummaa inni huje</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:31">worra amma hin dhalatiniif hin himan.<verse eid="PSA 22:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="PSA 23"/>
  <para style="s1">Mootiin Waan Maraa Tissee Dansa'a</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Daawitii.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 23:1"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa tissee kiyya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:1">ani womaa hin dhabu.<verse eid="PSA 23:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 23:2"/>Inni marra bisilee keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:2">akka ani foorfadhu godha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:2">gara bisaan dansa'aa na geessa.<verse eid="PSA 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 23:3"/>Inni jabeenna haareya naa kenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:3">maqaa ifiitiif jedhee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:3">daandii balchaa irra na sooressa.<verse eid="PSA 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 23:4"/>Ani dhooqa gaaddisa du'aa keessa yoo ideemelle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:4">ati waan na woliin jirtuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:4">Ani waan hantuu natti dhuttu hin sodaadhu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:4">Uleen teetii fi borjoon teeti na jajjabeessan.<verse eid="PSA 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 23:5"/>Adoo diinoti kiyya dhagganuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:5">ati nyaata naaf qopheessita.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 23:5">Mataa kiyya zayitii ejersaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:5 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Zayitii ejersaa: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Akkuma Gujiin dhadhaa iffatu, Israa'elooti zayitii ejersaa iffatan.</char></note> muudda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:5">muduunuun tiyyalle guuttee irraa dhangalaati.<verse eid="PSA 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 23:6"/>Dhugumaan, bara jiruu tiyyaa mara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:6">dansummaan teetii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:6">marartiin teeti na gula deeman;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:6">bara le'ii tiyyaa mara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:6">mana Mootii Waan Maraa keessa hin le'a.<verse eid="PSA 23:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="PSA 24"/>
  <para style="s1">Mooticha Guddaa</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Daawitii.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 24:1"/>Lafaa fi wonni lafa irra jiru marti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:1">ka Mootii Waan Maraa ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:1">biyyi lafaatii fi worri isii keessa le'u marti ka isaa ti.<verse eid="PSA 24:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 24:2"/>Inni lafa hundee abbaaya'aa irra keye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:2">bisaan irra isii jabeessee dhaabe.<verse eid="PSA 24:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 24:3"/>Gara kooba Mootii Waan Maraa ka ol bayu eennu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:3">Dunkaanii isaa woyyittii keessa ka dhaabbatu eennu?<verse eid="PSA 24:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 24:4"/>Nama harka qulqullu'uutii fi gadhaa qullu'uu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:4">ka waaqota dharaa hin waaqonfanne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:4">ka sobaan hin kakanne qofa.<verse eid="PSA 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 24:5"/>Inni Mootii Waan Maraa biraa eebba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:5">Waaqa fayyisaa biraa balchummaa hin dhaggata.<verse eid="PSA 24:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 24:6"/>Dhalooti isa barbaadu isaan kana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:6">ee Waaqa Yaaqoobii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:6">worri fuula keeti barbaadu isaanuma kana.<verse eid="PSA 24:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 24:7"/>Mootiin ulfinnaa akka seenu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:7">Ee Karra, gara maraan banama'a!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:7">Isin balbala durii durii, badhadha'aa banama'a!<verse eid="PSA 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 24:8"/>Mootiin ulfinnaa kun eennu inni?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:8">Inni Mootii Waan Maraa jaba'aa fi janna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:8">inni Mootii Waan Maraa ka lolaan jaba'aa ti.<verse eid="PSA 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 24:9"/>Mootiin ulfinnaa akka seenu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:9">Ee karra, gara maraan banama'a!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:9">Isin balbala durii durii, badhadha'aa banama'a!<verse eid="PSA 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 24:10"/>Mootiin ulfinnaa kun eennu inni?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:10">Inni Mootii Waan Maraa Ka Waan Mara Dade,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:10">mootii ulfinnaa ti.<verse eid="PSA 24:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="PSA 25"/>
  <para style="s1">Waaqaan sooreffamiisaa Fi Eegamiisaafiille Daadimata Dhikaate</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Daawitii.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 25:1"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:1">lubbuun tiyya ol gara keeti yaaddi;<verse eid="PSA 25:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 25:2"/>Ee Waaqa kiyya, ani sitti addadha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 25:2">Akka fokkifadhu na hin godhin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:2">diinoti kiyya natti hin gammadin.<verse eid="PSA 25:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 25:3"/>Worri addii sitti godhatu hin fokkifatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:3">worri si'iif hin addatanne ammoo hin fokkifatan.<verse eid="PSA 25:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 25:4"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:4">karaa keeti akka beeku na godhi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:4">daandii teeti na barsiisi.<verse eid="PSA 25:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 25:5"/>Ati Waaqa fayyisaa kiyya waan teeteef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:5">dhugaa teetiin na sooressii, na barsiisi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:5">ani yennaa mara addii si godhadha.<verse eid="PSA 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 25:6"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:6">marartii teetii guddo'oo fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:6">jaalala keeti ka bara baraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:6">ka durii jalqaddee mudhitte yaadadhu.<verse eid="PSA 25:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 25:7"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa, ati dansaa waan teeteef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:7">akka jaalala keeti ka bara baraatitti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:7">naa yaadadhu malee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:7">cubbuu dargaggummaa tiyyaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:7">yookiin yakkaa tiyya hin yaadatin.<verse eid="PSA 25:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 25:8"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa dansa'aa fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:8">balchaa waan te'eef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:8">inni cubbaaleyyii daandii ifii barsiisa.<verse eid="PSA 25:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 25:9"/>Inni worra gad ifi qabu haqaan sooressaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:9">karaa ifiille isaan hin barsiisa.<verse eid="PSA 25:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 25:10"/>Worra gondooroo isaatii fi ajaja isaa eegatanuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:10">Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:10">jaalala ifii ka bara baraatii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:10">addatamummaa hin mudhisa.<verse eid="PSA 25:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 25:11"/>Yakkaan tiyya bacaa waan teeteef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:11">ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:11">maqaa keetiif jedhii naaf araarami.<verse eid="PSA 25:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 25:12"/>Nami Mootii Waan Maraa sodaatu eennu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:12">Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:12">karaa inni filatu'uu male isa hin barsiisa.<verse eid="PSA 25:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 25:13"/>Inni jiruu dansaa hin jiraata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:13">sanyiin isaalle lafa hin dhaalti.<verse eid="PSA 25:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 25:14"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:14">worra isa sodaatu dhossaa ifii itti hima;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:14">inni gondooroo ifii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:14">akka isaanitti beekkantu hin godha.<verse eid="PSA 25:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 25:15"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:15">miila kiyya tiyyoo keessaa waan baasuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:15">ilti tiyya yennaa mara gara isaa ilaalti.<verse eid="PSA 25:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 25:16"/>Ani qofuu waan jiruuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:16">cunqurfamaalle waan te'eef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:16">fuula keeti gara kiyya deebifadhuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:16">naaf mararfadhu.<verse eid="PSA 25:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 25:17"/>Rakkinni kiyya bindilla'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:17">farra tiyya jalaa na baasi.<verse eid="PSA 25:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 25:18"/>Rakkinnaa fi farra tiyya ilaali;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:18">cubbuu tiyya mara naa araarami.<verse eid="PSA 25:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 25:19"/>Diinoti kiyya attam attam akka bacatanu ilaali;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:19">attam akka isaan na jibbanulle ilaali.<verse eid="PSA 25:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 25:20"/>Na eegi; na baasi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:20">Ani waan sitti baqadheef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:20">akka ani fokkifadhu na hin godhin.<verse eid="PSA 25:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 25:21"/>Ani addi'iin waan si eegadhuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:21">addatamumma'aa fi qajeelummaan na eeganuu ti;<verse eid="PSA 25:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 25:22"/>Ee Waaqa, rakkinna isi'ii mara keessaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:22">kolbaa Israa'elii wodi.<verse eid="PSA 25:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="PSA 26"/>
  <para style="s1">Daadimata Nama Komii hin qannee</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Daawitii.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 26:1"/>Ani komii tokko malee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:1">sitti addadhee raafama malee waan le'eef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:1">Ee Mootii Waan Maraa, naaf muri.<verse eid="PSA 26:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 26:2"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:2">na qorqori, hagalle na ilaali;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:2">gadhaa kiyyaa fi qalbii tiyya qorqori.<verse eid="PSA 26:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 26:3"/>Jaalalli keeti ka bara baraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:3">ila tiyya dura jira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:3">anille dhugaa teetiin hin ideema.<verse eid="PSA 26:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 26:4"/>Ani sobaaleyyii woliin hin tee'u;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:4">worra kijiboolee jaala hin godhadhu.<verse eid="PSA 26:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 26:5"/>Ani yaa'ii worra hantuu hujuu hin jibba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:5">hamaaleyyii wolille'een hin tee'u.<verse eid="PSA 26:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 26:6"/>Yakkaa akka hin qanne mudhisiisaaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:6">harka dhiqadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:6">Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:6">addee ciinca'aa teeti cinaa mara.<verse eid="PSA 26:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 26:7"/>Faaruu galataa guddisee faarfataa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:7">hujii maade'ee teeti hin odeessa.<verse eid="PSA 26:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 26:8"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa, mana keeti addee ati leetu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:8">addee ulfinni keeti jiru, ani hin jaaladha.<verse eid="PSA 26:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 26:9"/>Lubbuu tiyya cubbaaleyyii woliin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:9">jiruu tiyya worra dhiiga namaa dhangalaasu woliin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:9">hin balleessin.<verse eid="PSA 26:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 26:10"/>Harka worra akkasii keessa karoora hama'atti jira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:10">harka isaanii middicha keessa safu'utti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:10 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Safuu: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yookiin malaamaltumma.</char></note> guuteera.<verse eid="PSA 26:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 26:11"/>Ani ammoo komii malee le'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:11">na wodi; na mararfadhu.<verse eid="PSA 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 26:12"/>Miilli kiyya lafa wol qixxee irra dhaabbateera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:12">gumii guddoo keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:12">ani Mootii Waan Maraa leellisa.<verse eid="PSA 26:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="PSA 27"/>
  <para style="s1">Daadimata Waaqatti Addatiisaa</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Daawitii.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 27:1"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa ifa kiyyaa fi fayyinna kiyya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:1">ani eennu sodaadha ree?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 27:1">Mootiin Waan Maraa kushee jiruu tiyyaa ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:1">eentu na sodaachisa ree?<verse eid="PSA 27:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 27:2"/>Worri hamaaleyyiin foon kiyya nyaatiisaaf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:2">yennaa natti dhufanu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:2">diinoti kiyyaa fi nyaapholeen tiyya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:2">yennaa na lolanu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:2">isaanuu gufatanee hin jigan.<verse eid="PSA 27:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 27:3"/>Loltooti duudiin na marsanulle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:3">ani hin sodaadhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:3">lolli yoo natti ka'elle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:3">ani Mootuma Waan Maraa addadha.<verse eid="PSA 27:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 27:4"/>Ani waan tokko Mootii Waan Maraa gaafadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:4">isiille dhaggatuu barbaada:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:4">bara jiruu tiyyaa mara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:4">mana Mootii Waan Maraa keessa akka le'u,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:4">dansummaa isaa akka dhaggu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:4">Dunkaanii Woyyittii isaa keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:4">akka isa barbaadadhu.<verse eid="PSA 27:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 27:5"/>Inni guyyaa rakkinnaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:5">mana ifii keessatti na hin eega;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 27:5">Dunkaanii Woyyittii ifii keessatti na hin dhossa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:5">rassaa irratti ol na hin baasa.<verse eid="PSA 27:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 27:6"/>Achiin duuba diinota na marsaneeranu irratti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:6">mataan kiyya ol hin jedha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:6">gammadaa ilillisaa addee dunkaanii isaatitti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:6">ciincaa isaaf hin dhikeessa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:6">faarfataa, Mootii Waan Maraa hin leellisa.<verse eid="PSA 27:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 27:7"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:7">ani yennaa si waamu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:7">naa dhage'i;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:7">naa marariitii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:7">daadimata kiyya naa dhage'i.<verse eid="PSA 27:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 27:8"/>Gadhaan kiyya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:8">«Fuula isaa barbaadi» naan jedhe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:8">ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:8">ani fuula keeti barbaada.<verse eid="PSA 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 27:9"/>Fuula keeti na hin dhossin.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 27:9"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 27:9">Ati aari'iin ana tajaajilaa keeti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:9">ifi irraa hin fageessin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:9">ati qarqaarsa naaf teeteerta.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 27:9">Ee Waaqa fayyisaa kiyya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:9">na hin gatin; na hin lakkisin!<verse eid="PSA 27:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 27:10"/>Abbaan kiyyaa fi haati tiyya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:10">yoo na lakkisanelle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:10">Mootiin Waan Maraa kiyya na hin fudhata.<verse eid="PSA 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 27:11"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:11">karaa keeti na barsiisi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:11">ani diinota hedduu waan qabuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:11">daandii qajeelaa irra na sooressi.<verse eid="PSA 27:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 27:12"/>Dhugaa baatoti dharaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:12">hunnaan waan na irratti ka'aneef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:12">fedhii diinota kiyyaatiif</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:12">dabarsitee na hin kennin.<verse eid="PSA 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 27:13"/>Lafa worra jiraata'aa keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:13">dansummaa Mootii Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:13">akka dhaggu hin addadha.<verse eid="PSA 27:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 27:14"/>Mootii Waan Maraa eegadhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:14">jabaadhu; addii hin kutatin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:14">Mootii Waan Maraa eegadhu.<verse eid="PSA 27:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="PSA 28"/>
  <para style="s1">Daadimata Qarqaarsa Dhaggatiisaaf Dhikaate</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Daawitii.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 28:1"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa, ani si waammadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:1">rassaa kiyya, ati na jalaa hin cadhisin!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 28:1">Ati yoo na jalaa cadhitte,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:1">ani akka worra boolla awwaalaatitti gad bu'ee hin te'a.<verse eid="PSA 28:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 28:2"/>Qarqaarsa dhaggatiisaaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:2">harka kiyya gara addee woyyittii woyyootaa teetii ol kaasee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:2">yennaa ani gara keeti iyyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:2">daadimata kiyya naaf dhage'i.<verse eid="PSA 28:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 28:3"/>Worra hamaaleyyii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:3">ka waan hantuu huju woliin na hin harkisin!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 28:3">Isaan ollaa ifii woliin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:3">afaaniin dubbii nageyaa dubbatan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:3">gadhaa ifii keessatti ammoo waan hantuu yaadan.<verse eid="PSA 28:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 28:4"/>Ati akka hujii isaaniititti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:4">akka hujii hantuu isaaniititti gatii isaaniif kenni;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 28:4">Akka hujii harka isaaniititti isaaniif kenni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:4">adabbii isaaniif malte isaaniif kenni.<verse eid="PSA 28:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 28:5"/>Isaan hujii Mootii Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:5">yookiin hujii harka isaa waan hin ilaalleef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:5">inni isaan hin diiga malee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:5">deebi'ee isaan hin ijaaru.<verse eid="PSA 28:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 28:6"/>Iyya tiyya waan dhage'eef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:6">Mootiin Waan Maraa leellifamu.<verse eid="PSA 28:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 28:7"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa jabeenna kiyya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:7">wontee tiyyalle'e;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:7">ani isatti addadha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 28:7">Inni waan na qarqaaree na gammachiiseef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:7">ani faaru'uun isa hin galateessa.<verse eid="PSA 28:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 28:8"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:8">kolbaa ifiitiif jabeenna isaanii ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:8">ka ifii muudeef kushee fayyinnaa ti.<verse eid="PSA 28:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 28:9"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:9">kolbaa teeti baasi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:9">worra keeti te'ane eebbisi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:9">tissee isaanii te'iitii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:9">haga bara baraa isaan ba'adhu.<verse eid="PSA 28:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="PSA 29"/>
  <para style="s1">Hunna Mootii Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Daawitii.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 29:1"/>Isin ergantooti Waaqaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:1">ulfinnaa fi hunna Mootii Waan Maraa leellisa'a.<verse eid="PSA 29:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 29:2"/>Ulfinna maqaa isaatiif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:2">Mootii Waan Maraa leellisa'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:2">Arnya woyyummaa isaatiif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:2">Mootii Waan Maraa waaqonfadha'a.<verse eid="PSA 29:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 29:3"/>Qoonqoon Mootii Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:3">abbaayaa guddittii irraa dhage'anti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:3">Waaqi ulfinnaa, Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:3">abbaayaa irraa mandi'a.<verse eid="PSA 29:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 29:4"/>Qoonqoon Mootii Waan Maraa hunnaametti'i;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:4">qoonqoon Mootii Waan Maraa arnya qabeetti'i.<verse eid="PSA 29:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 29:5"/>Qoonqoon Mootii Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:5">hindheensa caccassiti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:5">Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:5">hindheensa Libaanoniituu hin caccassa.<verse eid="PSA 29:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 29:6"/>Inni gaara Libaanonii akka jabbi'ii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:6">gaara Siiriyoniille<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:6 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Gaara Siiriyonii: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Gaarri kun gaaruma Herimonii ti. </char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:6">akka ilmee gafarsaa hin burraassisa.<verse eid="PSA 29:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 29:7"/>Qoonqoon Mootii Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:7">balaqqeettii balaqqitti.<verse eid="PSA 29:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 29:8"/>Qoonqoon Mootii Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:8">goomolee tachootti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:8">Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:8">goomolee Qaadeshii hin tachoosa.<verse eid="PSA 29:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 29:9"/>Qoonqoon Mootii Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:9">qilxaan akka hargufamu gooti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:9">baala muka badda'aa hin harcaatti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:9">worri addee inni jiruu martinuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:9">«Ulfinni Mootii Waan Maraatiif te'u!» jedhan.<verse eid="PSA 29:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 29:10"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa qilee abbaaya'aalle bulcha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:10">Mootiin Waan Maraa haga bara baraa hin bulcha.<verse eid="PSA 29:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 29:11"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa kolbaa ifiitiif jabeenna kenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:11">nageyalle'een isaan eebbisa.<verse eid="PSA 29:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 29"/>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="PSA 30"/>
  <para style="s1">Daadimata Galataa</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Daawitii ta eebba manaatiif Faarfante.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 30:1"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa, ati qilee keessaa na baattee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:1">diinoti kiyya na irratti akka hin gammanne waan gooteef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:1">ani guddisee si galateeffadha.<verse eid="PSA 30:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 30:2"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa Waaqa kiyya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:2">akka na qarqaartuuf gara keetti iyyee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:2">atille na fayyitteerta.<verse eid="PSA 30:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 30:3"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:3">ati lubbuu tiyya boolla awwaalaa keessaa baatteerta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:3">akka ani boollatti gad hin buune na hamburteerta.<verse eid="PSA 30:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 30:4"/>Isin worri isaaf addatantane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:4">Mootii Waan Maraa faaru'uun leellisa'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:4">maqaa isaa woyyichalle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:4">galateessa'a.<verse eid="PSA 30:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 30:5"/>Aariin isaa yennaa diqqoo qofa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:5">tolli isaa ammoo bara jiru'uu mara.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 30:5">Halkan bowaa yoo bulane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:5">ganama ammoo ililleessi hin te'a.<verse eid="PSA 30:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 30:6"/>Yennaa natti tole, ani ifiin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:6">«Ani ijjumaa hin raafamu» jedhe.<verse eid="PSA 30:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 30:7"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:7">arnya keetiin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:7">akka gaara jabaa tokkoo na goote;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:7">yennaa fuula keeti na duraa dhossite ammoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:7">guddoo sodaadhe.<verse eid="PSA 30:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 30:8"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:8">ani si waammadhee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:8">akka na marartuuf si gaafadhee,<verse eid="PSA 30:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 30:9"/>«Du'a tiyya irraa maan dhaggatta?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:9">Ani yoo boollatti gad bu'e bu'aan maan?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 30:9">Worri du'eeru si hin leellisaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:9">Isaan addatamummaa teeti hin himanii?<verse eid="PSA 30:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 30:10"/>Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:10">naa dhage'i; naa marari;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:10">Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:10">na qarqaar» jedhe.<verse eid="PSA 30:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 30:11"/>Ati gadda kiyya gara sirbaatitti jijjiirte;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:11">woyaa gaddaa na irraa fuutee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:11">gammada natti uffitte.<verse eid="PSA 30:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 30:12"/>Yoona, ani hin cadhisu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:12">faaru'uun si leellisa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 30:12">Ee Mootii Waan Maraa Waaqa kiyya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:12">ani haga bara baraa si galateessa.<verse eid="PSA 30:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 30"/>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="PSA 31"/>
  <para style="s1">Daadimata Waaqatti Adddatiisaa</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Daawitii, sooressa faarfattootaatiif.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 31:1"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:1">ani sitti baqadheera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:1">ani ijjumaa hin fokkifatin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:1">balchummaa teetiin na baasi.<verse eid="PSA 31:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 31:2"/>Gurra keeti gara kiyya deebifadhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:2">ariifadhuu na baasi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:2">Rassaa ani itti baqadhu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:2">na baasiisaaf, kushee jadduu naaf te'i.<verse eid="PSA 31:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 31:3"/>Ati rassaa kiyyaa fi kushee tiyya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:3">maqaa keetiif jedhii na sooressi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:3">naan duralle deemi.<verse eid="PSA 31:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 31:4"/>Ati addee ani itti baqadhu waan teeteef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:4">tiyyoo diinoti naaf afane jalaa na baasi.<verse eid="PSA 31:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 31:5"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa, Waaqa addatama'a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:5">ati na wodatteerta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:5">anille lubbuu tiyya harka keetitti kennadha.<verse eid="PSA 31:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 31:6"/>Ani worra waaqota dharaa waaqonfatu hin jibba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:6">ammoo Mootii Waan Maraatitti hin addadha.<verse eid="PSA 31:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 31:7"/>Sababa jaalala keeti ka bara baraatiif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:7">ani gammadee hin ilillisa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:7">Ati farra tiyya dhaggiteerta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:7">rakkoo tiyyalle beetteerta.<verse eid="PSA 31:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 31:8"/>Ati harka diinotaatitti dabarsitee na hin kennine;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:8">miila kiyya ammoo addee badhoo dhaabbachiitte.<verse eid="PSA 31:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 31:9"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:9">ani rakkatiisatti waan jiruuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:9">naa marari;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:9">bowa guddo'oon ilti tiyya dadhaddeerti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:9">lubbuun tiyyaa fi nafi kiyyalle gaddaan dadhabeera.<verse eid="PSA 31:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 31:10"/>Barri jiruu tiyyaa gaddaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:10">woggaan tiyya aadiisaan dabaraneeran;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:10">sababa rakkoo tiyyaatiif hunna dhabe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:10">lafeen tiyyalle dadhadde.<verse eid="PSA 31:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 31:11"/>Diinoti kiyya marti natti murgane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:11">ollaan kiyyalle irra caalaa natti murge;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:11">worri na beeku natti fokkifata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:11">worri karaa irratti na dhaggu na irraa baqata.<verse eid="PSA 31:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 31:12"/>Akka nama du'ee dedhame;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:12">akka okkotee caddee te'e.<verse eid="PSA 31:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 31:13"/>Ani hasaassaa nama heddu'uu waan dhage'uuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:13">adaala kiyya mara soda'atti jira.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:13">Isaan wolitti qabamanee na irratti mari'atan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:13">na ijjeesiisaafille mala dhowan.<verse eid="PSA 31:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 31:14"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:14">ani ammoo si'itti addadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:14">«Ati Waaqa kiyya» jedha.<verse eid="PSA 31:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 31:15"/>Ani yennaa mara harka keeti keessa jira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:15">harka diinota kiyyaatii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:15">worra na ari'u jalaa na baasi.<verse eid="PSA 31:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 31:16"/>Fuulli keeti ana tajaajilaa keetitti ifuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:16">jaalala keeti ka bara baraatiin na baasi.<verse eid="PSA 31:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 31:17"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:17">ani waan si waammadheef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:17">akka fokkifadhu na hin godhin.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:17">Worri hamaaleyyiin fokkifatuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:17">gara addee worri du'e jirutti gad bu'anee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:17">cadhisanuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 31:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 31:18"/>Afaan dharaamessi kooraa fi tuffi'iin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:18">nama balchaa irratti dubbatu cadhisuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 31:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 31:19"/>Wonni dansaan ta ati worra si sodaatuuf massite,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:19">dansummaan ta ati ilmaan namootaa duratti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:19">worra sitti baqatuuf mudhitte,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:19">attam attam guddo'o!<verse eid="PSA 31:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 31:20"/>Ati mala nami dhowu duraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:20">bobaa teeti jalatti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:20">jechoota hamaa duraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:20">dunkaanii teeti keessatti isaan dhossita.<verse eid="PSA 31:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 31:21"/>Yennaa ani qachaa marfame keessa jiru</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:21">Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:21">jaalala ifii ka bara baraatiin waan na jaalateef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:21">inni leellifamu.<verse eid="PSA 31:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 31:22"/>Ani yennaa rifadhe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:22">«Fuula keeti duraa gatameera» jedheeraayyu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:22">Ati ammoo yennaa ani gara keeti iyye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:22">iyya tiyya naa dhageette.<verse eid="PSA 31:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 31:23"/>Isin worri isaaf woyyoontane marti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:23">Mootii Waan Maraa jaaladha'a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:23">Mootiin Waan Maraa worra addatamaa hin eega;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:23">worra kooru ammoo ijjumaa hin adaba.<verse eid="PSA 31:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 31:24"/>Isin worri Mootii Waan Maraatitti addii godhattanu marti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:24">jabaadha'a; jajjabaadha'a.<verse eid="PSA 31:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 31"/>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="PSA 32"/>
  <para style="s1">Cubbuu faaci'atiisaa Fi Araara</para>
  <para style="s2">Wolaloo Daawitii.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 32:1"/>Nami cubbuu isaatiif araarri kennameef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:1">ka yakkaan isaa lakkifanteef ka gammade.<verse eid="PSA 32:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 32:2"/>Nami Mootiin Waan Maraa cubbuu itti hin laakkonne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:2">ka soba ifi keessaa hin qanne ka gammade.<verse eid="PSA 32:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 32:3"/>Ani yennaa cubbuu tiyya faaci'atuu dhabe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:3">guyyaa guutuu aada.<verse eid="PSA 32:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 32:4"/>Ati halkanii fi guyyaa na adadde;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:4">akka waan o'i bonaa gossee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:4">hunni tiyya na keessaa godde.<verse eid="PSA 32:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 32:5"/>Achiin duuba ani cubbuu tiyya sitti dhugaa baase;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:5">yakkaa tiyyalle hin dhoffanne.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 32:5">Ani «Cubbuu tiyya Mootii Waan Maraatitti dhugaa baasa» jedhe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:5">atille cubbuu tiyya naaf araarante.<verse eid="PSA 32:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 32:6"/>Tanaaf, nami addatamaan marti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:6">gara keeti daadimatuu ti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 32:6">Rakkinni akka lolaa jaba'aa yennaa dhufe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:6">isa hin dhaqqabu.<verse eid="PSA 32:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 32:7"/>Ati addee ani itti dhokadhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:7">ati rakkinna irraa na eedda.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 32:7">Ati ililleettii worra bayiisa kiyyatti firinxiixuun na marsite.<verse eid="PSA 32:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 32:8"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:8">«Ani karaa ati deemu'uu malte</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:8">si hubachiisee si barsiisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:8">si gorsa; si toowadha.<verse eid="PSA 32:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 32:9"/>Ati akka fardaa fi gaange'ee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:9">ka wo hin beennee hin te'in!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 32:9">Bixaalaa fi lugaamaan ifitti yoo harkitte malee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:9">isaan sitti hin dhikaatanu» jedhe.<verse eid="PSA 32:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 32:10"/>Farri worra cubbaaleyyi'ii heddu'u;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:10">nama Mootii Waan Maraatitti addatu ammoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:10">jaalalli isaa ka bara baraa isa hin marsa.<verse eid="PSA 32:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 32:11"/>Isin balchooleen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:11">Mootii Waan Maraatiin gammada'aa ilillisa'a!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:11">Isin worri gadhaa qajeela'aa ilillisa'a.<verse eid="PSA 32:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 32"/>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="PSA 33"/>
  <para style="s1">Faaruu Leellisaa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 33:1"/>Isin balchooti Mootii Waan Maraatiin gammada'a.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:1">Worri qajeelaan isa leellisuu barbaachisa.<verse eid="PSA 33:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 33:2"/>Maasinqo'oon Mootii Waan Maraa leellisa'a!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:2">Kiraara guddicha ribuu kudhaniitiin isaaf faarsa'a.<verse eid="PSA 33:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 33:3"/>Faaruu haareya isaaf faarsa'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:3">kiraara guddicha akka dansaa dhowa'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:3">gammadaan, «Ilili!» jedha'a.<verse eid="PSA 33:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 33:4"/>Jechi Mootii Waan Maraa dhuga'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:4">Mootiin Waan Maraa hujii ifii maraan addatama'a.<verse eid="PSA 33:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 33:5"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa balchumma'aa fi haqa jaalata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:5">Latti jaalala isaa ka bara baraatiin guutanteerti.<verse eid="PSA 33:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 33:6"/>Ol-gubbaan jecha Mootii Waan Maraatiin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:6">aduun, ji'aa fi urjooti ajaja isaatiin dadamane.<verse eid="PSA 33:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 33:7"/>Inni bisaan abbaaya'aa addee tokkotti wolitti qaba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:7">abbaayaa gugurdoo qilee te'ane</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:7">addee itti kuufamanutti kuusa.<verse eid="PSA 33:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 33:8"/>Biyyi lafaa marti Mootii Waan Maraa sodaattuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:8">kolbaan biyya lafaa marti isaaf sheephittuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 33:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 33:9"/>Inni dubbate, wonni inni dubbatelle dadante;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:9">inni ajaje, wonni inni ajajelle teete.<verse eid="PSA 33:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 33:10"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:10">karoora gosa biyya adda addaa hin diiga;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:10">inni yaadi kolbaa heddu'uu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:10">hujii irra akka hin oolle godha.<verse eid="PSA 33:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 33:11"/>Karoorri Mootii Waan Maraa ammoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:11">bara baraan jabaatee dhaabbata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:11">yaadi isaalle dhaloota irraa gara dhalootaa dabara.<verse eid="PSA 33:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 33:12"/>Gosi Waaqi Mootii Waan Maraa te'eef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:12">kolbaan inni ifiif filate gammadduu ti.<verse eid="PSA 33:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 33:13"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa ol-gubbaa irraa gad ilaala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:13">inni nama duudii dhagga.<verse eid="PSA 33:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 33:14"/>Barcumaa mootummaa ifii irraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:14">inni worra lafa irra jiru mara dhagga.<verse eid="PSA 33:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 33:15"/>Inni ka qalbii isaanii mara dade,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:15">waan isaan hujanu mara hin beeka.<verse eid="PSA 33:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 33:16"/>Mootiin loltoota ifii guddo'oon hin bayu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:16">jannille jabeenna ifii gudda'aan hin miliqu.<verse eid="PSA 33:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 33:17"/>Fardi lolaa injifatiisaaf addii bu'aa hin qanne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:17">jabeenni guddaan isaalle nama baasuu hin dande'u.<verse eid="PSA 33:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 33:18"/>Ilti Mootii Waan Maraa ammoo worra isa sodaatu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:18">worra jaalala isaa ka bara baraatitti addatu ilaalti.<verse eid="PSA 33:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 33:19"/>Inni du'a irraa isaan hambura;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:19">bara beelaalle jiru'uun isaan eega.<verse eid="PSA 33:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 33:20"/>Lubbuun teenna addi'iin Mootii Waan Maraa eegatti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:20">inni qarqaaraa keenna; wontee teennalle'e.<verse eid="PSA 33:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 33:21"/>Maqaa isaa woyyichatti waan addannuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:21">gadhaan keenna isatti gammada.<verse eid="PSA 33:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 33:22"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:22">akkuma nuuti addii si godhane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:22">jaalalli keeti ka bara baraa nu irratti te'uu ti.<verse eid="PSA 33:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 33"/>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="PSA 34"/>
  <para style="s1">Leellisa Mootii Waan Maraatiif Dhikaatu</para>
  <para style="s2">Daawiti akka maraata'aa te'ee, Abiimelek dura waan dhikaateef, Abiimelek isa ariinaan, yennaa achii deeme faaruu Daawiti faarfate.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 34:1"/>Ani yennaa mara Mootii Waan Maraa hin leellisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:1">isa saadiisille yennaa mara afaan kiyyaa hin bu'u.<verse eid="PSA 34:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 34:2"/>Ani Mootii Waan Maraatiin ifi jaja;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:2">worri cunqurfame dhage'ee gammaduu ti.<verse eid="PSA 34:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 34:3"/>Na woliin guddinna Mootii Waan Maraa odeessa'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:3">maqaa isaa tokkumma'aan leellinnuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 34:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 34:4"/>Ani gara Mootii Waan Maraa daadimadhee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:4">innille deebii naa kenne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:4">waan sodaadhu mara jalaa na baase.<verse eid="PSA 34:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 34:5"/>Worri gara isaa ilaalu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:5">fuulli isaanii hin ifa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:5">isaan hin salphatanu.<verse eid="PSA 34:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 34:6"/>Namichi rakkataan kun isa waame,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:6">Mootiin Waan Maraalle isaaf dhage'e;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:6">rakkinna isaa mara keessaa isa baase.<verse eid="PSA 34:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 34:7"/>Ergamaan Mootii Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:7">adaala worra isa sodaatuu hin qubata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:7">inni balaa jalaa isaan hin baasa.<verse eid="PSA 34:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 34:8"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa attam attam dansaa akka te'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:8">qorqora'aatii ilaala'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:8">nami isatti baqatu ka gammade.<verse eid="PSA 34:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 34:9"/>Worri Mootii Waan Maraa sodaatu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:9">womaa waan hin dhanneef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:9">isin worri isaaf woyyoontane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:9">Mootii Waan Maraa sodaadha'a.<verse eid="PSA 34:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 34:10"/>Dardarooti neenqaatuu dhabanee hin beelotan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:10">worri Mootii Waan Maraa barbaadu ammoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:10">waan dansaa hin dhabu.<verse eid="PSA 34:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 34:11"/>Ee ijoolle! Gara kiyya kowa'aatii, na caqasa'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:11">ani Mootii Waan Maraa sodaatiisa isin hin barsiisa.<verse eid="PSA 34:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 34:12"/>Ka jiruu jaalatu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:12">waan dansaa dhaggiisaafille</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:12">bara hedduu ka halchu eennu?<verse eid="PSA 34:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 34:13"/>Arraba keeti waan hantuu irraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:13">hidhii teeti soba dubbatiisa irraa eegadhu.<verse eid="PSA 34:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 34:14"/>Waan hantuu irraa fagaadhuutii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:14">waan dansaa godhi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:14">nageya barbaadiitii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:14">gula deemi.<verse eid="PSA 34:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 34:15"/>Ilti Mootii Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:15">gara balchoole'ee ilaalti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:15">gurri isaalle iyya isaanii caqasa.<verse eid="PSA 34:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 34:16"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:16">worra waan hantuu huju hin morma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:16">lafa irratti akka isaan hin qaabatanne godha.<verse eid="PSA 34:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 34:17"/>Yennaa balchooleen gara isaa iyyitu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:17">Mootiin Waan Maraa isaaniif hin dhage'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:17">inni rakkinna isaanii mara keessaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:17">isaan hin baasa.<verse eid="PSA 34:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 34:18"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:18">worra guddoo gaddeeruuf dhikoo jira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:18">inni worra addii kutateeru hin baasa.<verse eid="PSA 34:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 34:19"/>Rakkoon balcha'aa baca'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:19">Mootiin Waan Maraa ammoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:19">waan mara keessaa isa hin baasa.<verse eid="PSA 34:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 34:20"/>Inni lafee isaa mara hin eega;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:20">lafee isaa keessaa takkaalle hin caddu.<verse eid="PSA 34:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 34:21"/>Hammeenni nama hamaa hin ijjeesa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:21">worra nama balchaa jibbu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:21">yakkaan itti hin muranti.<verse eid="PSA 34:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 34:22"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:22">jiruu tajaajiltoota ifii hin woda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:22">worra gara isaa baqatu keessaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:22">tokkolle'etti yakkaan itti hin murantu.<verse eid="PSA 34:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 34"/>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="PSA 35"/>
  <para style="s1">Diinota Jalaa Bayiisaaf Daadimata Dhikaate</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Daawitii.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 35:1"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:1">worra natti ka'u irratti ka'i;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:1">worra na lolu loli.<verse eid="PSA 35:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 35:2"/>Wontee teetii fi meya lolaa keeti fudhadhuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:2">na qarqaariisaaf koy.<verse eid="PSA 35:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 35:3"/>Worra na ari'utti ebo'oo fi urdee teeti fudhadhuutii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:3">lubbuu tiyyaan, «Ani fayyisaa keeti» jedhi.<verse eid="PSA 35:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 35:4"/>Worri na ijjeesiisaaf barbaadu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:4">fokkifatee qaanowuu ti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 35:4">Worri mala natti dhowu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:4">gara duubaa deebi'ee salphatuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 35:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 35:5"/>Ergamaan Waaqaa isaan ari'uun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:5">akka huura qilleensi afuufuu te'anuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 35:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 35:6"/>Ergamaan Mootii Waan Maraa isaan ari'uun</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:6">karaan isaanii dukkanaa fi mucucoo te'uu ti.<verse eid="PSA 35:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 35:7"/>Isaan sababa tokko malee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:7">tiyyoo dhossa'aan naaf afanee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:7">na qabiisaaf boolla qotaneeran.<verse eid="PSA 35:7"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 35:8"/>Adoo hin beekin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:8">badiin isaan irratti dhuttuu ti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:8">Tiyyoon isaan dhossane</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:8">isaanuma qadduu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:8">Boolla qotane keessa bu'anee badanuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 35:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 35:9"/>Lubbuun tiyya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:9">Mootii Waan Maraatiin hin gammaddi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:9">fayyisiisa isaatiin gammaddee firinxiixxi.<verse eid="PSA 35:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 35:10"/>Gadhaa kiyya tokkochaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:10">«Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:10">dadhaboolee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:10">worra guddoo jajjabaa harkaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:10">dadhaboole'ee fi hiyyeeyyiille</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:10">saantota harkaa ka baasu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:10">ka akka keetii eennu?» jedha.<verse eid="PSA 35:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 35:11"/>Dhugaa baatoti dharaa natti ka'ane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:11">marroo waan ani hin beennee na gaafatane.<verse eid="PSA 35:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 35:12"/>Qofi-galeessa na godhanee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:12">waan dansaa ani godheef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:12">hantuu naaf deebisane.<verse eid="PSA 35:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 35:13"/>Ani ammoo yennaa isaan dhibamane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:13">woyaa gaddaa uffadhe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:13">laamiisaan ifi rakkise;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:13">daadimati kiyyalle deebii dhabee,<verse eid="PSA 35:13"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 35:14"/>akka waan jaalaaf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:14">yookiin obboleessaaf gadduutitti gadde;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:14">akka nama haadha ifiitiif bowuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:14">mataa gad qabadhee bowe.<verse eid="PSA 35:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 35:15"/>Yennaa ani gufadhe ammoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:15">isaan gammadane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:15">dedhuma dhufanee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:15">sababa malee arrabaan na kukkutane.<verse eid="PSA 35:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 35:16"/>Akkuma worri Waaqa malee le'u godhu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:16">natti murgane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:16">ilkaan natti ciniinnatane.<verse eid="PSA 35:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 35:17"/>Ee Gootta'a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:17">haga yoomii cadhittee na ilaalta?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:17">Worra na miidhu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:17">ka akka neenqaa kana jalaa na baasi.<verse eid="PSA 35:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 35:18"/>Achiin duuba ani kolbaa teeti keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:18">si hin galateeffadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:18">kolbaa bacaa keessatti si hin leellifadha.<verse eid="PSA 35:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 35:19"/>Worri akkasumaan diina natti te'u,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:19">natti hin gammadin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:19">worri akkasumaan na jibbu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:19">na irratti ilaan wolitti hin qiphifatin.<verse eid="PSA 35:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 35:20"/>Isaan dubbii nageyaa hin dubbatanu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:20">worra biyya keessa nageyaan le'u irratti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:20">dubbii dharaa yaadanee qopheessan.<verse eid="PSA 35:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 35:21"/>Isaan, «Baga waan ati hujje dhaggine!» jedhaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:21">afaan natti banan.<verse eid="PSA 35:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 35:22"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa, ati tana dhaggiteerta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:22">hin cadhisin!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:22">Ee Gootta'a, na irraa hin fagaatin!<verse eid="PSA 35:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 35:23"/>Ee Gootta'a, Waaqa kiyya dammaqi!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:23">Na irraa dhooggiisaaf ka'i!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:23">Haajaa kiyyaaf loli.<verse eid="PSA 35:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 35:24"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa, Waaqa kiyya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:24">balchummaa teetiin naaf muri;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:24">diinoti kiyya natti hin gammadin.<verse eid="PSA 35:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 35:25"/>Isaan, «Halchaa gadhaa keennaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:25">baga dhagganne!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:25">Nuuti ijjumaa isa balleessineerra» hin jedhin.<verse eid="PSA 35:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 35:26"/>Worri rakkinna kiyyatti gammadu marti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:26">fokkifatanee qaanowanuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:26">worri na irratti ifi saadu marti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:26">fokko'oo fi salphinna uffatuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 35:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 35:27"/>Worri muraa haqaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:27">dhaggatiisa kiyyatti gammadu marti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:27">gammadaan ilillisanuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:27">isaan «Mootiin Waan Maraa gudda'a!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:27">Inni yennaa tajaajilaan nageya dhaggatu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:27">hin gammada!» jedhanuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 35:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 35:28"/>Arrabi kiyya balchummaa teetii dubbataa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:28">guyyaa guutuu si hin leellisa.<verse eid="PSA 35:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 35"/>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="PSA 36"/>
  <para style="s1">Hammeenna Namaatii Fi Arjummaa Waaqaa</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Daawitii tajaajilaa Mootii Waan Maraa, sooressa faarfattootaatiif.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 36:1"/>Cubbuun nama hamaa gadhaa ifii keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:1">hammeenna akka yaadatu gooti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:1">Inni ijjumaa Waaqa hin sodaatu.<verse eid="PSA 36:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 36:2"/>Inni yakkaa ifii dhaggee akka hin jibbine,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:2">ifumaan ifi sossoba.<verse eid="PSA 36:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 36:3"/>Dubbiin afaan isaa hammeennaa fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:3">dharaan guutanteerti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:3">inni qarumma'aan hujiisaa fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:3">waan dansaa godhiisa lakkiseera.<verse eid="PSA 36:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 36:4"/>Inni rifanoo irra adoo jiruu hantuu yaadata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:4">karaa hamaa ideema;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:4">waan hantuu hin didatu.<verse eid="PSA 36:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 36:5"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:5">jaalalli keeti ka bara baraa haga ol-gubba'aa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:5">addatamummaan teetille</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:5">haga duumensaa hin dhaqqaddi.<verse eid="PSA 36:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 36:6"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:6">balchummaan teeti akka gaarota gugurda'aa ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:6">muraan teeti akka gad fageenna abbaaya'aa ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:6">ati namaa fi horii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:6">bineensalle hin eedda.<verse eid="PSA 36:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 36:7"/>Ee Waaqa, jaalalli keeti ka bara baraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:7">attam attam ka gatii guddoo qabu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:7">Kolbaan marti gaaddisa koola keetii jalatti baqatti.<verse eid="PSA 36:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 36:8"/>Isaan sagalee bacaa mana keetii nyaatan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:8">ati laga keeti gammachiisaa irraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:8">bisaan isaaniif kennita.<verse eid="PSA 36:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 36:9"/>Ati madda jiru'uu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:9">nuuti ifa keetiin ifa dhaggina.<verse eid="PSA 36:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 36:10"/>Worra si beekuuf, jaalalli keeti ka bara baraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:10">worra gadhaa-qajeela'aatiif</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:10">balchummaan keeti irraa hin citin.<verse eid="PSA 36:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 36:11"/>Miilli worra kooruu na hin dhiitin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:11">harki worra hamaaleyyi'ii na hin ari'in.<verse eid="PSA 36:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 36:12"/>Worri hamaaleyyiin attam akka jigane ilaali;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:12">isaan jiganeeran, ka'uu hin dande'anu.<verse eid="PSA 36:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 36"/>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="PSA 37"/>
  <para style="s1">Hiree worra Balcha'aatii Fi worra hama'aa</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Daawitii.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 37:1"/>Sababa worra hama'aatiif hin aarin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:1">worra cubbuu huju hin hinaafin.<verse eid="PSA 37:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 37:2"/>Isaan akka marraa ariifatanee hin gogan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:2">akka baala bisile'ee hin qooran.<verse eid="PSA 37:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 37:3"/>Mootii Waan Maraatitti addadhuu waan dansaa godhi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:3">biyya keessa nageyaan le'i.<verse eid="PSA 37:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 37:4"/>Mootii Waan Maraatitti gammadi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:4">inni halchaa gadhaa keetii si'iif hin kenna.<verse eid="PSA 37:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 37:5"/>Karaa keeti Mootii Waan Maraatitti kennadhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:5">isa addadhu; innille si'iif hin milkeessa.<verse eid="PSA 37:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 37:6"/>Inni balchummaa teeti akka ifaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:6">haqa haajaa keetii akka aduu saafowaa hin godha.<verse eid="PSA 37:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 37:7"/>Mootii Waan Maraa duratti cadhisiitii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:7">ossaan isa eeggadhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:7">worra hamaaleyyii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:7">yaad hamaan isaanii toleef itti hin aarin.<verse eid="PSA 37:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 37:8"/>Aarii irraa ifi dhooggi; mufii irraa deebi'i.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:8">Aariin gara hammeennaa qofa si geessitii, hin aarin.<verse eid="PSA 37:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 37:9"/>Worri hamaaleyyiin hin badan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:9">Worri Mootii Waan Maraa eegatu ammoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:9">lafa hin dhaalan.<verse eid="PSA 37:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 37:10"/>Nami hamaan yennaa diqqo'oon duuba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:10">achitti hin dhaggamu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:10">Ati isa hin barbaadda, ammoo hin dhaggitu.<verse eid="PSA 37:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 37:11"/>Worri gad ifi qabu lafa hin dhaalan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:11">nageya gudda'aan hin gammadan.<verse eid="PSA 37:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 37:12"/>Nami hamaan nama balchaa irratti mala dhowa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:12">ilkaan itti ciniinnatta.<verse eid="PSA 37:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 37:13"/>Guyyaan nami hamaan sun badu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:13">akka dhufaaru waan beekuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:13">Goottaan ammoo itti kolla.<verse eid="PSA 37:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 37:14"/>Worri hamaaleyyiin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:14">worra hiyyeeyyi'ii fi worra deega ijjeesiisaaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:14">worra qajeelaa qaliisaaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:14">shallaagaa ifii buqqifatan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:14">guubeelle qopheeffatan.<verse eid="PSA 37:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 37:15"/>Shallaagaan isaanii ammoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:15">gadhuma isaanii hin woraana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:15">guubeen isaaniille hin caccaddi.<verse eid="PSA 37:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 37:16"/>Karra nama hama'aa hedduu caalaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:16">karra nama balcha'aa diqqoo woyya.<verse eid="PSA 37:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 37:17"/>Hunni worra hamaaleyyi'ii hin caddi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:17">worra balchoolee ammoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:17">Mootiin Waan Maraa hin utuba.<verse eid="PSA 37:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 37:18"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:18">worra komii hin qanne guyyuma guyya'aan eega;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:18">kennansi inni isaanii kenne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:18">haga bara baraa hin badu.<verse eid="PSA 37:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 37:19"/>Isaan yennaa hantuu keessalle hin salphatanu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:19">bara beelaalle hin quufan.<verse eid="PSA 37:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 37:20"/>Worri hamaaleyyiin ammoo hin badan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:20">diinoti Mootii Waan Maraalle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:20">akka marra diidaa hin dhumatan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:20">isaan akka aaraa hin badan.<verse eid="PSA 37:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 37:21"/>Nami hamaan liqaa hin deebisu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:21">nami balchaan ammoo arjumma'aan kenna.<verse eid="PSA 37:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 37:22"/>Worri Mootiin Waan Maraa eebbise lafa dhaalan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:22">Worri Mootiin Waan Maraa abaare ammoo hin badan.<verse eid="PSA 37:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 37:23"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:23">karaa namaatitti yennaa gammade,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:23">karaa isaaf akeekee, ijjata isaa jabeessa.<verse eid="PSA 37:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 37:24"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa harka ifiitiin isa waan qabuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:24">yoo gufatelle hin jigu.<verse eid="PSA 37:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 37:25"/>Ani dur dargageessa; amma dulloomeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:25">ani Mootiin Waan Maraa nama balchaa gateeruun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:25">yookiin ijoolleen isaa sagalee kadhattuun</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:25">ijjumaa dhaggee hin beeku.<verse eid="PSA 37:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 37:26"/>Nami balchaan yennaa mara arjumma'aan kenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:26">hin liqeessalle'e;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:26">sanyiin isaalle worra dhibi'iif eebba hin teeti.<verse eid="PSA 37:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 37:27"/>Waan hantuu irraa deebi'ii, waan dansaa godhi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:27">bara dheeraa hin leeta.<verse eid="PSA 37:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 37:28"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:28">muraa dhuga'aa waan jaalatuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:28">inni worra isaaf addatamu hin lakkisu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 37:28">Inni haga bara baraa nageyaan isaan eega;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:28">sanyiin worra hamaaleyyi'ii ammoo hin baddi.<verse eid="PSA 37:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 37:29"/>Worri balchooleen lafa hin dhaalan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:29">lafa san keessalle bara dheeraa hin le'an.<verse eid="PSA 37:29"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 37:30"/>Afaan nama balcha'aa qarummaa odeessa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:30">arrabi isaa haqa dubbata.<verse eid="PSA 37:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 37:31"/>Seerri Waaqaa qalbii isaa keessa jira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:31">miilli isaalle hin fallaadu.<verse eid="PSA 37:31"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 37:32"/>Nami hamaan nama balchaa riphee gaada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:32">ijjeesiisaaf isa barbaada.<verse eid="PSA 37:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 37:33"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa ammoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:33">harka diinaatitti isa hin kennu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:33">muraa dura yennaa dhikaate,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:33">yakkaan akka itti murantu hin godhu.<verse eid="PSA 37:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 37:34"/>Mootii Waan Maraa addi'iin eegadhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:34">karaa isaalle eegadhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:34">inni lafa si dhaalchisiisaaf ulfinna si'iif hin kenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:34">badii worra hamaaleyyi'iille hin dhaggita.<verse eid="PSA 37:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 37:35"/>Ani nama hamaa hunnaan nama irratti ka'u</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:35">ka akka muka lafa itti toltu irra jiruu tokko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:35">dagaageeruun dhagge.<verse eid="PSA 37:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 37:36"/>Eega san yennaa achiin dabaru, adde'ee dhabe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:36">ani isa barbaade,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:36">ammoo isa dhagguu hin dandeenne.<verse eid="PSA 37:36"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 37:37"/>Nama komii hin qanne ilaali;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:37">nama balchichaa hubadhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:37">nama nageellicha muummeen isaa hin baddu.<verse eid="PSA 37:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 37:38"/>Cubbaaleyyiin ammoo ijjumaa hin badan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:38">muummeen isaaniille hin baddi.<verse eid="PSA 37:38"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 37:39"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa balchoolee hin baasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:39">yennaa rakkinnaa addeen isaan itti baqatanu isa.<verse eid="PSA 37:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 37:40"/>Isaan Mootii Waan Maraatitti waan baqatanuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:40">inni isaan qarqaaree, isaan baasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:40">inni harka worra hamaaleyyi'ii irraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:40">isaan baasee, isaan hambura.<verse eid="PSA 37:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 37"/>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="PSA 38"/>
  <para style="s1">Daadimata Yennaa Rakkinnaa</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Daawitii ta akka Waaqi isa qaabatuuf faarfatante.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 38:1"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa, aari'iin na hin xixin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:1">mufi'iin na hin adabin.<verse eid="PSA 38:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 38:2"/>Daayi keeti na woraaneera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:2">harki keeti gad na qabe.<verse eid="PSA 38:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 38:3"/>Sababa mufii teetiitiif, nafi kiyya dhibameera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:3">sababa cubbu'uutiif, lafeen tiyya fayyaa hin qaddu.<verse eid="PSA 38:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 38:4"/>Yakkaan tiyya mataa kiyya irra dabarteerti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:4">isiin akka ba'a'aa guddoo natti ulfaatteerti.<verse eid="PSA 38:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 38:5"/>Sababa gowwummaa tiyyaatiif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:5">madaan tiyya shantee ajootti.<verse eid="PSA 38:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 38:6"/>Ani gad jedhee, guddoo gugguufe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:6">guyyaa guutuu bowaa daaqe.<verse eid="PSA 38:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 38:7"/>Hidhi kiyya waan na o'eef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:7">nafi kiyya fayyaa hin qabu.<verse eid="PSA 38:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 38:8"/>Ani dadhabee, ijjumaa bututeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:8">gadhaan waan na raafameef aada.<verse eid="PSA 38:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 38:9"/>Ee Goottaa kiyya, ati halchaa tiyya mara beetta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:9">aadiisi kiyya si duraa dhokatee hin jiru.<verse eid="PSA 38:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 38:10"/>Onneen tiyya na dhowatti; hunni tiyya na laatteerti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:10">ilti tiyyalle dhagguu dhaddeerti.<verse eid="PSA 38:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 38:11"/>Jaaloti tiyyaa fi lansooti kiyya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:11">sababa madaa tiyyaatiif na irraa baqatane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:11">firri kiyyaayyuu na irraa fagaatane.<verse eid="PSA 38:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 38:12"/>Worri na ijjeesiisaaf barbaadu tiyyoo natti afan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:12">worri na miidhiisaaf barbaadu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:12">na balleessiisaaf mari'atan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:12">isaan guyyaa guutuu mala natti dhowan.<verse eid="PSA 38:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 38:13"/>Ani ammoo akka nama gurra duudee, hin dhage'u;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:13">akka nama afaan duudee, hin dubbadhu.<verse eid="PSA 38:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 38:14"/>Dhugumaan, ani akka nama hin dhageennee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:14">akka nama deebii deebisuu hin dandeennee ti.<verse eid="PSA 38:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 38:15"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:15">ani ammoo addi'iin si eegadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:15">Ee Goottaa Waaqa kiyya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:15">atille deebii naaf hin kennita.<verse eid="PSA 38:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 38:16"/>Ani, «Worri yennaa miilli kiyya mucucaatu na irratti kooru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:16">akka isaan natti gammadanu hin godhin!» jedhe.<verse eid="PSA 38:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 38:17"/>Ani jiguu geyeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:17">yennaa mara ani dhibee woliin jira.<verse eid="PSA 38:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 38:18"/>Yakkaa tiyya hin faaci'adha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:18">cubbuu tiyyaaf gadda.<verse eid="PSA 38:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 38:19"/>Diinoti kiyya hunnaameyyiin baca'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:19">worri sababa malee na jibbu heddu'u.<verse eid="PSA 38:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 38:20"/>Yennaa ani waan dansaa huju</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:20">waan hantuu naaf deebisan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:20">yennaa ani waan dansaa hordofu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:20">isaan na morman.<verse eid="PSA 38:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 38:21"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa, na hin lakkisin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:21">Waaqa kiyya, na irraa hin fagaatin.<verse eid="PSA 38:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 38:22"/>Ee Goottaa fayyisaa kiyya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:22">na qarqaariisaaf ariifadhuu koy.<verse eid="PSA 38:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 38"/>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="PSA 39"/>
  <para style="s1">Jiruu Namaa Gabaadduu</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Daawitii, Sooressa faarfattootaa Yedutu'uuf.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 25:1">1 Dab. 25:1</ref>,<ref loc="1CH 25:3">3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 39:1"/>Ani, «Arraba kiyyaan cubbuu akka hin dubbanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:1">lafa dhaqu maratti ifi hin eegadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:1">haga nami hamaan na bira jiru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:1">ani womaa hin dubbadhu» jedheera.<verse eid="PSA 39:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 39:2"/>Jecha tokkolle hin dubbatinuu cadhise;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:2">marroo waan dansa'aalle hin dubbanne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:2">rakkinni kiyya ammoo guddataatuma ideeme.<verse eid="PSA 39:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 39:3"/>Gadhaan kiyya na gubatee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:3">yaada kiyya keessatti ibiddi gabbate;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:3">achiin duuba ani arraba kiyyaan dubbadhee,<verse eid="PSA 39:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 39:4"/>«Mootii Waan Maraa kiyya, dhuma jiruu tiyyaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:4">barri jiruu tiyyaa hagam akka te'e natti himi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:4">ani jiruun tiyya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:4">attam ariifattee dabariisatti akka jirtu beekuu ti!» jedhe.<verse eid="PSA 39:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 39:5"/>Ati bara jiruu tiyyaa taakkuu takkaa goote;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:5">barri jiruu tiyyaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:5">si duratti woyitti hin laakkowamu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 39:5">Dhugumaan jiruu nama maraatuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:5">akka baafata hafuuraa tokkochaa ti.<verse eid="PSA 39:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 39:6"/>Dhugumaan nami akka gaaddisaa ti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 39:6">Inni akkanumaan elowa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:6">karra tuulata; ammoo ka isii fudhatu hin beeku.<verse eid="PSA 39:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 39:7"/>Goottaa kiyya, amma ani maan eegadha ree?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:7">Addiin tiyya si'i.<verse eid="PSA 39:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 39:8"/>Cubbuu tiyya mara jalaa na baasi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:8">worri gowwooleen akka natti murganu hin godhin.<verse eid="PSA 39:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 39:9"/>Akka akkana rakkadhu ka godhe si waan teeteef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:9">ani hin cadhisa; afaan kiyya hin saaqadhu.<verse eid="PSA 39:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 39:10"/>Dhowicha harka keetiitiin dadhabeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:10">dhowicha keeti na irraa kaasi.<verse eid="PSA 39:10"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 39:11"/>Ati sababa yakkaa isaatiif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:11">nama xixxee hin adadda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:11">akka waan qu'een nyaattee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:11">karra isaa hin balleessita.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:11">Dhugumaan nami akka baafata hafuura tokkochaa ti.<verse eid="PSA 39:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 39:12"/>Ee Mootiin Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:12">daadimata kiyya naa dhage'i;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:12">iyya tiyyalle caqasi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:12">imimmaan tiyyatti hin cadhisin.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 39:12">Ani si duratti alaga'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:12">akkuma abbootii tiyya ta durii keessumma'a.<verse eid="PSA 39:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 39:13"/>Gara hin deebinetti, gara du'aa adoo hin deemin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:13">gammada diqqaa akka dhaggadhu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:13">nyaara guurtee na hin ilaalin.<verse eid="PSA 39:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 39"/>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="PSA 40"/>
  <para style="s1">Faaruu Leellisaa</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Daawitii, sooressa faarfattootaatiif.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 40:1"/>Ani ossaan Mootii Waan Maraa eegadhe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:1">innille gara kiyya deebi'ee iyya tiyya dhage'e.<verse eid="PSA 40:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 40:2"/>Inni boolla caffa'aa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:2">linxixxoo dhoqqe'ee keessaa na baase.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:2">Inni miila kiyya rassaa irra dhaabbachiisee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:2">addee jadduu ani ideemu naa kenne.<verse eid="PSA 40:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 40:3"/>Inni faaruu haareya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:3">leellisa Waaqa keennaa afaan kiyya keessa keye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:3">Worri hedduun tana dhagganee isa sodaatanee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:3">Mootii Waan Maraatitti addatan.<verse eid="PSA 40:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 40:4"/>Nami Mootii Waan Maraatitti addatu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:4">gara worra koorameeyyi'iitii fi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:4">dharaameyyi'ii deebi'iisaan ka itti hin addanne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:4">ka gammade.<verse eid="PSA 40:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 40:5"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa Waaqa kiyya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:5">baasa hedduu nuu gooteerta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:5">ka akka keetii hin jiru!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:5">Ati waan baasaa nuu yaadatteerta.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:5">Laakkossi waan kanaa guddoo baca'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:5">ani ijjumaa odeessee fixee hin dande'u.<verse eid="PSA 40:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 40:6"/>Ati ciinca'aa fi kennansa hin barbaaddu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:6">horiin addee ciinca'aa irratti akka ciinceffamu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:6">yookiin ciincaa araara cubbu'uu hin barbaaddu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:6">Tanaa manna, gurra sii dhage'u naaf kenniteerta.<verse eid="PSA 40:6"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 40:7"/>Tanaaf anille, «Marroo tiyyaaf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:7">kitaaba maramaa keessatti akkuma barreeffante,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:7">kunoo, ani dhufeera;<verse eid="PSA 40:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 40:8"/>Waaqa kiyya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:8">ani fedhii teeti muummessuu halcha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:8">seerri keeti gadhaa kiyya keessa jira» jedhe.<verse eid="PSA 40:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 40:9"/>Ani wolde'a guddicha keessatti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:9">balchummaa teeti odeessa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:9">Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:9">akkuma ati beettu ani odeessuu ijjumaa hin lakkisu.<verse eid="PSA 40:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 40:10"/>Ani balchummaa teeti gadhaa kiyya keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:10">hin dhossine;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:10">ani addatamummaa teetii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:10">fayyisiisa keeti odeesseera.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:10">Wolde'a keeti guddicha duraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:10">jaala keeti ka bara baraatii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:10">addatamummaa teeti hin dhossine.<verse eid="PSA 40:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 40:11"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:11">ati marartii teeti na hin dhooggatin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:11">jaalalli keeti ka bara baraatii fi addatamummaan teeti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:11">yennaa mara na eeganuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 40:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 40:12"/>Rakkoon hedduun haga hin qanne na marsiteerti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:12">haga ani woy dhagguu dadhabutti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:12">cubbuun tiyya na liqinsiteerti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:12">cubbuun tun rifeensa mataa kiyyaa caalti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:12">anille jajjabaatiisa dadhabeera.<verse eid="PSA 40:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 40:13"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa, maganne'ee na baasi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:13">na qarqaariisaaf ariifadhuu koy.<verse eid="PSA 40:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 40:14"/>Worri na ijjeesiisa barbaadu marti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:14">fokkifatanee qaanowanuu ti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:14">Worri miidhama kiyya halchu marti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:14">salphinnaan gara duuba deebi'anuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 40:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 40:15"/>Worri, «Baga, baga» naan jedhu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:15">fokkoo ifiitiin nayanee goganuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 40:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 40:16"/>Worri si barbaadu marti ammoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:16">si'itti gammadanee ilillisanuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:16">Worri fayyisiisa keeti jaalatanu marti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:16">yennaa mara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:16">«Mootiin Waan Maraa gudda'a!» jedhanuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 40:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 40:17"/>Akka kiyyatti, ani rakkata'a; dadhabaalle'e;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:17">Gootta'a na hin dedhin.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:17">Ka na qarqaaruu fi ka na baasu si'i;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:17">Ee Waaqa kiyya, hin turin.<verse eid="PSA 40:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 40"/>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="PSA 41"/>
  <para style="s1">Daadimata Yennaa Dhibe'ee</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Daawitii, sooressa faarfattootaatiif.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 41:1"/>Nami worra hiyyeeyyi'iif yaadu ka gammade;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:1">guyyaa rakkinnaa, Mootiin Waan Maraa isa hin baasa.<verse eid="PSA 41:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 41:2"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa isa hin eega;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:2">jiruulle'een isa hin leesisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:2">inni lafa irratti isa hin gammachiisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:2">halchaa diinotaatiifille dabarsee isa hin kennu.<verse eid="PSA 41:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 41:3"/>Taqee inni dhibamee irra jiru irratti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:3">Mootiin Waan Maraa isa hin qarqaara;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:3">fayyisee taqee dhibo'oo irraa isa hin kaasa.<verse eid="PSA 41:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 41:4"/>Ani akka kiyyatti, «Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:4">ani waan si yakkeef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:4">na marariitii, dhibee irraa na fayyisi» jedheera.<verse eid="PSA 41:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 41:5"/>Diinoti kiyya waan hantuu na irratti dubbatanee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:5">«Inni yoom du'a?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:5">Maqaan isaa yoom bada?» jedhan.<verse eid="PSA 41:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 41:6"/>Worri na ilaaliisaaf dhufu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:6">dubbii sobaa haasowan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:6">gadhaa ifiititti waan hantuu qabatanee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:6">yennaa gad bayane, isii odeessan.<verse eid="PSA 41:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 41:7"/>Worri na jibbu marti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:7">marroo tiyya wolitti hasaasan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:7">isaan waan hantuu na irratti yaadaa,<verse eid="PSA 41:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 41:8"/>«Dhukkubi hamaan isa qabeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:8">inni addee irkate sanii deebi'ee hin ka'u» jedhan.<verse eid="PSA 41:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 41:9"/>Jaalli kiyya ka natti dhikaatuuyyuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:9">ka ani itti addadhu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:9">ka sagalee na woliin nyaate, na irratti ka'eera.<verse eid="PSA 41:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 41:10"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa, ati na marari;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:10">diinota kiyya akka ani haluu bayu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:10">dhibee tiyya irraa ol na kaasi.<verse eid="PSA 41:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 41:11"/>Diinoti kiyya injifachaa na irratti waan hin dhaggatiniif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:11">akka ati natti gammadde ani tanaan beeka.<verse eid="PSA 41:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 41:12"/>Sababa dhugaamessummaa tiyyaatiif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:12">ati na hin qarqaarta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:12">fuula keeti dura haga bara baraa na hin jiraachitta.<verse eid="PSA 41:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 41:13"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa, Waaqi Israa'elii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:13">bara baraa haga bara baraa leellifamuu ti!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 41:13">Ameen! Ameen!<verse eid="PSA 41:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 41"/>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="PSA 42"/>
  <para style="ms">Kitaaba Lammeesso'oo</para>
  <para style="mr">(<ref loc="PSA 42-72">Far. 42—72</ref>)</para>
  <para style="s1">Daadimata Nama Booji'amee</para>
  <para style="s2">Wolaloo ilmaan Qoraahii, sooressa faarfattootaatiif.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 42:1"/>Akkuma gadansi bisaan yaa'u dharra'u,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:1">Ee Waaqa, anille si dharra'a.<verse eid="PSA 42:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 42:2"/>Lubbuun tiyya Waaqa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:2">Waaqa jiraataa dheebotti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:2">ani yoom dhaqee fuula isaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:2">dhagguu dande'a ree?<verse eid="PSA 42:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 42:3"/>Kolbaan yennaa mara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:3">«Waaqi keeti meet?» waan naan jettuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:3">halkanii fi guyyaa imimmaan sagalee tiyya teeteerti;<verse eid="PSA 42:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 42:4"/>Ani gumii san woliin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:4">gumii jila jilifattu woliin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:4">ililleetti'ii fi faaruu galataatiin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:4">gogeessaan sooressaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:4">gara Galma Waaqaa attam akka deeme yennaa qaabadhu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:4">gadhaan kiyya gaddaan na bada.<verse eid="PSA 42:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 42:5"/>Ee lubbuu tiyya maaf gaddita?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:5">Na keessatti maaf jeeqanta?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 42:5">Ani deebi'ee Waaqa fayyisaa kiyya waan leellifadhuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:5">Waaqa keetitti addii godhadhu.<verse eid="PSA 42:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 42:6"/>Lubbuun tiyya na keessatti gadditeerti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:6">tanaaf ani lafa Yordaanosiitii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:6">kooba Hermoonii irraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:6">gaara Mizaarii irralle'ee si qaabadha.<verse eid="PSA 42:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 42:7"/>Shookkessa gootuu teetiitiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:7">qileen qilee waanti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:7">hunni guddoon danbalii teetii na gubbaa yaate.<verse eid="PSA 42:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 42:8"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa guyyaa mara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:8">jaalala ifii ka bara baraa mudhisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:8">anille halkan faaruu isaaf dhikeessa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:8">gara Waaqa jiruu tiyyaa daadimadha.<verse eid="PSA 42:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 42:9"/>Ani Waaqa rassaa kiyyaan, «Ati maaf na deete?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:9">Diinoti kiyya waan na cunqursaneef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:9">ani maaf bowaa ideema?» jedha.<verse eid="PSA 42:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 42:10"/>Diinoti kiyya yennaa mara, «Waaqi keeti meet?» jedhiisaan na arrassaa lafee na cassan.<verse eid="PSA 42:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 42:11"/>Ee lubbuu tiyya maaf gaddita?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:11">Na keessatti maaf jeeqanta?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 42:11">Ani deebi'ee Waaqa fayyisaa kiyya waan leellifadhuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:11">Waaqa keetitti addii godhadhu.<verse eid="PSA 42:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 42"/>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="PSA 43"/>
  <para style="s1">Daadimata Nama Booji'amee</para>
  <para style="d">(Faaruu 42 irraa itti fufe)</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 43:1"/>Ee Waaqa, naaf muri;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:1">worra si'itti hin dhugeeffanne duratti naaf falmi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:1">worra dharaameyyi'ii fi hamaaleyyii jalaa na baasi.<verse eid="PSA 43:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 43:2"/>Ati Waaqa ani itti baqadhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:2">ati maaf na lakkitte ree?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 43:2">Ani diinota kiyyaan cunqurfamee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:2">maaf bowaa ideema ree?<verse eid="PSA 43:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 43:3"/>Ifa keetii fi dhugaa teeti ergi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:3">isaan na sooressaa gara kooba teeti woyyitti'ii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:3">gara Galma ati keessa leetuu na fidanuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 43:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 43:4"/>Achiin duuba ani gara addee ciinca'aa ta Waaqaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:4">gara Waaqa itti gammaduu hin dhaqa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:4">ee Waaqa, Waaqa kiyya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:4">ani kiraara kiyya guddichaan si leellisa.<verse eid="PSA 43:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 43:5"/>Ee lubbuu tiyya maaf gaddita?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:5">Na keessatti maaf jeeqanta?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 43:5">Ani deebi'ee Waaqa fayyisaa kiyya waan leellifadhuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:5">Waaqa keetitti addii godhadhu.<verse eid="PSA 43:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 43"/>
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="PSA 44"/>
  <para style="s1">Daadimata Diinota Jalaa Bayiisaaf Dhikaate</para>
  <para style="s2">Wolaloo Ilmaan Qoraahii, sooressa faarfattootaatiif.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 44:1"/>Ee Waaqa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:1">nuuti gurra keennaan dhageenneerra;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:1">abbootiin teenna ta durii bara ifii keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:1">waan ati hujje nutti himaneeran.<verse eid="PSA 44:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 44:2"/>Ati harka keetiin gosa biyya adda addaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:2">lafa keessaa ariitee baattee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:2">abbootii teenna ta durii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:2">lafa isaanii keessatti qubachiitte.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 44:2">Gosa biyya adda addaa dhibii balleessitee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:2">abbootii teenna ta durii horsiitte.<verse eid="PSA 44:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 44:3"/>Isaan shallaagaa ifiitiin lafa san hin qabanne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:3">isaan hunna ifiitiin hin injifanne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:3">ati waan isaan jaalatteef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:3">harki keeti middichi, irreen teetii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:3">ifi fuula keetii tana isaaniif kenne.<verse eid="PSA 44:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 44:4"/>Ee Waaqa, ati mooticha kiyya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:4">kolbaa sanyii Yaaqoobiitiif injifachaa ka kennitu si'i.<verse eid="PSA 44:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 44:5"/>Hunna teetiin diinota keenna hin injifanna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:5">maqaa keetiin worra nu irratti ka'u irra sirbina.<verse eid="PSA 44:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 44:6"/>Ani guubee tiyyatti hin addadhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:6">shallaagaan kiyyalle injifachaa naaf hin kennu.<verse eid="PSA 44:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 44:7"/>Ati ammoo diinota keenna irratti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:7">injifachaa nuuf kennitee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:7">worra nu jibbu qaanessite.<verse eid="PSA 44:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 44:8"/>Nuuti guyyaa mara si Waaqaan ifi jajanna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:8">maqaa keetille haga bara baraa hin leellifanna.<verse eid="PSA 44:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 44:9"/>Amma ammoo ati nu gattee nu salphitteerta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:9">loltoota teenna woliin duulaaf hin baatu.<verse eid="PSA 44:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 44:10"/>Diinota keenna duraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:10">akka baqannu nu gooteerta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:10">nyaaphoti keenna nu saamaneeran.<verse eid="PSA 44:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 44:11"/>Ati akka hoolota qalantuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:11">dabarsitee nu kennitee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:11">gosa biyya adda addaa oddu'utti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:11">nu bittinneessiteerta.<verse eid="PSA 44:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 44:12"/>Ati kolbaa teeti gatii diqqo'otti gurgurte;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:12">gurgurama isaanii irraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:12">bu'aa womaa hin dhagganne.<verse eid="PSA 44:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 44:13"/>Ati cooraa gosa ollaa keennaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:13">murgo'oo fi kolla worra adaala keenna jiruu nu goote.<verse eid="PSA 44:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 44:14"/>Ati gosa biyya adda addaa oddu'utti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:14">mammaassa nu goote;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:14">isaan tuffi'iin mataa nutti raasan.<verse eid="PSA 44:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 44:15"/>Guyyaa mara salphinni kiyya naan dura jira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:15">fuulli kiyya qaanii uffateera.<verse eid="PSA 44:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 44:16"/>Dubbii worra natti murguutii fi cooruutiif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:16">sababa diinota worra haluu na bayuu tun teete.<verse eid="PSA 44:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 44:17"/>Nuuti adoo si hin dedhin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:17">gondooroo teetille adoo hin diigin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:17">wonni kun marti nu dhaqqadde.<verse eid="PSA 44:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 44:18"/>Gadhaan keenna gara duubaa hin deebine;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:18">miilli keenna daandii teeti irraa hin fallaanne.<verse eid="PSA 44:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 44:19"/>Ati ammoo addee jeedalti leetutti nu caccassiteerta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:19">dukkana dimmalle nutti uffitteerta.<verse eid="PSA 44:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 44:20"/>Nuuti maqaa Waaqa keennaa adoo deenee jiraannee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:20">harka keenna gara Waaqa ormaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:20">adoo badhifannee jiraannee,<verse eid="PSA 44:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 44:21"/>Waaqi dhossaa waan maraa beeku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:21">silaa tana qorqoree bira hin gewuu ree?<verse eid="PSA 44:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 44:22"/>Teetuu malee, nuuti guyyaa mara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:22">si'iif jennee ijjeefanna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:22">akka hoolee qalantuu laakkowanneerra.<verse eid="PSA 44:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 44:23"/>Goottaa kiyya, dammaqi! Maaf ratta?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:23">Ka'i! Haga bara baraa nu hin gatin.<verse eid="PSA 44:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 44:24"/>Ati maaf fuula keeti dhoffatta?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:24">Rakkoo teennaa fi cunqurfama keenna maaf deeta?<verse eid="PSA 44:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 44:25"/>Lubbuun teenna bukuu keessa gad lixxeerti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:25">nafi keennalle lafatti maxxaneera.<verse eid="PSA 44:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 44:26"/>Ka'i! Nu qarqaar.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:26">Jaalala keeti ka bara baraatiif jedhii nu wodi.<verse eid="PSA 44:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 44"/>
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="PSA 45"/>
  <para style="s1">Faaruu Fuudha Mootichaa</para>
  <para style="s2">Wolaloo ilmaan Qoraahii, sooressa faarfattootaatiif, faaruu ta akka yoyyoma faaruu, «Daraaraa» jedhantee beekkantutti faarfatante.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 45:1"/>Dubbiin dansaan gadhaa kiyya guuttee dhangalaati;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:1">wolaloo tiyya mootichaaf hin dhageessisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:1">arrabi kiyya akka feenii nama woy barreessiisaan beekkamee ti.<verse eid="PSA 45:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 45:2"/>Ati ilmaan namaa mara caalaa miidhaga'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:2">dubbiin teeti arnya qaddi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:2">tanaaf Waaqi haga bara baraa si eebbiseera.<verse eid="PSA 45:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 45:3"/>Ee mooticha janna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:3">ka ulfinnaa fi arnya qaddu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:3">shallaagaa keeti hidhadhu.<verse eid="PSA 45:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 45:4"/>Marroo dhuga'aa, marroo gadhi-laafumma'aa fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:4">balchumma'aatiif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:4">arnya keetiin injifatiisaaf ka'i;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:4">harki keeti middichi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:4">injifachaa gugurdoo dhaggisiisuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 45:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 45:5"/>Daayi keetii ka qarame,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:5">gadhaa diina keetii hin woraana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:5">gosi biyya adda addaa miila keeti jalatti hin jigan.<verse eid="PSA 45:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 45:6"/>Ee Waaqa barcumaan mootumma'aa keeti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:6">ka bara baraa ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:6">uleen bokku'uu teetille ulee bokku'uu ta haqaa ti.<verse eid="PSA 45:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 45:7"/>Ati balchummaa jaalattee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:7">hammeenna jibbite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:7">tanaaf Waaqi, Waaqi keeti zayitii gammadaa si muudee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:7">hari'aa teeti akka caaltu si godhe.<verse eid="PSA 45:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 45:8"/>Woyaan fiqiree qumbii, hargiisaa fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:8">dakkara irraa hujanteen fiqqitti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:8">Mana mootumma'aa ka ilka arbaatiin seefame keessaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:8">qoonqoon kiraara guddichaatii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:8">maseenqo'oo si gammachiitti.<verse eid="PSA 45:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 45:9"/>Dubartoota mana mootumma'aa keessa jiranu odduu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:9">ijoolleen durraa ta moototaa jiran;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:9">giittittiin worqii biyya Ofiirii naqattelle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:9">gara harka keeti middaatiin dhaabbatti.<verse eid="PSA 45:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 45:10"/>Ee intala dhage'i!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:10">Waan ani jedhu caqasi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:10">kolbaa teetii fi mana abbaa keetii dedhi.<verse eid="PSA 45:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 45:11"/>Mootichi miidhaginna keetiif si halcha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:11">inni goottaa keeti waan te'eef, isa ulfeessi.<verse eid="PSA 45:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 45:12"/>Kolbaan Xiiroosii kennansa sii fidan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:12">worri dureeyyiin si'itti dhikaatiisaaf barbaadan.<verse eid="PSA 45:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 45:13"/>Intalti mootichi fuudhaaru</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:13">woyaa worqi'iin kuulante uffattee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:13">kolloo ifii keessa jirti.<verse eid="PSA 45:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 45:14"/>Woyaa kuula hedduu qaddu san uffattee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:14">gara mootichaa geeffanti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:14">durri bookarsitooti isi'ii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:14">isii gula gara mootichaa hin dhaqan.<verse eid="PSA 45:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 45:15"/>Isaan ililleetti'ii fi gammadaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:15">isii gula mana mootichaa hin seenan.<verse eid="PSA 45:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 45:16"/>Ilmaan teeti addee abbootii teetii hin bu'an;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:16">ati lafa duudii akka bulchanu hin goota.<verse eid="PSA 45:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 45:17"/>Ani dhaloota mara keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:17">gurra keeti hin mudhisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:17">tanaaf gosi biyya adda addaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:17">bara baraa haga bara baraa si leellitti.<verse eid="PSA 45:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 45"/>
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="PSA 46"/>
  <para style="s1">Waaqi Nu Woliin Jira</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu ilmaan Qoraahii, sooressa faarfattootaatiif, ta qoonqoo durraatiin faarfatane.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 46:1"/>Waaqi addee itti baqannu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:1">inni hunna teenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:1">yennaa rakko'oo inni guddoo nu qarqaara.<verse eid="PSA 46:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 46:2"/>Tanaaf latti yoo tachoote,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:2">gaarri gara qilee abbaaya'aa yoo bu'e,<verse eid="PSA 46:2"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 46:3"/>bisaan yoo shookkisee hoomachowe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:3">raafamiisa isaatiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:3">gaaroti yoo hollatanelle nuuti hin sodaannu.<verse eid="PSA 46:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 46:4"/>Lagi maddi isaa qachaa Waaqaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:4">addee woyyittii Waaqi Ol Aanaan le'u</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:4">gammachiisu tokko jira.<verse eid="PSA 46:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 46:5"/>Waaqi qachaa san keessa waan jiruuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:5">qachaan sun hin tacho'u;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:5">Waaqi barii ganama qachaa san hin qarqaara.<verse eid="PSA 46:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 46:6"/>Gosi biyya adda addaa hogitte,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:6">mootummootille jidde;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:6">Waaqi qoonqoo ifii dhageessise,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:6">lattille baxxe.<verse eid="PSA 46:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 46:7"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:7">Waaqi Waan Mara Dade nu woliin jira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:7">Waaqi Yaaqoobii addee nuuti itti baqannu.<verse eid="PSA 46:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 46:8"/>Kowa'aatii, hujii Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:8">badii inni lafa irratti fide ilaala'a.<verse eid="PSA 46:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 46:9"/>Inni lola biyya lafaa irraa hin dhaabbachiisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:9">guube'ee fi eboo hin caccassa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:9">wonteelle ibiddaan hin guba.<verse eid="PSA 46:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 46:10"/>Inni, «Cadhisa'aa, ani Waaqa akka te'e beeka'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:10">ani gosa biyya adda addaa oddu'utti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:10">biyya lafaa irralle'etti hin saadama» jedha.<verse eid="PSA 46:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 46:11"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:11">Waaqi Waan Mara Dade nu woliin jira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:11">Waaqi Yaaqoobii addee nuuti itti baqannu.<verse eid="PSA 46:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 46"/>
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="PSA 47"/>
  <para style="s1">Waaqi Biyya Lafaa Irratti Mooti'i</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu ilmaan Qoraahii, sooressa faarfattootaatiif.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 47:1"/>Gosi biyya adda addaa marti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:1">harka keessan dhowa'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:1">qoonqoo ol qabadha'aatii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:1">Waaqaaf ilillisa'a.<verse eid="PSA 47:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 47:2"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa Ol Aanaan ka sodaatame;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:2">inni lafa duudii irratti mootii gudda'a.<verse eid="PSA 47:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 47:3"/>Inni kolbaa hedduu nu'uun jala godhe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:3">gosa biyya adda addaa miila keenna jala galche.<verse eid="PSA 47:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 47:4"/>Sanyii Yaaqoobii ta inni jaalatuuf koora ta teete,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:4">lafa nuuti dhaallu inni nu'uuf file;<verse eid="PSA 47:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 47:5"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa Waaqi ililleetti'ii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:5">qoonqoo tultulla'aatiin ol bayeera.<verse eid="PSA 47:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 47:6"/>Waaqa faaru'uun leellisa'a; leellisa'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:6">Mootii keenna faaru'uun leellisa'a; leellisa'a.<verse eid="PSA 47:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 47:7"/>Waaqi mootii lafa duudi'ii waan te'eef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:7">faaru'uun isa leellisa'a.<verse eid="PSA 47:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 47:8"/>Waaqi gosa biyya adda addaa irratti mooti'i;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:8">Waaqi barcumaa mootumma'aa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:8">ka ifii woyyicha irra tee'eera.<verse eid="PSA 47:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 47:9"/>Qondaaltoti gosa biyya adda addaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:9">kolbaa Waaqa Abrahaamii woliin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:9">wolitti qabamaneeran;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:9">loltooti lafaa marti ka Waaqaa waan te'aneef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:9">inni guddoo saadameera.<verse eid="PSA 47:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 47"/>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="PSA 48"/>
  <para style="s1">Qachaa Guddicha Waaqaa, Xiyoon</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu. Faaruu ilmaan Qoraahii.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 48:1"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa gudda'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:1">qachaa Waaqa keennaa keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:1">gaara woyyicha irratti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:1">guddoo leellifamuu qaba.<verse eid="PSA 48:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 48:2"/>Gaarri Xiyoonii ka gara kaabaatitti dhaggamu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:2">ka dheerinnaan miidhagu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:2">qachaa mooticha gudda'aa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:2">ka lafa duudii gammachiisu.<verse eid="PSA 48:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 48:3"/>Waaqi mana mootumma'aa jabaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:3">qachaa sanii keessa jira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:3">inni kushee qachaa sanii akka te'e ifi mudhiseera.<verse eid="PSA 48:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 48:4"/>Qachaa san loliisaaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:4">moototi wolitti qabamane.<verse eid="PSA 48:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 48:5"/>Isaan akkuma dhagganeen maadeffatane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:5">sodaatanee baqa kottee addeessane.<verse eid="PSA 48:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 48:6"/>Achitti rommiis isaanitti dhufee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:6">akka dubartii ciniinsifattuu muddamane.<verse eid="PSA 48:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 48:7"/>Akka hoboloota gugurdoo Tarshiishii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:7">ta qilleensa gara aduun baatuutiin bututanuu te'ane.<verse eid="PSA 48:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 48:8"/>Waaqi qachaa ifii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:8">haga bara baraa jabeessee akka dhaabu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:8">akkuma dhageenne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:8">akkasuma qachaa Mootii Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:8">Waaqa Waan Mara Dadee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:8">ka Waaqa keennaa irratti dhaggineerra.<verse eid="PSA 48:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 48:9"/>Ee Waaqa, Galma keeti keessatti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:9">jaalala keeti ka bara baraa yaadanna.<verse eid="PSA 48:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 48:10"/>Ee Waaqa, akkuma maqaan keeti lafa duudii geye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:10">leellisi keetille lafa duudii geyee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:10">harki keeti middichi balchumma'aan guutameera.<verse eid="PSA 48:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 48:11"/>Muraan teeti dhugaa waan teeteef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:11">worri gaara Xiyoonii irra le'u gammaduu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:11">worri qachoota Yihuda'aa keessa le'u firinxiixuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 48:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 48:12"/>Qachaa Xiyoonii naannowaa ideemaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:12">adaala isaa mara'a.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:12">Xelleephoo isaa laakkowa'a.<verse eid="PSA 48:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 48:13"/>Dalleya dhaka'aa ka isaa hubadha'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:13">kushee isaalle ilaala'a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 48:13">Akka dhaloota dhufuun,<verse eid="PSA 48:13"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 48:14"/>«Waaqi kun, haga bara baraa Waaqa keenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:14">inni haga du'aatitti nu sooressa» jettanu.<verse eid="PSA 48:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 48"/>
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="PSA 49"/>
  <para style="s1">Gowwummaa Durumma'atti Addatiisaa</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu ilmaan Qoraahii, sooressa faarfattootaatiif.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 49:1"/>Kolbaan marti tana dhage'a'a!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:1">Worri biyya lafaa tana keessa leetanu marti caqasa'a!<verse eid="PSA 49:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 49:2"/>Gudda'aa fi diqqa'aan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:2">dureessaa fi hiyyeessi caqasa'a.<verse eid="PSA 49:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 49:3"/>Afaan kiyya jechoota qarumma'aa dubbata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:3">yaad gadhaa kiyyaa hubantii kenna.<verse eid="PSA 49:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 49:4"/>Ani gurra kiyya gara fakkeennaa deebifadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:4">hiibboo tiyya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:4">kiraaraan hiika.<verse eid="PSA 49:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 49:5"/>Guyyaa wonni hantuun natti dhuttuu fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:5">hamaaleyyiin sobaaleyyiin na marsanu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:5">ani maaf sodaadha?<verse eid="PSA 49:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 49:6"/>Worra qabeenna ifiititti addatuu fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:6">durummaa ifii guddo'oon kooru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:6">ani maaf sodaadha?<verse eid="PSA 49:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 49:7"/>Dhugumaan, nami nama wodu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:7">yookiin gatii wodo'oo san</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:7">Waaqaaf kennuu dande'u hin jiru.<verse eid="PSA 49:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 49:8"/>Gatiin lubbuu namaa akka malee guddo'o;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:8">wonni silaa kaffaluu dande'anuuyyuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:8">ijjumaa hin geettu.<verse eid="PSA 49:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 49:9"/>Akka du'ee hin shanne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:9">haga bara baraa akka le'u godhiisaaf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:9">ijjumaa hin geettu.<verse eid="PSA 49:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 49:10"/>Qarooleen akka du'anu nami marti hin dhagga;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:10">gowwoole'ee fi daalleelle hin badan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:10">qabeenna ifiille worra dhibi'iif lakkisan.<verse eid="PSA 49:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 49:11"/>Lafa maqaa isaaniitiin waammantu yoo qabaatanelle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:11">irreensi isaanii haga bara baraa mana isaanii hin te'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:11">dhalootaa haga dhalootaatitti addee leetoo isaanii hin te'a.<verse eid="PSA 49:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 49:12"/>Durummaan du'a irraa nama hin hamburtu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:12">nami akkuma hori'ii hin du'a.<verse eid="PSA 49:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 49:13"/>Hireen worra gowwumma'aan ifitti addatuutii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:13">hordofattoota isaanii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:13">ka waan isaan jedhanu fudhatuu tana.<verse eid="PSA 49:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 49:14"/>Isaan kun akkuma hoole'ee hin du'an;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:14">duuti isaan hin tissiti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:14">Worri qajeelaan ganamaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:14">irreensa isaanii irra hin ideema;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:14">isaan mana ifii dansaa irraa fagaatanee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:14">addee worri du'e jiru keessatti hin shaman.<verse eid="PSA 49:14"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 49:15"/>Waaqi gara ifii waan na fudhatuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:15">dhugumaan inni lubbuu tiyya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:15">hunna addee worri du'e jiruu jalaa hin woda.<verse eid="PSA 49:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 49:16"/>Nami yennaa dureessa te'e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:16">qabeenni mana isaa yennaa dabalame,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:16">hin sodaatin.<verse eid="PSA 49:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 49:17"/>Inni yennaa du'u womaa hin fudhatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:17">karri isaa isa woliin hin awwaalamu.<verse eid="PSA 49:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 49:18"/>Nami bara jiruu ifii mara gammadee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:18">wonni marti isaaf teetee leellifamulle,<verse eid="PSA 49:18"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 49:19"/>du'ee gara abbootii ifii ta durii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:19">ta deebitee ifa hin dhagginee hin deema.<verse eid="PSA 49:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 49:20"/>Nami karra qabaatee hubantii dhabe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:20">akkuma hori'ii hin du'a.<verse eid="PSA 49:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 49"/>
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="PSA 50"/>
  <para style="s1">Waaqonfannaa Dhuga'aa</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Asaafii.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 50:1"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:1">Waaqi waaqotaa hin dubbata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:1">baya adu'uu irraa haga seensa adu'uutitti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:1">nama lafa irraa mara hin waama.<verse eid="PSA 50:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 50:2"/>Gaara Xiyoonii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:2">ka miidhaginna guutuu qabu irraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:2">Waaqi hin ifa.<verse eid="PSA 50:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 50:3"/>Waaqi keenna hin dhufa; inni hin cadhisu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:3">ibiddi gubu isa dura jira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:3">hobonbolattiin jadduun cinaa isaa marsiteerti.<verse eid="PSA 50:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 50:4"/>Inni kolbaa ifiititti muriisaaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:4">ol-gubbaa gubbaa jirtuu fi lafa waamee,<verse eid="PSA 50:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 50:5"/>«Worra ciinca'aan na woliin gondoorate,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:5">ka naaf addatamane wolitti naaf qaba'a» hin jedha.<verse eid="PSA 50:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 50:6"/>Waaqi abbaa mura'aa waan te'eef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:6">ol-gubbaan balchummaa isaa lalladdi.<verse eid="PSA 50:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 50:7"/>Ammalle Waaqi, «Kolbaa tiyya, dhage'a'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:7">Israa'el, ani si'i irratti dhugaa hin baya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:7">ani Waaqi keeti, Waaqa.<verse eid="PSA 50:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 50:8"/>Ani, ‹Ciincaa naa dhikeessitu dhabe› jedhee si hin komadhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:8">kennansi keeti ka gubamu yennaa mara fuula kiyya dura jira.<verse eid="PSA 50:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 50:9"/>Ani moonaa teeti keessaa korommii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:9">gooree teeti keessaa korbeeyyii re'e'ee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:9">fudhatiisaaf hin barbaadu.<verse eid="PSA 50:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 50:10"/>Bineensoti baddaa keessaa marti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:10">horiin kooba kuma hedduu irraa marti kiyya.<verse eid="PSA 50:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 50:11"/>Ani sinbirroota gaara irraa mara beeka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:11">wonni diida keessa munyuuqu marti tiyya.<verse eid="PSA 50:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 50:12"/>«Biyyi lafaatii fi wonni isii keessaa marti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:12">tiyya waan teeteef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:12">adoo beelowelle'ee ani sitti hin himu.<verse eid="PSA 50:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 50:13"/>Ani foon korommi'ii nyaadhaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:13">Yookiin dhiiga re'e'ee unaa?» jedha.<verse eid="PSA 50:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 50:14"/>Ciincaa galataa Waaqaaf dhikeessi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:14">waadaa keeti Ol Aana'aaf muummessi.<verse eid="PSA 50:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 50:15"/>Waaqi, «Guyyaa rakkinnaa na waami;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:15">ani si baasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:15">atille na hin ulfeessita» jedha.<verse eid="PSA 50:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 50:16"/>Waaqi ammoo nama hama'aan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:16">«Waan ajaja kiyyaatuu maaf dubbatta?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:16">Gondooroo tiyya maaf maqaa dhootta?<verse eid="PSA 50:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 50:17"/>Ati adabamiisa jibbita;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:17">jechoota kiyya ifiin duubatti gatta.<verse eid="PSA 50:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 50:18"/>Hattuu yennaa dhaggitu, jaala teetaaf;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:18">gaarayyeeffattoota wolille'een qooda qadda.<verse eid="PSA 50:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 50:19"/>«Afaan keeti waan hantuu dubbata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:19">arrabi keetille soba odeessa.<verse eid="PSA 50:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 50:20"/>Teettee obboleessa keeti hamatta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:20">ilma haadha teetii maqaa balleessita.<verse eid="PSA 50:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 50:21"/>Ati waan kana goote; ani hin cadhisaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:21">Ani akkuma keeti te'e na seetaa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 50:21">Amma ammoo waan ati goote sitti mudhisee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:21">si xixa.<verse eid="PSA 50:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 50:22"/>«Isin worri ana Waaqa deetanu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:22">tana hubadha'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:22">tun te'uu dhabaannaan ani isin kukkuta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:22">ka isin baasu hin jiru.<verse eid="PSA 50:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 50:23"/>Nami ciincaa galataa naaf dhikeessu na ulfeessa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:23">nama karaa qajeelaa deemuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:23">fayyisiisa kiyya itti mudhisa» jedha.<verse eid="PSA 50:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 50"/>
  <chapter number="51" style="c" sid="PSA 51"/>
  <para style="s1">Daadimata Araara Dhaggatiisaaf Dhikaate</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Daawiti sooressa faarfattootaatiif. Daawiti Baat-Sheebaa gaarayyeeffateen duuba yennaa raagichi Naataan gara isaa dhufe ta inni faarfate.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 51:1"/>Ee Waaqa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:1">sababa jaalala keeti ka bara baraatiif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:1">na marari.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 51:1">Sababa gadhi-laafummaa teeti guddo'ootiif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:1">yakkaa tiyya haxowii balleessi.<verse eid="PSA 51:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 51:2"/>Yakkaa tiyya mara dhiqii balleessi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:2">cubbuu tiyya irraa na qulqulleessi.<verse eid="PSA 51:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 51:3"/>Ani yakkaa tiyya waan beekuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:3">yennaa mara cubbuun tiyya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:3">fuula kiyya dura jirti.<verse eid="PSA 51:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 51:4"/>Ani si irratti ka'ee, si qofa yakkee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:4">waan hantuu si duratti godhe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 51:4">Tanaaf dubbiin ati na irratti dubbatte dhuga'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:4">muraan ati natti murtelle haqa.<verse eid="PSA 51:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 51:5"/>Dhugumaan ani cubbu'uun dhaladhe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:5">yennaa haati tiyya na ulfoottuu ani cubbicha.<verse eid="PSA 51:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 51:6"/>Ati keessa namaatitti dhugaa hin halchita;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:6">tanaaf, gadhaa kiyya ka dhossa'aa keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:6">qarummaa na barsiisi.<verse eid="PSA 51:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 51:7"/>Baala hisoophiitiin fiffixiitii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:7">cubbuu irraa na qulqulleessi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:7">anille hin qulqullowa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:7">na dhiqi; anille dhakaa roobaa caalaa hin addaadha.<verse eid="PSA 51:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 51:8"/>Ililleetti'ii fi gammada na dhageessisi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:8">ati na caccassitee butuchitulle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:8">ani deebi'ee hin gammada.<verse eid="PSA 51:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 51:9"/>Fuula keeti cubbuu tiyya irraa deebifadhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:9">yakkaa tiyya mara haxowii balleessi.<verse eid="PSA 51:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 51:10"/>Ee Waaqa, gadhaa qulluu naa dadi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:10">ayyaana haareya hin jijjiiranne naa kenni.<verse eid="PSA 51:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 51:11"/>Fuula keeti duraa na hin fageessin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:11">Ayyaana keeti Woyyichalle na irraa hin fudhatin.<verse eid="PSA 51:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 51:12"/>Gammada fayyisiisa keeti irraa dhufu san,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:12">adde'etti naaf deebisi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:12">akka si'iif ajajamu na qarqaar.<verse eid="PSA 51:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 51:13"/>Achiin duuba ani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:13">worra seera keeti yakku hin barsiisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:13">cubbaaleyyiille gara keeti hin deebi'an.<verse eid="PSA 51:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 51:14"/>Ee Waaqa, Waaqa fayyinna kiyyaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:14">yakkaa dhiiga dhangalaasee jalaa na baasi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">51:14 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Yakkaa dhiiga dhangalaasee jalaa na baasi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Afaan Ibrootaatiin </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">dhiigi kiyya akka hin dhangalaane na baasi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">jedhamuu hin dande'ama.</char></note>;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:14">arrabi kiyya marroo balchummaa teetii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:14">gammadaan ilillisa.<verse eid="PSA 51:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 51:15"/>Ee Gootta'a, afaan kiyya bani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:15">anille arraba kiyyaan si hin leellifadha.<verse eid="PSA 51:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 51:16"/>Ati adoo ciincaa jaalattu teetee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:16">ani silaa si'iif hin dhikeessaayyu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:16">Ati kennansa gubamutti hin gammaddu.<verse eid="PSA 51:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 51:17"/>Ciincaan Waaqaaf dhikaattu yaada gad jedhe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:17">ee Waaqa, ati yaada gad jedhee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:17">cubbuu irraa deebi'u hin tuffattu.<verse eid="PSA 51:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 51:18"/>Fedhii teetiin Xiyooniif waan dansaa godhi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:18">dalleya dhaka'aa ka Yerusaalemii deebisii ijaari.<verse eid="PSA 51:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 51:19"/>Achiin duuba ati ciincaa sirrii te'ee fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:19">kennansa gubamutti hin gammadda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:19">addee ciincaan itti ciinceffamu teeti irratti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:19">dardarooti hin dhikeeffaman.<verse eid="PSA 51:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 51"/>
  <chapter number="52" style="c" sid="PSA 52"/>
  <para style="s1">Muraa Waaqaatii Fi Badhaadha Waaqaa</para>
  <para style="s2">Sooressa faarfattootaatiif, wolaloo Daawitii ta yennaa nami biyya Edoomii Do'eeg gara Saa'olii dhufee, «Daawiti gara mana Ahiimelekii dhufeera» jedhee isatti hime faarfate.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 52:1"/>Nama hunnaamessa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:1">Hantuu hujiisa keetiin maaf koorta?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:1">Jaalalli bara baraa ka Waaqaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:1">haga bara baraa ti.<verse eid="PSA 52:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 52:2"/>Ati ka soba baratte,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:2">mala badi'ii dhootta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:2">arrabi keeti akka shiggire'ee ti.<verse eid="PSA 52:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 52:3"/>Ati waan dansaa caalaa waan hantuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:3">dhugaa dubbii caalaa dhara jaalatta.<verse eid="PSA 52:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 52:4"/>Ati nama sobaalessa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:4">Dubbii nama miitu jaalatta.<verse eid="PSA 52:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 52:5"/>Waaqi ammoo badii bara baraa sitti fidee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:5">mana keeti keessaa butee si baasee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:5">lafa worra jiraata'aa keessalle'ee si hin buqqisa.<verse eid="PSA 52:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 52:6"/>Worri balchooleen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:6">waan kana dhagganee, hin sodaatan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:6">achiin duuba sitti kollaa,<verse eid="PSA 52:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 52:7"/>«Nama Waaqatti hin irkanne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:7">ammoo bacinna karra ifiititti ka addatu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:7">ka worra dhibii balleessiisatti jabaatu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:7">kunoo ilaala'a!» hin jedhan.<verse eid="PSA 52:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 52:8"/>Ani ammoo mana Waaqaa keessatti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:8">akka muka ejersaa oshoba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 52:8">Jaalala Waaqaa ka bara baraatitti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:8">bara baraan itti addadha.<verse eid="PSA 52:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 52:9"/>Waaqa, marroo waan ati hujjeetiif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:9">ani bara baraan si leellifadha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 52:9">Worra si dhugeeffatu duratti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:9">maqaa keeti dansaa san addi'iin eegadha.<verse eid="PSA 52:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 52"/>
  <chapter number="53" style="c" sid="PSA 53"/>
  <para style="s1">Hammeenna Namaa</para>
  <para style="s2">Sooressa faarfattootaatiif, wolaloo Daawitii, ta akka yoyyoma, «Mahalaat» jedhamee beekkamutti faarfatante.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 53:1"/>Gowwooleen gadhaa ifii keessatti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:1">«Waaqi hin jiru» jedhan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:1">isaan worra bada'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:1">waan gadhee hujan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:1">isaan keessaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:1">ka waan dansaa huju tokkolle hin jiru.<verse eid="PSA 53:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 53:2"/>Worra qaroolee Waaqa barbaadu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:2">yoo jiraatane dhaggiisaaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:2">Waaqi ol-gubbaa irraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:2">gara ilmaan namaa gad ilaala.<verse eid="PSA 53:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 53:3"/>Isaan ammoo martinuu dudda itti galaneeran;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:3">martinuu wolumatti worra badaa te'aneeran;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:3">isaan keessaa ka waan dansaa huju hin jiru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:3">tokkolle hin jiru.<verse eid="PSA 53:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 53:4"/>Worri hamaaleyyiin womaa hin hubatuu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:4">Akkuma nami sagalee nyaatu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:4">worri kolbaa tiyya nyaatu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:4">gara Waaqaa hin daadimatu.<verse eid="PSA 53:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 53:5"/>Isaan addee wonni sodaatanu hin jirretti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:5">sodaatanee bararaqan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 53:5">Waaqi lafee diina kolbaa ifii hin bittinneessa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:5">Waaqi waan isaan jibbeef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:5">isin kolbaan Waaqaa isaan hin qaanessitan.<verse eid="PSA 53:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 53:6"/>Xiyoon keessaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:6">Israa'eliif fayyinni adoo dhufee jiraatee!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:6">Yennaa Waaqi boojuu kolbaa ifii deebisu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:6">sanyiin Yaaqoobii burraaxxuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:6">kolbaan Israa'elii gammadduu ti.<verse eid="PSA 53:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 53"/>
  <chapter number="54" style="c" sid="PSA 54"/>
  <para style="s1">Harka Diinaa Jalaa Bayiisaaf Daadimata Dhikaate</para>
  <para style="s2">Wolaloo Daawitii, sooressa faarfattootaatiif, ta yennaa worri Ziifii gara Saa'olii dhaqee, «Daawiti nu biratti dhokateera» jedhee isatti hime ta meya ribu'uutiin faarfatante.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 54:1"/>Ee Waaqa, maqaa keetiin na baasi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:1">hunna teetiin dhugaa naaf muri.<verse eid="PSA 54:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 54:2"/>Ee Waaqa, daadimata kiyya dhage'i;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:2">dubbii afaan kiyyaa caqasi.<verse eid="PSA 54:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 54:3"/>Namooti alagaan natti ka'an;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:3">worri nama sodaachisu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:3">na ijjeesiisaaf barbaadan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:3">isaan marroo Waaqaa hin yaadanu.<verse eid="PSA 54:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 54:4"/>Dhugumaan Waaqi qarqaarsa kiyya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:4">Goottaan irkuu jiruu tiyyaa ti.<verse eid="PSA 54:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 54:5"/>Wonni hantuun</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:5">worra ila diinumma'aatiin na ilaalutti deebituu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:5">ati addatamummaa teetiin isaan fixi.<verse eid="PSA 54:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 54:6"/>Ani fedhuma tiyyaan ciincaa sii dhikeessa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:6">Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:6">maqaan keeti dansaa waan te'eef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:6">ani isa hin leellisa.<verse eid="PSA 54:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 54:7"/>Ati rakkinna mara keessaa waan na baatteef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:7">injifatamiisa diinota kiyyaa dhaggeera.<verse eid="PSA 54:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 54"/>
  <chapter number="55" style="c" sid="PSA 55"/>
  <para style="s1">Jaalaan Diinatti Dabarfamanee Kennamuu</para>
  <para style="s2">Sooressa faarfattootaatiif, wolaloo Daawitii, ta meya ribu'uutiin faarfatante.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 55:1"/>Ee Waaqa, daadimata kiyya dhage'i;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:1">gaaffii tiyya cadhittee hin ilaalin.<verse eid="PSA 55:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 55:2"/>Ati na caqasii deebii naa kenni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:2">ani rakkinna kiyyaan nageya dhabeera.<verse eid="PSA 55:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 55:3"/>Diinoti kiyya natti iyyan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:3">worri hamaaleyyiin na cunqursan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 55:3">Isaan farra natti fidan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:3">aari'iin na lolan.<verse eid="PSA 55:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 55:4"/>Gadhaan kiyya na sodaateera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:4">bararaqi du'aa natti bu'eera.<verse eid="PSA 55:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 55:5"/>Soda'aa fi hollatiisi na qabataneeran;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:5">guddoo sheephiseera.<verse eid="PSA 55:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 55:6"/>Ani adoo akka saphaliisaa koola qabaadhe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:6">silaa koolaan ka'ee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:6">addee takkatti foorfadhaayyu.<verse eid="PSA 55:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 55:7"/>Ani silaa fagoo ideemee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:7">goomolee keessa turaayyu.<verse eid="PSA 55:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 55:8"/>Hobonbolatti'ii fi bubbee bokkeyaa jalaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:8">silaa ariifadhee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:8">gara addee itti baqadhuu hin deemaayyu.<verse eid="PSA 55:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 55:9"/>Ee Gootta'a, ani qachaa keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:9">hunnaan wolitti ka'iisaa fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:9">wol loliisa waan dhaggeef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:9">arrabi isaanii akka wol irraa miliqu godhi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:9">mala isaaniille balleessi.<verse eid="PSA 55:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 55:10"/>Halkanii fi guyyaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:10">isaan dalleya qachaa sanii gubbaa maran;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:10">yakka'aa fi rakkinni qachaa san keessa jiran.<verse eid="PSA 55:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 55:11"/>Qachaa san keessa addee mara badi'itti jira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:11">dikkoo qachaa sanii keessaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:11">cunqursa'aa fi sobatti guuteera.<verse eid="PSA 55:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 55:12"/>Ka na arrassu diina kiyyaa moti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:12">adoo diina kiyya te'ee, silaa hin ossadhaayyu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 55:12">Ka natti kooru, nyaapha kiyyaa moti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:12">adoo nyaapha kiyya te'ee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:12">silaa duraa dhokadhaayyu.<verse eid="PSA 55:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 55:13"/>Ka tana na godhe ammoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:13">nama hari'aa tiyyaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:13">si lansa kiyya, jaala kiyya ka wolitti dhikaannu,<verse eid="PSA 55:13"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 55:14"/>ka haasowa mi'aawaa woliin haasowaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:14">kolbaa woliin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:14">gara mana Waaqaa ideenne.<verse eid="PSA 55:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 55:15"/>Wonni hantuun mana isaaniitii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:15">gadhaa isaanii keessa waan jirtuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:15">diinota kiyyatti dedhuma duuti itti dhuttuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:15">adoo jiranuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:15">gara addee worri du'e jiruu gad bu'anuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 55:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 55:16"/>Ani ammoo Waaqa waammadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:16">Mootiin Waan Maraalle na baasa.<verse eid="PSA 55:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 55:17"/>Galgalaa fi ganama, guyyaa wodhakka'attille,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:17">rakko'oo fi gadda kiyya itti himadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:17">innille qoonqoo tiyya hin dhage'a.<verse eid="PSA 55:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 55:18"/>Worri na irratti ka'u bacaa waan te'eef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:18">inni worra na lolu jalaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:18">nageyaan na galcha.<verse eid="PSA 55:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 55:19"/>Isaan waan hin jijjiiranneef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:19">Waaqalle waan hin sodaanneef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:19">Waaqi, ka durii jalqabee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:19">barcumaa mootummaa ifii irra jiru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:19">daadimata kiyya dhage'ee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:19">isaan hin salphisa.<verse eid="PSA 55:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 55:20"/>Lansi kiyya sun jaalota ifii lole;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:20">waadaa galelle diige.<verse eid="PSA 55:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 55:21"/>Haasonni isaa dhadha'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:21">gadhaa ifiititti ammoo lola yaada.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 55:21">Jechooti isaa zayitii caalaa lallaafa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:21">ammoo akka shallaagaa buqqifamee ti.<verse eid="PSA 55:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 55:22"/>Ba'aa teeti Mootii Waan Maraa irratti buufadhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:22">inni si utuba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:22">inni worra balchoolee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:22">ijjumaa akka raafamanu hin godhu.<verse eid="PSA 55:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 55:23"/>Ee Waaqa, ati ammoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:23">worra hamaa boolla qile'etti gad gatta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:23">worri dhiiga namaa dhangalaasuu fi nama sobu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:23">bara le'ii ifii hin wodhakkeeffatanu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 55:23">Ani ammoo sitti addadha.<verse eid="PSA 55:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 55"/>
  <chapter number="56" style="c" sid="PSA 56"/>
  <para style="s1">Daadimata Waaqatti Addatiisaa</para>
  <para style="s2">Sooressa faarfattootaatiif, faaruu Daawitii, ta akka yoyyoma faaruu, «Saphaliisa qilxaa fagoo jiru irraa» jedhantee beekkantutti, yennaa worri Filisxeemotaa qachaa Gaatii keessatti isa qabane faarfatante.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 56:1"/>Kolbaan waan na ariituuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:1">Ee Waaqa, naaf marari;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:1">diinoti kiyya guyyaa mara na miidhan.<verse eid="PSA 56:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 56:2"/>Diinoti kiyya guyyaa guutuu na ari'an;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:2">worri kooru ka na lolu baca'a.<verse eid="PSA 56:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 56:3"/>Ani yennaa sodaadhu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:3">si'itti addadha.<verse eid="PSA 56:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 56:4"/>Marroo jecha isaatiif, isa leellifadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:4">ani Waaqatti addadha; hin sodaadhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:4">nami foonii maan na godhuu dande'a?<verse eid="PSA 56:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 56:5"/>Guyyaa guutuu dubbii tiyya micciiran;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:5">isaan yennaa mara na miidhiisaaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:5">mala natti dhowan.<verse eid="PSA 56:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 56:6"/>Isaan wolitti qabamanee, riphan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:6">jiruu tiyya balleessiisaaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:6">tarkaaffii tiyya eegan.<verse eid="PSA 56:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 56:7"/>Isaan yakkaa hujanee hin miliqin.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:7">Ati aarii teetiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:7">gosa biyya adda addaa san salphisi.<verse eid="PSA 56:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 56:8"/>Ati daaqiisa kiyya laakkotteerta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:8">imimmaan tiyya qodaa keetitti kuucheerta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:8">wonni kun dhugumaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:8">kitaaba keessatti barreeffamaneeranii motii?<verse eid="PSA 56:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 56:9"/>Yennaa ani gara keeti daadimadhu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:9">diinoti kiyya gara duubaa hin deebi'an;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:9">Waaqi cinaa tiyya akka jiru saniin beeka.<verse eid="PSA 56:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 56:10"/>Waaqa jecha isaa leellifadhuun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:10">Mootii Waan Maraa jecha isaa leellifadhuun,<verse eid="PSA 56:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 56:11"/>Waaqa itti addadhuun, ani hin sodaadhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:11">nami foonii maan na godhuu dande'a ree?<verse eid="PSA 56:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 56:12"/>Ee Waaqa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:12">waadaa sii galeeru muummessu'uu male;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:12">kennansa galataa sii dhikeessa.<verse eid="PSA 56:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 56:13"/>Ati lubbuu tiyya du'a irraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:13">miila kiyyalle jigiisa irraa hamburteerta.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:13">Tanaaf, ee Waaqa, ani fuula keeti dura</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:13">ifa jiru'uu keessa ideema.<verse eid="PSA 56:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 56"/>
  <chapter number="57" style="c" sid="PSA 57"/>
  <para style="s1">Daadimata Qarqaarsa Waaqaa Dhaggatiisaaf Dhikaate</para>
  <para style="s2">Sooressa faarfattootaatiif, faaruu Daawitii, ta akka yoyyoma faaruu, «Hin balleessin» jedhantee beekkantutti, yennaa inni Saa'ol duraa baqatee goda keessa jiru faarfatante.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 57:1"/>Lubbuun tiyya waan sitti baqattuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:1">na marari, ee Waaqa, na marari.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 57:1">Haga rakkoon dabartutti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:1">ani koola keeti jalatti baqadha.<verse eid="PSA 57:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 57:2"/>Ani gara Waaqa Ol-Aana'aa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:2">gara Waaqa waan naaf barbaachisu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:2">mara naa muummessuu hin iyya.<verse eid="PSA 57:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 57:3"/>Inni ol-gubbaa irraa ergee na baasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:3">inni worra na irra sirbu hin salphisa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 57:3">Waaqi jaalala ifii ka bara baraatii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:3">addatamummaa ifii hin erga.<verse eid="PSA 57:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 57:4"/>Ani worra akka neenqa nama nyaatiisaaf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:4">ila babaasuu odduu irkadhe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 57:4">Ilkaan isaanii akka ebo'ootii fi daayaa ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:4">arrabi isaanii akka shallaagaa qaramee ti.<verse eid="PSA 57:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 57:5"/>Ee Waaqa, ol-gubba'aan gubba'atti saadami;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:5">ulfinni keeti lafa duudii irratti te'uu ti.<verse eid="PSA 57:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 57:6"/>Diinoti kiyya miila kiyyaaf fonxoroo afane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:6">lubbuun tiyya gaddaan gad jette.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 57:6">Isaan karaa kiyya keessatti boolla qotane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:6">ammoo ifumaaf keessa bu'ane.<verse eid="PSA 57:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 57:7"/>Ee Waaqa, gadhaan kiyya hin mamu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:7">Gadhaan kiyya hin mamu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 57:7">Ani hin faarfadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:7">meya faaru'uu ka adda addaatiin hin faarfadha.<verse eid="PSA 57:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 57:8"/>Lubbuu tiyya dammaqi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:8">ee kiraaraa guddicha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:8">ee maseenqo'o dammaqa'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:8">anille boruu hin dayyaasa.<verse eid="PSA 57:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 57:9"/>Ee Gootta'a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:9">ani gosa biyya adda addaa oddu'utti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:9">si galateeffadha.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:9">Ani gosa biyya adda addaa oddu'utti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:9">faaru'uun si leellisa.<verse eid="PSA 57:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 57:10"/>Jaalalli keeti ka bara baraa guddaa waan te'eef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:10">akka ol-gubba'aa ol fagaata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:10">addatamummaan teeti duumensa dhaqqaddi.<verse eid="PSA 57:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 57:11"/>Ee Waaqa, ol-gubba'aan gubba'atti saadami;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:11">ulfinni keeti lafa duudii irratti te'uu ti.<verse eid="PSA 57:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 57"/>
  <chapter number="58" style="c" sid="PSA 58"/>
  <para style="s1">Waaqi Akka Nama Hamaa Adabuuf Daadimata Dhikaate</para>
  <para style="s2">Sooressa faarfattootaatiif, faaruu Daawitii, ta akka yoyyoma faaruu, «Hin balleessin» jedhantee beekkantutti faarfatante.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 58:1"/>Isin bulchitoota,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:1">isin dhugumaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:1">waan sirrii te'e hin dubbattanii ree?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:1">Isin kolba'atti haqa hin murtanii ree?<verse eid="PSA 58:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 58:2"/>Waawwo'o! Isin gadhaa keessan keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:2">waan haqa hin te'in mala dhoottan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:2">lafa irratti hunnaan namatti kaatan.<verse eid="PSA 58:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 58:3"/>Worri hamaaleyyiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:3">gadaamessa haadha ifiitii jalqabanee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:3">karaa irraa goraneeran;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:3">haga dhalatanee jalqabanee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:3">karaa fedha ifii deemaa dhara dubbatan.<verse eid="PSA 58:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 58:4"/>Isaan akka dhudhuufa'aa hadhaa qaban;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:4">isaan akka buutii gurra duuddu'uu,<verse eid="PSA 58:4"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 58:5"/>ta qoonqoo worra qorsaan muusessuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:5">yookiin dubbii worra qaroolee xanoo hujuulle hin dhageennee ti.<verse eid="PSA 58:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 58:6"/>Ee Waaqa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:6">ilkaan isaanii afaan isaanii keessatti caccassi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:6">Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:6">worra akka dardaroota neenqaa qadhiffaa qabu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:6">qadhiffaa isaanii butuchii keessaa harcaasi.<verse eid="PSA 58:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 58:7"/>Akka bisaan lola'ee dabaruu badanuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:7">yennaa isaan guubee qopheeffatanu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:7">daayi isaanii tutuma te'uu ti.<verse eid="PSA 58:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 58:8"/>Isaan akka calanqaa adoo ideemuu baquu te'anuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:8">isaan akka finna du'ee dhalatee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:8">ka ijjumaa ifa hin dhagginii te'anuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 58:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 58:9"/>Isaan akka haasumee jiituu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:9">yookiin godduu adoo hin bobe'in,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:9">adoo okkotee hin o'isiniin dura</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:9">qilleensaan haxowantuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 58:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 58:10"/>Worri balchaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:10">Waaqi haluu isaaniif bayuun yennaa dhagganu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:10">gammadaan firinxiixan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:10">miila ifii dhiiga worra hamaaleyyi'iitiin dhiqatan.<verse eid="PSA 58:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 58:11"/>Yennaa san namooti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:11">«Dhugumaan worri balchaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:11">gatii hin dhaggatan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:11">dhugumaan Waaqi biyya lafaatitti muru</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:11">hin jira» hin jedhan.<verse eid="PSA 58:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 58"/>
  <chapter number="59" style="c" sid="PSA 59"/>
  <para style="s1">Diinota Jalaa Bayiisaaf Daadimata Dhikaate</para>
  <para style="s2">Sooressa faarfattootaatiif, faaruu Daawitii, ta akka yoyyoma faaruu, «Hin balleessin» jedhantee beekkantutti, yennaa Saa'ol Daawitii ijjeesiisaaf namoota ergee mana isaa eegisiise faarfatante.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 59:1"/>Ee Waaqa kiyya, diinota jalaa na baasi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:1">worra na irratti ka'u irraa na eegi.<verse eid="PSA 59:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 59:2"/>Worra hamaaleyyii jalaa na baasi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:2">worra dhiiga namaa dhangalaasu jalaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:2">na hamburi.<verse eid="PSA 59:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 59:3"/>Isaan ammaayyuu riphanee na gaadan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:3">Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:3">ani cubbuu yookiin dokonkora adoo hin hujin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:3">worri hunnaameyyiin na irratti ka'an.<verse eid="PSA 59:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 59:4"/>Ani dokonkora womaa adoo hin hujin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:4">isaan na loliisaaf qophowaneeran.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:4">Na qarqaariisaaf ka'i;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:4">gara kiyya koyii na ilaali!<verse eid="PSA 59:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 59:5"/>Ee Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:5">Waaqa Waan Mara Dande'u,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:5">Waaqa Israa'elii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:5">gosa biyya adda addaa adabiisaaf ka'i;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:5">worra hamaaleyyii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:5">diinaaf dabarsee nama kennu hin mararin.<verse eid="PSA 59:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 59:6"/>Isaan akka sare'ee gurura'aa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:6">galgala galgala qachaa keessa loxxisan.<verse eid="PSA 59:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 59:7"/>Waan afaan isaanii keessaa bayu ilaali;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:7">arrabi isaanii akka shallaaga'aa ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:7">isaan, «Nami nu dhage'u hin jiru» jedhaa yaadan.<verse eid="PSA 59:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 59:8"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:8">ati ammoo isaanitti hin kollita;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:8">gosa biyya adda addaa maratti hin murgita.<verse eid="PSA 59:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 59:9"/>Ee Waaqa, ati jabeenna kiyya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:9">gollaa kiyyalle waan teeteef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:9">ani si eegadha.<verse eid="PSA 59:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 59:10"/>Waaqi jaalala ifii ka bara baraatiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:10">naan dura ideema;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:10">inni akka ani injifatamiisa diinota kiyyaa dhaggu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:10">hin godha.<verse eid="PSA 59:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 59:11"/>Ee Gootta'a, wontee teenna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:11">kolbaan injifachaa keeti akka hin deene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:11">isaan hin ijjeesin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:11">hunna teetiin isaan bittinneessii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:11">isaan salphisi.<verse eid="PSA 59:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 59:12"/>Sababa cubbuu afaan isaaniitiif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:12">sababa dubbii arraba isaaniitiif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:12">koora isaaniitiin qabamanuu ti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 59:12">Abaarsaa fi dhara waan dubbatanuuf,<verse eid="PSA 59:12"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 59:13"/>aarii teetiin isaan balleessi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:13">ijjumaa isaan balleessi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 59:13">Achiin duuba haga qaccee lafaatitti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:13">akka Waaqi kolbaa Yaaqoobii bulchu hin beekkanti.<verse eid="PSA 59:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 59:14"/>Isaan akka sare'ee gurura'aa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:14">galgala galgala qachaa keessa loxxisan.<verse eid="PSA 59:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 59:15"/>Isaan akka saree sagale'eef loxxittuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:15">ta yoo quufuu dhadde gururaatuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 59:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 59:16"/>Ati guyyaa rakkinnaa gollaa kiyya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:16">addee ani itti baqadhulle waan teeteef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:16">marroo jabeenna keetiitii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:16">marroo jaalala keeti ka bara baraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:16">ganama mara hin faarfadha.<verse eid="PSA 59:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 59:17"/>Ee Waaqa, ati gollaa kiyya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:17">Waaqa na jaalatu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:17">ee jabeenna kiyya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:17">faaruu leellisaa sii dhikeessa.<verse eid="PSA 59:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 59"/>
  <chapter number="60" style="c" sid="PSA 60"/>
  <para style="s1">Daadimata Qarqaarsa Waaqaa Dhaggatiisaaf Dhikaate</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Daawitii, sooressa faarfattootaatiif, ta akka yoyyoma faaruu, «Daraaraa» jedhantee beekkantutti faarfatante. Dhugaa bayiisa. Faaruu barsiisiisaa, ta inni yennaa worra Aaramii ka biyya bisaan lama oddu'uutii fi worra Aaram Xoba'aa woliin wol lole, yennaa Yo'aab deebi'ee dhooqa sooddaa keessatti namoota Edoomii kuma kudha lama injifate faarfate.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 60:1"/>Ee Waaqa, ati nu gatteerta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:1">nu caccassiteerta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:1">nutti aarteerta; amma adde'etti nu deebisi.<verse eid="PSA 60:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 60:2"/>Ati lafa tachoottee, dhodhoocheerta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:2">isiin waan raafamiisatti jirtuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:2">dho'a isi'ii san fayyisi.<verse eid="PSA 60:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 60:3"/>Ati kolbaan teeti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:3">akka guddoo rakkattu gooteerta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:3">daadhii woyni'ii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:3">ta akka nuuti tintimaa ideennu nu gootu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:3">nuu kenniteerta.<verse eid="PSA 60:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 60:4"/>Isaan akka daaya jalaa miliqanuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:4">ati worra si sodaatuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:4">baandiraa akka ol kaafatanu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:4">isaaniif kenniteerta.<verse eid="PSA 60:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 60:5"/>Kolbaan ati jaalattu akka baatu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:5">hunna teetiin nu baasi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:5">daadimata keennaafille deebii kenni.<verse eid="PSA 60:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 60:6"/>Waaqi addee woyyittii ifii keessaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:6">«Ani injifadhee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:6">lafa ‹Sheekem› jedhantu hin hira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:6">dhooqa Suukootii kolbaa tiyyaaf qooda.<verse eid="PSA 60:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 60:7"/>Latti Giil'aadii tiyya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:7">latti Minaase'eelle tiyya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:7">Efreem gullee tiyya ta sibiilaa ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:7">Yihudaan ulee tiyya ta bokku'uu ti.<verse eid="PSA 60:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 60:8"/>Mo'aab gabataa kiyya ka itti dhiqataa ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:8">Edoom kiyya akka te'e mirkaneessiisaaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:8">kophee tiyya irratti hin qolaansa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:8">Filisxeemota irratti injifanno'oon ilillisa» jedheera.<verse eid="PSA 60:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 60:9"/>Gara qachaa guddicha dalleya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:9">dhaka'aatiin marfamee eentu na fida ree?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:9">Akka loluuf gara Edoomii eentu na geessa ree?<verse eid="PSA 60:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 60:10"/>Ee Waaqa, ati nu gatteerta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:10">loltoota teenna woliin bayiisa lakkitteerta.<verse eid="PSA 60:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 60:11"/>Qarqaarsi namaa womaa waan nu'uuf hin baaneef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:11">diinota keenna akka lolluuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:11">ati nu qarqaar.<verse eid="PSA 60:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 60:12"/>Qarqaarsa Waaqaatiin hin injifanna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:12">inni diinota keenna hin salphisa.<verse eid="PSA 60:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 60"/>
  <chapter number="61" style="c" sid="PSA 61"/>
  <para style="s1">Daadimata Diinota Jalaa Bayiisaaf Dhikaate</para>
  <para style="s2">Sooressa faarfattootaatiif, faaruu Daawitii ta meya ribu'uutiin faarfatante.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 61:1"/>Ee Waaqa, iyya tiyya dhage'i;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:1">daadimata kiyya caqasi.<verse eid="PSA 61:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 61:2"/>Addii kutadhee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:2">qaccee lafaa irraa si waammadha;</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 61:2"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 61:2">Gara rassaa na caalaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:2">ol ka'eeruu san na geessi.<verse eid="PSA 61:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 61:3"/>Ati addee ani itti baqadhu waan teeteef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:3">diinota kiyya loliisaaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:3">ati xelleephoo tiyya jaddu'u.<verse eid="PSA 61:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 61:4"/>Ani bara jiruu tiyyaa mara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:4">mana keeti keessa le'uu fedha.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:4">Gaaddisa bobaa teetii jalatti baqatuu fedha.<verse eid="PSA 61:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 61:5"/>Ee Waaqa, waadaa kiyya dhageetteerta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:5">qooda worra maqaa keeti sodaatuuf kennite</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:5">naafille kenniteerta.<verse eid="PSA 61:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 61:6"/>Bara jiruu mootichaa irratti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:6">woggaa hedduu ede'i;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:6">inni dhalootaa haga dhaloota heddu'uu le'uu ti.<verse eid="PSA 61:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 61:7"/>Fuula keeti duratti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:7">haga bara baraa isa mootonsi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:7">jaalala keeti ka bara baraatii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:7">addatamummaa teetiin isa eegi.<verse eid="PSA 61:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 61:8"/>Guyyuma guyya'aan waadaa kiyya eegatiisaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:8">yennaa mara faaru'uun maqaa keeti leellisa.<verse eid="PSA 61:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 61"/>
  <chapter number="62" style="c" sid="PSA 62"/>
  <para style="s1">Waaqa Qofatti Addatuu</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Daawitii sooressa faarfattootaa Yedutu'uuf.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 62:1"/>Fayyinni kiyya isa irraa waan dhufuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:1">lubbuun tiyya Waaqa qofa cadhittee eegatti.<verse eid="PSA 62:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 62:2"/>Inni callaan rassaa kiyyaa fi fayyinna kiyya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:2">inni kushee tiyya; ani ijjumaa hin raafamu.<verse eid="PSA 62:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 62:3"/>Nama akka dalleya dhaka'aa ka duufee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:3">akka dalleya daaqee te'e tokko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:3">isin haga yoomii isa lolaa teettan ree?<verse eid="PSA 62:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 62:4"/>Isaan nama san addee ulfinnaa irraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:4">gad isa buusiisaaf barbaadan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 62:4">Dhara dubbatiisatti gammadan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:4">afaan ifiitiin hin eebbisan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:4">gadhaa ifiitiin ammoo hin abaaran.<verse eid="PSA 62:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 62:5"/>Lubbuun tiyya Waaqa qofa cadhittee eeggatti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:5">addiin tiyya isa irraa naa dhutti.<verse eid="PSA 62:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 62:6"/>Inni callaan rassaa kiyyaa fi fayyinna kiyya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:6">inni kushee tiyya; ani ijjumaa hin raafamu.<verse eid="PSA 62:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 62:7"/>Fayyinnii fi ulfinni kiyya Waaqa irraa dhufe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:7">inni rassaa jabaa kiyya; addee ani itti baqadhulle'e.<verse eid="PSA 62:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 62:8"/>Ee kolba'a, yennaa mara Waaqatti addadha'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:8">Waaqi ka itti baqannu waan te'eef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:8">yaada gadhaa keessanii mara itti himadha'a.<verse eid="PSA 62:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 62:9"/>Ilmaan namaa akka qilleensaa ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:9">namooti marti womaa moti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 62:9">Isaan yoo madaalamane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:9">qilleensa caalaa sallatan.<verse eid="PSA 62:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 62:10"/>Hunnaan saamiisatti hin addatina'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:10">waan hannaan dhaggameen hin koorina'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:10">yoo karri teessan ede'antelle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:10">addii itti hin godhatina'a.<verse eid="PSA 62:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 62:11"/>Waaqi takkaa dubbateera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:11">ani waan lama dhage'eera.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:11">Sunille, «Hunni ta Waaqaa ti;<verse eid="PSA 62:11"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 62:12"/>jaalalli bara baraa ka Gootta'aa ti» ta jettu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:12">Ee Gootta'a ati maraafuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:12">akka hujii isaatitti gatii isaaf kaffalta.<verse eid="PSA 62:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 62"/>
  <chapter number="63" style="c" sid="PSA 63"/>
  <para style="s1">Waaqa Barbaadiisa</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Daawitii ta inni yennaa goomolee Yihuda'aa keessa jiru Faarfate.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 63:1"/>Ee Waaqa, ati Waaqa kiyya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:1">ani si barbaada.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 63:1">Akka lafa bisaan dhaddee goggoddee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:1">lubbuun tiyya si dheebotti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:1">nafi kiyyalle si dharra'a.<verse eid="PSA 63:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 63:2"/>Tanaaf, ani Dunkaanii Woyyittii teeti keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:2">si ilaalee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:2">hunnaa fi ulfinna keeti dhagge.<verse eid="PSA 63:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 63:3"/>Jaalalli keeti ka bara baraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:3">jiruu waan caaluuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:3">arrabi kiyya si leellisa.<verse eid="PSA 63:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 63:4"/>Ani haga jiru si leellifadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:4">harka kiyya ol qabadhee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:4">maqaa keeti waammadha.<verse eid="PSA 63:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 63:5"/>Akka sagalee dansaa nyaatteetitti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:5">lubbuun tiyya quutte;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:5">afaan kiyya arraba ililleetti'iitiin si leellisa.<verse eid="PSA 63:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 63:6"/>Taqee tiyya irratti si qaabadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:6">halkan duudii marroo teeti yaada.<verse eid="PSA 63:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 63:7"/>Ati qarqaarsa kiyya waan teeteef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:7">gaaddisa bobaa teetii jalatti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:7">gammadaan faarfadha.<verse eid="PSA 63:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 63:8"/>Lubbuun tiyya sitti maxxanti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:8">harki keeti middichi ol na qaba.<verse eid="PSA 63:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 63:9"/>Worri jiruu tiyya balleessiisaaf barbaadu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:9">qilee lafa jalaatitti gad bu'a.<verse eid="PSA 63:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 63:10"/>Isaan shallaagaa afaan bu'an;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:10">jeedalaaf sagalee te'an.<verse eid="PSA 63:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 63:11"/>Mootichi ammoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:11">Waaqaan hin gammada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:11">worri maqaa Waaqaatiin kakatu marti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:11">Waaqa hin leellisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:11">afaan worra dharaameyyi'ii hin cufama.<verse eid="PSA 63:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 63"/>
  <chapter number="64" style="c" sid="PSA 64"/>
  <para style="s1">Daadimata Diinota Jalaa Bayiisaaf Dhikaate</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Daawitii, sooressa faarfattootaatiif.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 64:1"/>Ee Waaqa, rakkinna keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:1">qoonqoo tiyya naaf dhage'i;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:1">sodaachisaa diinaa irraa na eegi.<verse eid="PSA 64:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 64:2"/>Mala worra hama'aa duraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:2">waan hantuu hujiisaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:2">worra wolitti qabamu duraa na dhossi.<verse eid="PSA 64:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 64:3"/>Isaan arraba ifii akka shallaaga'aa qaratan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:3">dubbii hadhoottuu akka daayaa darbatan.<verse eid="PSA 64:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 64:4"/>Isaan dhokatanee nama yakkaa hin qannetti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:4">sodaa malee dedhuma darbatan.<verse eid="PSA 64:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 64:5"/>Isaan waan hantuu hujiisaaf woliin mari'atan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:5">tiyyoo afiisaaf dhossa'aan mala dhowaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:5">«Eentu nu dhagga?» jedhaa yaadan.<verse eid="PSA 64:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 64:6"/>Yaadi gadhaa namaatii fi qalbiin namaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:6">gad fagoo waan teeteef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:6">isaan waan hantuu mala dhowanee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:6">«Nuuti mala dansaa dhoonneera» jedhan.<verse eid="PSA 64:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 64:7"/>Waaqi ammoo daaya ifii gara isaanii hin darbata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:7">isaan dedhuma hin madowan.<verse eid="PSA 64:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 64:8"/>Waaqi dubbuma arraba isaaniitiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:8">gara badi'ii isaan fida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:8">worri isaan dhaggu marti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:8">murgo'oon mataa ifii itti hin raasan.<verse eid="PSA 64:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 64:9"/>Nami marti hin sodaata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:9">isaan hujii Waaqaa lallabaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:9">waan inni godhelle yaadanee hin hubatan.<verse eid="PSA 64:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 64:10"/>Worri balchaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:10">Mootii Waan Maraatiin gammaduu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:10">isatti baqatuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:10">worri qajeelaan marti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:10">Mootii Waan Maraa leellisuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 64:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 64"/>
  <chapter number="65" style="c" sid="PSA 65"/>
  <para style="s1">Leellisaa Fi Galata</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Daawitii, sooressa faarfattootaatiif.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 65:1"/>Ee Waaqa, Xiyoon keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:1">si leellisuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:1">waadaa si'iif gallelle muummessuu qanna.<verse eid="PSA 65:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 65:2"/>Ee ka daadimata namaa dhageettu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:2">nami marti gara keeti hin dhufa.<verse eid="PSA 65:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 65:3"/>Cubbuun nu moote;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:3">ati ammoo yakkaa teenna nuu araarante.<verse eid="PSA 65:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 65:4"/>Worri ati filattee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:4">badhinna mana keetii keessa akka le'anu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:4">ka ifitti dhikeeffatte ka eebbifame.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 65:4">Nuuti waan dansaa mana keetii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:4">ta Dunkaanii Woyyittii teetiitiin hin quunna.<verse eid="PSA 65:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 65:5"/>Ee Waaqa fayyisaa keenna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:5">hujii maade'ee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:5">ta balchumma'aatiin deebii nuuf kennita.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 65:5">Worri qaccee lafaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:5">abbaaya'aan gama fagoo jiru martille</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:5">addii sitti godhata.<verse eid="PSA 65:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 65:6"/>Ati hunna teeti uffattee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:6">jabeenna keetiin gaarota dadde.<verse eid="PSA 65:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 65:7"/>Ati Shookkessa abbaaya'aatii fi danbalii isi'ii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:7">caanca gosa biyya adda addaalle cadhi goota.<verse eid="PSA 65:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 65:8"/>Bilbaasa ati gooteen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:8">worri biyya lafaa irra le'u duudiin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:8">hin sodaata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:8">addee aduun baatu irraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:8">haga addee aduun seentuutitti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:8">ililleettiin akka dhage'antu hin goota.<verse eid="PSA 65:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 65:9"/>Ati lafa ilaaltee, rooba kennitaaf;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:9">guddoo laattuu isii goota.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 65:9">Lagi Waaqaa, bisaaniin guuteera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:9">akkas gootee waan qopheessiteef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:9">kolbaan midhaan dhaggatti.<verse eid="PSA 65:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 65:10"/>Fichaa qotame irratti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:10">bokkeya bacaa roobisiitta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:10">quqquuqaa isaalle hin bulleessita;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:10">biyyee tiifu'uun laafficha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:10">mudheen<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">65:10 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Mudheen: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Lafa tokko tokkotti mudhoon</char></note> lattee akka guddattu goota.<verse eid="PSA 65:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 65:11"/>Arjummaa teetiin bara eebbitta!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:11">Gara ati dhaxxe mara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:11">midhaan baca'atti jiraata.<verse eid="PSA 65:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 65:12"/>Goomoleen marti bisiltee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:12">koobotille gammada akka woya'aa uffatan.<verse eid="PSA 65:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 65:13"/>Diidi tika hoolotaatiin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:13">dhooqille midhaaniin guutaman;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:13">isaan ilillisaa faaruu faarfatan.<verse eid="PSA 65:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 65"/>
  <chapter number="66" style="c" sid="PSA 66"/>
  <para style="s1">Faaruu Leellisaatii Fi Galataa</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu, sooressa faarfattootaatiif.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 66:1"/>Biyyi lafaa duudiin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:1">Waaqaaf gammadaa ilillisa'a.<verse eid="PSA 66:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 66:2"/>Ulfinna maqaa isaatiif faarfadha'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:2">leellisa ulfinnaa isaaf kenna'a.<verse eid="PSA 66:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 66:3"/>Waaqaan, «Hujiin teeti attam attam bilbaasa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:3">Hunni teeti guddoo waan teeteef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:3">diinoti keeti soda'aan si duratti hollatan.<verse eid="PSA 66:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 66:4"/>Worri lafa irra jiru marti sii sagadan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:4">isaan faaru'uun si leellisan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:4">maqaa keeti leellisaa faarfatan» jedha'a.<verse eid="PSA 66:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 66:5"/>Waan Waaqi godhe kowa'aa ilaala'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:5">inni hujii baasaa odduu kolba'aatitti hujeera.<verse eid="PSA 66:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 66:6"/>Inni abbaayaa gargar kutee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:6">kolbaan isaa miila ifiitiin lafa godduu irra</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:6">laga Yordaanosii gamatti buute;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:6">nuutille waan inni godheen gammanne.<verse eid="PSA 66:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 66:7"/>Inni hunna ifiitiin haga bara baraa hin bulcha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:7">ilti isaa gosa biyya adda addaa hin eeddi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:7">Worri isa finqilu isa irratti hin ka'in.<verse eid="PSA 66:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 66:8"/>Ee, gosi biyya adda addaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:8">Waaqa keenna leellisa'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:8">qoonqoo ol qabadha'aatii isa leellisa'a.<verse eid="PSA 66:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 66:9"/>Inni jiru'uun nu eegee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:9">miila keennalle akka hin mucucaanne godheera.<verse eid="PSA 66:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 66:10"/>Ee Waaqa, ati haga nu ilaalteerta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:10">akkuma meetiin ibiddaan dhimbiibantu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:10">ati nu dhimbiidde.<verse eid="PSA 66:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 66:11"/>Ati tiyyoo keessa nu galchite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:11">ba'aa ulfaattuu dudda keenna irra keette.<verse eid="PSA 66:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 66:12"/>Ati akka namooti mataa keenna irratti bayanu goote;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:12">ibiddaa fi bisaan keessa dabarre;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:12">amma ammoo addee wonni dansaan jirtutti nu baache.<verse eid="PSA 66:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 66:13"/>Ani ciincaa qabadhee gara mana keetii hin seena;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:13">waan waadaa gale si'iif hin muummessa.<verse eid="PSA 66:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 66:14"/>Waadaan sun ka ani yennaa rakkoo keessa jiru</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:14">arrabi kiyya tuqee, afaan kiyya dubbate.<verse eid="PSA 66:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 66:15"/>Ciincaa horii cocoomaatii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:15">ciincaa korbeeyyii hoole'ee si'iif hin dhikeessa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:15">korommi'ii fi korbeeyyii re'e'ee hin kenna.<verse eid="PSA 66:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 66:16"/>Isin worri Waaqa sodaattanu marti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:16">kowa'aa dhage'a'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:16">ani waan Waaqi naaf godhe hin hima.<verse eid="PSA 66:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 66:17"/>Ani guddisee gara isaa iyye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:17">arraba kiyyaan isa saade.<verse eid="PSA 66:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 66:18"/>Ani cubbuu gadhaa kiyya keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:18">adoo dhoffadhee jiraadhee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:18">Goottaan silaa na hin caqasuuyyu.<verse eid="PSA 66:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 66:19"/>Waaqi ammoo dhugumaan naaf caqaseera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:19">qoonqoo daadimata kiyyaalle dhage'eera.<verse eid="PSA 66:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 66:20"/>Daadimata kiyya waan hin tuffatiniif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:20">yookiin jaalala ifii ka bara baraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:20">waan na irraa hin fudhatiniif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:20">Waaqi leellifamuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 66:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 66"/>
  <chapter number="67" style="c" sid="PSA 67"/>
  <para style="s1">Faaruu Leellisaa</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu takka, ta meya ribu'uutiin faarfatante, sooressa faarfattootaatiif.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 67:1"/>Waaqi nu mararuu ti; nulle eebbisuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:1">fuula ifii akka nu irratti ifu godhuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 67:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 67:2"/>Achiin duuba, karaan keeti lafa duudii irratti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:2">fayyisiis keeti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:2">gosa biyya adda addaa mara oddu'utti hin beekkama.<verse eid="PSA 67:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 67:3"/>Ee Waaqa, kolbaan si leellittuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:3">kolbaan marti si leellittuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 67:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 67:4"/>Ati haqaan kolbaa maratti waan murtuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:4">gosa biyya adda addaa waan sooressituuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:4">gosi biyya adda addaa gammadaan ilillittuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 67:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 67:5"/>Ee Waaqa, kolbaan si leellittuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:5">kolbaan marti si leellittuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 67:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 67:6"/>Latti midhaan baatteerti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:6">Waaqi, Waaqayyoon keenna nu hin eebbisa.<verse eid="PSA 67:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 67:7"/>Waaqi nu hin eebbisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:7">kolbaan lafa irraa marti isa hin sodaatti.<verse eid="PSA 67:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 67"/>
  <chapter number="68" style="c" sid="PSA 68"/>
  <para style="s1">Leellisaa Fi Galateeffatiisa</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Daawitii, sooressa faarfattootaatiif.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 68:1"/>Waaqi ol ka'uu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:1">diinoti isaa bittinnowanuu ti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:1">Worri isa jibbulle isa duraa baqatuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 68:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 68:2"/>Akkuma qilleensi aara oofu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:2">atille isaan oofi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:2">akkuma gagaan ibidda duratti baqu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:2">worri hamaalle Waaqa duraa baduu ti.<verse eid="PSA 68:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 68:3"/>Worri balchooleen gammadanuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:3">isaan Waaqa duratti ilillisanuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:3">gammadaan firinxiixanuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 68:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 68:4"/>Waaqaaf faarfadha'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:4">faaruu leellisaatiin maqaa isaa faarfadha'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:4">ka duumensa irra deemu saada'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:4">maqaan isaa Mootii Waan Maraa ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:4">isa duratti ilillisa'a!<verse eid="PSA 68:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 68:5"/>Waaqi addee woyyittii ifii keessa jira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:5">ijoollee abbaa hin qanneef abba'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:5">haadhotii hiyyeessaatiifille abbaa mura'aa ti.<verse eid="PSA 68:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 68:6"/>Waaqi worra qofi le'uuf maatii hin kenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:6">worra hidhamelle qananumma'atti hin baasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:6">finqiltooti ammoo goomolee godduu keessa le'an.<verse eid="PSA 68:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 68:7"/>Ee Waaqa, yennaa ati kolbaa teeti sooressite,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:7">goomolee keessa yennaa ideente,<verse eid="PSA 68:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 68:8"/>Waaqa gaara Siina'aa duratti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:8">Waaqa Israa'elii duratti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:8">latti tachootee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:8">ol-gubbaan bokkeya kennite.<verse eid="PSA 68:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 68:9"/>Ee Waaqa, ati bokkeya bacaa roobisiitte;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:9">lafa teeti ta godde haaressite.<verse eid="PSA 68:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 68:10"/>Kolbaan teeti achitti qubatte.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:10">Eebba keetiin worra hiyyeeyyi'iif</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:10">waan isaaniif barbaachisu kennite.<verse eid="PSA 68:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 68:11"/>Goottaan ajaja baase;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:11">dubartooti hedduun oduu san dabarsane:<verse eid="PSA 68:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 68:12"/>«Moototii fi loltooti isaanii ariiti'iin baqatane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:12">dubartooti mana jiranu boojuu qoodamane;<verse eid="PSA 68:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 68:13"/>Worri hoolee tissiisaaf duubatti hafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:13">fakkii saphaliisaa ta koolli isi'ii meetii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:13">ta baalli isi'ii worqii bifa magariisaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:13">itti gonfame yennaa qoodamanu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:13">isin maaf gooree hoole'ee keessa rattane?» jedhane.<verse eid="PSA 68:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 68:14"/>Ka waan mara dande'u</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:14">yennaa mootota lafa sanii bittinneesse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:14">dhakaan bokkeyaa gaara Zaalmon irratti bu'e.<verse eid="PSA 68:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 68:15"/>Gaarri Baashaanii gaara ol aana'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:15">gaarri Baashaanii qaccee hedduu qaba.<verse eid="PSA 68:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 68:16"/>Ee isin gaaroti qaccee hedduu qaddanu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:16">gaara Waaqi irra le'iisaaf filate,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:16">ka Mootiin Waan Maraa haga bara baraa irra le'u,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:16">maaf ila hinaaffa'aatiin ilaaltan.<verse eid="PSA 68:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 68:17"/>Garreettaa fardo'oon harkifamu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:17">ka Waaqaa kuma hedduu woliin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:17">Goottaan gaara Siina'aa irraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:17">gara addee woyyittii ifii dhufa.<verse eid="PSA 68:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 68:18"/>Mootii Waan Maraa Waaqa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:18">ati yennaa ol baate,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:18">boojuu fudhattee gara addee leetuu dhaxxe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:18">kolbaa mara irraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:18">worra si mormu irralle'ee kennansa fudhatte.<verse eid="PSA 68:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 68:19"/>Goottaan, Waaqi fayyisaan keenna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:19">ka guyyaa mara ba'aa teenna ba'atu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:19">leellifamuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 68:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 68:20"/>Waaqi keenna, Waaqa nu fayyisu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:20">Mootiin Waan Maraa Waaqi ka du'a jalaa nu baasu.<verse eid="PSA 68:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 68:21"/>Waaqi ammoo mataa diinota ifii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:21">buqqii mataa worra karaa cubbuu ifiititti jabaatuu hin butucha.<verse eid="PSA 68:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 68:22"/>Goottaan, «Ani diinota keeti biyya Baashaaniitii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:22">qilee abbaaya'aa keessaa deebisee hin fida;<verse eid="PSA 68:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 68:23"/>Achiin duuba ati dhiiga isaanii keessa ijjatta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:23">sareeleen teetille qooda ifii hin arraabbatan» jedhe.<verse eid="PSA 68:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 68:24"/>Ee Waaqa, gogeessi worra si woliin jiruu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:24">ka ati Waaqi mootiin kiyya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:24">gara addee woyyittii teetii seentu mudhate.<verse eid="PSA 68:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 68:25"/>Worri faarfatu fuula duraan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:25">worri meya faarfanna'aa dhowanu duubaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:25">ijoolleen durra ta dibbee dhoottu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:25">wodhakkaa isaaniitiin jiraniiyyu.<verse eid="PSA 68:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 68:26"/>Isaan, «Gumii guddoo keessatti Waaqa leellisa'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:26">gumii kolbaa Israa'elii keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:26">Mootii Waan Maraa leellisa'a» jedhan.<verse eid="PSA 68:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 68:27"/>Gosi Beniyaaminii diqqoon isaan sooressiti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:27">qondaaltoti Yihuda'aa golii ifii woliin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:27">qondaaltoti Zebulooniitii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:27">qondaaltoti Naftaalemii achi jiraniiyyu.<verse eid="PSA 68:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 68:28"/>Ee Waaqa, hunna teeti ajaji;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:28">akkuma dur nuuf goote,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:28">ee Waaqa jabeenna keeti mudhisi.<verse eid="PSA 68:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 68:29"/>Sababa Dunkaanii Woyyittii teeti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:29">ta Yerusaalem keessaatiif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:29">moototi kennansa si'iif fidan.<verse eid="PSA 68:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 68:30"/>Biyya Gibxi'ii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:30">ta akka bineensa shonbooqqoo keessaa xixi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:30">mootota biyya adda addaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:30">ta akka korommi'iitii fi jabbi'ii xixi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 68:30">Akka meeti'iin gabbaranu jilbiiffatanuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:30">gosa biyya adda addaa ta lola jaalattu bittinneessi.<verse eid="PSA 68:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 68:31"/>Ergantooti biyya Gibxi'ii irraa hin dhufan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:31">kolbaan Itoophiya'aa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">68:31 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Itoophiyaa: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Afaan Ibrootaatiin </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuushi jedha. </char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:31">harka ifii gara Waaqaa hin diriirsiti.<verse eid="PSA 68:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 68:32"/>Ee isin mootummooti biyya lafaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:32">Waaqaaf faarfadha'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:32">faaruu leellisaa Gootta'aaf faarsa'a.<verse eid="PSA 68:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 68:33"/>Ka ol-gubbaa durii duriitii jalqaddee jirtu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:33">gubbaa ideemuuf faarfadha'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:33">inni qoonqoo ifii jaddu'uun</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:33">mandi'uun caqasa'a.<verse eid="PSA 68:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 68:34"/>Waaqa arnyi isaa Israa'el irra jiru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:34">ka hunni isaa gubbaa keessa jirtu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:34">hunna isaa lallaba'a.<verse eid="PSA 68:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 68:35"/>Waaqi, addee woyyittii ifii keessaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:35">attam attam sodaachisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:35">inni kolbaa ifii Israa'eliif</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:35">hunnaa fi jabeenna kenna;</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 68:35"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 68:35">Waaqi leellifamuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 68:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 68"/>
  <chapter number="69" style="c" sid="PSA 69"/>
  <para style="s1">Daadimata Qarqaarsa Dhaggatiisaa Dhikaate</para>
  <para style="s2">Sooressa faarfattootaatiif, faaruu Daawitii ta akka yoyyoma faaruu, «Daraaraa» jedhantee beekkantutti faarfatante.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 69:1"/>Bisaan waan morma na geyeef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:1">Ee Waaqa na baasi!<verse eid="PSA 69:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 69:2"/>Ani qilee caffa'aa keessa lixe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:2">miilli kiyya waan irra dhaabbatu dhabe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:2">ani qilee bisaanii keessa lixe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:2">lolaan na liqinse.<verse eid="PSA 69:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 69:3"/>Ani iyyiisaan dadhabe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:3">laagadaan na babbaqaqe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:3">qarqaarsa Waaqaa eeggatiisaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:3">ilti tiyya dadhadde.<verse eid="PSA 69:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 69:4"/>Worri sababa malee na jibbu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:4">rifeensa mataa kiyyaa caalaa bacata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:4">diinoti kiyya worri dharaan na himatu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:4">ka na balleessiisaaf barbaadu heddu'u.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 69:4">Ani waan hin hatin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:4">ade'etti deebisuu qabaa ree?<verse eid="PSA 69:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 69:5"/>Ee Waaqa, ati gowwummaa tiyya hin beetta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:5">yakkaan tiyya si duraa dhokattee hin jirtu.<verse eid="PSA 69:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 69:6"/>Ee Waaqa waan mara dande'u,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:6">worri si addatu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:6">sababa kiyyaaf hin fokkifatin.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 69:6">Ee Waaqa Israa'elii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:6">worri si barbaadu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:6">sababa kiyyaaf hin qaanowin.<verse eid="PSA 69:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 69:7"/>Ani si'iif jedhee arraba ossadhe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:7">ani si'iif jedhee fokkoo uffadhe.<verse eid="PSA 69:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 69:8"/>Ani obboleeyyan tiyyatti orma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:8">ilmaan haadha tiyyaatitti alagaa te'e.<verse eid="PSA 69:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 69:9"/>Hinaaffaan mana keetiif qabu na gudde;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:9">arrabi si arrassanu na irra bu'e.<verse eid="PSA 69:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 69:10"/>Yennaa ani laamee bowe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:10">isaan na arrassane.<verse eid="PSA 69:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 69:11"/>Woyaa gaddaa yennaa uffadhe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:11">nama ittiin mammaakanu isaaniif te'e.<verse eid="PSA 69:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 69:12"/>Ani waan worri addee yaa'ii tee'u ittiin mammaaku te'e;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:12">worri machowulle marroo tiyya sirba.<verse eid="PSA 69:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 69:13"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:13">yennaa si biratti fudhatama qaddutti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:13">ani gara keeti daadimadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:13">ee Waaqa jaalala keeti ka bara baraatiin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:13">fayyisiisa keeti ka dhuga'aatiin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:13">deebii naaf kenni.<verse eid="PSA 69:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 69:14"/>Dhoqqee keessa lixiisa irraa na hamburi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:14">diinota kiyya jalaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:14">qilee bisaanii keessaa na baasi.<verse eid="PSA 69:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 69:15"/>Lolaan na fudhatee hin deemin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:15">yookiin qileen na hin liqinsin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:15">yookiin boolli na irratti hin cufamin.<verse eid="PSA 69:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 69:16"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:16">jaalalli keeti ka bara baraa dansaa waan te'eef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:16">deebii naaf kenni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:16">marartii teeti guddo'oon gara kiyya deebi'i.<verse eid="PSA 69:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 69:17"/>Fuula keeti ana tajaajilaa keeti duraa hin dhoffatin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:17">ani rakkoo guddoo keessa waan jiruuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:17">ariifadhuu deebii naaf kenni.<verse eid="PSA 69:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 69:18"/>Natti dhikaadhuu na wodi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:18">dhiibbii<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">69:18 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Dhiibbii: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Yookiin dhiibii </char></note> diinota kiyyaatiif jedhii na baasi.<verse eid="PSA 69:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 69:19"/>Arraffamiisa kiyya, qaanowiisa kiyya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:19">salphatiisa kiyyalle hin beetta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:19">ati diinota kiyya mara dhaggita.<verse eid="PSA 69:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 69:20"/>Arrabi na miidhee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:20">anille addii kutadhe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:20">nama naaf nayu barbaadee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:20">ammoo dhabe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 69:20">Nama na jajjabeessulle barbaadee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:20">ammoo tokkolle hin dhagganne.<verse eid="PSA 69:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 69:21"/>Akka nyaadhuuf hadhaa naaf kennane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:21">dheebuu tiyyaaf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:21">daadhii woyni'ii dhangaggoottuu naaf kennane.<verse eid="PSA 69:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 69:22"/>Qoriin isaanii fonxoroo isaanii teetuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:22">worra isaan woliin nyaatuufille tiyyoo teetuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 69:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 69:23"/>Akka hin dhaggine,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:23">ilti isaanii dukkanoottuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:23">hidhi isaanii yennaa mara lellequu ti.<verse eid="PSA 69:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 69:24"/>Mufii teeti isaan irratti dhangalaasi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:24">aariin teeti ta bobeettu isaan dhaqqadduu ti.<verse eid="PSA 69:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 69:25"/>Quttumi isaanii onuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:25">dunkaanii isaanii keessa nami hin le'in.<verse eid="PSA 69:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 69:26"/>Isaan worra ati dhaante ari'an;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:26">marroo farra worra ati madeessitee haasowan.<verse eid="PSA 69:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 69:27"/>Yakkaa ifii irratti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:27">yakkaa akka dabalatanuuf isaan lakkisi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:27">gara balchummaa teetii isaan hin fidin.<verse eid="PSA 69:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 69:28"/>Maqaan isaanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:28">galmee worra jiraata'aa keessaa haqamuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:28">isaan worra balchoolee woliin hin galmeeffamin.<verse eid="PSA 69:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 69:29"/>Ani ammoo farraa fi rakkinna guddaa keessa jira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:29">ee Waaqa, fayyisiisi keeti ol na qabuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 69:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 69:30"/>Ani faaru'uun maqaa Waaqaa hin leellisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:30">galatalle'een isa ulfeessa.<verse eid="PSA 69:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 69:31"/>Kun korma yookiin dardara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:31">gaafaa fi qeenca qabu caalaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:31">Mootii Waan Maraa hin gammachiisa.<verse eid="PSA 69:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 69:32"/>Worri cunqurfame tana dhaggee hin gammada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:32">isin worri Waaqa barbaaddanu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:32">gadhaan keessan jajjabaatuu ti;<verse eid="PSA 69:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 69:33"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa worra rakkata'aaf hin dhage'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:33">kolbaa ifii worra hidhameerulle hin tuffatu.<verse eid="PSA 69:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 69:34"/>Ol-gubba'aa fi latti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:34">abbaaya'aa fi wonni isii keessa munyuuqu marti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:34">isa leellisanuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 69:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 69:35"/>Waaqi qachaa Xiyoonii hin baasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:35">qachoota Yihuda'aalle deebisee hin ijaara.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 69:35">Kolbaan isaalle achitti qubattee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:35">lafa san hin qabatti.<verse eid="PSA 69:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 69:36"/>Ijoolleen tajaajiltoota isaa lafa san hin dhaalti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:36">worri maqaa isaa jaalatulle lafa san keessa hin le'a.<verse eid="PSA 69:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 69"/>
  <chapter number="70" style="c" sid="PSA 70"/>
  <para style="s1">Diinota jalaa Bayiisaaf Daadimata Dhikaate</para>
  <para style="s2">Sooressa faarfattootaatiif, faaruu Daawitii ta akka Waaqi isa qaabatuuf faarfatante.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 70:1"/>Ee Waaqa na baasi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 70:1">Mootii Waan Maraa kiyya na qarqaariisaaf ariifadhu.<verse eid="PSA 70:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 70:2"/>Worri na ijjeesiisaaf barbaadu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 70:2">fokkifatee jaanjuruu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 70:2">worri na miidhiisaaf halchu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 70:2">salphatee gara duubaa deebi'uu ti.<verse eid="PSA 70:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 70:3"/>Worri, «Baga, baga!» naan jedhu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 70:3">fokkifatee gara duubaa deebi'uu ti.<verse eid="PSA 70:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 70:4"/>Worri si barbaadu marti ammoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 70:4">si'iin gammadee firinxiixuu ti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 70:4">Worri fayyisiisa keeti jaalatu marti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 70:4">yennaa mara, «Waaqi gudda'a» jedhuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 70:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 70:5"/>Ani rakkataa hiyyeessa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 70:5">Ee Waaqa, ariifadhuu gara kiyya koy;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 70:5">Ee Mootii Waan Maraa kiyya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 70:5">ati qarqaara'aa fi fayyisaa kiyya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 70:5">na irraa hin turin.<verse eid="PSA 70:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 70"/>
  <chapter number="71" style="c" sid="PSA 71"/>
  <para style="s1">Daadimata Jaarsaa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 71:1"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa, ani sitti baqadheera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:1">ani ijjumaa hin fokkifatin.<verse eid="PSA 71:1"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 71:2"/>Ati balchummaa teetiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:2">na baasiitii, na hamburi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:2">gurra keeti gara kiyya deebifadhuutii, na baasi.<verse eid="PSA 71:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 71:3"/>Ati rassaa kiyya ka ani itti baqadhu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:3">ka ani yennaa mara itti dhokadhu naa te'i;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:3">ati rassaa kiyyaa fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:3">kushee jadduu tiyya waan teeteef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:3">na hamburiisaaf, ajaja baatteerta.<verse eid="PSA 71:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 71:4"/>Ee Waaqa, harka worra hamaaleyyi'ii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:4">harka worra hantuu hujuutii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:4">harka worra gadhi-jabeeyyi'ii keessaa na baasi.<verse eid="PSA 71:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 71:5"/>Ee Gootta'a, Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:5">ati addii tiyya waan teeteef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:5">dargaggummaa tiyyaa jalqaddee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:5">ka ani itti addadhu.<verse eid="PSA 71:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 71:6"/>Gadhaa haadha tiyyaa keessaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:6">akka dhaladhu sittuu godhe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:6">dhaloota kiyyaa jalqabee sitti irkadheera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:6">ani yennaa mara si leellisa.<verse eid="PSA 71:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 71:7"/>Ani nama heddu'uuf fakkeenna te'eera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:7">ati ammoo addee jadduu ani itti baqadhu.<verse eid="PSA 71:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 71:8"/>Guyyaa guutuu leellisii fi ulfinni keeti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:8">afaan kiyya guuteera.<verse eid="PSA 71:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 71:9"/>Yennaa ani dulloometti na hin gatin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:9">yennaa ani jabeenna kiyya dhabetti na hin lakkisin.<verse eid="PSA 71:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 71:10"/>Diinoti kiyya waan hantuu na irratti dubbatan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:10">worri na ijjeesiisaaf barbaadu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:10">woli woliin mari'atan.<verse eid="PSA 71:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 71:11"/>Isaan, «Waaqi isa lakkiseera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:11">ka isa baasu hin jiru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:11">ari'a'aatii qaba'a» jedhan.<verse eid="PSA 71:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 71:12"/>Ee Waaqa, na irraa hin fagaatin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:12">Ee Waaqa kiyya, na qarqaariisaaf ariifadhu.<verse eid="PSA 71:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 71:13"/>Worri diina natti te'u fokko'oon baduu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:13">worri na miidhiisaaf barbaadu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:13">tuffatamaa fi salphinna uffatuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 71:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 71:14"/>Ani yennaa mara addii si godhadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:14">ittuma ede'ee, ede'ee si leellisa.<verse eid="PSA 71:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 71:15"/>Laakkossa hujii balchummaa teetiitii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:15">fayyisiisa keetii haga wollaalulle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:15">afaan kiyya guyyaa guutuu hin dubbata.<verse eid="PSA 71:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 71:16"/>Ee Gootta'a, Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:16">ani dhufee hujii teeti jadduu san,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:16">balchummaa teeti qofa lallaba.<verse eid="PSA 71:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 71:17"/>Ee Waaqa, dargaggummaa tiyyaa jalqaddee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:17">ati na barsiitteerta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:17">ani haga ammaa hujii teeti ta maade'ee odeessa.<verse eid="PSA 71:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 71:18"/>Hunna teeti dhaloota dhufuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:18">hujii teeti ta maade'ee worra dhufu'uu jiru maraaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:18">haga odeessutti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:18">ani dulloomee arrii baasulle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:18">Ee Waaqa, na hin lakkisin.<verse eid="PSA 71:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 71:19"/>Ee Waaqa, balchummaan teeti guddattee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:19">ol-gubbaa geetteerti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:19">ati waan guddoo hujjeerta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:19">ee Waaqa, ka akka keetii eennu?<verse eid="PSA 71:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 71:20"/>Ati rakkoo heddu'uu fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:20">farra akka dhaggu na gootulle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:20">ati ammalle jiruu tiyya adde'etti deebittee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:20">qilee lafa jalaa keessaa ol na hin baatta.<verse eid="PSA 71:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 71:21"/>Ati ulfinna kiyya itti edeeta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:21">ammalle deebittee na hin jajjabeessita.<verse eid="PSA 71:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 71:22"/>Ee Waaqa kiyya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:22">marroo addatamummaa teetiitiif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:22">ani kiraara guddichaan si leellisa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 71:22">Ee Woyyicha Israa'elii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:22">ani maseenqo'oon faaruu leellisaa sii faarsa.<verse eid="PSA 71:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 71:23"/>Yennaa ani faaruu leellisaa si'iif faarsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:23">afaan kiyya, lubbuun tiyya ta ati wodattelle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:23">si'iif hin ilillisan.<verse eid="PSA 71:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 71:24"/>Worri na miidhiisaaf barbaadu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:24">fokkifatee waan salphateef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:24">arrabi kiyya guyyaa guutuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:24">balchummaa teeti dubbata.<verse eid="PSA 71:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 71"/>
  <chapter number="72" style="c" sid="PSA 72"/>
  <para style="s1">Daadimata Marroo Mootichaa</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Solomoonii.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 72:1"/>Ee Waaqa, haqa muriisa keeti mootichaaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:1">balchummaa teetille isaaf kenni.<verse eid="PSA 72:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 72:2"/>Innille kolbaa teeti balchumma'aan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:2">hiyyeeyyiille haqaan hin bulcha.<verse eid="PSA 72:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 72:3"/>Gaaroti nageya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:3">koobotille balchummaa hin kennan.<verse eid="PSA 72:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 72:4"/>Mootichi odduu kolba'aatitti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:4">worra cunqurfameef hin falmata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:4">inni ijoollee worra hiyyeeyyi'ii hin baasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:4">cunqursitoota hin butucha.<verse eid="PSA 72:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 72:5"/>Haga adu'uu fi ji'i le'anu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:5">mootichi dhalootaa haga dhalootaatitti bulchuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 72:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 72:6"/>Inni akka bokkeya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:6">fichaa marri irraa haamame irratti roobuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:6">akka tiifuu lafa jiittuu te'uu ti.<verse eid="PSA 72:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 72:7"/>Bara isaatitti balchaan hin daraara;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:7">haga ji'i ifa kennu mara, nageenni hin bacata.<verse eid="PSA 72:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 72:8"/>Inni abbaayaa irraa haga abbaaya'aatitti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:8">laga Efraaxiisii irraa haga qaccee lafaatitti bulchuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 72:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 72:9"/>Worri goomolee keessa le'u isa duratti sagaduu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:9">diinoti isaa biyyee arraabanuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 72:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 72:10"/>Moototi Tarshiishii, ta oddoola keessaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:10">gibira isaaf fidanuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:10">moototi Sheeba'aatii fi Saaba'aalle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:10">kennansa isaaf dhikeessanuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 72:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 72:11"/>Moototi marti isaaf sagadanuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:11">gosi biyya adda addaa marti isa tajaajilanuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 72:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 72:12"/>Inni worra hiyyeeyyii gara isaa iyyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:12">worra rakkataa nama qarqaaru hin qanne hin baasa.<verse eid="PSA 72:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 72:13"/>Inni worra dadhaba'aa fi hiyyeeyyi'iif gadhaa laafa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:13">jiruu worra rakkata'aalle hin hambura.<verse eid="PSA 72:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 72:14"/>Dhiigi isaanii isa duratti gatii-qabeessa waan te'eef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:14">inni cunqurfamiisaa fi hunnaan irratti ka'iisa irraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:14">lubbuu isaanii hin woda.<verse eid="PSA 72:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 72:15"/>Mootichi bara dheeraa le'uu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:15">worqiin biyya Sheeba'aa isaaf kennantuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:15">kolbaan yennaa mara isaaf daadimattuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:15">guyyaa guutuu isa eebbittuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 72:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 72:16"/>Lafa san keessa midhaan bacatuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:16">koobota gubba'atti latuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:16">midhaan inni buusulle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:16">akka midhaan Libaanonii misuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 72:16">Kolbaan qachaa keessaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:16">akka marra diida keessaa bacattuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 72:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 72:17"/>Maqaan isaa haga bara baraa jabaatee le'uu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:17">gurri isaa haga bara aduun jirtu mara jiraatuu ti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 72:17">Gosi biyya adda addaa marti isaan eebbifantuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:17">Isaan, «Inni eebbifama'a» jedhanee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:17">isa waamanuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 72:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 72:18"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:18">Waaqi Israa'elii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:18">ka qofuu waan maade'ee huju,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:18">leellifamuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 72:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 72:19"/>Maqaan isaa ulfaataan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:19">haga bara baraa leellifamuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:19">biyyi lafaa duudiin ulfinna isaatiin guutantuu ti.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 72:19"/>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:19">Ameen! Ameen!<verse eid="PSA 72:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 72:20"/>Daadimati Daawitii ilma Iseyii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:20">as irratti muummowe.<verse eid="PSA 72:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 72"/>
  <chapter number="73" style="c" sid="PSA 73"/>
  <para style="ms">Kitaaba Sadeesso'oo</para>
  <para style="mr">(<ref loc="PSA 73-89">Far. 73—89</ref>)</para>
  <para style="s1">Haqa Waaqaa</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Asaafii.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 73:1"/>Worra Israa'elootaa ka gadhaa qulqullu'uutiif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:1">Waaqi dhugumaan dansa'a.<verse eid="PSA 73:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 73:2"/>Ani akka kiyyatti ammoo, miilli kiyya fallaadee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:2">mucucaadhee jigiisaaf diqqoo hafe.<verse eid="PSA 73:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 73:3"/>Ani worri hamaan qananoomuun dhaggee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:3">worra ifi jaju hinaafe.<verse eid="PSA 73:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 73:4"/>Isaan dhiboo waan hin qanneef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:4">nafi isaanii fayya'a; gabbaalle'e.<verse eid="PSA 73:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 73:5"/>Isaan akka worra dhibi'ii rakkinna hin qabanu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:5">akka kolbaa dhibi'ii balaan isaan hin dhaqqabu.<verse eid="PSA 73:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 73:6"/>Tanaaf, isaan koora akka seesa mormaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:6">mormatti naqataneeran;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:6">hunnaan nama irratti ka'iisa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:6">akka woya'aa uffataneeran.<verse eid="PSA 73:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 73:7"/>Ila isaanii coomatti iitessee gad baase;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:7">gadhaa isaanii hammeennatti guutee irraa dhangala'e.<verse eid="PSA 73:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 73:8"/>Isaan namatti murgaa waan hantuu dubbatan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:8">kooraan nama cunqursan.<verse eid="PSA 73:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 73:9"/>Afaaniin Waaqa ol-gubba'aa arrassan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:9">arrabaan lafa duudii dhaqqaban.<verse eid="PSA 73:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 73:10"/>Tanaaf, kolbaan Waaqaa gara isaanii deebitee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:10">waan isaan jedhanu mara fudhatti.<verse eid="PSA 73:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 73:11"/>Isaan, «Waaqi attam beekuu dande'a?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:11">Waaqi Ol-Aanaan beekkumsa qabaa?» jedhan.<verse eid="PSA 73:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 73:12"/>Worri hamaan akkas jiran;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:12">yennaa mara qanannumma'aan le'aa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:12">durummaa ede'atan.<verse eid="PSA 73:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 73:13"/>Gadhaa kiyya qulqulleeffachuun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:13">yakkaa hujiisa irraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:13">ifi eeggachuun kiyya tolumaa ree?<verse eid="PSA 73:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 73:14"/>Guyyaa guutuu balaan na dhaqqabe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:14">ganama mara adabame.<verse eid="PSA 73:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 73:15"/>Ani adoo, «Akkuma isaanii hin dubbadha» jedhee jiraadhee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:15">kolbaa teeti dabarsee kenneeraayyu.<verse eid="PSA 73:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 73:16"/>Ani yennaa waan kana hubatiisaaf itti yaade ammoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:16">akka malee rakkisaa natti teete.<verse eid="PSA 73:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 73:17"/>Ani haga Dunkaanii Woyyittii seenee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:17">waan worri hamaan te'u hubadhutti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:17">akka malee na rakkitte.<verse eid="PSA 73:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 73:18"/>Ati dhugumaan lafa mucucaattu irra</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:18">isaan dhaabbachiitta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:18">jiganee akka badanu isaan goota.<verse eid="PSA 73:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 73:19"/>Isaan attam attam dedhuma badane!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:19">Isaan attam attam bararaqiisaan muxuqi jedhane!<verse eid="PSA 73:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 73:20"/>Akkuma wonni oojju'uun dhaggane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:20">yennaa dammaqane dhabantu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:20">Ee Gootta'a, yennaa ati kaatu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:20">isaan ila teeti duraa hin dhabaman.<verse eid="PSA 73:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 73:21"/>Yennaa lubbuun natti hadhootte,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:21">yennaa gadhaan na cite,<verse eid="PSA 73:21"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 73:22"/>ani nama gowwaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:22">woy hubatuu hin dandeenne te'ee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:22">si duratti akka hori'ii te'e.<verse eid="PSA 73:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 73:23"/>Te'uu malee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:23">ani yennaa mara si'uma woliin jira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:23">atille harka kiyya middicha na qadda.<verse eid="PSA 73:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 73:24"/>Ati gorsa keetiin na sooressita;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:24">muummee irratti gara ulfinnaa na hin fudhatta.<verse eid="PSA 73:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 73:25"/>Ol-gubba'atti si malee eennu qaba ree?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:25">Lafa irralle'etti si malee ka ani barbaadu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:25">ka dhibiin hin jiru.<verse eid="PSA 73:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 73:26"/>Foon kiyyaa fi keessi kiyya dadhabuu dande'an;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:26">Waaqi ammoo jabeenna kiyyaa fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:26">qooda kiyya ka bara baraa ti.<verse eid="PSA 73:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 73:27"/>Kunoo, worri si irraa fagaatu hin bada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:27">worra si'iif hin addatanne ati hin balleessita.<verse eid="PSA 73:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 73:28"/>Anaaf ammoo gara Waaqa dhikaatiisi dansa'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:28">hujii teeti mara odeessiisaaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:28">ani si Goottaa Mootii Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:28">addee itti baqadhu godhadheera.<verse eid="PSA 73:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 73"/>
  <chapter number="74" style="c" sid="PSA 74"/>
  <para style="s1">Kolbaan Akka Baatuuf Daadimata Dhikaate</para>
  <para style="s2">Wolaloo Asaafii.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 74:1"/>Ee Waaqa, ati maaf ijjumaa nu lakkitte?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:1">Hoolota tika keeti jala jiranu irratti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:1">aariin teeti maaf bobeette?<verse eid="PSA 74:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 74:2"/>Kolbaa teeti ta durii jalqaddee ifiif filatte,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:2">ta gosa teeti akka te'anuuf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:2">garbummaa keessaa wodatte,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:2">gaara Xiyoonii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:2">ka dhuttee irra qubatte qaabadhu.<verse eid="PSA 74:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 74:3"/>Diinoti waan mana keeti keessaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:3">mara balleessaneeran;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:3">koyiitii waan diigamee hafe kana ilaali.<verse eid="PSA 74:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 74:4"/>Diinoti keeti mana keeti keessaa bookkisane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:4">beessisa ifii ittiin beekkamanulle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:4">achi dhaabbataneeran.<verse eid="PSA 74:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 74:5"/>Isaan namoota gongomaa keessaa muka muriisaaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:5">agaraa fudhatanu fakkaatan.<verse eid="PSA 74:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 74:6"/>Seesa muka irraa qiriixamee hujame mara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:6">agara'aa fi burrisaan butuchane.<verse eid="PSA 74:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 74:7"/>Isaan mana keeti ibiddaan gubane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:7">addee maqaan keeti itti waamamu batteessane.<verse eid="PSA 74:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 74:8"/>Isaan gadhaa ifii keessatti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:8">«Ijjumaa isaan hin balleessina» jedhane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:8">isaan lafa san keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:8">addee Waaqi itti waaqonfamu mara gubane.<verse eid="PSA 74:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 74:9"/>Haganaa achi beessisi hin jiraatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:9">raagille hin jiraatu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 74:9">Kun haga yoomii akka te'u,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:9">nu keessaa nami beeku hin jiru.<verse eid="PSA 74:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 74:10"/>Ee Waaqa haga yoomii diinoti sitti murgan?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:10">Haga yoomii nyaaphoti maqaa keeti tuffatan ree?<verse eid="PSA 74:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 74:11"/>Ati maaf isaan hin adabin?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:11">Maaf isaan hin balleessin?<verse eid="PSA 74:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 74:12"/>Ee Waaqa, durii duriitii jalqaddee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:12">ati mootii kiyya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:12">ati fayyisiisa keeti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:12">lafa irratti fidde.<verse eid="PSA 74:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 74:13"/>Ati hunna teetiin abbaayaa gargar kutte;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:13">mataa bineensota jawwee fakkaatuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:13">ka abbaayaa keessaa butuchite.<verse eid="PSA 74:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 74:14"/>Ati mataa hedduu bineensa naacha fakkaatu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:14">ka abbaayaa keessaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:14">ka, «Lewaataan» jedhamu butuchite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:14">foon isaa bineensota goomole'eetiif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:14">sagalee gootee kennite.<verse eid="PSA 74:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 74:15"/>Ati maddaa fi caancoo akka maddu goote;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:15">laga yennaa mara yaa'u gossite.<verse eid="PSA 74:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 74:16"/>Guyyaan keeti; halkanille keeti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:16">adu'uu fi ji'alle addee isaaniititti sittuu keye.<verse eid="PSA 74:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 74:17"/>Ka meessaa lafaa tolche si'i;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:17">bonaa fi gannalle sittuu dade.<verse eid="PSA 74:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 74:18"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:18">diinoti keeti attam akka si irratti murgane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:18">kolbaan gowwaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:18">maqaa keeti attam akka tuffatte qaabadhu.<verse eid="PSA 74:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 74:19"/>Lubbuu kolbaa teetii worra akka saphaliisaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:19">bineensatti dabarsitee hin kennin.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:19">Jiruu kolbaa rakkattuu teetii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:19">haga bara baraa hin dedhin.<verse eid="PSA 74:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 74:20"/>Lafa addee dukkanaa keessatti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:20">hunnaan nama irratti ka'iis waan guuteeruuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:20">ati gondooroo teeti qaabadhu.<verse eid="PSA 74:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 74:21"/>Worri cunqurfame fokkifatee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:21">akka deebi'u hin godhin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:21">worri hiyyeeyyi'ii fi deegi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:21">maqaa keeti leellisanuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 74:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 74:22"/>Ee Waaqa ka'i! Waan keeti falmadhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:22">worri gowwaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:22">guyyaa guutuu akka sitti murgu qaabadhu.<verse eid="PSA 74:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 74:23"/>Hogaa nyaapha keetiitii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:23">harqiisa diina keetii hin dedhin.<verse eid="PSA 74:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 74"/>
  <chapter number="75" style="c" sid="PSA 75"/>
  <para style="s1">Waaqi Abbaa Mura'aa Ti</para>
  <para style="s2">Sooressa faarfattootaatiif, faaruu Asaafii ta akka yoyyoma faaruu, «Hin balleessin» jedhantee beekkantutti faarfatante.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 75:1"/>Ee Waaqa, nuuti si galateeffanna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:1">maqaan keeti dhikoo waan jiruuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:1">nuuti si galateeffanna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:1">kolbaan hujii teeti ta maade'ee hin odeessiti.<verse eid="PSA 75:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 75:2"/>Waaqa ati, «Ani yennaa muraa kennu murteesseera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:2">ani yennaa sanitti muraa sirri'ii hin kenna.<verse eid="PSA 75:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 75:3"/>Yennaa lafaa fi wonni isii irraa marti tachootu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:3">utubaa isi'ii ka jabeessu ana.<verse eid="PSA 75:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 75:4"/>Ani worra kooruun, ‹Haganaa achi hin koorina'a!›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:4">Worra hamoole'een, ‹Gaafa hin baasina'a!<verse eid="PSA 75:4"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 75:5"/>Gaafa keessan gara ol-gubba'aa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:5">ol hin togina'a!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:5">Morma yaafattanee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:5">hin dubbatina'a!› jedhaan» jetta.<verse eid="PSA 75:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 75:6"/>Ulfinni baya adu'uu irraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:6">yookiin seensa adu'uu irraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:6">yookiin goomolee keessaa hin dhufu.<verse eid="PSA 75:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 75:7"/>Muraa ka kennu ammoo Waaqa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:7">inni tokko gadi qabee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:7">kaan ol hin qaba.<verse eid="PSA 75:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 75:8"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:8">muduunuu daadhii woyni'ii ta mufi'ii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:8">hoomachoottuu harkaa qaba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:8">inni gad isii cossa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:8">worri hamaaleyyiin lafaa marti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:8">cingifatanee unan.<verse eid="PSA 75:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 75:9"/>Ani ammoo haga bara baraa tana hin lallaba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:9">Waaqa Yaaqoobii faaru'uun hin leellisa.<verse eid="PSA 75:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 75:10"/>Inni hunna worra hamoole'ee hin cassa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:10">hunni worra balchoole'ee ammoo hin ede'anti.<verse eid="PSA 75:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 75"/>
  <chapter number="76" style="c" sid="PSA 76"/>
  <para style="s1">Injifatiisa Waaqaa</para>
  <para style="s2">Sooressa faarfattootaatiif, faaruu Asaafii ta meya ribu'uutiin faarfatante.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 76:1"/>Waaqi biyya Yihuda'aatitti beekkama'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:1">Israa'el keessatti maqaan isaa gudda'a.<verse eid="PSA 76:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 76:2"/>Dunkaaniin isaa Yerusaalem keessa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:2">addeen woyyittiin isaa gaara Xiyoonii irra.<verse eid="PSA 76:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 76:3"/>Inni achitti daaya balaqqisaa deentu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:3">wontee, shallaaga'aa fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:3">meya woraanaa mara caccasse.<verse eid="PSA 76:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 76:4"/>Ee Waaqa ati attam attam ulfaata'a!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:4">Arnyi keeti gaarota gugurdaa caala.<verse eid="PSA 76:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 76:5"/>Worri jannooti saamamanee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:5">akka malee rafaneeran;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:5">isaan keessaa tokkolle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:5">harka ifiitiin womaa hujuu hin dandeenne.<verse eid="PSA 76:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 76:6"/>Ee Waaqa Yaaqoobii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:6">xixicha keetiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:6">abbaan fardaatii fi fardi isaalle jigane.<verse eid="PSA 76:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 76:7"/>Ati ammoo sodaatama'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:7">yennaa aariin teeti kaate,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:7">eentu si dura dhaabbatuu dande'a?<verse eid="PSA 76:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 76:8"/>Ati ol-gubbaa irraa muraa teeti lassite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:8">biyyi lafaalle sodaattee cadhitte.<verse eid="PSA 76:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 76:9"/>Ee Waaqa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:9">worra biyya lafaa irratti cunqurfame wodiisaaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:9">yennaa ati muraa kenniisaaf kaate,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:9">biyyi lafaa cadhitte.<verse eid="PSA 76:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 76:10"/>Mufiin teeti waan hantuu waan mormituuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:10">kolbaan si leellifatti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:10">worri mufii teeti irraa hafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:10">waan hantuu hujiisa hin lakkisa.<verse eid="PSA 76:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 76:11"/>Waaqa Mootii Waan Maraa keessaniif</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:11">waadaa gala'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:11">waan waadaa galtane san muummessa'a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 76:11">Worri lafa adaala isaa jiru marti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:11">ka sodaatamu'uu maleef kennansa fidanuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 76:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 76:12"/>Inni qondaaltota kooranu gad qaba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:12">mootota lafa irraalle akka malee sodaachisa.<verse eid="PSA 76:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 76"/>
  <chapter number="77" style="c" sid="PSA 77"/>
  <para style="s1">Daadimata Jajjabeessiisaa</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Asaafii sooressa faarfattootaa Yedutu'uuf.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 77:1"/>Ani qoonqoo ol qabadhee gara Waaqaa iyya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:1">akka inni naaf dhage'u,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:1">qoonqoo ol qabadhee gara Waaqaa iyya.<verse eid="PSA 77:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 77:2"/>Yennaa rakkinnaa keessa Goottaa barbaadadhe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:2">halkan guutuu harka kiyya diriirse;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:2">te'uu malee ani hin jajjabaanne.<verse eid="PSA 77:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 77:3"/>Ee Waaqa, ani yennaa si qaabadhu hin aada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:3">yennaa guddisee itti yaadu hin gaggaba.<verse eid="PSA 77:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 77:4"/>Ati ila wolitti qabatiisa na dhooggite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:4">haga dubbatiisa dadhabutti rakkadhe.<verse eid="PSA 77:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 77:5"/>Ani marroo bara durii yaade;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:5">woggoota durii durii qaabadhe.<verse eid="PSA 77:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 77:6"/>Halkan keessa faaruu tiyya ta durii qaabadhe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:6">ani guddisee itti yaadee, yaada kiyya qorqoree,<verse eid="PSA 77:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 77:7"/>«Goottaan haga bara baraa nu hin gataa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:7">Inni ijjumaa deebi'ee nu'uuf hin nayuu?<verse eid="PSA 77:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 77:8"/>Jaalalli isaa ka bara baraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:8">haga bara baraa dhumatee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:8">Waadaan inni gale yoona hin muummowuu ree?<verse eid="PSA 77:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 77:9"/>Waaqi marartii dedhee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:9">Aariin gadhi-laafummaa isaa dhooggitee ree?» jedhe.<verse eid="PSA 77:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 77:10"/>Achiin duuba ani, «Hunni Waaqa Ol Aana'aa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:10">waan jijjiiranteef, gaddee laaleffadhe» jedhe.<verse eid="PSA 77:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 77:11"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:11">ani hujii teeti gugurdoo hin yaadadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:11">bilbaasota ati dur goote hin qaabadha.<verse eid="PSA 77:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 77:12"/>Ani marroo hujii teetii mara hin heda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:12">hujii teeti gugurdoo mara itti hin yaadadha.<verse eid="PSA 77:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 77:13"/>Ee Waaqa, karaan keeti woyyicha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:13">waaqota keessaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:13">guddaan akka Waaqa keennaa eennu?<verse eid="PSA 77:13"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 77:14"/>Ati Waaqa bilbaasa huju;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:14">ati gosa biyya adda addaa oddu'utti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:14">hunna teeti mudhitteerta.<verse eid="PSA 77:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 77:15"/>Ati kolbaa teeti sanyii Yaaqoobiitii fi Yoseefii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:15">hunna teeti jaddu'uun wodatteerta.<verse eid="PSA 77:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 77:16"/>Ee Waaqa bisaan hedduun</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:16">si dhagganee sodaatane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:16">qileen abbaaya'aalle raafante.<verse eid="PSA 77:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 77:17"/>Duumensi bisaan gad coccosse;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:17">gubbaa irraa mandiisuun mandiite.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:17">Balaqqeettiin akka daayaa gara mara balaqqitte.<verse eid="PSA 77:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 77:18"/>Hobonbolattii keessa mandiisuun dhage'ante;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:18">balaqqeettiin biyya lafaa issite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:18">latti rommitee tachoote.<verse eid="PSA 77:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 77:19"/>Abbaayaa keessa karaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:19">bisaan gugurdaa keessa daandii godhatte;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:19">faanti miila keetii ammoo hin mudhanne.<verse eid="PSA 77:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 77:20"/>Harka Muuse'eetii fi Aaroniitiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:20">akka nama hoolee tissuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:20">ati kolbaa teeti sooressite.<verse eid="PSA 77:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 77"/>
  <chapter number="78" style="c" sid="PSA 78"/>
  <para style="s1">Waaqaa Fi Kolbaa Waaqaa</para>
  <para style="s2">Wolaloo Asaafii.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 78:1"/>Ee kolbaa tiyya, barsiisa kiyya caqasa'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:1">gurra keessan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:1">gara dubbii afaan kiyyaa deebifadha'a.<verse eid="PSA 78:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 78:2"/>Ani fakkeennaan afaan kiyya hin saaqadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:2">dubbii dhossa'aa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:2">ta durii jalqaddee dhoffante hin mudhisa.<verse eid="PSA 78:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 78:3"/>Dubbiin tun ta dhageennee hin beenne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:3">ta abbootiin teenna ta durii nutti hinte,<verse eid="PSA 78:3"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 78:4"/>nuuti ijoollee isaanii hin dhossinu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:4">marroo leellisa Mootii Waan Maraatii fi hunna isaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:4">marroo bilbaasa inni hujee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:4">dhaloota dhufutti hin hinna.<verse eid="PSA 78:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 78:5"/>Inni ajaja sanyii Yaaqoobiitiif kennee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:5">seera Israa'el keessatti baasee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:5">ijoollee ifiille akka barsiisanu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:5">abbootii teenna ta durii ajaje.<verse eid="PSA 78:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 78:6"/>Wonni inni tana godheef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:6">dhalooti itti aanu tana akka beeku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:6">worri amma hin dhalatinille</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:6">ijoollee ifii akka barsiisu.<verse eid="PSA 78:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 78:7"/>Achiin duuba ijoolleen sun Waaqatti addatti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:7">hujii Waaqaalle hin deetu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:7">ajaja isaalle yennaa mara eeggatti.<verse eid="PSA 78:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 78:8"/>Isaan akka abbootii ifii ta durii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:8">mati-jabeeyyi'ii fi worra Waaqa irratti ka'u,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:8">worra gadhaan isaanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:8">Waaqaaf addatamumma'aan hin jabaanne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:8">worra qalbiin isaanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:8">Waaqaaf hin addatanne hin te'anu.<verse eid="PSA 78:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 78:9"/>Loltooti worri Efreemii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:9">worri guube'ee fi daaya qabataneeranu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:9">guyyaa lolaa baqatane.<verse eid="PSA 78:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 78:10"/>Isaan gondooroo Waaqaa hin eeganne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:10">akka seera isaatitti deemuu didane.<verse eid="PSA 78:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 78:11"/>Isaan waan inni hujee fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:11">bilbaasota inni itti mudhise dedhane.<verse eid="PSA 78:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 78:12"/>Biyya Gibxi'iititti, diida Zo'aaniititti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:12">fuula abbootii isaanii duratti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:12">Waaqi bilbaasota huje.<verse eid="PSA 78:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 78:13"/>Inni abbaayaa gargar kutee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:13">keessa isaan dabarse;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:13">bisaanille akka tuula'aa dhaabbachiise.<verse eid="PSA 78:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 78:14"/>Guyyaa duumensaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:14">halkan guutuu ifa ibiddaatiin isaan sooresse.<verse eid="PSA 78:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 78:15"/>Inni lafa goomole'ee keessatti rassaa dhoosee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:15">bisaan akka bisaan abbaaya'aa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:15">kenneefii isaan obaase.<verse eid="PSA 78:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 78:16"/>Inni rassaa keessaa bisaan baasee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:16">akka lagaa lolaase.<verse eid="PSA 78:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 78:17"/>Isaan ammoo ittuma ede'anee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:17">isa irratti cubbuu hujanee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:17">goomolee keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:17">Waaqa Ol Aanaa irratti ka'ane.<verse eid="PSA 78:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 78:18"/>Isaan sagalee halchane gaafatiisaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:18">Waaqa haga ilaalane.<verse eid="PSA 78:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 78:19"/>Isaan Waaqa irratti ka'anee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:19">«Waaqi goomolee keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:19">sagalee qopheessee hin dande'aa?<verse eid="PSA 78:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 78:20"/>Yennaa inni rassaa dhowe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:20">bisaan akka lagaa keessaa lola'e.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 78:20">Inni ammoo sagaleelle nuu kennuu hin dande'aa ree?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:20">Yookiin kolbaa ifiitiif</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:20">foon kennuu hin dande'aa ree?» jedhane.<verse eid="PSA 78:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 78:21"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa yennaa tana dhage'e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:21">aaree bobe'e;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:21">sanyii Yaaqoobii irratti ibiddi gabbate;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:21">aariin isaa Israa'el irratti bobeette.<verse eid="PSA 78:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 78:22"/>Wonni tun teeteef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:22">isaan Waaqatti hin dhugeeffanne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:22">akka inni isaan fayyisulle isatti hin addanne.<verse eid="PSA 78:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 78:23"/>Te'uu malee, inni duumensa gubba'aa ajajee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:23">balbala ol-gubba'aa bane;<verse eid="PSA 78:23"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 78:24"/>akka isaan nyaatanuuf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:24">mannaa gad isaaniif roobisiisee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:24">midhaan ol-gubba'aa isaaniif kenne.<verse eid="PSA 78:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 78:25"/>Maarre isaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:25">sagalee ergantoota Waaqaa nyaatane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:25">Waaqi sagalee isaan quussitu isaaniif erge.<verse eid="PSA 78:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 78:26"/>Inni qilleensi baya adu'uu akka ka'u godhe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:26">hunna ifiitiin qilleensa kibbaalle kaase.<verse eid="PSA 78:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 78:27"/>Inni foon akka biyye'ee bacatu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:27">barbadi-kille akka maansa abbaaya'aa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:27">isaaniif roobisiise.<verse eid="PSA 78:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 78:28"/>Gororrii san quttuma isaanii keessa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:28">adaala dunkaanii isaanii maratti gad harcaase.<verse eid="PSA 78:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 78:29"/>Inni waan isaan dharra'ane waan isaanii kenneef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:29">isaan nyaatanee akka malee quufane.<verse eid="PSA 78:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 78:30"/>Ammoo adoo isaan dharraa hin bayinuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:30">adoo nyaatiisatti jiranuu,<verse eid="PSA 78:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 78:31"/>Waaqi isaanitti aaree,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:31">isaan keessaa worra jajjabaa ijjeese;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:31">dargaggeeyyii Israa'eliille qoome.<verse eid="PSA 78:31"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 78:32"/>Tana mara keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:32">isaan cubbuu hujiisa hin lakkinne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:32">bilbaasa inni godhelle hin dhugeeffanne.<verse eid="PSA 78:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 78:33"/>Tanaaf, inni ganna isaanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:33">akka hafuura baafata tokkochaa godhee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:33">jiruu isaanii bararaqaan fixachiise.<verse eid="PSA 78:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 78:34"/>Yennaa inni isaan keessaa ijjeese,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:34">isaan isa barbaadane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:34">cubbuu irraa deebi'anee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:34">gadhaa tokkochaan gara isaa deebi'ane.<verse eid="PSA 78:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 78:35"/>Isaan Waaqi rassaa isaanii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:35">Waaqi Ol Aanaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:35">wodoo isaanii akka te'e qaabatane.<verse eid="PSA 78:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 78:36"/>Isaan ammoo afaaniin isa kookkisane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:36">arraba ifiitiin soba isatti dubbatane.<verse eid="PSA 78:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 78:37"/>Gadhaan isaanii isaaf hin addatanne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:37">gondooroo isaalle hin eeganne.<verse eid="PSA 78:37"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 78:38"/>Waaqi ammoo kolbaa ifiitiif mararee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:38">yakkaa isaaniif araarame malee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:38">isaan hin balleessine;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:38">inni yennaa hedduu aarii ifii caffate;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:38">mufii ifii mara ol hin kaanne.<verse eid="PSA 78:38"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 78:39"/>Inni nama foonii qofa te'iisa isaanii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:39">qilleensa dabaru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:39">ka deebi'ee hin dhunne akka te'ane qaabate.<verse eid="PSA 78:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 78:40"/>Isaan goomolee keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:40">yennaa hedduu isa irratti ka'anee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:40">gammoojjii keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:40">yennaa hedduu isa gaddisiisane.<verse eid="PSA 78:40"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 78:41"/>Isaan itti deddeebi'anee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:41">Waaqa haga ilaalane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:41">Woyyicha Israa'elii gaddisiisane.<verse eid="PSA 78:41"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 78:42"/>Isaan hunna isaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:42">ta guyyaa inni diinota jalaa isaan wodee,<verse eid="PSA 78:42"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 78:43"/>biyya Gibxi'ii keessatti hujii baasaatii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:43">bilbaasota inni diida Zo'aaniititti huje hin qaabanne.<verse eid="PSA 78:43"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 78:44"/>Inni bisaan laga isaanii mara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:44">gara dhiigaa jijjiire;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:44">tanaaf worri Gibxi'ii bisaan yaa'u keessaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:44">unuu hin dandeenne.<verse eid="PSA 78:44"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 78:45"/>Inni tiiticha isaan iddu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:45">raacha isaan balleessu itti erge.<verse eid="PSA 78:45"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 78:46"/>Midhaan isaanii korophiisaaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:46">eloo isaanii awwaannisaaf kenne.<verse eid="PSA 78:46"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 78:47"/>Muka woynii isaanii dhakaa roobaatiin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:47">muka harru'uu ka isaanii qorraan balleesse.<verse eid="PSA 78:47"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 78:48"/>Loon isaanii dhakaa roobaatiin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:48">karra horii isaanii banqo'oon fixe.<verse eid="PSA 78:48"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 78:49"/>Inni aarii ifii ta bobeettu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:49">mufii ifii, aarii jaddu'uu fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:49">golii ergantoota Waaqaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:49">ta balaa badi'ii hiikee isaanitti gad lakkise.<verse eid="PSA 78:49"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 78:50"/>Inni aarii ifiitiif daandii qopheesse;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:50">lubbuu isaanii bala'aaf dabarsee kenne malee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:50">du'a irraa isaan hin hamburre.<verse eid="PSA 78:50"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 78:51"/>Inni biyya Gibxi'ii keessatti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:51">angafa te'ee ka dhalate,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:51">ilma angaficha mara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:51">dunkaanii sanyii Kaamii keessatti ijjeese.<verse eid="PSA 78:51"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 78:52"/>Achiin duuba inni kolbaa ifii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:52">akka hoole'ee achii baasee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:52">akka tika hoole'eelle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:52">goomolee keessa isaan sooresse.<verse eid="PSA 78:52"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="PSA 78:53"/>Inni nageyaan waan isaan sooresseef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:53">isaan hin sodaanne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:53">diinota isaanii ammoo abbaayaan liqinsite.<verse eid="PSA 78:53"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="PSA 78:54"/>Inni gara lafa woyyittii ifii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:54">gara gaara harka ifii middichaan injifatee qabateeruu isaan fide.<verse eid="PSA 78:54"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="PSA 78:55"/>Inni gosa biyya adda addaa isaan duraa ari'ee baase;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:55">lafa isaanii isaan dhaalchisee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:55">mana isaaniille gosa Israa'eliitiif qoode.<verse eid="PSA 78:55"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="PSA 78:56"/>Isaan ammoo Waaqa Ol Aanaa haga ilaalanee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:56">isa irratti ka'ane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:56">seerata isaalle hin eeganne.<verse eid="PSA 78:56"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="PSA 78:57"/>Isaan akkuma abbootii ifii ta durii irraa garagalanee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:57">addatamuu dhabanee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:57">akka guubee qajeelatti daaya hin darbannee micciiramane.<verse eid="PSA 78:57"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="PSA 78:58"/>Addee waaqonfannaa ifiitiin isa aarsane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:58">waaqota dharaa ifiitiin hinaaffa'atti isa kaasane.<verse eid="PSA 78:58"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="PSA 78:59"/>Waaqi tana yennaa dhage'e, aaree bobe'e;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:59">inni ijjumaa Israa'el gate.<verse eid="PSA 78:59"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="PSA 78:60"/>Inni addee bultoo ifii, ka Shiilo'oo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:60">dunkaanii odduu namaatitti keessa bulu lakkise.<verse eid="PSA 78:60"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="PSA 78:61"/>Inni Saanduqa Gondooro'oo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:61">ka beessisa hunnaa isaatii fi ulfinna isaa te'e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:61">harka diinaatitti booju'uuf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:61">dabarsee kenne.<verse eid="PSA 78:61"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="PSA 78:62"/>Inni kolbaa ifiititti guddoo aaree,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:62">shallaaga'aaf dabarsee kenne.<verse eid="PSA 78:62"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="PSA 78:63"/>Dargaggeeyyii isaanii ibiddi fixe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:63">durri isaanii nama heerumtu dhadde.<verse eid="PSA 78:63"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="PSA 78:64"/>Hayyooti isaanii shallaaga'aan dhumatane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:64">niitoti isaanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:64">isaaniif bowiisa hin dandeenne.<verse eid="PSA 78:64"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="PSA 78:65"/>Achiin duuba Goottaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:65">akka waan hirriibaa dammaqee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:65">akka nama janna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:65">daadhii woyni'ii quufee dhaadatuu ka'e.<verse eid="PSA 78:65"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="PSA 78:66"/>Inni diinota ifii dhowee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:66">gara duubaa deebisee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:66">haga bara baraa isaan fokkisiise.<verse eid="PSA 78:66"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="PSA 78:67"/>Inni dunkaanii Yoseefii tuffatte;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:67">sanyii Efreemiille hin filanne;<verse eid="PSA 78:67"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="PSA 78:68"/>ammoo gosa Yihuda'aatii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:68">gaara Xiyoonii ka jaalatu filate.<verse eid="PSA 78:68"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="PSA 78:69"/>Inni mana Woyyicha ifii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:69">akka kooba dheera'aa ijaaree,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:69">akka lafaa haga bara baraa jabeessee dhaabe.<verse eid="PSA 78:69"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="PSA 78:70"/>Inni tajaajilaa ifii Daawiti filate;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:70">tika hoole'ee keessaa isa fudhate.<verse eid="PSA 78:70"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="PSA 78:71"/>Hoolee haadhotii ilmoole'ee tissiisa lakkisee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:71">kolbaa ifii Yaaqoob,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:71">Israa'elii ifiitiif tissee akka te'u isa fide.<verse eid="PSA 78:71"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="PSA 78:72"/>Inni gadhaa qajeela'aan isaan tisse;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:72">qarumma'aan guutamee isaan sooresse.<verse eid="PSA 78:72"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 78"/>
  <chapter number="79" style="c" sid="PSA 79"/>
  <para style="s1">Daadimata Nageya Biyyaatiif Dhikaate</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Asaafii.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 79:1"/>Ee Waaqa, gosi biyya adda addaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:1">lafa teeti fudhatiisaaf nu lolaneeran;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:1">Galma Woyyicha keeti batteessaneeran;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:1">Yerusaalemille diiganeeran.<verse eid="PSA 79:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 79:2"/>Reeffa tajaajiltoota teetii allaatti'iif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:2">foon addatantoota teetii bineensaaf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:2">sagalee godhaneeran.<verse eid="PSA 79:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 79:3"/>Isaan adaala Yerusaalemiititti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:3">dhiiga isaanii akka bisaanii dhangalaasaneeran;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:3">nami isaan awwaalulle hin jiru.<verse eid="PSA 79:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 79:4"/>Nuuti gosa biyya addaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:4">ta ollaa keennaatiif shasha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:4">gosa biyya adda addaa ta adaala keennaatiif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:4">waan murgo'ootii fi waan coora'aa teeneerra.<verse eid="PSA 79:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 79:5"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:5">kun haga yoomii akkas te'a?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:5">Ati haga bara baraa aartaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:5">Hinaaffaan teeti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:5">haga yoomii akka ibiddaa bobeetti ree?<verse eid="PSA 79:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 79:6"/>Mufii teeti gosa biyya adda addaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:6">ta si hin beenne irratti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:6">mootummoota maqaa keeti hin waammanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:6">irralle'etti dhangalaasi.<verse eid="PSA 79:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 79:7"/>Wonni tana gootuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:7">isaan kolbaa Yaaqoobii fixaneeran;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:7">qe'ee isaanii onsaneeran.<verse eid="PSA 79:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 79:8"/>Yakkaa abbootii teenna ta durii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:8">nutti hin laakkowin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:8">mataa keenna guddoo waan gad qabanneef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:8">marartiin teeti ariiti'iin gara keenna dhuttuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 79:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 79:9"/>Ee Waaqa fayyisaa keenna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:9">ulfinna maqaa keetiitiif jedhii nu qarqaar;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:9">maqaa keetiif jedhii nu baasi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:9">cubbuu teennalle nuu araarami.<verse eid="PSA 79:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 79:10"/>Gosi biyya adda addaa maaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:10">«Waaqi isaanii meet?» jedhanee gaafatan ree?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 79:10">Dhiiga tajaajiltoota teetii ka dhangalaafameef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:10">ila teenna duratti haluu bayiisi keeti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:10">gosa biyya adda addaa oddu'utti beekkamuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 79:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 79:11"/>Aadiis worra hidhamee si bira gewuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:11">hunna teeti guddo'oon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:11">worra duuti itti murante hamburi.<verse eid="PSA 79:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 79:12"/>Ee Gootta'a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:12">arraba worri ollaa keennaa si arrassane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:12">dachaa torba godhiitii itti deebisi.<verse eid="PSA 79:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 79:13"/>Achii duuba nuuti kolbaan teeti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:13">worri tika keeti jala jirru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:13">haga bara baraa si galateeffanna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:13">dhalootaa haga dhalootaatitti si leellifanna.<verse eid="PSA 79:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 79"/>
  <chapter number="80" style="c" sid="PSA 80"/>
  <para style="s1">Adde'etti Deebi'iisa Israa'eliitiif Daadimata Dhikaate</para>
  <para style="s2">Sooressa faarfattootaatiif, faaruu Asaafii ta akka yoyyoma faaruu, «Daraaraa» jedhantee beekkantutti faarfatante, ta dhugaa bayiisaa.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 80:1"/>Ee tissee Israa'elii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:1">ka sanyii Yoseefii akka hoole'ee sooressitu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:1">ka barcumaa mootumma'aa keeti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:1">ka wodhakkaa dada ol-gubba'aa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:1">ta koola qadduu irra teetteertu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:1">nuu dhage'i;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:1">ifa keeti issiitii,<verse eid="PSA 80:1"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 80:2"/>sanyii Efreemii, sanyii Beniyaaminiitii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:2">sanyii Minaasee duratti mudhisi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 80:2">Hunna teetiin ka'iitii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:2">koyii nu baasi.<verse eid="PSA 80:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 80:3"/>Ee Waaqa adde'etti nu deebisi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:3">nuu marariitii nu baasi.<verse eid="PSA 80:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 80:4"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:4">Waaqa waan mara dande'u,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:4">haga yoomii daadimata kolbaa teetiititti aarta?<verse eid="PSA 80:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 80:5"/>Ati imimmaan akka sagale'ee isaan areerte;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:5">akka bisaanii imimmaan isaan obaatte<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">80:5 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Obaatte: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yookiin obaache</char></note>.<verse eid="PSA 80:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 80:6"/>Gosi biyya adda addaa ta ollaa keennaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:6">lafa teenna fudhatiisaaf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:6">akka wol lolanu goote;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:6">diinoti keennalle nutti murgane.<verse eid="PSA 80:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 80:7"/>Ee Waaqa waan mara dande'u,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:7">adde'etti nu deebisi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:7">nuu marariitii nu baasi.<verse eid="PSA 80:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 80:8"/>Ati muka woyni'ii<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">80:8 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Muka woyni'ii: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muki woyni'ii kun Israa'eloota ilaala.</char></note> biyya Gibxi'iitii fiddee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:8">gosa biyya adda addaa ariitee baattee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:8">lafa san keessatti dhaadde.<verse eid="PSA 80:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 80:9"/>Ati lafa san cirteefii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:9">muki woyni'ii sunille hidda gad fageeffatee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:9">lafa san guute.<verse eid="PSA 80:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 80:10"/>Gaaroti gaaddisa isaatiin gollamane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:10">dameeleen isaalle hindheensa gugurdaa gollite.<verse eid="PSA 80:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 80:11"/>Dameelee ifii haga abbaayaa Mediteraaniya'aa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:11">kichuu ifiille haga laga Efraaxiisii diriirfate.<verse eid="PSA 80:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 80:12"/>Ati maaf dalleya isatti marfameeru irraa diiddee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:12">nami karaa san dabaru marti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:12">midhaan isaa irraa guurata ree?<verse eid="PSA 80:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 80:13"/>Gurreen gongoma'aa irra sirban;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:13">bineensi marti irraa nyaatan.<verse eid="PSA 80:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 80:14"/>Ee Waaqa waan mara dande'u,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:14">gara keenna deebi'i;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:14">ol-gubbaa irraa gad nu ilaalii, nuu dhaggi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:14">muka woyni'ii kana kunuunsi.<verse eid="PSA 80:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 80:15"/>Muka harki keeti middichi dhaabe kana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:15">biqiltuu ifiif guddifate tana eegi.<verse eid="PSA 80:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 80:16"/>Diinoti muranee, ibiddaan gubaneeran;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:16">xixxaa teetiin isaan ilaalii, isaan balleessi.<verse eid="PSA 80:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 80:17"/>Nama harka keeti middicha keessa jiru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:17">ka ifiif jabeeffatte,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:17">harki keeti isa irra jiraatuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 80:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 80:18"/>Achiin duuba nuuti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:18">ijjumaa si irraa duubatti hin deebinu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:18">jiruu nuu kenni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:18">nuutille maqaa keeti waammanna.<verse eid="PSA 80:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 80:19"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:19">Waaqa waan mara dande'u,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:19">adde'etti nu deebisi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:19">nuu marariitii nu baasi.<verse eid="PSA 80:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 80"/>
  <chapter number="81" style="c" sid="PSA 81"/>
  <para style="s1">Faaruu Guyyaa Jilaa</para>
  <para style="s2">Sooressa faarfattootaatiif, faaruu Asaafii ta suusulle'een faarfatante</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 81:1"/>Waaqa jabeenna keenna te'eef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:1">qoonqoo guddo'oon faarsa'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:1">Waaqa Yaaqoobiitiif ilillisa'a.<verse eid="PSA 81:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 81:2"/>Faaruu jalqaba'a; dibbeelle dhowa'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:2">maseenqoo namatti toltuu fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:2">kiraara guddicha dhowa'a.<verse eid="PSA 81:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 81:3"/>Baatii ji'aatitti, goobana ji'aatitti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:3">guyyaa jila teennaatitti tultullaa afuufa'a.<verse eid="PSA 81:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 81:4"/>Kun Israa'eliif seerata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:4">ajaja Waaqa Yaaqoobii ti.<verse eid="PSA 81:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 81:5"/>Inni yennaa biyya Gibxi'ii dhowiisaaf baye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:5">ajaja kana ijoollee Yoseefiitiif kenne.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 81:5">Qoonqoon ani dur hin beenne takka,<verse eid="PSA 81:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 81:6"/>«Ani gurmuu teessan irraa ba'aa buuse;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:6">harka keessan kollonjoo qabatiisa irraa bilisa baase.<verse eid="PSA 81:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 81:7"/>Isin rakkinna keessa na waammattane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:7">anille isin baase;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:7">addee gollaa jirtu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:7">duumensa mandi'u keessaa deebii isinii kenne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:7">ani bisaan Mariiba'aa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">81:7 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Mariibaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yaadannoo Bay. 17:7 irratti kenname ilaali.</char></note> biratti haga isin ilaale.<verse eid="PSA 81:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 81:8"/>Ee kolbaa tiyya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:8">yennaa ani ifi isin eeggachiisu dhage'a'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:8">ee Israa'el, adoo naaf dhageettanee jiraattanee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:8">attam attam dansa'a!<verse eid="PSA 81:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 81:9"/>Waaqoti alagaan odduu teessan hin jiraatin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:9">waaqota ormaaf hin sagadina'a.<verse eid="PSA 81:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 81:10"/>Ani Mootii Waan Maraa Waaqa keessan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:10">ka lafa Gibxi'ii keessaa isin baase;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:10">afaan keessan badhisa'aatii banadha'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:10">anille hin guuta.<verse eid="PSA 81:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 81:11"/>«Kolbaan tiyya ammoo na hin dhageenne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:11">Israa'el naaf hin ajajanne.<verse eid="PSA 81:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 81:12"/>Maarre ani mataa jabeeyyii akka te'anuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:12">yaada ifiille akka hordofanuuf isaan lakkise.<verse eid="PSA 81:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 81:13"/>Kolbaan tiyya adoo naaf dhageettee jiraattee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:13">Israa'el adoo karaa kiyya ideentee jiraattee,<verse eid="PSA 81:13"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 81:14"/>ani silaa ariiti'iin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:14">diinota isaanii hin jilbiissisaayyu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:14">harka kiyyalle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:14">gara nyaapha isaanii hin deebifadhaayyu.<verse eid="PSA 81:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 81:15"/>Worri ana Mootii Waan Maraa jibbu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:15">na duratti hin jiganiiyyu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:15">adabbiin isaaniille</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:15">haga bara baraa hin teetiiyyu.<verse eid="PSA 81:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 81:16"/>Ani ammoo silaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:16">qamadii dansaa isin Israa'el areeraayyu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:16">damma hollaalle isin quussaayyu» jette.<verse eid="PSA 81:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 81"/>
  <chapter number="82" style="c" sid="PSA 82"/>
  <para style="s1">Waaqi Bulchaa Ol Aana'a</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Asaafii.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 82:1"/>Waaqi yaa'ii ol-gubba'aa keessa dhaabbata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:1">waaqota oddu'utti muraa kenna.<verse eid="PSA 82:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 82:2"/>Inni, «Isin haga yoomii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:2">muraa sirrii hin te'in murtan?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:2">Haga yoomii worra hamaaleyyi'iif golii teetan?<verse eid="PSA 82:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 82:3"/>Worra dadhaba'aa fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:3">ijoollee abba'aa fi haadha hin qanneef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:3">dhugaa mura'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:3">worra hiyyeeyyi'ii fi worra cunqurfamaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:3">haqa isaanii eega'a.<verse eid="PSA 82:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 82:4"/>Worra dadhaba'aa fi hiyyeeyyii hambura'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:4">harka worra hamaaleyyi'ii keessaa isaan baasa'a.<verse eid="PSA 82:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 82:5"/>«Worri hamaaleyyiin hin beekanu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:5">yookiin womaa hin hubatanu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:5">dukkana keessa deddeebi'an;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:5">hundeen lafaa duudiin raafante.<verse eid="PSA 82:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 82:6"/>Anille, ‹Isin waaqota;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:6">marti keessanuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:6">ilmaan Waaqa Ol Aana'aa ti› jedhe.<verse eid="PSA 82:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 82:7"/>Te'uu malee, isin akkuma namaa hin duutan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:7">akkuma bulchaa tokkoo hin jiddan» jedhe.<verse eid="PSA 82:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 82:8"/>Gosi biyya adda addaa teeti waan teeteef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:8">ee Waaqa ka'ii, biyya lafaa irratti muraa kenni.<verse eid="PSA 82:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 82"/>
  <chapter number="83" style="c" sid="PSA 83"/>
  <para style="s1">Diinoti Israa'elii Akka Injifatamanuuf Daadimata Dhikaate</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Asaafii.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 83:1"/>Ee Waaqa, hin cadhisin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:1">hin sarmin yookiin cadhittee hin ilaalin.<verse eid="PSA 83:1"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 83:2"/>Amumaayyuu diinoti keeti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:2">finqila kaasaneeran;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:2">worri si jibbu mataa ifii togeera.<verse eid="PSA 83:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 83:3"/>Isaan kolbaa teeti irratti mala dhowani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:3">worra ati jaalattu irratti mari'atan.<verse eid="PSA 83:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 83:4"/>Isaan, «Maqaan gosa biyya Israa'elii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:4">deebi'ee akka hin qaabatanne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:4">akka isaan kolbaa hin teene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:4">kowaa, isaan balleessinaa» jedhan.<verse eid="PSA 83:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 83:5"/>Yaada tokkoon wolii galanee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:5">si irratti mala dhowane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:5">si irratti ka'iisaaf wol gondooratane;<verse eid="PSA 83:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 83:6"/>Isaan kun kolbaa Edoomii, kolbaa Ishimaa'elii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:6">kolbaa Mo'aabiitii fi Aggaarii,<verse eid="PSA 83:6"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 83:7"/>kolbaa Gebaaliitii fi Amoonii, Amaaleqoota,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:7">worra Filisxeemotaatii fi Xiiroosii ti.<verse eid="PSA 83:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 83:8"/>Worri Asooriille isaanitti ede'amanee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:8">sanyii Looxii gargaarane.<verse eid="PSA 83:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 83:9"/>Worra Miidiyaanii akkuma goote,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:9">laga Qiisoniititti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:9">Siisaara'aa fi Yaabiin akkuma goote,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:9">isaan kanalle akkasuma godhi.<verse eid="PSA 83:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 83:10"/>Worri sun Endooritti ijjeefamanee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:10">shamanee lafaaf kosii te'ane.<verse eid="PSA 83:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 83:11"/>Qondaaltota isaanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:11">akkuma Oreebiitii fi Ze'eebii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:11">sooressitoota isaaniille</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:11">akkuma Zeeba'aa fi Xaalmuna'aa godhi.<verse eid="PSA 83:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 83:12"/>Isaan, «Lafa kaloo kolbaa Waaqaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:12">fudhannee teenna godhanna» worra jedhe.<verse eid="PSA 83:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 83:13"/>Ee Waaqa kiyya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:13">akka bukuu hobonbolattiin garagaggalchituu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:13">akka huura qilleensi fuudhee deemuu isaan godhi.<verse eid="PSA 83:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 83:14"/>Akkuma ibiddi gongomaa muxuqi godhu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:14">akkuma bobeenni gaara gubu,<verse eid="PSA 83:14"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 83:15"/>ati bubbee teetiin isaan ari'i;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:15">hobonbolattii teetiin isaan bararassi.<verse eid="PSA 83:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 83:16"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:16">akka isaan maqaa keeti barbaadanu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:16">isaan fokkisiisi.<verse eid="PSA 83:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 83:17"/>Haga bara baraa isaan qaanessiitii naasisi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:17">isaan salphinnaan badanuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 83:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 83:18"/>Isaan maqaan keeti Mootii Waan Maraa akka te'e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:18">ati callaan lafa duudii irratti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:18">Waaqa Ol Aanaa akka teete beekanuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 83:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 83"/>
  <chapter number="84" style="c" sid="PSA 84"/>
  <para style="s1">Mana Waaqaa Dharra'uu</para>
  <para style="s2">Sooressa faarfattootaatiif, faaruu ilmaan Qoraahii ta suusulle'een faarfatante.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 84:1"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:1">ka Waan Mara Dadde,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:1">Galmi ati keessa leetu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:1">attam attam natti tola!<verse eid="PSA 84:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 84:2"/>Lubbuun tiyya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:2">badhinna Dunkaanii Woyyittii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:2">Mootii Waan Maraa keessa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:2">jiraatiisaaf dharraatee gaggaddi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 84:2">Gadhaan kiyyaa fi foon kiyya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:2">Waaqa jiraata'aaf ilillisan.<verse eid="PSA 84:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 84:3"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:3">Ka Waan Mara Dadde,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:3">mootii kiyya, Waaqa kiyya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:3">addee ciinca'aa teetitti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:3">sinbirrooti didiqqoon mana ifii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:3">maddoolle mandhee ilmoolee ifii keyattu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:3">ijaarrataneeran.<verse eid="PSA 84:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 84:4"/>Worri mana keeti keessa le'u ka gammade;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:4">isaan yennaa mara si leellisan.<verse eid="PSA 84:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 84:5"/>Worri gara gaara Xiyoonii deemiisaaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:5">gadhaa ifii keessatti dharra'ee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:5">hunna si biraa dhaggatu ka gammade.<verse eid="PSA 84:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 84:6"/>Isaan yennaa dhooqa godde,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:6">ta, «Baka» jedhantu keessa dabaranu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:6">addee maddaa isaaniif teeti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:6">bokkeenni furmaataalle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:6">dhooqa san keessa haroo eelcha.<verse eid="PSA 84:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 84:7"/>Isaan akkuma deemanuun jabeenna ede'atan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:7">Waaqa Xiyoon keessaa dura hin dhikaatan.<verse eid="PSA 84:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 84:8"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:8">Waaqa waan mara dande'u,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:8">daadimata kiyya dhage'i;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:8">Waaqa Yaaqoobii na caqasi.<verse eid="PSA 84:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 84:9"/>Ee Waaqa, wontee teenna ilaali;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:9">mooticha muuddeertuuf gadhaa laafi.<verse eid="PSA 84:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 84:10"/>Addee dhibii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:10">guyyaa kuma tokko ooliisaa mannaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:10">badhinna Galma woyyicha keetii keessa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:10">guyyaa tokko ooluu woyya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 84:10">Dunkaanii worra hamaaleyyi'ii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:10">keessa tee'iisaa mannaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:10">eedduu balbala mana Waaqa kiyyaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:10">te'u naa woyya.<verse eid="PSA 84:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 84:11"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:11">Waaqi akka adu'uu tii fi akka wonte'ee ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:11">inni fudhatamaa fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:11">ulfinna akka dhaggatanu hin godha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 84:11">Mootiin Waan Maraa worra komii hin qanne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:11">waan dansaa hin dhooggatu.<verse eid="PSA 84:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 84:12"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:12">Ka Waan Mara Dadde,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:12">nami si'itti addatu ka gammade.<verse eid="PSA 84:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 84"/>
  <chapter number="85" style="c" sid="PSA 85"/>
  <para style="s1">Daadimata Nageya Biyyaatiif Dhikaate</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu ilmaan Qoraahii, Sooressa faarfattootaatiif.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 85:1"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:1">ati lafa teeti mararteerta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:1">sanyii Yaaqoobiitiif</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:1">milkii adde'etti deebitteerta.<verse eid="PSA 85:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 85:2"/>Ati yakkaa kolbaa teetii araaranteerta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:2">cubbuu isaaniille mara golliteerta.<verse eid="PSA 85:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 85:3"/>Mufii teeti lakkitteerta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:3">aarii teeti ta bobeettu irraa deebiteerta.<verse eid="PSA 85:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 85:4"/>Ee Waaqa fayyisaa keenna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:4">adde'etti nu deebisi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:4">nutti mufatiisa lakkisi.<verse eid="PSA 85:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 85:5"/>Ati haga bara baraa nutti aartaa ree?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:5">Aarii teeti dhaloota irraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:5">gara dhalootaatitti dabarsitaa ree?<verse eid="PSA 85:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 85:6"/>Kolbaan teeti akka sitti guddoo gammadu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:6">deebittee nu hin jiraachittuu ree?<verse eid="PSA 85:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 85:7"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:7">jaalala keeti ka bara baraa nutti mudhisi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:7">fayyisiisa keeti nuu kenni.<verse eid="PSA 85:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 85:8"/>Ani waan Waaqi Mootiin Waan Maraa dubbatu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:8">hin caqasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:8">kolbaan isaa, worri isaaf addatame,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:8">gara gowwumma'aatitti hin deebi'in malee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:8">Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:8">nageya isaaniif waadaa gala.<verse eid="PSA 85:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 85:9"/>Ulfinni isaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:9">lafa teenna keessa akka jiraatu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:9">dhugumaan fayyisiisi isaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:9">worra isa sodaatuuf dhikoo jira.<verse eid="PSA 85:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 85:10"/>Jaalalli fi addatamummaan wol dhaggan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:10">balchumma'aa fi nageenni wol sunqatan.<verse eid="PSA 85:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 85:11"/>Addatamummaan lafa keessaa latti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:11">balchummaan ol-gubbaa irraa gad ilaalti.<verse eid="PSA 85:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 85:12"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:12">waan dansaa hin kenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:12">latti teennalle midhaan hin baatti.<verse eid="PSA 85:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 85:13"/>Balchummaan dura isaa deenti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:13">tarkaaffii isaatiif daandii qopheessiti.<verse eid="PSA 85:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 85"/>
  <chapter number="86" style="c" sid="PSA 86"/>
  <para style="s1">Daadimata Qarqaarsa Waaqaa Dhaggatiisaaf Dhikaate</para>
  <para style="s2">Daadimata Daawitii.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 86:1"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa, ani hiyyeessa rakkataa waan te'eef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:1">gurra keeti gara kiyya deebifadhuutii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:1">naa dhage'i.<verse eid="PSA 86:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 86:2"/>Ani waan si'iif ifi kenneeruuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:2">jiruu tiyya eegi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:2">tajaajilaa keeti ka sitti addatu baasi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:2">ati Waaqa kiyya.<verse eid="PSA 86:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 86:3"/>Ani guyyaa guutuu gara keeti waan iyyuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:3">ee Mootii Waan Maraa, na marari.<verse eid="PSA 86:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 86:4"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:4">ani lubbuu tiyya sitti waan kennadheeruuf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:4">ana tajaajilaa keeti gammachiisi.<verse eid="PSA 86:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 86:5"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa, ati dansa'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:5">namaafille hin araaranta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:5">worra si waammatuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:5">jaalala keeti ka bara baraa hin baceessita.<verse eid="PSA 86:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 86:6"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa, daadimata kiyya dhage'i;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:6">iyya gaaffii tiyyaa caqasi.<verse eid="PSA 86:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 86:7"/>Ati waan deebii naa kennituuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:7">ani guyyaa rakkinna kiyyaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:7">si waammadha.<verse eid="PSA 86:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 86:8"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:8">waaqota keessaa ka akka keetii hin jiru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:8">hujiin akka hujii teetiille hin jirtu.<verse eid="PSA 86:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 86:9"/>Gootta'a, kolbaan biyya adda addaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:9">ta ati dadde marti gara keeti dhuttee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:9">si'iif hin sagaddi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:9">maqaa keetiifille ulfinna hin kenniti.<verse eid="PSA 86:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 86:10"/>Ati guddaa waan teeteef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:10">hujii baasaa hin hujja;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:10">ati callaan Waaqa.<verse eid="PSA 86:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 86:11"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:11">ani dhugaa teetiin akka deemuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:11">karaa keeti na barsiisi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 86:11">Akka ani maqaa keeti sodaadhuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:11">nama gadhaa tokkochaa na godhi.<verse eid="PSA 86:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 86:12"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa Waaqa kiyya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:12">ani gadhaa tokkochaan si galateeffadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:12">maqaa keetiifille</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:12">haga bara baraa ulfinna hin keenna.<verse eid="PSA 86:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 86:13"/>Jaalalli keeti ka bara baraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:13">ka ati naaf qaddu gudda'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:13">ati lubbuu tiyya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:13">qilee addee worri du'e jiru irraa hamburteerta.<verse eid="PSA 86:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 86:14"/>Ee Waaqa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:14">worri bondhooru na irratti ka'eera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:14">goliin worra gadhaa jabaatuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:14">lubbuu tiyya balleessiisaaf barbaadan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:14">isaan woyittuu si hin laakkowanu.<verse eid="PSA 86:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 86:15"/>Ee Gootta'a, ati ammoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:15">Waaqa mararaa arja'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:15">aari'iif hin ariifattu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:15">jaalalli keeti ka bara baraatii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:15">addatamummaan teetille baca'a.<verse eid="PSA 86:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 86:16"/>Gara kiyya deebi'ii, na marari;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:16">hunna teeti ana tajaajilaa keetiif kenni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:16">ana ilma garbittii teetii baasi.<verse eid="PSA 86:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 86:17"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:17">ati waan na qarqaartee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:17">na jajjabeessiteef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:17">diinoti kiyya dhagganee akka fokkifatanu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:17">beessisa fudhatama keeti dhaggatiisaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:17">na irratti mudhisi.<verse eid="PSA 86:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 86"/>
  <chapter number="87" style="c" sid="PSA 87"/>
  <para style="s1">Leellisa Yerusaalemiif Dhikaate</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu ilmaan Qoraahii.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 87:1"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa hundee qachaa ifii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:1">gaarota woyyoota irratti dhaabe;<verse eid="PSA 87:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 87:2"/>Addee Yaaqoob le'u mara caalaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:2">Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:2">seensuma karra Xiyoonii jaalata;<verse eid="PSA 87:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 87:3"/>Ee qachaa Waaqaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:3">wonni maade'ee marroo teetiif dubbatanti;<verse eid="PSA 87:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 87:4"/>Waaqi, «Ani worra na beeku oddu'utti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:4">Gibxi'ii fi Baabilon hin galmeessa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:4">worri Filisxeemotaa, worri Xiiroosiitii fi Itoophiya'aalle<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">87:4 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Itoophiyaa: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Afaan Ibrootaatiin </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuushi jedha. </char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:4">worra achitti dhalate» jedha.<verse eid="PSA 87:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 87:5"/>Marroo Xiyoonii, «Dhugumaan, Waaqi Ol Aanaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:5">waan isii jabeessuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:5">kolbaan tunii fi sunille,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:5">as isii keessatti dhalatte» hin jedhama.<verse eid="PSA 87:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 87:6"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:6">yennaa gosa biyya adda addaa galmeessu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:6">«Worri kun achitti dhalatane» jedhee hin barreessa.<verse eid="PSA 87:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 87:7"/>Worri faarsuu fi worri sirbu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:7">«Maddi keenna martinuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:7">Xiyoon keessa jira» hin jedhan.<verse eid="PSA 87:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 87"/>
  <chapter number="88" style="c" sid="PSA 88"/>
  <para style="s1">Daadimata Qarqaarsa Waaqaa Dhaggatiisaaf Dhikaate</para>
  <para style="s2">Sooressa faarfattootaatiif, faaruu ilmaan Qoraahii, ta akka yoyyoma faaruu, «Mahalaat» jedhantuun faarfante; barsiisa Hemaanii Ezraahichaa.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 88:1"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:1">Waaqa fayyinna kiyyaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:1">ani fuula keeti duratti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:1">halkanii fi guyyaa gara keeti iyya.<verse eid="PSA 88:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 88:2"/>Daadimati kiyya si bira gewuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:2">gurra keeti gara iyya tiyya deebifadhu.<verse eid="PSA 88:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 88:3"/>Lubbuun tiyya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:3">rakkinnaan waan guutanteef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:3">jiruun tiyya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:3">gara addee worri du'e jiruu dhikaatteerti.<verse eid="PSA 88:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 88:4"/>Ani worra gad gara boollaa dhaqu oddu'utti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:4">laakkowame;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:4">ani akka nama hunna hin qannee te'e.<verse eid="PSA 88:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 88:5"/>Ani akka nama worra du'e keessatti gatamee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:5">akka worra ijjeefamee awwaala keessa ciisuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:5">akka worra ati deebitee hin qaabannee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:5">ka ati ijjumaa hin qarqaarree te'e.<verse eid="PSA 88:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 88:6"/>Ati boolla qilee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:6">qilee dukkanaa keessa na buutte.<verse eid="PSA 88:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 88:7"/>Mufiin teeti ulfaattee na irra ciitteerti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:7">ati danbalii mufii teetii mara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:7">na irra danbalaatteerta.<verse eid="PSA 88:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 88:8"/>Firooti kiyya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:8">akka na irraa fagaatanu gooteerta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:8">akka isaan na diqatanu gooteerta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:8">akka ani miliquu hin dandeenne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:8">balbalti natti cufanteerti.<verse eid="PSA 88:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 88:9"/>Ilti tiyya gaddaan caararrootteerti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:9">ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:9">guyyuma guyya'aan ani si waammadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:9">harka kiyyalle gara keeti diriirsa.<verse eid="PSA 88:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 88:10"/>Ati worra du'eeruuf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:10">waan maade'ee hin hujjaa ree?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:10">Ekeraan kaatee si leellifattii ree?<verse eid="PSA 88:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 88:11"/>Jaalalli keeti ka bara baraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:11">boolla awwaalaa keessatti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:11">addatamummaan teeti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:11">addee badi'ii keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:11">hin lallabantii ree?<verse eid="PSA 88:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 88:12"/>Hujii teeti ta bilbaasaa dukkana keessatti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:12">yookiin balchummaan teeti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:12">lafa dedhante keessatti hin beekkantii ree?<verse eid="PSA 88:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 88:13"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa, ani ammoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:13">qarqaarsa dhaggatiisaaf gara keeti iyya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:13">ganama ganamaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:13">daadimati kiyya si dura dhikaata.<verse eid="PSA 88:13"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 88:14"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:14">ati maaf ifi irraa na fageessita?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:14">Ati maaf fuula keeti na dhoffatta?<verse eid="PSA 88:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 88:15"/>Ani dargaggummaa tiyya irraa jalqabee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:15">farree du'a geyeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:15">bararassiisa keeti irraa ka ka'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:15">waan godhu wollaaleera.<verse eid="PSA 88:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 88:16"/>Mufiin teeti na irra buuteerti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:16">bararassiisi keetille na balleesseera.<verse eid="PSA 88:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 88:17"/>Mufiin teetii fi bararassiisi keeti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:17">guyyaa guutuu akka lola'aa na marsane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:17">gara maraan karaa natti cufane.<verse eid="PSA 88:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 88:18"/>Ati lansootaa fi jaalota kiyya na irraa fageessite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:18">dukkanti callaan jaala kiyya naaf teete.<verse eid="PSA 88:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 88"/>
  <chapter number="89" style="c" sid="PSA 89"/>
  <para style="s1">Addatamummaa Waaqaa</para>
  <para style="s2">Wolaloo Etaanii Ezraahichaa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 89:1"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa, ani marroo jaalala keeti ka bara baraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:1">yennaa mara hin faarfadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:1">addatamummaa teeti dhaloota maraaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:1">afaan kiyyaan hin lallaba.<verse eid="PSA 89:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 89:2"/>Jaalalli keeti ka bara baraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:2">jabaatee akka dhaabbate,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:2">addatamummaa teetille</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:2">akka ol-gubba'aa akka ati dhaadde,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:2">ani hin lallaba.<verse eid="PSA 89:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 89:3"/>Ati, «Ka filadhe woliin gondooroo godheera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:3">tajaajilaa kiyya Daawitiif,<verse eid="PSA 89:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 89:4"/>‹Sanyii teeti haga bara baraa hin jabeessa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:4">barcumaa mootummaa teetii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:4">dhalootaa haga dhalootaatitti hin dhaaba›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:4">jedhee kakadheera» jetteerta.<verse eid="PSA 89:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 89:5"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:5">ol-gubbaan bilbaasa keeti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:5">yaa'iin woyyootaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:5">addatamummaa teeti leellifatanuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 89:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 89:6"/>Ol-gubbaa keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:6">ka Mootii Waan Maraatiin wol qixxawu eennu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:6">Ergantoota Waaqaa ta ol-gubba'aa keessaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:6">ka akka Mootii Waan Maraa jiru eennu?<verse eid="PSA 89:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 89:7"/>Yaa'ii woyyittii keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:7">Mootiin Waan Maraa guddoo ka sodaatame;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:7">worra adaala isaa jiru mara caalaa sodaachisa'a.<verse eid="PSA 89:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 89:8"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:8">Waaqa Waan Mara Dande'u,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:8">ka akka keetii eennu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 89:8">Ati jaba'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:8">Ati waan maraan addatama'a.<verse eid="PSA 89:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 89:9"/>Ati bulpheessa abbaaya'aa irratti baallii qadda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:9">danbaliin isi'ii yennaa kaatulle, hin sarmisiitta.<verse eid="PSA 89:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 89:10"/>Bineensa akka jawwe'ee ka, «Rahaab» jedhamu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:10">akka waan qalameetitti butuchite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:10">irree teeti jaddu'uun diinota keeti bittinneessite.<verse eid="PSA 89:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 89:11"/>Ol-gubbaan teeti; lattille teeti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:11">biyya lafaatii fi waan isii keessaa mara ka dade si'i.<verse eid="PSA 89:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 89:12"/>Kaabaa fi kibballe sittuu dade;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:12">gaarri Taaboriitii fi gaarri Hermoonii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:12">maqaa keetiif ilillisan.<verse eid="PSA 89:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 89:13"/>Ati irree hunnaamettii qadda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:13">harki keeti jaba'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:13">hunna teeti mudhisiisaaf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:13">harki keeti middichi ol ka'eera.<verse eid="PSA 89:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 89:14"/>Barcumaan mootumma'aa keeti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:14">balchumma'aa fi haqa irra dhaabbateera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:14">jaalalaa fi addatamummaan siin dura deeman.<verse eid="PSA 89:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 89:15"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:15">Kolbaan ilillisaa si leellittu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:15">ta ifa fuula keeti duraa keessa ideentu gammadduu ti.<verse eid="PSA 89:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 89:16"/>Isaan guyyaa guutuu maqaa keetitti gammadan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:16">balchummaa teetille'een si leellisan.<verse eid="PSA 89:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 89:17"/>Ati ulfinnaa fi jabeenna isaanii waan teeteef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:17">fudhatama si biraa dhagganneen injifanna.<verse eid="PSA 89:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 89:18"/>Wonteen teenna ta Mootii Waan Maraa ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:18">mootiin keennalle ka Woyyicha Israa'elii ti.<verse eid="PSA 89:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Addii Waaqi Daawitiif Kenne</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 89:19"/>Ati yennaa takka tajaajiltoota addatantoota teetitti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:19">mudhi'iin dubbattee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 89:19">«Janna tokkoof qarqaarsa kenneera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:19">dargaggeessa tokko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:19">odduu kolba'aatii filee ol kaaseera.<verse eid="PSA 89:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 89:20"/>Tajaajilaa kiyya Daawiti dhaggadheera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:20">zayitii tiyya woyyitti'iin isa muudeera.<verse eid="PSA 89:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 89:21"/>Harki kiyya isa woliin hin jiraata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:21">irreen tiyyalle isa hin jabeessiti.<verse eid="PSA 89:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 89:22"/>Diinni isa hin injifatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:22">nami hamaalle gad isa hin qabu.<verse eid="PSA 89:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 89:23"/>Ani nyaaphota isaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:23">fuula isaa duratti hin butucha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:23">worra isa jibbulle gad dhowa.<verse eid="PSA 89:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 89:24"/>Addatamummaan tiyyaa fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:24">marartiin tiyya isa woliin hin jiraatan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:24">maqaa kiyyaan hin injifata.<verse eid="PSA 89:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 89:25"/>Ani harka isaa abbaayaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">89:25 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Abbaayaa: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Abbaayaan tun abbaayaa Mediteraaniya'aa ti.</char></note> irra,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:25">harka isaa middichalle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:25">lagoota<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">89:25 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Lagoota: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Lagooti kun laga Xeegrosiitii fi Efraaxiisii ti.</char></note> irra hin keya.<verse eid="PSA 89:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 89:26"/>Inni, ‹Ati abbaa kiyya, Waaqa kiyya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:26">rassaa fayyinna kiyyaa ti› naan hin jedha.<verse eid="PSA 89:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 89:27"/>Anille ilma kiyya angafa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:27">ka mootota biyya lafa mara caalu isa hin godha.<verse eid="PSA 89:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 89:28"/>Ani haga bara baraa isa jaaladha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:28">gondooroon ani isa woliin godhelle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:28">ijjumaa hin diigantu.<verse eid="PSA 89:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 89:29"/>Sanyiin isaa haga bara baraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:29">barcumaan mootummaa isaalle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:29">akka ol-gubba'aa jabaatee akka dhaabbatu hin godha.<verse eid="PSA 89:29"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 89:30"/>«Ijoolleen isaa ammoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:30">seera kiyya yoo diidde,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:30">akka ajaja kiyyaatitti yoo deemuu dhadde,<verse eid="PSA 89:30"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 89:31"/>seerata kiyya yoo diigane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:31">ajaja kiyya yoo eegatuu dhabane,<verse eid="PSA 89:31"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 89:32"/>ani cubbuu isaaniitiif ule'een isaan adaba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:32">yakkaa isaaniitiif isaan hin dhaana.<verse eid="PSA 89:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 89:33"/>Ammoo ani Daawiti jaalatiisa hin lakkisu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:33">yookiin addatamummaan ani isaaf qabu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:33">soba hin teetu.<verse eid="PSA 89:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 89:34"/>Ani gondooroo tiyya hin diigu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:34">yookiin dubbii afaan kiyyaa baatelle hin jijjiiru.<verse eid="PSA 89:34"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 89:35"/>«Ani takkaa woyyummaa tiyyaan kakadheera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:35">ani Daawiti hin sobu.<verse eid="PSA 89:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 89:36"/>Sanyiin isaa haga bara baraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:36">barcumaan mootummaa isaalle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:36">akka adu'uu fuula kiyya dura hin jiraata.<verse eid="PSA 89:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 89:37"/>Mootummaan Daawitii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:37">akka ji'a dhugaa bayaa addatamaa gubba'aa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:37">haga bara baraa jabaattee hin dhaabbatti» jette.<verse eid="PSA 89:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 89:38"/>Amma ammoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:38">ati ka muuddee mootii gooteetitti mufattee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:38">isa tuffattee gatteerta.<verse eid="PSA 89:38"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 89:39"/>Ati gondooroo tajaajilaa keeti woliin goote diiddee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:39">kallacha isaa bukuu keessatti gattee batteessite.<verse eid="PSA 89:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 89:40"/>Ati dalleya isaa mara jissitee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:40">kushee isaalle diidde.<verse eid="PSA 89:40"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 89:41"/>Worri achiin dabaru marti isa saamane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:41">inni murgoo olloota ifii te'e.<verse eid="PSA 89:41"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 89:42"/>Nyaaphota isaatiif jabeenna kennitee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:42">diinota isaa mara gammachiitte.<verse eid="PSA 89:42"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 89:43"/>Qara shallaagaa isaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:43">gara duubaa garagalchite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:43">lola keessalle'etti isa hin qarqaarre.<verse eid="PSA 89:43"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 89:44"/>Ulee bokku'uu ta isaa harkaa fuutee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:44">barcumaa mootummaa isaalle lafatti jissite.<verse eid="PSA 89:44"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 89:45"/>Bara dargaggummaa isaa itti gabaassitee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:45">qaanii itti uffitte.<verse eid="PSA 89:45"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 89:46"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:46">tun haga yoomii teeti?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:46">Ati haga bara baraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:46">ifi dhoffattaa ree?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:46">Haga yoomii mufiin teeti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:46">akka ibiddaa bobeetti ree?<verse eid="PSA 89:46"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 89:47"/>Barri jiruu tiyyaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:47">attam attam gabaabaa akka te'e yaadadhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:47">ati ilmaan namaa waan bu'aa hin qanneef daddee ree?<verse eid="PSA 89:47"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 89:48"/>Nami ijjumaa hin du'in le'uu dande'u eennu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:48">Awwaala jalaa ka miliquu dande'u eennu?<verse eid="PSA 89:48"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 89:49"/>Ee Gootta'a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:49">jaalalli keeti ka bara baraa guddaan durii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:49">ka ati addatamummaa teetiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:49">Daawitiif kakatte meet ree?<verse eid="PSA 89:49"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 89:50"/>Ee Gootta'a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:50">ana tajaajilaa keetitti attam attam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:50">akka isaan murgane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:50">ani arraba gosa biyya adda addaa mara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:50">attam attam akka ossadhe qaabadhu.<verse eid="PSA 89:50"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 89:51"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:51">diinoti keeti ka ati muuddee mootii goote salphisan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:51">lafa inni dhaqu maratti itti murgan.<verse eid="PSA 89:51"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 89:52"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa haga bara baraa leellifamu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:52">Ameen! Ameen!<verse eid="PSA 89:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 89"/>
  <chapter number="90" style="c" sid="PSA 90"/>
  <para style="ms">Kitaaba Arfeesso'oo</para>
  <para style="mr">(<ref loc="PSA 90-106">Far. 90—106</ref>)</para>
  <para style="s1">Waaqi Dande'aa Bara Baraa Akka Te'e</para>
  <para style="s2">Daadimata Muusee Nama Waaqaa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 90:1"/>Ee Gootta'a, ati dhalootaa haga dhalootaatitti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:1">addee itti baqannu nuuf teeteerta.<verse eid="PSA 90:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 90:2"/>Gaarri adoo hin dadamin dura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:2">yookiin ati lafaa fi biyya lafaa adoo hin dadin dura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:2">baraa haga bara baraatitti ati Waaqa.<verse eid="PSA 90:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 90:3"/>Ilmaan namaa gara biyye'ee deebitta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:3">ati, «Ee ilmaan namaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:3">gara biyye'ee deebi'a'a» jetta.<verse eid="PSA 90:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 90:4"/>Woggaan kum tokko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:4">si'iif akkuma guyyaa kalee dabaree ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:4">yookiin akkuma yennaa diqqoo halkan keessaa ti.<verse eid="PSA 90:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 90:5"/>Ati namoota haxoottee dabarsita;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:5">isaan akka oojju'uu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:5">isaan akka marra ganama quunxuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 90:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 90:6"/>Marri ganama quunxee bisila;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:6">galgala qooree goga.<verse eid="PSA 90:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 90:7"/>Nuuti aarii teetiin banneerra;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:7">mufii teetiin bararandheerra.<verse eid="PSA 90:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 90:8"/>Ati yakkaa teenna ifi dura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:8">cubbuu teenna ta dhossa'aa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:8">ifa fuula keetii dura keetteerta.<verse eid="PSA 90:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 90:9"/>Barri keenna marti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:9">adoo nuuti mufii teeti jala jirruu dabaran;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:9">bara jiruu teennaa aadaatuma fixanna.<verse eid="PSA 90:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 90:10"/>Barri jiruu teennaa woggaa torbaatama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:10">yoo bacatelle woggaa saddeettama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:10">woggooti sunuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:10">dadhabbi'ii fi rakkinna nutti fidan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 90:10">Isaan dafanee waan dabaranuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:10">nuuti koolaan kaanee dabarra.<verse eid="PSA 90:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 90:11"/>Hunna aarii teetii eentu beeka?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:11">Mufii teeti guddoo san eentu hubatuu dande'a?<verse eid="PSA 90:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 90:12"/>Qaroolee akka teenu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:12">barri jiruu teennaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:12">gabaabaa akka te'e akka beennu nu barsiisi.<verse eid="PSA 90:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 90:13"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa, deebi'i!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:13">Haga yoomii mufatta?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:13">Tajaajiltoota teetiif gadhaa laafi.<verse eid="PSA 90:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 90:14"/>Bara jiruu teennaa mara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:14">akka gammannee ilillinnu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:14">ganama ganama jaalala keeti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:14">ka bara baraatiin nu quussi.<verse eid="PSA 90:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 90:15"/>Akkuma bara bacaa nu rakkitte,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:15">akkuma woggaa bacaa waan hantuu dhaggine,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:15">amma nu gammachiisi!<verse eid="PSA 90:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 90:16"/>Hujii teeti tajaajiltoota teetitti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:16">ulfinna keeti ijoollee isaaniititti mudhisi.<verse eid="PSA 90:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 90:17"/>Goottaa Waaqa keenna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:17">ila dansa'aan nu ilaali;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:17">hujii harka keennaalle nuu milkeessi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:17">ee, nuu milkeessi.<verse eid="PSA 90:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 90"/>
  <chapter number="91" style="c" sid="PSA 91"/>
  <para style="s1">Eegunsa Waaqaa Jala Jiraachuu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 91:1"/>Nami gollaa Waaqa Ol Aana'aa jala le'u,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:1">ka gaaddisa Waaqa Waan Mara Dande'uu jalatti foorfatu,<verse eid="PSA 91:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 91:2"/>Mootii Waan Maraatiin, «Ati addee ani itti baqadhu, kushee tiyya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:2">Waaqa kiyya ka ani itti addadhu» hin jedha.<verse eid="PSA 91:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 91:3"/>Waaqi tiyyoo nami si'iif afee fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:3">dhukkuba hamaa jalaa si hin baasa.<verse eid="PSA 91:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 91:4"/>Inni koola ifiitiin si golla;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:4">baala isaa jalatti baqatta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:4">addatamummaan isaa wonte'ee fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:4">kushee si'iif hin te'a.<verse eid="PSA 91:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 91:5"/>Ati waan halkan nama sodaachisu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:5">daaya guyya'aan namatti darbatamu<verse eid="PSA 91:5"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 91:6"/>yookiin dhukkuba hamaa halkaniin deemu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:6">yookiin balaa guyyaa wodhakkaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:6">nama balleessu hin sodaattu.<verse eid="PSA 91:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 91:7"/>Kum tokko cinaa teetitti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:7">kum kudhan midda keetitti hin jigan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:7">ammoo si hin tuqanu.<verse eid="PSA 91:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 91:8"/>Ati ammoo ila teeti qofaan ilaaltee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:8">adabamiisa worra hama'aa dhaggita.<verse eid="PSA 91:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 91:9"/>Ati Mootii Waan Maraa addee itti baqattu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:9">Waaqa Ol Aanaa mana keeti waan godhatteef,<verse eid="PSA 91:9"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 91:10"/>wonni hantuun sitti hin dhuttu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:10">balaan qe'ee teetitti hin dhikaatu.<verse eid="PSA 91:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 91:11"/>Sababille karaa ati ideentu maratti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:11">akka si eeganuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:11">inni ergantoota ifii si'iif hin ajaja.<verse eid="PSA 91:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 91:12"/>Miilli keeti dhaka'aan akka hin gufanne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:12">isaan harka ifiitiin ol si hin kiphan.<verse eid="PSA 91:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 91:13"/>Ati neenqaa fi dhudhuufaa irra hin ejjatta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:13">neenqa dardaraa fi buutii irra hin sirbita.<verse eid="PSA 91:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 91:14"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa, «Inni waan na jaalatuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:14">ani diinota isaa jalaa isa hin baasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:14">inni maqaa kiyya waan beekuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:14">ani isa hin eega.<verse eid="PSA 91:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 91:15"/>Inni na hin waammata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:15">anille deebii isaaf hin kenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:15">yennaa inni rakkatu isa woliin hin jiraadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:15">ani isa hin baasa; ulfinnalle isaaf hin kenna.<verse eid="PSA 91:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 91:16"/>Jiruu bara dheera'aatiin isa hin quussa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:16">ani fayyisaa isaa akka te'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:16">akka inni dhaggu hin godha» jedha.<verse eid="PSA 91:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 91"/>
  <chapter number="92" style="c" sid="PSA 92"/>
  <para style="s1">Hujii Isaatiif Mootii Waan Maraa Leellisuu</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Guyyaa Sanbataa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 92:1"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa, si leellisuun</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:1">Ee Waaqa Ol Aana'a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:1">maqaa keetiif faaruu leellisaa dhikeessuun dansa'a.<verse eid="PSA 92:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 92:2"/>Jaalala keeti ka bara baraa ganamaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:2">addatamummaa teeti halkaniin lallabuun,<verse eid="PSA 92:2"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 92:3"/>meya faaru'uu ka ribuu kudhan qabuu fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:3">yoyyoma kiraara guddichaatiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:3">si leellisuun dansa'a.<verse eid="PSA 92:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 92:4"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa, hujii teetiin na gammachiitta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:4">ani hujii harka keetiititti gammadee faarfadha.<verse eid="PSA 92:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 92:5"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa, hujiin teeti attam attam guddo'o;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:5">yaadi keeti attam attam gad fagaata!<verse eid="PSA 92:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 92:6"/>Nami daalleen tana hin beeku;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:6">gowwaalle tana hin hubatu.<verse eid="PSA 92:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 92:7"/>Worri hamaan akka marraa latanulle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:7">worri waan hantuu huju marti daraaranulle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:7">isaan ijjumaayyuu hin badan.<verse eid="PSA 92:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 92:8"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa, ati ammoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:8">haga bara baraa ol aana'a.<verse eid="PSA 92:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 92:9"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa, diinoti keeti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:9">dhugumaan diinoti keeti hin badan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:9">worri waan hantuu huju marti hin bittinnowan.<verse eid="PSA 92:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 92:10"/>Ati akka gafarsaa na jabeessitee<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">92:10 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Akka gafarsaa na jabeessitee: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Afaan Ibrootaatiin </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">akka gaafa gafarsaa gaafa kiyya ol kaache </char><char style="ft" closed="false">jedha. Gaafi ammoo jabeenna isaa ilaala.</char></note>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:10">zayiti'iin na muudde.<verse eid="PSA 92:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 92:11"/>Ilti tiyya injifatama diinota kiyyaa dhaggite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:11">gurri kiyyalle iyya nyaaphota kiyya hamoole'ee dhage'e.<verse eid="PSA 92:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 92:12"/>Nami balchaan akka muka meexxi'ii hin oshoba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:12">akka hindheensa Libaanonii hin banqaaqa.<verse eid="PSA 92:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 92:13"/>Isaan akka muka mana Mootii Waan Maraa keessatti dhaabamanee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:13">badhinna mana Waaqa keennaatiin duraa keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:13">hin oshoban.<verse eid="PSA 92:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 92:14"/>Isaan akka muka dullummaa keessa midhaan buusuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:14">ka yennaa mara bisille'ee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:14">hin te'an.<verse eid="PSA 92:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 92:15"/>Isaan, «Mootiin Waan Maraa sirri'i;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:15">inni rassaa ani itti baqadhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:15">isa keessa hammeenni hin jiru» jedhan.<verse eid="PSA 92:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 92"/>
  <chapter number="93" style="c" sid="PSA 93"/>
  <para style="s1">Arnya Mootii Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 93:1"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa mooti'i; inni arnya uffate;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:1">arnya uffatee jabeennaan hidhate.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 93:1">Biyyi lafaa jabaattee dhaabbatte;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:1">isiin ijjumaa hin tachootu.<verse eid="PSA 93:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 93:2"/>Barcumaan mootumma'aa keeti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:2">durii duriitii jalqabee dhaabbate;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:2">ati bara durii duriitii jalqaddee jirta.<verse eid="PSA 93:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 93:3"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa, lagi hedduun ol kakka'e;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:3">shookkisiisa ifii ol qabate;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:3">danbalii shookkisiisa ifiille ol kaafate.<verse eid="PSA 93:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 93:4"/>Shookkisiisa bisaan jabaa heddu'uu caalaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:4">danbalii abbaaya'aa hunnaamettii caalaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:4">Mootiin Waan Maraa ka ol-gubbaa jiru hunnaamessa.<verse eid="PSA 93:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 93:5"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa, seerri keeti ka addatame;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:5">manni keetille haga bara baraa woyyumma'aan ka miidhage.<verse eid="PSA 93:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 93"/>
  <chapter number="94" style="c" sid="PSA 94"/>
  <para style="s1">Waaqa Balchootaaf Haluu Bayu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 94:1"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa, ati Waaqa haluu bayu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:1">ee Waaqa haluu bayu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:1">ulfinna keeti mudhisi!<verse eid="PSA 94:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 94:2"/>Ee abbaa mura'aa ka lafa tanaa, ka'i!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:2">Worra koorameeyyi'iif waan isaaniif male kenni.<verse eid="PSA 94:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 94:3"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:3">worri hamaan haga yoomii firinxiixan?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:3">Isaan haga yoomii firinxiixan?<verse eid="PSA 94:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 94:4"/>Isaan jechoota koora ifii gad naqan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:4">worri hantuu huju marti ifi jajiisaan guutamaneeran.<verse eid="PSA 94:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 94:5"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa, isaan kolbaa teeti butuchan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:5">kolbaa teeti cunqursan.<verse eid="PSA 94:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 94:6"/>Isaan haadhotii hiyyeessaatii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:6">alagaa worra lafa teenna keessa le'u ijjeesan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:6">ijoollee haadhaa fi abbaa hin qanne qalan.<verse eid="PSA 94:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 94:7"/>Isaan, «Mootiin Waan Maraa hin dhaggu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:7">Waaqi Yaaqoobii tana hin hubatu» jedhan.<verse eid="PSA 94:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 94:8"/>Kolbaa keessaa worri daalleen hubadha'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:8">isin worri gowwaan yoom qaroolee teetan?<verse eid="PSA 94:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 94:9"/>Ka gurra dade ifii hin dhage'uu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:9">Ka ila dade ifii hin dhagguu?<verse eid="PSA 94:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 94:10"/>Ka gosa biyya adda addaa gorsu hin adabuu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:10">Ka ilmaan namaa barsiisu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:10">inni beekkumsa dhabee ree?<verse eid="PSA 94:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 94:11"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa yaada namaa hin beeka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:11">yaadi namaa akka hafuura baafata tokkochaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:11">akka te'e inni hin beeka.<verse eid="PSA 94:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 94:12"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa, nami ati gorsitu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:12">ka ati seera keeti barsiittu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:12">attam attam ka gammade.<verse eid="PSA 94:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 94:13"/>Worra hama'aaf boolli haga qotantutti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:13">ati guyyaa rakkinnaa irraa isa foorfachiitta.<verse eid="PSA 94:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 94:14"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa kolbaa ifii hin gatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:14">ijoollee ifii hin lakkisu.<verse eid="PSA 94:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 94:15"/>Muraan deebitee haqa irratti hin hundootti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:15">worri qajeelaan marti haqa gula deeman.<verse eid="PSA 94:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 94:16"/>Eentu ka'ee worra hamaa naaf ka'ee morma?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:16">Eentu worra waan hantuu huju mormiisaaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:16">golii tiyya dhaabbata?<verse eid="PSA 94:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 94:17"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa adoo na hin qarqaarre teetee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:17">silaa ani ariiti'iin du'eera.<verse eid="PSA 94:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 94:18"/>Yennaa ani, «Miilli kiyya mucucaate» jedhu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:18">ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:18">jaalalli keeti ka bara baraa na utuba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">94:18 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Utuba: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Yookiin kipha </char></note>.<verse eid="PSA 94:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 94:19"/>Yennaa yaaddoon gadhaa kiyyatti bacattu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:19">ati na jajjabeessitee lubbuu tiyya gammachiitta.<verse eid="PSA 94:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 94:20"/>Worri seera sababeeffatee maltummaa huju,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:20">sooreyyiin hamooleen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:20">si woliin jaalota te'uu dande'anii ree?<verse eid="PSA 94:20"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 94:21"/>Isaan jiruu worra balchoole'ee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:21">irratti ka'iisaaf wol qabatan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:21">worra yakkaa hin qannetti du'a muran.<verse eid="PSA 94:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 94:22"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa kiyya ammoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:22">kushee naaf te'eera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:22">Waaqi kiyya rassaa ani itti baqadhu.<verse eid="PSA 94:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 94:23"/>Waaqi yakkaa isaaniitiif isaan hin adaba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:23">hammeenna isaaniitiifille isaan hin balleessa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:23">Mootiin Waan Maraa Waaqi keenna isaan hin balleessa.<verse eid="PSA 94:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 94"/>
  <chapter number="95" style="c" sid="PSA 95"/>
  <para style="s1">Faaruu Leellisaa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 95:1"/>Kowa'a, Mootii Waan Maraatiif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:1">ilillisaa faarfannaa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:1">Rassaa nu baasu iyyinee leellifannaa!<verse eid="PSA 95:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 95:2"/>Galataan fuula isaa dura dhikaannuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:2">faaruu leellisaatiin ilillinnuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 95:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 95:3"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa Waaqa gudda'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:3">waaqota mara irratti mooti'i.<verse eid="PSA 95:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 95:4"/>Qileen lafa jalaa harka isaa keessa jirti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:4">qacceen gaaraalle tama isaa ti.<verse eid="PSA 95:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 95:5"/>Inni waan isii dadeef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:5">abbaayaan ta isaa ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:5">lafa godduulle harkuma isaatitti dade.<verse eid="PSA 95:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 95:6"/>Kowa'a, gad jennee isa waaqonfannaa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:6">Mootii Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:6">ka nu dade duratti jilbiiffannaa!<verse eid="PSA 95:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 95:7"/>Inni Waaqa keenna waan te'eef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:7">nuuti kolbaa inni bobbaasu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:7">hoolota inni tissu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 95:7"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 95:7">Adha qoonqoo isaa yoo dhageettane,<verse eid="PSA 95:7"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 95:8"/>«Akkuma abbootiin teessan ta durii goomolee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:8">Mariiba'aatii fi Maasa'aa keessatti goote,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:8">isin mataa jabeeyyii hin te'ina'a.<verse eid="PSA 95:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 95:9"/>Abbootiin teessan ta durii achitti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:9">waan ani isaanii godhe adoo dhagganeeranu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:9">haga na ilaalanee, na aarsane.<verse eid="PSA 95:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 95:10"/>Ani dhaloota san woggaa afurtama diqadhee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:10">‹Isaan worra karaa irraa goreeru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:10">karaa kiyyalle hin beenne› jedhe.<verse eid="PSA 95:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 95:11"/>Ani tanaaf aaree,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:11">‹Isaan ijjumaa biyya fooraa tiyyatti hin galanu› jedhee kakadhe» jedhe.<verse eid="PSA 95:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 95"/>
  <chapter number="96" style="c" sid="PSA 96"/>
  <para style="s1">Waaqa Mooticha Ol Aanaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 16:23-33">1 Dab. 16:23-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 96:1"/>Faaruu haareya Mootii Waan Maraatiif faarsa'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:1">Kolbaan lafa irraa marti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:1">Mootii Waan Maraatiif faaruu faarsa'a.<verse eid="PSA 96:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 96:2"/>Mootii Waan Maraatiif faaruu faarsa'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:2">maqaa isaa leellisa'a.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:2">Guyyuma guyya'aan fayyisiisa isaa lassa'a.<verse eid="PSA 96:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 96:3"/>Gosa biyya adda addaatiif ulfinna isaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:3">kolbaa maratti hujii isaa ta maade'ee lassa'a.<verse eid="PSA 96:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 96:4"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa guddaa waan te'eef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:4">guddifamee leellifamuu male;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:4">waaqota mara caalaa sodaatamuu male;<verse eid="PSA 96:4"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 96:5"/>waaqoti gosa biyya adda addaa marti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:5">waaqota dharaa ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:5">Mootiin Waan Maraa ammoo ka ol-gubbaa dade.<verse eid="PSA 96:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 96:6"/>Ulfinnii fi arnyi fuula isaa dura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:6">jabeennii fi dansummaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:6">addee woyyittii isaa keessa jiran.<verse eid="PSA 96:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 96:7"/>Maatiin gosa biyya adda addaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:7">Mootii Waan Maraa leellisa'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:7">ulfinnaa fi jabeenna Mootii Waan Maraa leellisa'a.<verse eid="PSA 96:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 96:8"/>Ulfinna maqaa isaatiif te'u</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:8">Mootii Waan Maraatiif dhikeessa'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:8">kennansa fida'aatii gara badhinna mana isaa kowa'a.<verse eid="PSA 96:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 96:9"/>Dansummaa woyyummaa isaatiif</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:9">Mootii Waan Maraa waaqonfadha'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:9">nami lafa irraa marti fuula isaa duratti holladha'a.<verse eid="PSA 96:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 96:10"/>Gosa biyya adda addaa maraan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:10">«Mootiin Waan Maraa mooti'i!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:10">Biyyi lafaa jabaattee dhaabanteerti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:10">isiin ijjumaa hin tachootu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:10">inni kolbaa maraaf wol qixxee mura» jedha'a.<verse eid="PSA 96:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 96:11"/>Ol-gubbaan gammadduu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:11">lattille firinxiixxuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:11">abbaaya'aa fi wonni isii keessalle shookkittuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 96:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 96:12"/>Ficha'aa fi wonni isa keessaa marti gammadduu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:12">achiin duuba muki badda'aa marti ilillisaa hin faarsan.<verse eid="PSA 96:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 96:13"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa waan dhufuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:13">fuula isaa duratti ilillisaa faarsan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:13">inni lafatti muriisaaf hin dhufa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 96:13">Biyya lafaatitti balchumma'aan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:13">kolbaa maratti dhuga'aan hin mura.<verse eid="PSA 96:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 96"/>
  <chapter number="97" style="c" sid="PSA 97"/>
  <para style="s1">Waaqa Bulchaa Ol Aanaa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 97:1"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa mooti'i!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:1">Latti gammadduu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:1">isin worri oddoola abbaaya'aa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:1">keessa jirtanulle gammada'a.<verse eid="PSA 97:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 97:2"/>Duumensii fi dukkanti dimmi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:2">isa marsaneeran;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:2">balchumma'aa fi haqi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:2">hundee mootummaa isaa ti.<verse eid="PSA 97:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 97:3"/>Ibiddi dura isaa ideemaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:3">diinota isa marsaneeranu mara guba.<verse eid="PSA 97:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 97:4"/>Balaqqeettiin isaa biyya lafaa issiti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:4">lattille dhaggitee rommiti.<verse eid="PSA 97:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 97:5"/>Mootii Waan Maraa ka lafa duudi'ii duratti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:5">gaarri akka gaga'aa hin baqa.<verse eid="PSA 97:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 97:6"/>Ol-gubbaan balchummaa isaa lassiti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:6">kolbaan martille ulfinna isaa dhaggiti.<verse eid="PSA 97:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 97:7"/>Worri fakkii waaqonfatu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:7">ka waaqota dharaa gatii hin qanneen kooru marti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:7">hin fokkifatan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:7">waaqoti marti isaaf jilbiiffatan.<verse eid="PSA 97:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 97:8"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa, marroo muraa teetii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:8">worri Xiyoonii dhage'anee hin gammadan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:8">kolbaan Yihuda'aalle hin ilillitti.<verse eid="PSA 97:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 97:9"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:9">ati lafa mara irratti Ol Aana'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:9">ati waaqota mara caalta.<verse eid="PSA 97:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 97:10"/>Worri Mootii Waan Maraa jaalatu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:10">waan hantuu jibbuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:10">inni lubbuu worra addatama'aa waan eeguuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:10">harka worra hamaaleyyi'ii jalaa isaan hin baasa.<verse eid="PSA 97:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 97:11"/>Ifi worra balcha'aaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:11">gammaddi worra qajeela'aaf baya.<verse eid="PSA 97:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 97:12"/>Isin balchooti Mootii Waan Maraatiin gammada'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:12">maqaa isaa woyyicha leellisa'a.<verse eid="PSA 97:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 97"/>
  <chapter number="98" style="c" sid="PSA 98"/>
  <para style="s1">Abbaa Mura'aa Ka Biyya Lafaa Leellisa'a</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 98:1"/>Inni hujii maade'ee waan hujeef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:1">faaruu haareya Mootii Waan Maraatiif faarsa'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:1">inni harka ifii middichaa fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:1">irree ifii woyyitti'iin injifateera.<verse eid="PSA 98:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 98:2"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:2">fayyisiisa ifii akka beekkamu godheera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:2">balchummaa ifiille</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:2">gosa biyya adda addaatitti mudhiseera.<verse eid="PSA 98:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 98:3"/>Inni jaalala ifii ka bara baraatii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:3">addatamummaa ifii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:3">mana Israa'eliitiif yaadateera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:3">worri qaccee lafaa jiru marti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:3">fayyisiisa Waaqa keennaa dhagganeeran.<verse eid="PSA 98:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 98:4"/>Kolbaan lafa irraa marti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:4">Mootii Waan Maraatiif ilillisa'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:4">gammadaa fi faaru'uun isa leellisa'a.<verse eid="PSA 98:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 98:5"/>Qoonqoo kiraara guddichaatiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:5">kiraaraa guddichaa fi faaru'uun</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:5">Mootii Waan Maraa leellisa'a.<verse eid="PSA 98:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 98:6"/>Tultulla'aa fi tultullaa gaafa hoole'ee afuufaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:6">Mootii Waan Maraa mooticha duratti ilillisa'a.<verse eid="PSA 98:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 98:7"/>Abbaaya'aa fi wonni isii keessaa marti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:7">biyyi lafaatii fi wonni isii keessa le'u marti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:7">shookkisanuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 98:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 98:8"/>Lagooti harka dhowanuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:8">gaaroti adduma tokko ilillisanuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 98:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 98:9"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:9">kolbaa lafaatitti muriisaaf waan dhufuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:9">isa duratti faarfatanuu ti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 98:9">Inni biyya lafaatitti balchumma'aan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:9">kolbaa maratti haqaan hin mura.<verse eid="PSA 98:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 98"/>
  <chapter number="99" style="c" sid="PSA 99"/>
  <para style="s1">Waaqi Mootii Ol Aana'a</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 99:1"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa mooti'i;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:1">gosi biyya adda addaa hollattuu ti!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 99:1">Inni barcumaa mootumma'aa irra</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:1">odduu dada ol-gubba'aa ta koola qaddu te'eera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:1">lattille tachootuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 99:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 99:2"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa Xiyoon keessatti gudda'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:2">inni gosa biyya adda addaa irratti ol aana'a.<verse eid="PSA 99:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 99:3"/>Maqaa keeti gudda'aa fi sodaatamaa leellisanuu ti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:3">Inni woyyu'u!<verse eid="PSA 99:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 99:4"/>Ati mootichi hunnaamessa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:4">ati haqa jaalata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:4">waan sirrii te'e hundeessiteerta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:4">Israa'el keessatti haqaa fi balchummaa hujjeerta.<verse eid="PSA 99:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 99:5"/>Mootii Waan Maraa Waaqa keenna saada'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:5">miila isaa jalatti sagada'a!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:5">Inni woyyu'u!<verse eid="PSA 99:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 99:6"/>Hayyoota isaa keessaa gariin Muuse'ee fi Aaron;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:6">worra maqaa isaa waame keessaa tokkochi Saamu'el;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:6">isaan maqaa Mootii Waan Maraa waammatane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:6">innille isaaniif deebii kenne.<verse eid="PSA 99:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 99:7"/>Inni utubaa duumensaa keessaa isaanitti dubbate;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:7">isaanille qajeelfamaa fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:7">seerata inni isaaniif kenne eegatane.<verse eid="PSA 99:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 99:8"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa Waaqa keenna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:8">ati deebii isaaniif kennite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:8">cubbuu isaaniitiif haluu isaan baatulle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:8">ati Waaqa araaraa isaaniif teeteerta.<verse eid="PSA 99:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 99:9"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:9">Waaqi keenna woyyuu waan te'eef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:9">isa saada'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:9">gaara isaa woyyicha irratti isa waaqonfadha'a.<verse eid="PSA 99:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 99"/>
  <chapter number="100" style="c" sid="PSA 100"/>
  <para style="s1">Leellisiisaaf Mootii Waan Maraa Waamuu</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Galataa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 100:1"/>Kolbaan lafa irraa marti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 100:1">Mootii Waan Maraatiif ilillisa'a.<verse eid="PSA 100:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 100:2"/>Mootii Waan Maraa gammadaan tajaajila'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 100:2">gammadaan faarfataa fuula isaa dura dhikaadha'a.<verse eid="PSA 100:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 100:3"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa akka Waaqa te'e beeka'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 100:3">ka nu dade isa; nuutille ka isaa ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 100:3">nuuti kolbaa isaa ti; hoolota inni tiffatu.<verse eid="PSA 100:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 100:4"/>Galateeffataa gara karra isaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 100:4">leellifataa gara badhinna mana isaa duraa seena'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 100:4">isa galateeffataa, maqaa isaa leellisa'a.<verse eid="PSA 100:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 100:5"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa dansaa waan te'eef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 100:5">jaalalli isaa ka bara baraa haga bara baraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 100:5">addatamummaan isaalle dhalootaa haga dhalootaa ti.<verse eid="PSA 100:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 100"/>
  <chapter number="101" style="c" sid="PSA 101"/>
  <para style="s1">Waadaa Mootichaa</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Daawitii.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 101:1"/>Ani marroo jaalala keeti ka bara baraatii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:1">marroo muraa haqaa teetii hin faarfadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:1">ee Mootii Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:1">faaruu leellisaa sii hin faarsa.<verse eid="PSA 101:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 101:2"/>Ani jiruu komii hin qanne le'a.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:2">Ati yoom gara kiyya dhutta?</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 101:2"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 101:2">Ani mana kiyya keessa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:2">komii malee ideema.<verse eid="PSA 101:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 101:3"/>Ani waan hantuu ila tiyya dura hin keyadhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:3">ani hujii worra Waaqa irraa goree hin jibba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:3">isiin natti hin maxxantu.<verse eid="PSA 101:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 101:4"/>Namooti yaada micciiramaa qabanu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:4">na irraa fagaatanuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:4">ani waan hantuu woliin tokkummaa hin qabu.<verse eid="PSA 101:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 101:5"/>Nama ollaa ifii dhossa'aan hamatu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:5">hin balleessa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:5">nama nama tuffatuu fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:5">nama kooruuf ani hin ossadhu.<verse eid="PSA 101:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 101:6"/>Akka isaan na woliin le'anuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:6">ilti tiyya gara worra addatamaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:6">lafa tana keessa jiranuu hin ilaalti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 101:6">Nami karaa komii hin qanne ideemu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:6">inni na hin tajaajila.<verse eid="PSA 101:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 101:7"/>Nami nama sobu mana kiyya keessa hin le'u;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:7">nami dhara dubbatu na dura hin dhaabbatu.<verse eid="PSA 101:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 101:8"/>Ani guyyuma guyya'aan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:8">worra hamaa lafa tana keessa jiranu hin balleessa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:8">worra hantuu huju mara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:8">qachaa Mootii Waan Maraa keessaa hin balleessa.<verse eid="PSA 101:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 101"/>
  <chapter number="102" style="c" sid="PSA 102"/>
  <para style="s1">Daadimata Nama Rakkoo Irra Jiruu</para>
  <para style="s2">Daadimata nama rakkate tokkoo, ka yennaa inni gaggabee iyyata ifii Mootii Waan Maraa dura Dhikeeffatu.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 102:1"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:1">daadimata kiyya naaf dhage'i;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:1">iyyi tiyyalle gara keeti dhuttuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 102:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 102:2"/>Guyyaa rakkinna kiyyaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:2">fuula keeti na hin dhoffatin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:2">gurra keeti gara kiyya deebifadhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:2">yennaa ani si waamu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:2">ariifadhuu deebii naaf kenni.<verse eid="PSA 102:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 102:3"/>Barri jiruu tiyyaa akka aaraa dabariisatti jira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:3">lafeen tiyya akka barbada ibiddaa gubatiisatti jirti.<verse eid="PSA 102:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 102:4"/>Gadhaan kiyya madowee akka marraa waan qooreef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:4">sagalee nyaatiisa dadhabe.<verse eid="PSA 102:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 102:5"/>Qoonqoo ol qabadhee waan aaduuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:5">lafeen tiyya gogaa kiyyatti maxxante.<verse eid="PSA 102:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 102:6"/>Ani akka huummoo goomolee keessaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:6">akka urunguu waan diigame oddu'uu te'e.<verse eid="PSA 102:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 102:7"/>Hirriiba malee irkadhee bula;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:7">ani akka sinbirree qofi-galeettii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:7">guutuu manaa irra jirtuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 102:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 102:8"/>Guyyaa mara diinoti kiyya natti murgan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:8">worri natti cooru</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:8">maqaa kiyya maqaa abaarsaa godhatan.<verse eid="PSA 102:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 102:9"/>Ani daadhaa akka sagale'ee nyaadhe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:9">imimmaan waan unu woliin wolitti makadhe.<verse eid="PSA 102:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 102:10"/>Mufii teeti guddoo irraa ta kaate,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:10">ati ol na fuutee gad na gatte.<verse eid="PSA 102:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 102:11"/>Barri jiruu tiyyaa akka gaaddisa galgalaa dabara;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:11">ani akka marraa qoora.<verse eid="PSA 102:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 102:12"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:12">ati haga bara baraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:12">barcumaa mootumma'aa keeti irra teetta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:12">maqaan keeti dhalootaa haga dhalootaatitti hin jiraata.<verse eid="PSA 102:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 102:13"/>Yennaan ati isi'iif gadhaa laattu amma waan dhutteef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:13">ati hin kaata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:13">Xiyoon hin mararta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:13">yennaan murtootte dhutteerti.<verse eid="PSA 102:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 102:14"/>Tajaajiltooti teeti dhakoota isi'iituu hin jaalatan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:14">bututaa isi'ii ka diigameefuu gadhaa laafan.<verse eid="PSA 102:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 102:15"/>Gosi biyya adda addaa maqaa Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:15">moototi lafaa marti ulfinna isaa hin sodaatan.<verse eid="PSA 102:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 102:16"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa Xiyoon deebisee hin ijaara;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:16">inni ulfinna ifiitiin hin mudhata.<verse eid="PSA 102:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 102:17"/>Inni daadimata worra deegaa hin dhage'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:17">gaaffii isaaniille hin tuffatu.<verse eid="PSA 102:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 102:18"/>Kolbaan amma hin dhalatin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:18">akka Mootii Waan Maraa leellittu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:18">wonni kun dhaloota dhufuuf barreeffantuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 102:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 102:19"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:19">addee woyyittii gubba'aa irraa gad ilaale;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:19">ol-gubbaa tee'ee lafa ilaale.<verse eid="PSA 102:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 102:20"/>Inni aadiisa worra hidhameeruu dhage'e;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:20">worra duuti itti murante bilisa baase.<verse eid="PSA 102:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 102:21"/>Tanaaf maqaan Mootii Waan Maraa Xiyoon keessatti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:21">leellifamiisi isaa Yerusaalem keessatti laffama.<verse eid="PSA 102:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 102:22"/>Tunille yennaa gosi biyya adda addaatii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:22">mootummooti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:22">Mootii Waan Maraa waaqonfatiisaaf wolitti qabamanu teeti.<verse eid="PSA 102:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 102:23"/>Adoo ani dargaggeessaatuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:23">inni jabeenna kiyya casseera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:23">bara jiruu tiyyalle gabaasseera.<verse eid="PSA 102:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 102:24"/>Maarre ani, «Ee Waaqa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:24">ka barri keeti dhalootaa gara dhalootaatitti dabaru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:24">wodhakkaa bara jiruu tiyyaatitti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:24">na hin fudhatin» jedhe.<verse eid="PSA 102:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 102:25"/>Dur ati lafa dadde;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:25">ol-gubbaalle hujii harka keetii ti.<verse eid="PSA 102:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 102:26"/>Isaan hin badan; ati ammoo hin leeta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:26">isaan akka woya'aa hin dullooman;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:26">ati akka uffanaa isaan hin jijjiirta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:26">isaanille hin gataman.<verse eid="PSA 102:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 102:27"/>Ati ammoo yennaa mara sanuma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:27">barri keetiille dhuma hin qabu.<verse eid="PSA 102:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 102:28"/>Ijoolleen tajaajiltoota teetii nageyaan hin le'an;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:28">sanyiin isaaniille fuula keeti dura jabaatanee hin le'an.<verse eid="PSA 102:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 102"/>
  <chapter number="103" style="c" sid="PSA 103"/>
  <para style="s1">Jaalala Waaqaa</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Daawitii.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 103:1"/>Ee lubbuu tiyya Mootii Waan Maraa leellisi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:1">keessi kiyya duudiin maqaa isaa woyyicha leellisi.<verse eid="PSA 103:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 103:2"/>Ee lubbuu tiyya Mootii Waan Maraa leellisi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:2">waan dansaa inni godhe mara hin dedhin.<verse eid="PSA 103:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 103:3"/>Ka cubbuu teeti mara si'iif araaramu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:3">ka dhukkuba keeti mara fayyisu,<verse eid="PSA 103:3"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 103:4"/>ka jiruu teeti awwaalamuu irraa wodu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:4">ka jaalala bara baraatii fi marartii sii kennu,<verse eid="PSA 103:4"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 103:5"/>dargaggummaan teeti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:5">akka risa'aa akka haareffantu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:5">ka jiruu teeti waan dansa'aan quussu isa.<verse eid="PSA 103:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 103:6"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa worra cunqurfame maraaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:6">balchumma'aa fi haqaan huja.<verse eid="PSA 103:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 103:7"/>Inni karaa ifii Muuse'etti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:7">hujii ifii kolbaa Israa'eliititti beessise.<verse eid="PSA 103:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 103:8"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:8">mararti'ii fi araaraan ka guutame,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:8">ka aari'iif hin ariifannee fi ka jaalala guddaa qabu.<verse eid="PSA 103:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 103:9"/>Inni yennaa mara yakkaa teenna hin laakkowu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:9">haga bara baraa aari'iin hin turu.<verse eid="PSA 103:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 103:10"/>Inni akka cubbuu teennaatitti nu irratti hin huju;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:10">akka yakkaa teennaatitti gatii nu'uuf hin kaffalle.<verse eid="PSA 103:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 103:11"/>Akkuma ol-gubbaan lafa irraa ol fagaattu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:11">worra isa sodaatuuf jaalalli isaa ka bara baraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:11">akka malee gudda'a.<verse eid="PSA 103:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 103:12"/>Akkuma garri aduun baatu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:12">gara aduun seentu irraa fagaatu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:12">inni cubbuu teenna nu irraa fageessa.<verse eid="PSA 103:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 103:13"/>Akkuma abbaan ijoollee ifiitiif gadhaa laafu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:13">maarre Mootiin Waan Maraalle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:13">worra isa sodaatuuf gadhaa laafa.<verse eid="PSA 103:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 103:14"/>Inni attam akka nuuti dadanne waan beekuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:14">biyyee akka teene hin qaabata.<verse eid="PSA 103:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 103:15"/>Barri jiruu namaa akkuma marraa ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:15">akkuma daraaraa badda'aa hin daraara.<verse eid="PSA 103:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 103:16"/>Yennaa qilleensi dhowu daraaraan hin bada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:16">addeen isaalle deebi'ee hin beekkamu.<verse eid="PSA 103:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 103:17"/>Jaalalli bara baraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:17">ka Mootii Waan Maraa ammoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:17">bara baraa haga bara baraatitti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:17">worra isa sodaatu woliin hin jiraata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:17">balchummaan isaalle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:17">ijoollee ijoollee isaa woliin hin jiraatti.<verse eid="PSA 103:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 103:18"/>Kunille worra gondooroo isaa eegatanuu fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:18">worra ajaja isaa muummessiisaaf qaabatanuuf te'a.<verse eid="PSA 103:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 103:19"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:19">barcumaa mootummaa ifii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:19">ol-gubbaa keessatti jabeessee dhaabbateera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:19">mootummaan isaa waan mara bulchiti.<verse eid="PSA 103:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 103:20"/>Isin ergantooti Waaqaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:20">worri jajannooti jajjabooti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:20">ka jecha isaatiif ajajantanee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:20">waan inni jedhu gootanu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:20">Mootii Waan Maraa leellisa'a.<verse eid="PSA 103:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 103:21"/>Isin loltooti ol-gubba'aa marti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:21">tajaajiltooti isaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:21">worri fedhii isaa muummessitanu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:21">Mootii Waan Maraa leellisa'a.<verse eid="PSA 103:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 103:22"/>Wonni inni dade marti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:22">mootummaa isaa keessa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:22">addee jirtanu maratti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:22">Mootii Waan Maraa leellisa'a.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:22">Ee lubbuu tiyya Mootii Waan Maraa leellisi.<verse eid="PSA 103:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 103"/>
  <chapter number="104" style="c" sid="PSA 104"/>
  <para style="s1">Leellisa Abbaa Dadaatiif Dhikaate</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 104:1"/>Ee lubbuu tiyya, Mootii Waan Maraa leellisi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:1">Ee Mootii Waan Maraa Waaqa kiyya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:1">ati attam attam gudda'a!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:1">Ulfinnaa fi arnya uffatteerta.<verse eid="PSA 104:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 104:2"/>Ati ifa akka woya'aa ifitti maratte;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:2">ol-gubbaa akka dunkaani'ii diriirsite.<verse eid="PSA 104:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 104:3"/>Ati utubaa mana keetii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:3">bisaan ol-gubba'aa irra dhaabbachiitte;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:3">duumensa garreettaa fardaan harkifamu godhatte;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:3">koola qilleensaa irra teettee gulutte.<verse eid="PSA 104:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 104:4"/>Ati qilleensa ergamaa keeti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:4">bobe'a ibiddaa tajaajilaa keeti godhatte.<verse eid="PSA 104:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 104:5"/>Akka isiin ijjumaa hin raafanne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:5">ati lafa hundee isi'ii irratti dhaabbachiitte.<verse eid="PSA 104:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 104:6"/>Abbaayaa akka woya'aa lafatti uffitte;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:6">bisaan gaarota golle.<verse eid="PSA 104:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 104:7"/>Yennaa ati xixxe, bisaan baqate;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:7">qoonqoo mandiisu'uu teeti yennaa dhage'e dheete.<verse eid="PSA 104:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 104:8"/>Gaarota gubbaa dhangala'ee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:8">gad dhooqa keessa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:8">gara addee ati isaaf qopheessitee dhaqe.<verse eid="PSA 104:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 104:9"/>Akka deebi'ee lafa hin golline,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:9">meessaa inni dande'ee hin dabarre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:9">ati isaaf goote.<verse eid="PSA 104:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 104:10"/>Ati maddi dhooqa keessa akka yaa'u goote;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:10">isaan koobota wodhakkaa yaa'an.<verse eid="PSA 104:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 104:11"/>Bineensoti isaan unan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:11">harreen diidaalle untee dheebuu baati.<verse eid="PSA 104:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 104:12"/>Sinbirrooti bisaan san biratti mana ijaarratan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:12">isaan dameelee oddu'uu wocan.<verse eid="PSA 104:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 104:13"/>Gubbaa irraa bokkeyaan gaarota bisaan obaatta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:13">lattille waan ati hujjeen guutanti.<verse eid="PSA 104:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 104:14"/>Marri hori'iif akka latu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:14">namaafille sagalee waan te'uuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:14">lafa irraa midhaan akka latu goota.<verse eid="PSA 104:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 104:15"/>Woyniin gadhaa namaa akka gammachiittu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:15">zayitiin fuula namaa akka cululussitu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:15">sagaleen akka nama jabeessitu goota.<verse eid="PSA 104:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 104:16"/>Mukooti Mootii Waan Maraa birbirsooti Libaanonii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:16">ka inni dhaabe bisaan guddaa dhaggatan.<verse eid="PSA 104:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 104:17"/>Sinbirrooti isaan keessatti mana ijaarratan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:17">qongaan birbirsa irratti hin gala.<verse eid="PSA 104:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 104:18"/>Gaaroti dhedheeraan ka goda'aa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">104:18 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Godaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bineensa re'ee fakkaatu ka gaara irra le'u.</char></note> ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:18">holli rassa'aa lafa osoleen itti baqattu.<verse eid="PSA 104:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 104:19"/>Ji'a yennaa akka gargar baasuuf dadde;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:19">aduulle yennaa seensuma ifii hin beetti.<verse eid="PSA 104:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 104:20"/>Ati dukkana dadde; isiin halkan teeti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:20">yennaa san bineensoti badda'aa luuxanee bayan.<verse eid="PSA 104:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 104:21"/>Neenqoti dardarooti adamo'oof dhangaa dhowan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:21">sagalee ifii Waaqa irraa barbaadatan.<verse eid="PSA 104:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 104:22"/>Yennaa aduun baatu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:22">deebi'anee mandhee ifii keessa ciisan.<verse eid="PSA 104:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 104:23"/>Achiin duuba nami gara hujii ifii bayee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:23">haga galgalaatitti hujii ifii huja.<verse eid="PSA 104:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 104:24"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:24">hujiin teeti attam attam baca'a!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:24">Ati isaan mara qarumma'aan daddeerta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:24">latti waan ati daddeen guutanteerti.<verse eid="PSA 104:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 104:25"/>Kunoo, abbaayaan guddittiin guddo'oo fi badhoon achi jirti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:25">bineensi didiqqa'aa fi gugurdaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:25">wonni lubbuu qabu bindillaan achi keessa jiran.<verse eid="PSA 104:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 104:26"/>Abbaayaa san irra hobolooti gugurdoon hin ideeman;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:26">bineensi naacha fakkaatu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:26">ka «Lewaataan» jedhamu achi keessa taphata.<verse eid="PSA 104:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 104:27"/>Sagalee yenna'aan akka isaaniif kennitu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:27">isaan kun marti si eeggatan.<verse eid="PSA 104:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 104:28"/>Yennaa ati isaaniif kennitu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:28">isaan wolitti qabatan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:28">yennaa ati harka keeti isaaniif diriirsitu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:28">isaan waan dansaa hin quufan.<verse eid="PSA 104:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 104:29"/>Yennaa ati isaan irraa garagaltu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:29">isaan guddoo sodaatan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:29">yennaa ati hafuura isaanii isaan keessaa fudhatu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:29">isaan hin du'an;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:29">gara biyye'ee hin deebi'an.<verse eid="PSA 104:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 104:30"/>Yennaa ati hafuura keeti itti baafatu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:30">isaan hin dadaman;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:30">ati lafa deebittee haareya goota.<verse eid="PSA 104:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 104:31"/>Ulfinni Mootii Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:31">haga bara baraa jiraatuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:31">Mootiin Waan Maraa hujii ifiitiin gammaduu ti.<verse eid="PSA 104:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 104:32"/>Inni ilaalchaan ka lafa rommisiisu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:32">tuqiisaan gaara keessaa ka aara baasu.<verse eid="PSA 104:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 104:33"/>Ani bara jiruu tiyyaa mara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:33">Mootii Waan Maraatiif hin faarsa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:33">ani haga jiru mara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:33">Waaqa kiyya faaru'uun hin leellisa.<verse eid="PSA 104:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 104:34"/>Yaadi gadhaa kiyyaa isa gammachiisuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:34">ani Mootii Waan Maraatiin hin gammada.<verse eid="PSA 104:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 104:35"/>Cubbaaleyiin lafa irraa badanuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:35">hamaaleyyiin haganaa achi hin jiraatin.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 104:35"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 104:35">Ee lubbuu tiyya Mootii Waan Maraa leellisi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:35">Mootii Waan Maraa leellisa'a.<verse eid="PSA 104:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 104"/>
  <chapter number="105" style="c" sid="PSA 105"/>
  <para style="s1">Baasa Waaqi Kolbaa Israa'eliitiif Godhe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 16:8-22">1 Dab. 16:8-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 105:1"/>Mootii Waan Maraa galateeffadha'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:1">maqaa isaa waammadha'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:1">waan inni huje</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:1">gosa biyya adda addaa oddu'utti beessisa'a.<verse eid="PSA 105:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 105:2"/>Isa faarfadha'a; faaru'uun isa leellisa'a.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:2">Waan bilbaasa inni huje mara odeessa'a.<verse eid="PSA 105:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 105:3"/>Maqaa isaa woyyichaan ifi jaja'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:3">gadhaan worra Mootii Waan Maraa barbaaduu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:3">gammadee firinxiixuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 105:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 105:4"/>Mootii Waan Maraatii fi jabeenna isaa barbaada'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:4">yennaa mara fuula isaa barbaada'a.<verse eid="PSA 105:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 105:5"/>Hujii baasaa ta inni huje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:5">bilbaasota, muraa inni kennelle qaabadha'a;<verse eid="PSA 105:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 105:6"/>Isin ijoolleen Abrahaamii tajaajilaa isaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:6">isin ilmaan Yaaqoobii worri isaaf filatantane</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:6">tana qaabadha'a.<verse eid="PSA 105:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 105:7"/>Inni Mootii Waan Maraa Waaqa keenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:7">inni biyya lafaa duudi'itti mura.<verse eid="PSA 105:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 105:8"/>Inni gondooroo ifii haga bara baraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:8">jecha ifii ka ajaje</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:8">haga dhaloota kumaatitti hin dedhu.<verse eid="PSA 105:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 105:9"/>Inni gondooroo Abrahaam woliin gondoore,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:9">kakuu Yisihaqiif kakate hin dedhu.<verse eid="PSA 105:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 105:10"/>Tun Yaaqoobiif Seerata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:10">Israa'eliif gondooroo bara baraa akka teetuuf jabeessee,<verse eid="PSA 105:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 105:11"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa, «Qooda ati dhaaltu akka teetu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:11">ani lafa Kana'aanii si'iif hin kenna» jedhe.<verse eid="PSA 105:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 105:12"/>Yennaa san laakkossi kolbaa Waaqaa hin bacanne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:12">isaan laakkossaan worra diqqaa, biyya ormaatitti galee,<verse eid="PSA 105:12"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 105:13"/>gosa biyya tokkoo irraa gara gosa biyya tokkoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:13">mootummaa tokko irraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:13">gara kolbaa dhibi'ii asii fi achi worra daaqaa ture.<verse eid="PSA 105:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 105:14"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa ammoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:14">nami tokkolle akka isaan cunqursu hin goone;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:14">inni isaaniif jedhee mootota xixee,<verse eid="PSA 105:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 105:15"/>«Worra ani muudadhe hin tuqina'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:15">raagota tiyya hin miidhina'a» jedhe.<verse eid="PSA 105:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 105:16"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa lafa irratti beela buuse;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:16">sagalee isaanii mara balleesse.<verse eid="PSA 105:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 105:17"/>Ammoo inni namicha tokko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:17">ka garbicha te'ee gurgurame,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:17">Yoseef isaaniin dura erge.<verse eid="PSA 105:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 105:18"/>Isaan wodaroo sibiilaa miila isaatitti keyanee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:18">wodaroo sibiilaatiin hidhane.<verse eid="PSA 105:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 105:19"/>Wonni Yoseef dursee dubbate haga muummottutti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:19">jechi Mootii Waan Maraa haga isa ilaale.<verse eid="PSA 105:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 105:20"/>Mootichi biyya Gibxi'ii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:20">ka gosa biyya adda addaa bulchu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:20">nama ergee isa hiikisiisee, bilisa isa baase.<verse eid="PSA 105:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 105:21"/>Inni mana ifii irratti goottaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:21">qabeenna ifii mara irratti bulchaa isa godhate.<verse eid="PSA 105:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 105:22"/>Qondaaltota mootichaa akka fedhe akka gorsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:22">gorsitoota mootichaalle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:22">qarummaa akka barsiisu godhe.<verse eid="PSA 105:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 105:23"/>Achiin duuba Israa'el gara biyya Gibxi'ii dhaqee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:23">maatiin Yaaqoobii biyya Kaamiititti alagaa teete.<verse eid="PSA 105:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 105:24"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa kolbaa ifii baceessee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:24">diinota isaanii caalaa isaan jabeesse.<verse eid="PSA 105:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 105:25"/>Worri Gibxi'ii akka kolbaa isaa jibbitu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:25">tajaajiltoota isaatitti mala akka dhoottu godhe.<verse eid="PSA 105:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 105:26"/>Achiin duuba inni tajaajilaa ifii Muuse'ee fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:26">Aaronii ifii filate erge.<verse eid="PSA 105:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 105:27"/>Isaan beessisa bilbaasa isaa worra Gibxi'ii oddu'utti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:27">waan maade'ee lafa kaamii keessatti hujane.<verse eid="PSA 105:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 105:28"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:28">dukkana ergee lafa dukkaneesse;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:28">worri Gibxi'ii ammoo waan inni jedhe mormane.<verse eid="PSA 105:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 105:29"/>Inni bisaan isaanii gara dhiigaa jijjiiree,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:29">qurxummii isaaniille akka du'anu godhe.<verse eid="PSA 105:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 105:30"/>Biyya isaanii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:30">kolloon moototaalle adoo hin hafin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:30">raachi keessa guute.<verse eid="PSA 105:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 105:31"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa dubbannaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:31">faachii fi bookeen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:31">biyya isaanii duudii keessa dhufane.<verse eid="PSA 105:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 105:32"/>Bokkeya isaanii bokkeya dhaka'aa godhee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:32">lafa isaanii maratti mandiisuu buuse.<verse eid="PSA 105:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 105:33"/>Woynii isaaniitii fi harruu isaanii balleessee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:33">muka lafa isaanii butuche.<verse eid="PSA 105:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 105:34"/>Inni dubbannaan awwaannisi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:34">korophiis laakkowanee hin dandeenne dhufane.<verse eid="PSA 105:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 105:35"/>Isaan waan bisilee lafa isaanii keessaa mara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:35">midhaan lafa isaaniille nyaatane.<verse eid="PSA 105:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 105:36"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:36">biyya Gibxi'ii keessaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:36">angafa te'ee ka dhalate mara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:36">ilma isaanii angaficha mara ijjeese.<verse eid="PSA 105:36"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 105:37"/>Achiin duuba inni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:37">Israa'elooti meeti'ii fi worqii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:37">fudhatanee akka bayanu godhe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:37">gosa isaanii keessaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:37">tokkolle nami duubatti hafe hin jiru.<verse eid="PSA 105:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 105:38"/>Worri Gibxi'ii guddoo waan isaan sodaataneef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:38">yennaa Israa'elooti bayanu gammadane.<verse eid="PSA 105:38"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 105:39"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:39">akka golla'aa duumensa diriirsee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:39">halkan ifa akka isaanii kennu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:39">ibidda isaaniif qopheesse.<verse eid="PSA 105:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 105:40"/>Isaan gaafannaan inni barbadi-kille isaaniif fide;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:40">ol-gubbaa irraa sagalee isaanii kennee isaan quusse.<verse eid="PSA 105:40"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 105:41"/>Inni rassaa dhoosee, bisaan keessaa lola'ee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:41">akka lagaa goomolee keessa yaa'e.<verse eid="PSA 105:41"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 105:42"/>Inni addii ifii woyyittii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:42">tajaajilaa ifii Abrahaamiif kenne qaabate.<verse eid="PSA 105:42"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 105:43"/>Inni kolbaa ifii gammadaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:43">worra isaaf filame ililleetti'iin akka bayanu godhe.<verse eid="PSA 105:43"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 105:44"/>Inni lafa gosa biyya adda addaa isaaniif kenne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:44">maarre isaan lafa worri dhibiin itti elowe fudhatane.<verse eid="PSA 105:44"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 105:45"/>Tunille akka isaan seerata isaatii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:45">seera isaa eegatanuuf teete.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 105:45"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 105:45">Mootii Waan Maraa leellisa'a.<verse eid="PSA 105:45"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 105"/>
  <chapter number="106" style="c" sid="PSA 106"/>
  <para style="s1">Arjummaa Mootiin Waan Maraa Kolbaa Ifiititti Mudhise</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 106:1"/>Mootii Waan Maraa leellisa'a!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:1">Inni dansaa waan te'eef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:1">haga bara baraa kolbaa waan jaalatuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:1">Mootii Waan Maraa galateessa'a!<verse eid="PSA 106:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 106:2"/>Hujii gugurdoo Mootii Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:2">eentu lallabee dande'a?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:2">Yookiin leellisa isaa mara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:2">eentu lassee dande'a?<verse eid="PSA 106:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 106:3"/>Worri haqa eegu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:3">worri yennaa mara balchumma'aan huju</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:3">ka gammade.<verse eid="PSA 106:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 106:4"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:4">yennaa kolbaa teetiif waan dansaa gootu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:4">na qaabadhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:4">yennaa isaan baachu analle qarqaar.<verse eid="PSA 106:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 106:5"/>Duroomiisa worra si'iif filamee akka dhaggu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:5">gammadiisa kolbaa teetiitiin akka gammadu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:5">kolbaa teeti woliin akka si leellisu na godhi.<verse eid="PSA 106:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 106:6"/>Akkuma abbootii teennaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:6">nuutille cubbuu hunyeerra;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:6">balleessineerra; waan hantuulle gooneerra.<verse eid="PSA 106:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 106:7"/>Abbootiin teenna yennaa biyya Gibxi'ii jirtu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:7">hujii teeti ta baasaa hin hubanne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:7">gadhi-laafummaa teeti hin qaabanne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:7">isaan abbaayaa diintuu biratti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:7">si irratti ka'ane.<verse eid="PSA 106:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 106:8"/>Te'uu malee, Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:8">hunna ifii jadduu mudhisiisaaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:8">maqaa ifiitiif jedhee isaan baase.<verse eid="PSA 106:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 106:9"/>Inni abbaayaa diintuu xixee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:9">isiille godde;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:9">inni qilee keessa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:9">akka goomolee keessaa isaan sooresse.<verse eid="PSA 106:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 106:10"/>Inni harka nyaapha isaanii keessaa isaan baasee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:10">harka diinota isaanii keessaa isaan wode.<verse eid="PSA 106:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 106:11"/>Bisaan diinota isaanii irra garagale;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:11">isaan keessaa tokkolle hin hanne.<verse eid="PSA 106:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 106:12"/>Achiin duuba kolbaan jecha isaa dhugeeffatte;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:12">faaruu leellisaa isaaf faarsane.<verse eid="PSA 106:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 106:13"/>Te'uu malee, isaan yoosuma waan inni huje dedhane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:13">gorsa isaalle hin eeganne.<verse eid="PSA 106:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 106:14"/>Isaan gammoojjii keessatti sagalee dharra'ane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:14">goomolee keessatti Waaqa haga ilaalane.<verse eid="PSA 106:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 106:15"/>Inni waan isaan gaafatane isaaniif kenne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:15">ammoo dhukkuba isaan golgoleessu itti fide.<verse eid="PSA 106:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 106:16"/>Isaan addee quttumaa san keessatti Muuse'ee fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:16">woyyicha Mootii Waan Maraa Aaron hinaafane.<verse eid="PSA 106:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 106:17"/>Latti gargar baqaxxee Daataan liqinsitee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:17">waa'eloota Abiiraamiille'etti cufante.<verse eid="PSA 106:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 106:18"/>Worra isaan hordofu oddu'utti ibiddi gabbate;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:18">bobe'i ibidda sanii worra hamaaleyyii muxuqi godhe.<verse eid="PSA 106:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 106:19"/>Isaan gaara Horeebiititti jabbii hujanee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:19">waaqa dharaa san waaqonfatane.<verse eid="PSA 106:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 106:20"/>Isaan Waaqa ulfaataa ifii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:20">fakkii horii marra dheeduutiin jijjiirane.<verse eid="PSA 106:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 106:21"/>Isaan Waaqaa isaan baase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:21">ka biyya Gibxi'ii keessatti waan gugurdoo huje,<verse eid="PSA 106:21"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 106:22"/>hujii bilbaasaa ta inni biyya Kaamii keessatti huje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:22">waan maade'ee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:22">ta inni abbaayaa diintuu biratti huje dedhane.<verse eid="PSA 106:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 106:23"/>Maarre Waaqi silaa isaan hin balleessa jedheeraayyu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:23">Muuseen inni filate sun ammoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:23">mufii isaa ta isaan balleessitu isaan irraa deebisiisaaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:23">odduu seenee fuula isaa dura dhaabbate.<verse eid="PSA 106:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 106:24"/>Achiin duuba isaan lafa dansaa Kana'aanii san tuffatanee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:24">addii Waaqi isaaniif kenne hin dhugeeffanne.<verse eid="PSA 106:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 106:25"/>Isaan dunkaanii ifii keessatti gungumane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:25">Mootii Waan Maraatiifille hin ajajanne.<verse eid="PSA 106:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 106:26"/>Tanaaf inni harka ol fudhatee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:26">goomolee keessatti akka isaan du'anu kakatee,<verse eid="PSA 106:26"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 106:27"/>sanyiin isaanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:27">gosa biyya adda addaa oddu'utti akka duutu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:27">lafa mara keessa isaan bittinneesse.<verse eid="PSA 106:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 106:28"/>Isaan waaqa, «Ba'aal Phe'or» jedhamu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:28">waaqonfatiisaan qabamanee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:28">ciincaa waaqota lubbuu hin qanneef dhikaatelle nyaatane.<verse eid="PSA 106:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 106:29"/>Isaan hujii ifiitiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:29">Mootii Waan Maraa tuttuqanee aarsanee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:29">odduu ifiititti balaa buusane.<verse eid="PSA 106:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 106:30"/>Fiinehaas ammoo ka'ee worra yakkaa huje adabee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:30">balaan sun dhaabbate.<verse eid="PSA 106:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 106:31"/>Wonni inni tolche sun dhalootaa haga dhalootaatitti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:31">yennaa mara akka balchumma'aatitti isaaf laakkowatante.<verse eid="PSA 106:31"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 106:32"/>Bisaan Mariiba'aa biratti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:32">isaan Mootii Waan Maraa aarsane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:32">sababa waan isaan hujaneetiif</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:32">Muuseen rakkate.<verse eid="PSA 106:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 106:33"/>Isaan akka malee waan Muusee aarsaneeranuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:33">inni dubbii dubbii hin teene dubbate.<verse eid="PSA 106:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 106:34"/>Akka Mootiin Waan Maraa isaan ajajetti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:34">isaan gosa biyya adda addaa hin balleessine.<verse eid="PSA 106:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 106:35"/>Ammoo gosa biyya adda addaa woliin makamanee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:35">aadaa isaanii baratane.<verse eid="PSA 106:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 106:36"/>Isaan waaqota dharaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:36">ka tiyyoo isaanitti te'e waaqonfatane.<verse eid="PSA 106:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 106:37"/>Isaan ilmaan ifiitii fi ijoollee durraa ta ifii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:37">durriisotaaf ciincessane.<verse eid="PSA 106:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 106:38"/>Isaan waaqota dharaa ka worra Kana'aaniitiif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:38">dhiiga ilmaan ifiitii fi ijoollee durraa ta ifii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:38">ta yakkaa hin qanne dhangalaasane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:38">lattille dhiigaan battootte.<verse eid="PSA 106:38"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 106:39"/>Akkasiin isaan hujii ifiitiin battowanee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:39">akka gaarayyeeffattootaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:39">Waaqaaf addatamummaa dhabane.<verse eid="PSA 106:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 106:40"/>Tanaaf Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:40">kolbaa ifiititti aaree bobe'ee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:40">isaan diqate.<verse eid="PSA 106:40"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 106:41"/>Inni harka gosa biyya adda addaatitti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:41">dabarsee isaan kennee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:41">diinoti isaanii bulchitoota isaanii te'ane.<verse eid="PSA 106:41"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 106:42"/>Diinoti isaanii isaan cunqursanee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:42">isaan baallii isaanii jala galane.<verse eid="PSA 106:42"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 106:43"/>Inni yennaa hedduu isaan baase;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:43">isaan ammoo finqiliisatti jabaatanee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:43">yakkaa ifiitiin salphatane.<verse eid="PSA 106:43"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 106:44"/>Te'uu malee, yennaa iyya isaanii dhage'e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:44">inni rakkinna isaanii ilaale.<verse eid="PSA 106:44"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 106:45"/>Isaaniif jedhee inni gondooroo ifii qaabate;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:45">sababa jaalala guddaa ifiitiif</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:45">isaaniif naye.<verse eid="PSA 106:45"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 106:46"/>Worri isaan booji'e marti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:46">akka isaaniif nayanu godhe.<verse eid="PSA 106:46"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 106:47"/>Nuuti maqaa keeti woyyicha akka galateeffannuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:47">si leellisiisaan akka ulfinna sii kenninuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:47">ee Mootii Waan Maraa Waaqa keenna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:47">ati nu baasi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:47">gosa biyya adda addaa keessaa wolitti nu qabi.<verse eid="PSA 106:47"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 106:48"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa Waaqi Israa'elii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:48">bara baraa haga bara baraa leellifamuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:48">kolbaan marti «Ameen» jettuu ti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 106:48">Mootii Waan Maraa leellisa'a.<verse eid="PSA 106:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 106"/>
  <chapter number="107" style="c" sid="PSA 107"/>
  <para style="ms">Kitaaba Shaneesso'oo</para>
  <para style="mr">(<ref loc="PSA 107-150">Far. 107—150</ref>)</para>
  <para style="s1">Rakkoo Hedduu Keessaa Waan Baaseef Galata Waaqaaf Dhikaatu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 107:1"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa dansaa waan te'eef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:1">inni haga bara baraa kolbaa waan jaalatuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:1">isa galateeffadha'a.<verse eid="PSA 107:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 107:2"/>Worri Mootiin Waan Maraa wode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:2">ka inni harka diinaa jalaa wode,<verse eid="PSA 107:2"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 107:3"/>ka inni lafa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:3">karaa aduun baatuu fi seentu irraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:3">kaabaa fi kibba irraa wolitti qabe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:3">isa galateeffadha'a.<verse eid="PSA 107:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 107:4"/>Worri gariin goomolee duwwaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:4">lafa womaa keessa hin jirre keessa daaqane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:4">karaa gara qachaa keessa qubatanu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:4">isaan geessu irraa miliqane.<verse eid="PSA 107:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 107:5"/>Isaan beelotaanee dheebotane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:5">addiille kutatane.<verse eid="PSA 107:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 107:6"/>Achiin duuba isaan rakkinna ifii keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:6">gara Mootii Waan Maraa iyyane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:6">innille rakkinna guddaa isaanii jalaa isaan baase.<verse eid="PSA 107:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 107:7"/>Inni gara qachaa isaan keessa qubatanuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:7">karaa qajeelaa irra isaan sooresse.<verse eid="PSA 107:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 107:8"/>Jaalala isaa ka bara baraatiif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:8">waan bilbaasaa ka inni ilmaan namaatiif godheef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:8">isaan Mootii Waan Maraa galateeffatanuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 107:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 107:9"/>Inni worra dheebote dheebuu baasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:9">worra beelotelle waan dansa'aan quussa.<verse eid="PSA 107:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 107:10"/>Worri gariin dukkanaa fi dimma keessa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:10">wodaroo sibiilaatiin hidhamanee le'ane.<verse eid="PSA 107:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 107:11"/>Sababille isaan jecha Waaqaa mormanee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:11">gorsa Waaqa Ol Aana'aa tuffatane.<verse eid="PSA 107:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 107:12"/>Maarre inni hujii dadhassiittu'uun gad isaan qabe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:12">isaan gad jigane; ka isaan qarqaarulle hin jiru.<verse eid="PSA 107:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 107:13"/>Achiin duuba isaan rakkinna ifii keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:13">gara Mootii Waan Maraa iyyane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:13">innille rakkinna guddaa isaanii jalaa isaan baase.<verse eid="PSA 107:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 107:14"/>Inni dukkanaa fi dimma keessaa isaan baasee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:14">wodaroo sibiilaa ta ittiin hidhamane kukkute.<verse eid="PSA 107:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 107:15"/>Jaalala isaa ka bara baraatiif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:15">waan bilbaasaa ka inni ilmaan namaatii godheef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:15">isaan Mootii Waan Maraa galateeffatanuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 107:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 107:16"/>Inni balbala sageettu'uu caccasse;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:16">danqaraa sibiilaa adda lamatti qurxe.<verse eid="PSA 107:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 107:17"/>Worri gariin karaa cubbu'uu waan deemaneef</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:17">gowwoomanee, sababa yakkaa ifiitiifille farrane.<verse eid="PSA 107:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 107:18"/>Isaan sagalee mara diqatanee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:18">du'iisa geyane.<verse eid="PSA 107:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 107:19"/>Achiin duuba isaan rakkinna ifii keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:19">gara Mootii Waan Maraa iyyane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:19">innille rakkinna guddaa isaanii jalaa isaan baase.<verse eid="PSA 107:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 107:20"/>Inni jecha ifii ergee isaan fayyise;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:20">du'iisa irraa isaan hambure.<verse eid="PSA 107:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 107:21"/>Jaalala isaa ka bara baraatiif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:21">waan bilbaasaa ka inni ilmaan namaatii godheef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:21">isaan Mootii Waan Maraa galateeffatanuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 107:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 107:22"/>Ciincaa galataa dhikeessanuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:22">faaruu gammadaatiin hujii isaa odeessanuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 107:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 107:23"/>Worri gariin hobolootaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:23">abbaayaa irra deemaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:23">bisaan guddaa irra daldalatan.<verse eid="PSA 107:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 107:24"/>Isaan waan Mootiin Waan Maraa godhu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:24">bilbaasa inni qilee abbaayaa gudditti'ii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:24">keessatti huju dhaggane.<verse eid="PSA 107:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 107:25"/>Inni ajajee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:25">hobonbolattii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:25">danbalii abbaaya'aa ol fuutu kaase.<verse eid="PSA 107:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 107:26"/>Isaan gara ol-gubba'aa ol ka'anee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:26">gara qile'ee gad bu'ane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:26">rakkinna keessalle'etti addii kutatane.<verse eid="PSA 107:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 107:27"/>Isaan akka nama machowee loollowanee tintimane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:27">waan godhanulle wollaalane.<verse eid="PSA 107:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 107:28"/>Achiin duuba isaan rakkinna ifii keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:28">gara Mootii Waan Maraa iyyane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:28">innille rakkinna isaanii keessaa isaan baase.<verse eid="PSA 107:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 107:29"/>Inni hobonbolattii sarmisiisee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:29">danbaliille cadhi godhe.<verse eid="PSA 107:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 107:30"/>Isaan danbaliin waan cadhitteef gammadanee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:30">innille gara buufata hoboloo gudditti'ii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:30">ta isaan bira geyiisaaf fedhanee isaan geesse.<verse eid="PSA 107:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 107:31"/>Jaalala isaa ka bara baraatiif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:31">waan bilbaasaa ka inni ilmaan namaatii godheef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:31">isaan Mootii Waan Maraa galateeffatanuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 107:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 107:32"/>Isaan wolde'a kolba'aa keessatti isa saadanuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:32">yaa'ii maanguddo'oo keessalle'etti isa leellisanuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 107:32"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 107:33"/>Inni laga gara goomole'ee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:33">madda bisaanii gara lafa godddu'uu jijjiire.<verse eid="PSA 107:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 107:34"/>Sababa worra hamoolee isii irra le'uutiif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:34">lafa midhaan baachu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:34">akka lafa booqee sooddaa ta midhaan hin baanyee godhe.<verse eid="PSA 107:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 107:35"/>Inni goomolee gara baleessa bisaanii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:35">lafa godduulle gara madda bisaanii jijjiire.<verse eid="PSA 107:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 107:36"/>Inni worri beelowaan akka achi qubatanu godhe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:36">isaanille qachaa keessa le'anu ijaarratane.<verse eid="PSA 107:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 107:37"/>Isaan ficha'atti midhaan facaafatanee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:37">muka woyni'ii dhaabbatane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:37">midhaan bacaalle galfatane.<verse eid="PSA 107:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 107:38"/>Waaqi isaan eebbisee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:38">isaan ijoollee bacaa horane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:38">horiin isaaniille akka diqqaatu hin goone.<verse eid="PSA 107:38"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 107:39"/>Yennaa isaan cunqurfamiisaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:39">rakkatiisaa fi gaddiisaan gad qabamane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:39">laakkossi isaanii diqqaate.<verse eid="PSA 107:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 107:40"/>Inni qondaaltotatti salphinna fidee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:40">goomolee daandii hin qanne keessa akka daaqanu godhe.<verse eid="PSA 107:40"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 107:41"/>Inni ammoo worra hiyyeeyyii farra keessaa baasee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:41">maatii isaanii akka hoole'ee akka horanu godhe.<verse eid="PSA 107:41"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 107:42"/>Worri qajeelaan waan kana dhagganee gammadan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:42">worri hamaan ammoo afaan ifii qabatan.<verse eid="PSA 107:42"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 107:43"/>Worri qarooleen waan kana hubatanuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:43">jaalala bara baraa ka Mootii Waan Maraa qalbeeffatanuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 107:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 107"/>
  <chapter number="108" style="c" sid="PSA 108"/>
  <para style="s1">Leellisaa fi Daadimata Qarqaarsa Dhaggatiisaaf Dhikaate</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu. Faaruu Daawitii.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 108:1"/>Ee Waaqa, gadhaan kiyya hin mamu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:1">ani gadhaa tokkochaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:1">meya faaru'uu ka adda addaatiin hin faarfadha!<verse eid="PSA 108:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 108:2"/>Ee kiraara guddicha, ee maseenqo'o dammaqa'a!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:2">Anille boruu hin dayyaasa.<verse eid="PSA 108:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 108:3"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:3">ani gosa biyya adda addaa oddu'utti si galateeffadha.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:3">Ani gosa biyya adda addaa oddu'utti faaru'uun si leellisa.<verse eid="PSA 108:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 108:4"/>Jaalalli keeti ka bara baraa guddaa waan te'eef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:4">akka ol-gubba'aa ol fagaata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:4">addatamummaan teeti duumensa dhaqqaddi.<verse eid="PSA 108:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 108:5"/>Ee Waaqa, ol-gubba'aan gubba'atti saadami;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:5">ulfinni keeti lafa duudii irratti te'uu ti.<verse eid="PSA 108:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 108:6"/>Kolbaan ati jaalatu akka baatu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:6">hunna teetiin nu baasi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:6">daadimata keennaafille deebii kenni.<verse eid="PSA 108:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 108:7"/>Waaqi addee woyyittii ifii keessaa, «Ani injifadhee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:7">lafa, ‹Sheekem› jedhantu hin hira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:7">dhooqa Suukootii kolbaa tiyyaaf hin qooda.<verse eid="PSA 108:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 108:8"/>Latti Giil'aadii tiyya; latti Minaase'eelle tiyya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:8">Efreem gullee tiyya ta sibiilaa ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:8">Yihudaan ulee tiyya ta bokku'uu ti.<verse eid="PSA 108:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 108:9"/>Mo'aab gabataa kiyya ka itti dhiqataa ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:9">Edoom kiyya akka te'e mirkaneessiisaaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:9">kophee tiyya irratti hin qolaansa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:9">Filisxeemota irratti injifanno'oon ilillisa» jedheera.<verse eid="PSA 108:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 108:10"/>Gara qachaa guddicha dalleya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:10">dhaka'aatiin marfamee eentu na fida ree?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:10">Akka loluuf gara Edoomii eentu na geessa ree?<verse eid="PSA 108:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 108:11"/>Ee Waaqa, ati nu gatteerta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:11">loltoota teenna woliin bayiisa lakkitteerta.<verse eid="PSA 108:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 108:12"/>Qarqaarsi namaa womaa waan nu'uuf hin baneef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:12">diinota keenna akka lolluuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:12">ati nu qarqaar.<verse eid="PSA 108:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 108:13"/>Qarqaarsa Waaqaatiin hin injifanna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:13">inni diinota keenna hin salphisa.<verse eid="PSA 108:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 108"/>
  <chapter number="109" style="c" sid="PSA 109"/>
  <para style="s1">Iyyata Nama Rakkoo Irra Jiruu</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Daawitii, sooressa faarfattootaatiif.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 109:1"/>Ee Waaqa, ka ani leellifadhu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:1">hin cadhisin.<verse eid="PSA 109:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 109:2"/>Worri hamaaleyyi'ii fi dharaameyyiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:2">dharaan afaan natti banatan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:2">arraba dharaatiin natti dubbatan.<verse eid="PSA 109:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 109:3"/>Isaan na marsanee jecha jibbaa dubbatan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:3">sababa malee na lolan.<verse eid="PSA 109:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 109:4"/>Ani isaan jaaladhulle, isaan na lolan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:4">ani ammoo isaaniif hin daadimadha.<verse eid="PSA 109:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 109:5"/>Waan dansaa ani godheef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:5">isaan waan hantuu naaf deebisan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:5">ani isaan jaaladha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:5">isaan ammoo na jibban.<verse eid="PSA 109:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 109:6"/>Abbaa mura'aa hamaa diina kiyya irratti kaasi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:6">nami isa himatu midda isaa dhaabbatuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 109:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 109:7"/>Kora mura'aa duratti yakkaamessa te'ee dhaggamuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:7">daadimati isaalle akka cubbu'uu isatti laakkowantuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 109:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 109:8"/>Barri jiruu isaa gabaabbatuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:8">nami dhibiin sooressummaa isaa fudhatuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 109:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 109:9"/>Ijoolleen isaa ka abbaa hin qanne teetuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:9">niitiin isaalle haadha hiyyeessaa teetuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 109:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 109:10"/>Ijoolleen isaa daaqaa kadhattuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:10">mana diigamaa amma keessa le'anu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:10">keessaalle'ee ari'amanuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 109:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 109:11"/>Qabeenna isaa mara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:11">abbaan beenya'aa qabatuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:11">waan inni itti elowee dhaggate</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:11">alagaan saamuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 109:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 109:12"/>Nami isaaf nawu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:12">yookiin ijoollee isaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:12">ta abbaa hin qanne ka kunuunsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:12">tokkolle hin jiraatin.<verse eid="PSA 109:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 109:13"/>Sanyiin isaa dhumattuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:13">maqaan isaanii dhaloota itti aanu keessaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:13">haxowamee baduu ti.<verse eid="PSA 109:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 109:14"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:14">yakkaa abbootii isaa ta durii qaabatuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:14">cubbuun haadha isaalle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:14">haxowantee hin balleeffanti.<verse eid="PSA 109:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 109:15"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:15">yennaa mara cubbuu isaanii qaabatuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:15">isaan ijjumaa lafa irraa dedhamanuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 109:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 109:16"/>Namichi hamaan worra hiyyeeyyii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:16">worra rakkata'aa fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:16">worra akka malee gaddeeru ari'ee ijjeese malee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:16">isaaniif hin mararre.<verse eid="PSA 109:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 109:17"/>Inni abaaruu jaalate; abaarsi isatti dhufuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:17">inni eebba hin jaalatu; eebbi isa irraa fagaatuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 109:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 109:18"/>Inni abaarsa akka woya'aa uffate;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:18">abaarsi akka bisaanii gara nafa isaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:18">akka zayiti'ii gara lafee isaa seenuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 109:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 109:19"/>Abaarsi akka woyaa inni facaafatuu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">109:19 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Woyaa inni facaafatu: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lafa tokko tokkotti </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">woyaa inni darbatu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">jedhan.</char></note>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:19">akka hiituu inni guyyaa mara hidhatuu isatti te'uu ti.<verse eid="PSA 109:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 109:20"/>Kun martinuu gatii Mootii Waan Maraa biraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:20">worri na himatu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:20">ka hantuu tiyya dubbatu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:20">dhaggatu teetuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 109:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 109:21"/>Ee Goottaa Mootii Waan Maraa, ati ammoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:21">maqaa keetiif jedhii waan dansaa naa godhi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:21">jaalala keeti ka bara baraatiin, na baasi.<verse eid="PSA 109:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 109:22"/>Ani hiyyeessa, rakkataalle waan te'eef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:22">gadhaan kiyya na madowe.<verse eid="PSA 109:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 109:23"/>Ani akka gaaddisa galgalaa dabaraara;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:23">akka awwaannisa muka irraa hargufanuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:23">hargufamiisatti jira.<verse eid="PSA 109:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 109:24"/>Laamiisa irraa ka ka'e jilbi kiyya lelleqe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:24">nafi kiyya huqqatee googiraa te'e.<verse eid="PSA 109:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 109:25"/>Diinota kiyyaaf murgoo te'e;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:25">isaan yennaa na dhagganu mataa natti raasan.<verse eid="PSA 109:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 109:26"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa Waaqa kiyya, na qarqaar;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:26">jaalala keeti ka bara baraatiif jedhii na baasi.<verse eid="PSA 109:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 109:27"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:27">wonni kun hujii harka keetii akka teete,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:27">akka ati waan kana hujje</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:27">diinoti kiyya beekanuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 109:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 109:28"/>Isaan na abaaran; ati ammoo na hin eebbitta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:28">isaan natti ka'an; ammoo hin salphatan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:28">ani tajaajilaan keeti ammoo hin gammada.<verse eid="PSA 109:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 109:29"/>Diinoti kiyya salphinna akka woya'aa uffatanuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:29">qaanii akka bullukko'oo facaafatanuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 109:29"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 109:30"/>Afaan kiyyaan guddisee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:30">Mootii Waan Maraa galateeffadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:30">kolbaa hedduu duratti isa leellisa.<verse eid="PSA 109:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 109:31"/>Sababille harka worra du'a isaanitti mure jalaa baasiisaaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:31">inni midda worra rakkata'aa dhaabbatta.<verse eid="PSA 109:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 109"/>
  <chapter number="110" style="c" sid="PSA 110"/>
  <para style="s1">Mooticha Mootiin Waan Maraa File</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 110:1"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa Goottaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">110:1 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Goottaa: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Goottaan kun Masiihii.</char></note> kiyyaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:1">«Haga ani diinota keeti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:1">ejjata miila keetii jala kewutti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:1">ati midda kiyya tee'i» jedhe.<verse eid="PSA 110:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 110:2"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:2">Xiyoon irraa ulee bokku'uu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:2">ta jabeenna keetii si'iif hin erga;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:2">atille diinota keeti irratti mootii te'i!<verse eid="PSA 110:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 110:3"/>Guyyaa ati diinota keeti loltu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:3">kolbaan teeti fedhii ifiitiin si woliin hin duulan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:3">dargaggooti teetille akka fixeensa dayya'a boru'uu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:3">kooba woyyittii irratti gara keeti hin dhufan.<verse eid="PSA 110:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 110:4"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:4">«Akkuma hayyummaa Malkiisedeqii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:4">ati hayyuu bara baraa ti» jedhee kakateera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:4">inni yaada ifii hin jijjiiratu.<verse eid="PSA 110:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 110:5"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa midda keeti jira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:5">guyyaa mufii ifii mootota hin butucha.<verse eid="PSA 110:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 110:6"/>Inni gosa biyya adda addaatitti hin mura;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:6">reeffa isaan keessa hin guuta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:6">bulchitoota lafaa duudiille hin butucha.<verse eid="PSA 110:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 110:7"/>Mootichi madda karaa cina'aa keessaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:7">bisaan hin una;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:7">tanaaf inni mataa ifii ol hin qabata.<verse eid="PSA 110:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 110"/>
  <chapter number="111" style="c" sid="PSA 111"/>
  <para style="s1">Leellisa Hujii Maade'ee Mootii Waan Maraatiif Dhikaate</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 111:1"/>Mootii Waan Maraa Leellisa'a!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 111:1"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 111:1">Kora worra qajeela'aatii fi wolde'a keessatti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:1">gadhaa tokkochaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:1">ani Mootii Waan Maraa hin saadadha!<verse eid="PSA 111:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 111:2"/>Wonni Mootiin Waan Maraa huje guddo'o;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:2">worri hujii guddoo saniin gammadu marti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:2">isii hubatiisa barbaada.<verse eid="PSA 111:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 111:3"/>Wonni inni huje marti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:3">ulfinnaa fi arnyaan guutanteerti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:3">balchummaan isaalle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:3">haga bara baraa jabaattee dhaabbatti.<verse eid="PSA 111:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 111:4"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:4">hujii ifii akka qaabatantu godhe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:4">inni arja'a; mararaalle'e.<verse eid="PSA 111:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 111:5"/>Inni worra isa sodaatuuf sagalee hin kenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:5">haga bara baraa gondooroo ifii hin qaabata.<verse eid="PSA 111:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 111:6"/>Inni lafa gosa adda addaa isaanii kenniisaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:6">hunna ifii kolbaa ifiititti mudhiseera.<verse eid="PSA 111:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 111:7"/>Hujiin harka isaa marti dhuga'aa fi haqa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:7">seerri isaa marti addatama'a.<verse eid="PSA 111:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 111:8"/>Seerri isaa haga bara baraa jabaatee dhaabbatee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:8">addatamumma'aa fi balchumma'aan hujameera.<verse eid="PSA 111:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 111:9"/>Inni kolbaa ifiitiif wodoo erge;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:9">gondooroo ifiille haga bara baraa ajaje;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:9">maqaan isaa woyyicha; ka sodaatamelle'e.<verse eid="PSA 111:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 111:10"/>Qarummaan jalqabaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:10">Mootii Waan Maraa sodaatiisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:10">worri ajaja isaa hordofu hubantii dansaa qaban;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:10">kolbaan haga bara baraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:10">Mootii Waan Maraa saadatu'uu malte.<verse eid="PSA 111:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 111"/>
  <chapter number="112" style="c" sid="PSA 112"/>
  <para style="s1">Gammada Nama Balcha'aa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 112:1"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa leellifamuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:1">nami Mootii Waan Maraa sodaatu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:1">ka ajaja isaatiin guddoo gammadu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:1">ka gammade.<verse eid="PSA 112:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 112:2"/>Sanyiin isaa lafa san keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:2">worra jabaa hin te'an;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:2">dhalooti worra qajeela'aa hin eebbifanti.<verse eid="PSA 112:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 112:3"/>Manni isaa taajurumma'aa fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:3">durumma'aan hin guutama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:3">balchummaan isaaniille</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:3">haga bara baraa hin jiraatti.<verse eid="PSA 112:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 112:4"/>Nama arja'aa, nama marara'aa fi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:4">nama balcha'aafille,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:4">dukkana keessalle'etti ifi isaaf hin baya.<verse eid="PSA 112:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 112:5"/>Nama arjaa, liqaa namaaf kennu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:5">wonni dansaan isaaf hin teeti.<verse eid="PSA 112:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 112:6"/>Dhugumaan inni ijjumaa hin raafamu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:6">nami balchaan haga bara baraa hin qaabatama.<verse eid="PSA 112:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 112:7"/>Inni oduu hantuu hin sodaatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:7">Mootii Waan Maraatitti waan addatuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:7">gadhaan isaa hin mamu.<verse eid="PSA 112:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 112:8"/>Gadhaan isaa ijjumaa hin raafamu; hin sodaatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:8">dhuma irratti jinnana diinota ifii hin dhagga.<verse eid="PSA 112:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 112:9"/>Inni arjumma'aan worra hiyyeeyyi'iif kenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:9">balchummaan isaa haga bara baraa jiraatti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:9">Hunnaa fi ulfinnaan hin saadama.<verse eid="PSA 112:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 112:10"/>Nami hamaan tana dhaggee hin aara;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:10">inni ilkaan ifii qaree, hin bada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:10">halchaan isaalle ta bu'aa hin qanne teeti.<verse eid="PSA 112:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 112"/>
  <chapter number="113" style="c" sid="PSA 113"/>
  <para style="s1">Waaqa Qarqaaraa Worra Hiyyeeyyi'ii</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 113:1"/>Mootii Waan Maraa leellisa'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:1">ee tajaajiltoota Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:1">Mootii Waan Maraa leellisa'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:1">maqaa Mootii Waan Maraa leellisa'a.<verse eid="PSA 113:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 113:2"/>Ammaa jalqabee haga bara baraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:2">maqaan Mootii Waan Maraa leellifamuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 113:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 113:3"/>Baya adu'uutii jalqabee haga seensa adu'uutitti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:3">maqaan Mootii Waan Maraa leellifamuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 113:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 113:4"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:4">gosa biyya adda addaa mara irratti ol aanana'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:4">ulfinni isaa ol-gubbaa caala.<verse eid="PSA 113:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 113:5"/>Ka akka Mootii Waan Maraa Waaqa keennaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:5">Ka barcumaa mootummaa gubba'aa irra tee'u,<verse eid="PSA 113:5"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 113:6"/>ka ol-gubba'aa fi lafa gad ilaalu eennu?<verse eid="PSA 113:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 113:7"/>Inni hiyyeeyyii bukuu keessaa kaasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:7">worra rakkataalle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:7">tuulaa daadha'aa keessaa ol fuudha.<verse eid="PSA 113:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 113:8"/>Inni qondaaltota woliin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:8">qondaaltota kolbaa ifii woliin isaan teessisa.<verse eid="PSA 113:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 113:9"/>Maseentittiin haadha ijoolle'ee teetee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:9">gammadaan mana ifii keessa akka leetu hin godha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:9">Mootii Waan Maraa leellisa'a.<verse eid="PSA 113:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 113"/>
  <chapter number="114" style="c" sid="PSA 114"/>
  <para style="s1">Faaruu Yaadannoo Irra Dabaramaa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 114:1"/>Yennaa Israa'el, sanyiin Yaaqoobii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:1">gosa afaan ormaa dubbattu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:1">biyya Gibxi'ii keessaa baate,<verse eid="PSA 114:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 114:2"/>Yihudaan addee woyyittii Waaqaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:2">Israa'elille bulchiisa isaa jala teete.<verse eid="PSA 114:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 114:3"/>Abbaayaan dhaggitee baqatte;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:3">lagi Yordaanosiille gara duubaa deebi'e.<verse eid="PSA 114:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 114:4"/>Gaaroti akka korbeeyyii hoole'ee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:4">koobotille akka ilmoolee hoole'ee burraaqane.<verse eid="PSA 114:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 114:5"/>Ee abbaaya'a, ati maaf baqatte?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:5">Ee laga Yordaanosii, gara duubaa maaf deebite?<verse eid="PSA 114:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 114:6"/>Ee gaarota, isin maaf akka korbeeyyii hoole'ee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:6">ee koobota,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:6">isin maaf akka ilmoolee hoole'ee burraaxxane?<verse eid="PSA 114:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 114:7"/>Ee lafa, Goottaa duratti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:7">fuula Waaqa Yaaqoobii duratti holladhu!<verse eid="PSA 114:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 114:8"/>Inni rassaa gara baleessaatitti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:8">rassaa jabaa gara madda bisaaniititti hin deebisa.<verse eid="PSA 114:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 114"/>
  <chapter number="115" style="c" sid="PSA 115"/>
  <para style="s1">Waaqa Tokkocha Dhuga'aa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 115:1"/>Nu'uufii moti, ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:1">nu'uufii moti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:1">sababa jaalalaa fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:1">addatamummaa teetiitiif jedhii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:1">maqaa keeti ulfeessi!<verse eid="PSA 115:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 115:2"/>Gosi biyya adda addaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:2">«Waaqi isaanii meet» maaf jedhan?<verse eid="PSA 115:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 115:3"/>Waaqi keenna ol-gubbaa jira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:3">waan isa gammachiisu mara godha.<verse eid="PSA 115:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 115:4"/>Waaqoti isaanii ka dharaa meeti'ii fi worqii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:4">harka namaatiin hujante.<verse eid="PSA 115:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 115:5"/>Isaan afaan qaban malee, hin dubbatanu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:5">ila qaban malee, hin dhagganu.<verse eid="PSA 115:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 115:6"/>Isaan gurra qaban malee, hin dhage'anu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:6">funnaan qaban malee, foolee hin fuudhanu.<verse eid="PSA 115:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 115:7"/>Isaan harka qaban malee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:7">qaqqabuu hin dande'anu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:7">Miila qaban malee, hin ideemanu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:7">laagadaan isaaniille</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:7">qoonqoo hin dhageessisu.<verse eid="PSA 115:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 115:8"/>Worri isaan hujee fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:8">isaanitti dhugeeffatu martinuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:8">akkuma isaanii hin te'an.<verse eid="PSA 115:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 115:9"/>Ee kolbaa Israa'elii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:9">ka isin qarqaaruu fi isin eegu isa waan te'eef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:9">Mootii Waan Maraatitti addadha'a!<verse eid="PSA 115:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 115:10"/>Ee hayyoota, sanyii Aaronii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:10">inni qarqaaraa keessan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:10">wontee teessanille'e.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:10">Mootii Waan Maraatitti addadha'a!<verse eid="PSA 115:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 115:11"/>Isin worri Mootii Waan Maraa sodaattanu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:11">Mootii Waan Maraatitti addadha'a!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:11">Inni qarqaaraa keessan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:11">wontee teessanille'e.<verse eid="PSA 115:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 115:12"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa nu qaabata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:12">nu hin eebbisalle'e;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:12">inni kolbaa Israa'elii hin eebbisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:12">inni hayyoota sanyii Aaronii hin eebbisa.<verse eid="PSA 115:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 115:13"/>Inni worra isa sodaatu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:13">diqqa'aa fi guddaa hin eebbisa.<verse eid="PSA 115:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 115:14"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:14">isinii fi ijoollee teessan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:14">akka hortanu godhuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 115:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 115:15"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:15">ol-gubba'aa fi lafa ka dade</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:15">isin eebbisuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 115:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 115:16"/>Ol-gubbaan ol-gubbootaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:16">ta Mootii Waan Maraa ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:16">latti ammoo ilmaan namaatiif kennanteerti.<verse eid="PSA 115:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 115:17"/>Worri du'eeru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:17">ka gara cadheessaa gad bu'eeru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:17">Mootii Waan Maraa leellisuu hin dande'u.<verse eid="PSA 115:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 115:18"/>Nuuti worri jirru ammoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:18">ammaa jalqannee haga bara baraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:18">Mootii Waan Maraa hin leellifanna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:18">Mootii Waan Maraa leellisa'a.<verse eid="PSA 115:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 115"/>
  <chapter number="116" style="c" sid="PSA 116"/>
  <para style="s1">Galata Nama Dhibamee Fayyee</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 116:1"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:1">qoonqoo tiyyaa fi iyyata kiyya waan dhage'eef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:1">ani isa jaaladha.<verse eid="PSA 116:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 116:2"/>Inni waan naa dhage'uuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:2">ani bara jiruu tiyyaa mara isa waammadha.<verse eid="PSA 116:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 116:3"/>Wodaroon du'aa natti maratte;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:3">rakkoon farri addee worri du'e jiruu na qabatte;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:3">farraa fi gaddaa keessa seene.<verse eid="PSA 116:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 116:4"/>Achiin duuba ani, «Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:4">ani si daadimadhaa na baasi» jedhee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:4">maqaa Mootii Waan Maraa waammadhe.<verse eid="PSA 116:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 116:5"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa arja'a; balchaalle'e;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:5">Waaqi keenna marara'a.<verse eid="PSA 116:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 116:6"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:6">worra gad ifi qabu hin eega;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:6">yennaa ani gad qabame, inni na qarqaare.<verse eid="PSA 116:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 116:7"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:7">waan dansaa waan si'iif godheef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:7">ee lubbuu tiyya, gara foora keetii deebi'i.<verse eid="PSA 116:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 116:8"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:8">lubbuu tiyya du'a irraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:8">ila tiyya imimmaan irraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:8">miila kiyya gufatiisa irraa hamburte.<verse eid="PSA 116:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 116:9"/>Maarre ani Mootii Waan Maraa dura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:9">lafa worra jiraata'aa keessa ideema.<verse eid="PSA 116:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 116:10"/>Ani yennaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:10">«Ani guddoo rakkadheera» jedheeyyuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:10">dhugeeffannaa tiyya hin lakkinne.<verse eid="PSA 116:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 116:11"/>Ani yennaa sodaadhe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:11">«Nami addatamu tokkoolle hin jiru» jedhe.<verse eid="PSA 116:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 116:12"/>Waan dansaa inni naaf kenne maraaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:12">ani Mootii Waan Maraatiif</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:12">maan deebisee dande'a?<verse eid="PSA 116:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 116:13"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa waan na fayyiseef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:13">ani isa hin galateeffadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:13">kennansa daadhii woyni'ii isaaf hin dhikeessa.<verse eid="PSA 116:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 116:14"/>Fuula kolbaa isaa mara duratti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:14">ani waan waadaa gale</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:14">Mootii Waan Maraatiif hin muummessa.<verse eid="PSA 116:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 116:15"/>Duuti worra woyyootaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:15">Mootii Waan Maraa duratti ulfinna qaddi.<verse eid="PSA 116:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 116:16"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa, ani tajaajilaa keeti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:16">ani tajaajilaa keeti, ilma garbittii teetii ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:16">ati hidhaa tiyya keessaa na hiitteerta.<verse eid="PSA 116:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 116:17"/>Ani ciincaa galataa si'iif hin dhikeessa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:17">gara keetille hin daadimadha.<verse eid="PSA 116:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 116:18"/>Ani fuula kolbaa isaa mara duratti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:18">waan Mootii Waan Maraatiif waadaa gale</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:18">hin muummessa;<verse eid="PSA 116:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 116:19"/>Tanalle badhinna Galma Mootii Waan Maraa duraa keessatti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:19">Yerusaalem wodhakka'atti hin godha.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 116:19"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 116:19">Mootii Waan Maraa leellisa'a.<verse eid="PSA 116:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 116"/>
  <chapter number="117" style="c" sid="PSA 117"/>
  <para style="s1">Leellisa Mootii Waan Maraatiif Dhikaate</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 117:1"/>Gosi biyya adda addaa martinuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 117:1">Mootii Waan Maraa leellisa'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 117:1">kolbaan martinuu isa saada'a.<verse eid="PSA 117:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 117:2"/>Jaalalli isaa ka bara baraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 117:2">ka inni nu'uuf qabu guddaa waan te'eef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 117:2">addatamummaan isaa haga bara baraa ti.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 117:2"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 117:2">Mootii Waan Maraa leellisa'a.<verse eid="PSA 117:2"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 117"/>
  <chapter number="118" style="c" sid="PSA 118"/>
  <para style="s1">Faaruu Injifanno'oo</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 118:1"/>Inni dansaa waan te'eef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:1">jaalala isaa ka bara baraatiif</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:1">Mootii Waan Maraa galateessa'a.<verse eid="PSA 118:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 118:2"/>Kolbaan Israa'elii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:2">«Jaalalli isaa ka bara baraa ti» jettuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 118:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 118:3"/>Sanyiin Aaronii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:3">«Jaalalli isaa ka bara baraa ti» jettuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 118:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 118:4"/>Worri Mootii Waan Maraa sodaatu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:4">«Jaalalli isaa ka bara baraa ti» jedhuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 118:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 118:5"/>Ani rakkinna kiyya keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:5">gara Mootii Waan Maraa iyye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:5">innille deebii naa kennee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:5">bilisa na baase.<verse eid="PSA 118:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 118:6"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:6">na woliin jira; ani hin sodaadhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:6">nami maan na godhuu dande'a?<verse eid="PSA 118:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 118:7"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:7">na qarqaariisaaf na woliin jira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:7">ani jinnana diinota kiyyaa hin dhagga.<verse eid="PSA 118:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 118:8"/>Namatti addatiisaa mannaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:8">gara Mootii Waan Maraa baqatiisa woyya.<verse eid="PSA 118:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 118:9"/>Qondaaltotatti addatiisaa mannaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:9">gara Mootii Waan Maraa baqatiisa woyya.<verse eid="PSA 118:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 118:10"/>Gosi biyya adda addaa marti na marsane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:10">ani ammoo maqaa Mootii Waan Maraatiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:10">isaan balleesse.<verse eid="PSA 118:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 118:11"/>Isaan gara maraan na marsane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:11">ani ammoo maqaa Mootii Waan Maraatiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:11">isaan balleesse.<verse eid="PSA 118:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 118:12"/>Isaan akka kinniisaa na marsane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:12">ammoo akka ibidda qore'ee dhaamane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:12">ani maqaa Mootii Waan Maraatiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:12">isaan balleesse.<verse eid="PSA 118:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 118:13"/>Ani gara duubaa dhiibamee, jigiisa geye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:13">Mootiin Waan Maraa ammoo na qarqaare.<verse eid="PSA 118:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 118:14"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:14">jabeenna kiyyaa fi faaruu tiyya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:14">inni fayyinna kiyya te'eera.<verse eid="PSA 118:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 118:15"/>Qoonqoon gammadaatii fi injifanno'oo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:15">dunkaanii worra balchootaa keessaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:15">«Harki Mootii Waan Maraa middichi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:15">hujii jadduu huje;<verse eid="PSA 118:15"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 118:16"/>harki Mootii Waan Maraa middichi ol ka'e;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:16">harki Mootii Waan Maraa middichi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:16">hujii jadduu huje» jettu dhage'ante.<verse eid="PSA 118:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 118:17"/>Ani hin le'a malee, hin du'u;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:17">waan Mootiin Waan Maraa hujelle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:17">hin odeessa.<verse eid="PSA 118:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 118:18"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:18">jabeessee na adabeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:18">ammoo du'aaf dabarsee na hin kennine.<verse eid="PSA 118:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 118:19"/>Akka ani ol seenee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:19">Mootii Waan Maraa galateeffadhuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:19">balbala balchumma'aa naaf bana'a.<verse eid="PSA 118:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 118:20"/>Tun balbala Mootii Waan Maraa ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:20">karaa balchooleen seenanu.<verse eid="PSA 118:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 118:21"/>Ati waan naa dhageetteef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:21">fayyinna kiyyalle waan naaf teeteef</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:21">si galatteeffadha.<verse eid="PSA 118:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 118:22"/>Dhakaan worri mana ijaaru tuffate,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:22">dhakaa dhakaa mara caalaa barbaadamu te'e;<verse eid="PSA 118:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 118:23"/>Tun hujii Mootii Waan Maraa ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:23">isiin ila teennalle'etti waan baasaa ti.<verse eid="PSA 118:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 118:24"/>Guyyaan Mootiin Waan Maraa tolche kana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:24">itti gammannee firinxiindhuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 118:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 118:25"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa nu baasi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:25">ee Mootii Waan Maraa nu milkeessi.<verse eid="PSA 118:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 118:26"/>Maqaa Mootii Waan Maraatiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:26">ka dhufu ka eebbifame;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:26">nuuti Galma Waaqaa keessaa isin eebbinna.<verse eid="PSA 118:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 118:27"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa Waaqa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:27">inni ifa nu'uuf isseera.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 118:27">Dameelee bisilee qabannee, jila bobbaanee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:27">haga gaafota addee ciinca'aa dhandhuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 118:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 118:28"/>Ati Waaqa kiyya; ani si galateeffadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:28">ati Waaqa kiyya; ani si saadadha.<verse eid="PSA 118:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 118:29"/>Inni dansaa waan te'eef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:29">jaalala isaa ka bara baraatiif</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:29">Mootii Waan Maraa galateessa'a.<verse eid="PSA 118:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 118"/>
  <chapter number="119" style="c" sid="PSA 119"/>
  <para style="s1">Seera Mootii Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 119:1"/>Worri karaan isaanii komii hin qanne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:1">ka seera Mootii Waan Maraatiin ideemanu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:1">ka gammadane.<verse eid="PSA 119:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 119:2"/>Worri ajaja isaa eegatu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:2">ka gadhaa tokkochaan isa barbaadu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:2">ka gammade.<verse eid="PSA 119:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 119:3"/>Isaan dokonkora hin hujanu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:3">karaa isaa ideeman.<verse eid="PSA 119:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 119:4"/>Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:4">ajaji keeti guutumatti akka eegamu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:4">ati ajajjeerta.<verse eid="PSA 119:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 119:5"/>Ani ajaja keeti eegatiisaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:5">jabaadhee adoo dhaabbadhee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:5">attam attam halcha!<verse eid="PSA 119:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 119:6"/>Ani ila tiyya ajaja keeti mara irraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:6">yoo hin buqqifatin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:6">ani hin qaanowu.<verse eid="PSA 119:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 119:7"/>Muraa haqaa teeti yennaa baradhe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:7">ani gadhaa qajeela'aan si leellisa.<verse eid="PSA 119:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 119:8"/>Ani ajaja keeti hin eegadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:8">ati ijjumaa na hin lakkisin.<verse eid="PSA 119:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Seera Mootii Waan Maraatiif Ajajamuu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 119:9"/>Dargaggooti attamiin karaa ifii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:9">qulqullumma'aan eegatiisa dande'an?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:9">Karaa ifii akka jecha keetiititti eegatiisaan.<verse eid="PSA 119:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 119:10"/>Ani gadhaa tokkochaan si barbaada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:10">ajaja keeti irraa akka goru na hin lakkisin.<verse eid="PSA 119:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 119:11"/>Akka si hin yakkineef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:11">jecha keeti gadhaa kiyya keessatti dhoffadheera.<verse eid="PSA 119:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 119:12"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa, ati ka leellifante;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:12">seera keeti na barsiisi.<verse eid="PSA 119:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 119:13"/>Ani qajeelfama afaan keetii baye mara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:13">afaan kiyyaan hin lallaba.<verse eid="PSA 119:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 119:14"/>Akkuma nami durummaa guddo'otti gammadu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:14">ani qajeelfama keeti hordofiisatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:14">hin gammada.<verse eid="PSA 119:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 119:15"/>Ani ajaja keeti irra deddeebi'ee itti hin yaada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:15">karaa keeti irraa ila tiyya hin buqqifadhu.<verse eid="PSA 119:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 119:16"/>Ani seera keetiin hin gammada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:16">ani jecha keeti hin dedhu.<verse eid="PSA 119:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 119:17"/>Akka ani le'uuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:17">jecha keetiifille akka ajajamu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:17">ana tajaajilaa keetiif waan dansaa godhi.<verse eid="PSA 119:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 119:18"/>Waan maade'ee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:18">ta seera keeti keessaa akka dhaggu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:18">ila tiyya bani.<verse eid="PSA 119:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 119:19"/>Ani lafa irratti alaga'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:19">ajaja keeti na hin dhossin.<verse eid="PSA 119:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 119:20"/>Lubbuun tiyya seera keeti halchiisaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:20">yennaa mara akka malee dadhaddi.<verse eid="PSA 119:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 119:21"/>Ati worra koorameeyyii abaarame,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:21">ka ajaja keeti irraa gore,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:21">hin xixxa.<verse eid="PSA 119:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 119:22"/>Ani ajaja keeti waan eegadheef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:22">ati murgo'oo fi tuffii isaanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:22">na irraa fageessi.<verse eid="PSA 119:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 119:23"/>Qondaaltoti tee'anee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:23">mala na irratti dhowanulle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:23">ani tajaajilaan keeti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:23">seera keeti itti deddeebi'ee hin yaada.<verse eid="PSA 119:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 119:24"/>Ajaji keeti marti na gammachiisan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:24">isaan gorsitoota tiyya.<verse eid="PSA 119:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Seera Waaqaatiif Ajajamiisaaf Murteeffatuu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 119:25"/>Ani du'iisa geyeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:25">ati akka jecha keetiititti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:25">lubbuu tiyya natti deebisi.<verse eid="PSA 119:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 119:26"/>Ani waan jiruu tiyya keessatti te'e mara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:26">sitti himadheera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:26">atille deebii naaf kenniteerta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:26">seera keeti mara na barsiisi.<verse eid="PSA 119:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 119:27"/>Ajaja keeti na hubachiisi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:27">anille hujii teeti ta maade'ee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:27">itti deddeebi'ee hin yaada.<verse eid="PSA 119:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 119:28"/>Lubbuun tiyya gaddaan dadhaddeerti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:28">akka jecha keetiititti na jabeessi.<verse eid="PSA 119:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 119:29"/>Karaa sobaa na irraa fageessi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:29">badhaadha keetiin seera keeti na barsiisi.<verse eid="PSA 119:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 119:30"/>Ani karaa dhuga'aa filadheera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:30">seera keeti ifi dura keyadheera.<verse eid="PSA 119:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 119:31"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:31">ani jaja keeti jabeessee qabadheera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:31">na hin qaanessin.<verse eid="PSA 119:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 119:32"/>Ati waan bilisa na baatteef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:32">ani karaa ajaja keetii rukkisa.<verse eid="PSA 119:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Daadimata Hubantii Dhaggatiisaaf Dhikaate</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 119:33"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:33">karaa seera keetii na barsiisi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:33">anille yennaa mara hin hordofa.<verse eid="PSA 119:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 119:34"/>Seera keeti akka ani eegadhu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:34">gadhaa tokkochalle'een akka ani ajajamu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:34">hubantii naa kenni.<verse eid="PSA 119:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 119:35"/>Ani waan ittiin gammaduuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:35">daandii ajaja keetii irra akka deemu na godhi.<verse eid="PSA 119:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 119:36"/>Bu'aa haqa hin te'in dhaggatiisa irraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:36">gadhaa kiyya gara ajaja keetii deebisi.<verse eid="PSA 119:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 119:37"/>Ila tiyya waan bu'aa hin qanne irraa deebisi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:37">karaa keeti irratti jiruu naa kenni.<verse eid="PSA 119:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 119:38"/>Akka sodaatantuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:38">Waadaa ana tajaajilaa keetiif galte muummessi.<verse eid="PSA 119:38"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 119:39"/>Seerri keeti dansaa waan te'eef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:39">qaanii ani sodaadhu na irraa fageessi.<verse eid="PSA 119:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 119:40"/>Kunoo, ani ajaja keeti eegatiisaaf dharra'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:40">balchummaa teetiin jiruu naa kenni.<verse eid="PSA 119:40"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 119:41"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:41">jaalalli keeti ka bara baraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:41">gara kiyya dhufuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:41">akka waadaa keetiititti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:41">fayyisiis keetille gara kiyya dhufuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 119:41"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 119:42"/>Achiin duuba ani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:42">jecha keetitti waan addadhuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:42">worra na arrassuuf deebii hin kenna.<verse eid="PSA 119:42"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 119:43"/>Ani seera keetitti addii waan godhadhuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:43">jecha dhuga'aa keeti dubatiisa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:43">na hin dhooggin.<verse eid="PSA 119:43"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 119:44"/>Ani yennaa mara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:44">haga bara baraa seera keeti hin eegadha.<verse eid="PSA 119:44"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 119:45"/>Ani ajaja keeti muummessiisa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:45">waan barbaaduuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:45">bilisaan hin ideema.<verse eid="PSA 119:45"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 119:46"/>Ani ajaja keeti mootota duratti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:46">hin dubbadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:46">hin qaaneffadhu.<verse eid="PSA 119:46"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 119:47"/>Ani ajaja keeti hin jaaladha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:47">ittille hin gammada.<verse eid="PSA 119:47"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 119:48"/>Ani harka kiyya gara ajaja keeti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:48">ka jaaladhuu ol hin kaasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:48">seerata keetille itti deddeebi'ee hin yaada.<verse eid="PSA 119:48"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 119:49"/>Jecha keeti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:49">ka akka ani addi'iin eegadhu goote,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:49">ana tajaajilaa keetiif qaabadhu.<verse eid="PSA 119:49"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 119:50"/>Waadaan keeti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:50">jiruu waan naa kenneef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:50">rakkinna kiyya keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:50">jajjabeenni kiyya kana.<verse eid="PSA 119:50"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 119:51"/>Worri koorameeyyiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:51">yennaa mara natti murgan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:51">ani ammoo seera keeti irraa hin deebine.<verse eid="PSA 119:51"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 119:52"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:52">ani seeraa keeti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:52">ka durii durii yennaa qabaadhu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:52">ittiin hin jajjabaadha.<verse eid="PSA 119:52"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="PSA 119:53"/>Worri hamaaleyyiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:53">seera keeti waan lakkisaneef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:53">aariin guddoon na qabatte.<verse eid="PSA 119:53"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="PSA 119:54"/>Addee le'u maratti ajaji keeti faaruu tiyya.<verse eid="PSA 119:54"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="PSA 119:55"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:55">halkan keessa maqaa keeti qaabadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:55">seera keetille hin eegadha.<verse eid="PSA 119:55"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="PSA 119:56"/>Ani ajaja keeti eegadhe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:56">tunille hujii tiyya teete.<verse eid="PSA 119:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Seera Waaqaatiif Ajajamuu</para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="PSA 119:57"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:57">jiruu tiyya keessatti ati qooda kiyya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:57">ani jecha keeti eegatiisaaf waadaa galeera.<verse eid="PSA 119:57"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="PSA 119:58"/>Fudhatama dhaggatiisaaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:58">gadhaa tokkochaan si daadimadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:58">akkuma waadaa keetiititti naa marari.<verse eid="PSA 119:58"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="PSA 119:59"/>Ani yennaa karaa keeti yaadadhu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:59">miila kiyya gara ajaja keetii deebifadha.<verse eid="PSA 119:59"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="PSA 119:60"/>Ani ajaja keeti muummessiisaaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:60">hin ariifadha; hin turu.<verse eid="PSA 119:60"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="PSA 119:61"/>Worri hamaan wodaroo natti marulle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:61">ani seera keeti hin dedhu.<verse eid="PSA 119:61"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="PSA 119:62"/>Muraa teeti balchitti'iif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:62">si galateeffatiisaaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:62">ani halkan wodhakkaa hin ka'a.<verse eid="PSA 119:62"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="PSA 119:63"/>Ani worra si sodaatu maraaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:63">worra ajaja keeti eegatu maraaf jaala.<verse eid="PSA 119:63"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="PSA 119:64"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:64">latti jaalala keeti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:64">ka bara baraatiin guutanteerti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:64">seera keeti na barsiisi.<verse eid="PSA 119:64"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="PSA 119:65"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:65">akkuma jecha keetiititti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:65">ati tajaajilaa keetiif waan dansaa gooteerta.<verse eid="PSA 119:65"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="PSA 119:66"/>Ani ajaja keeti waan addadhuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:66">beekkumsaa fi hubantii dansaa na barsiisi.<verse eid="PSA 119:66"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="PSA 119:67"/>Adoo hin rakkatin dura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:67">ani karaa keeti irraa goreera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:67">amma ammoo jecha keeti hin eegadha.<verse eid="PSA 119:67"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="PSA 119:68"/>Ati dansa'a; wonni ati gootulle dansa'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:68">seera keeti na barsiisi.<verse eid="PSA 119:68"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="PSA 119:69"/>Worri koorameeyyiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:69">dharaan maqaa na balleessanulle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:69">ani ammoo gadhaa tokkochaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:69">ajaja keeti hin eegadha.<verse eid="PSA 119:69"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="PSA 119:70"/>Isaan mataa jabaatan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:70">ani ammoo seera keetiin gammada.<verse eid="PSA 119:70"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="PSA 119:71"/>Seera keeti akka baradhu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:71">rakkatiisi kiyya dansa'a.<verse eid="PSA 119:71"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="PSA 119:72"/>Worqi'ii fi meetii kuma hedduu caalaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:72">seera afaan keetii bayu naaf woyya.<verse eid="PSA 119:72"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Haqa Seera Waaqaa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="PSA 119:73"/>Harki keeti na huje;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:73">na mimmiidhasselle'e;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:73">akka ani ajaja keeti baradhu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:73">qalbeeffata naaf kenni.<verse eid="PSA 119:73"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="PSA 119:74"/>Ani jecha keetitti addii waan godhadheef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:74">worri si sodaatu yennaa na dhaggu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:74">hin gammada.<verse eid="PSA 119:74"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="PSA 119:75"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:75">muraan teeti dhugaa akka teete,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:75">ani hin beeka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:75">ati addatamumma'aan na adadde.<verse eid="PSA 119:75"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="PSA 119:76"/>Akkuma ana tajaajilaa keetiif waadaa galtetti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:76">jaalalli keeti ka bara baraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:76">na jajjabeessuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 119:76"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="PSA 119:77"/>Seerri keeti waan na gammachiisuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:77">akka le'uuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:77">marartiin teeti naaf dhuttuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 119:77"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="PSA 119:78"/>Worri koorameeyyiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:78">dharaan waan na himatanuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:78">qaanowanuu ti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 119:78">Ani ammoo ajaja keeti itti deddeebi'ee yaada.<verse eid="PSA 119:78"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="PSA 119:79"/>Worri si sodaatuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:79">worri ajaja keeti beeku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:79">gara kiyya deebi'uu ti.<verse eid="PSA 119:79"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="PSA 119:80"/>Akka ani hin qaanonneef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:80">gadhaan kiyya seera keetitti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:80">komii hin qabaatin.<verse eid="PSA 119:80"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="81" style="v" sid="PSA 119:81"/>Lubbuun tiyya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:81">fayyisiisa keeti dharra'iisaan gaggaddi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:81">ani ammoo jecha keetitti addii godhadha.<verse eid="PSA 119:81"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="82" style="v" sid="PSA 119:82"/>Ilti tiyya dubbii teeti eegatiisaan dadhaddi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:82">ani, «Yoom na jajjabeessita?» jedhee gaafadha.<verse eid="PSA 119:82"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="83" style="v" sid="PSA 119:83"/>Ani akka qalqalluu daadhii woyni'ii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:83">ka aara keessaa shuntuuradhulle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:83">seera keeti hin dedhu.<verse eid="PSA 119:83"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="84" style="v" sid="PSA 119:84"/>Ani tajaajilaan keeti haga yoomii le'inna laati?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:84">Ati worra na miidhutti yoom murta?<verse eid="PSA 119:84"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="85" style="v" sid="PSA 119:85"/>Worri koorameeyyiin seera keetiif hin ajajanne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:85">boolla naaf qotane.<verse eid="PSA 119:85"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="86" style="v" sid="PSA 119:86"/>Ajaji keeti martinuu addatama'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:86">namooti sababa malee waan na miidhanuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:86">ati na qarqaar.<verse eid="PSA 119:86"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="87" style="v" sid="PSA 119:87"/>Isaan diqquma lafa irraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:87">na hin balleessin hafane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:87">ani ammoo ajaja keeti hin lakkinne.<verse eid="PSA 119:87"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="88" style="v" sid="PSA 119:88"/>Akka ani ajaja keeti eegadhu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:88">jaalala keeti bara baraatiin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:88">jiruu naa kenni.<verse eid="PSA 119:88"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="89" style="v" sid="PSA 119:89"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:89">jechi keeti haga bara baraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:89">ol-gubbaa keessatti jabaatee jiraata.<verse eid="PSA 119:89"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="90" style="v" sid="PSA 119:90"/>Addatamummaan teeti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:90">dhalootaa irraa haga dhaloota maraatitti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:90">hin jiraatti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:90">ati lafa daddeerta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:90">isiille jabaattee jiraatti.<verse eid="PSA 119:90"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="91" style="v" sid="PSA 119:91"/>Wonni martinuu tajaajiltoota teeti waan teeteef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:91">ajaja keetiin haga adhaa jabaattee jiraatti.<verse eid="PSA 119:91"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="92" style="v" sid="PSA 119:92"/>Seerri keeti adoo na hin gammachiinne teete,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:92">rakkinna kiyyaan silaa ani badeeraayyu.<verse eid="PSA 119:92"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="93" style="v" sid="PSA 119:93"/>Ati seera keetiin jiruu waan naa kenniteef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:93">ani ijjumaa seera keeti hin dedhu.<verse eid="PSA 119:93"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="94" style="v" sid="PSA 119:94"/>Ani seera keeti waan barbaaduuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:94">ani keeti; na hamburi.<verse eid="PSA 119:94"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="95" style="v" sid="PSA 119:95"/>Worri hamaaleyyiin na ijjeesiisaaf na gaadan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:95">ani ammoo ajaja keeti itti deddeebi'ee yaada.<verse eid="PSA 119:95"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="96" style="v" sid="PSA 119:96"/>Wonni dhidhinna hin qanne marti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:96">meessaa akka qaddu dhaggeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:96">ajaji keeti ammoo meessaa hin qabu.<verse eid="PSA 119:96"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Seera Waaqaa Jaalatiisa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="97" style="v" sid="PSA 119:97"/>Ani attam attam seera keeti jaaladha!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:97">Ani guyyaa guutuu itti deddeebi'ee isa yaada.<verse eid="PSA 119:97"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="98" style="v" sid="PSA 119:98"/>Ajaji keeti yennaa mara na woliin waan jiruuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:98">diinota kiyya caalaa qaroo na godha.<verse eid="PSA 119:98"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="99" style="v" sid="PSA 119:99"/>Ani seera keeti itti deddeebi'ee waan yaaduuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:99">barsiisota tiyya mara caalaa qarummaa qaba.<verse eid="PSA 119:99"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="100" style="v" sid="PSA 119:100"/>Ani seera keeti waan muummessuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:100">maanguddoota caalaa hubantii qaba.<verse eid="PSA 119:100"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="101" style="v" sid="PSA 119:101"/>Ani jecha keeti eegatiisaaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:101">miila kiyya karaa hamaa mara irraa eegadheera.<verse eid="PSA 119:101"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="102" style="v" sid="PSA 119:102"/>Ati waan na barsiitteef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:102">ani seera keeti irraa hin gorre.<verse eid="PSA 119:102"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="103" style="v" sid="PSA 119:103"/>Jechi keeti arraba kiyyatti attam attam mi'owa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:103">Afaan kiyya keessatti damma caalaa mi'owa.<verse eid="PSA 119:103"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="104" style="v" sid="PSA 119:104"/>Ani seera keeti irraa hubantii dhaggadheera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:104">tanaaf karaa dharaa mara hin jibba.<verse eid="PSA 119:104"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="105" style="v" sid="PSA 119:105"/>Jechi keeti miila kiyyaaf issa'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:105">daandii tiyyaafille ifa.<verse eid="PSA 119:105"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="106" style="v" sid="PSA 119:106"/>Seera keeti balchicha hordofiisaaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:106">kakadheera; ittille hin jabaadha.<verse eid="PSA 119:106"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="107" style="v" sid="PSA 119:107"/>Ani guddoo rakkadheera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:107">ee Mootii Waan Maraa, akka jecha keetiititti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:107">jiruu naa kenni.<verse eid="PSA 119:107"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="108" style="v" sid="PSA 119:108"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:108">leellisa fedhii tiyyaan sii dhikeessu fudhadhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:108">seera keetille na barsiisi.<verse eid="PSA 119:108"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="109" style="v" sid="PSA 119:109"/>Lubbuun tiyya yennaa mara balaa bira jirti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:109">ammoo ani seera keeti hin dedhu.<verse eid="PSA 119:109"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="110" style="v" sid="PSA 119:110"/>Worri hamaan tiyyoo naaf afe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:110">ani ammoo seera keeti irraa hin gorre.<verse eid="PSA 119:110"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="111" style="v" sid="PSA 119:111"/>Seerri keeti haga bara baraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:111">dhaala kiyya waan te'eef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:111">gammadi gadhaa kiyyaa isa.<verse eid="PSA 119:111"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="112" style="v" sid="PSA 119:112"/>Ani haga du'utti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:112">bara baraan seera keeti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:112">muummessiisaaf murteeffadheera.<verse eid="PSA 119:112"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="113" style="v" sid="PSA 119:113"/>Ani worra yaada lamaa jibbe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:113">seera keeti ammoo jaaladhe.<verse eid="PSA 119:113"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="114" style="v" sid="PSA 119:114"/>Ati addee ani itti dhokadhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:114">wontee tiyyalle'e.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:114">Ani jecha keetitti addii godhadha.<verse eid="PSA 119:114"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="115" style="v" sid="PSA 119:115"/>Akka ani ajaja Waaqa kiyyaa eegadhu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:115">isin worri waan hantuu hujjanu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:115">na irraa fagaadha'a.<verse eid="PSA 119:115"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="116" style="v" sid="PSA 119:116"/>Akka ani jiru'uun le'u,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:116">akka jecha waadaa keetiititti na jabeessi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:116">addii tiyyaan ani hin qaanowin.<verse eid="PSA 119:116"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="117" style="v" sid="PSA 119:117"/>Akka ani bayu ati na qabi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:117">ani yennaa mara seera keetitti xiyyeeffadha.<verse eid="PSA 119:117"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="118" style="v" sid="PSA 119:118"/>Malli soba isaanii bu'aa waan hin qanneef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:118">ati worra seera keeti irraa goru mara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:118">hin fugussita.<verse eid="PSA 119:118"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="119" style="v" sid="PSA 119:119"/>Worra hamaa lafa irraa mara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:119">ati akka solloqqee sibiilaa hin gatta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:119">tanaaf, ani seera keeti hin jaaladha.<verse eid="PSA 119:119"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="120" style="v" sid="PSA 119:120"/>Foon kiyya si sodaatee hollate;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:120">ani muraa teeti guddoo sodaadhe.<verse eid="PSA 119:120"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="121" style="v" sid="PSA 119:121"/>Ani waan dhuga'aatii fi haqaa hujeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:121">ati worra na cunqursuuf na hin lakkisin.<verse eid="PSA 119:121"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="122" style="v" sid="PSA 119:122"/>Ani tajaajilaan keeti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:122">waan dansaa akka dhaggadhu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:122">wobii naa te'i;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:122">worri koorameeyyiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:122">akka na cunqursu hin lakkisin.<verse eid="PSA 119:122"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="123" style="v" sid="PSA 119:123"/>Fayyisiisa keetii fi waadaa keeti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:123">balchaa san eegatiisaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:123">ilti tiyya dadhadde.<verse eid="PSA 119:123"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="124" style="v" sid="PSA 119:124"/>Akka jaalala keeti ka bara baraatitti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:124">ana tajaajilaa keeti qabadhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:124">seera keetille na barsiisi.<verse eid="PSA 119:124"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="125" style="v" sid="PSA 119:125"/>Ani tajaajilaa keeti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:125">akka ani seera keeti beeku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:125">hubantii naaf kenni.<verse eid="PSA 119:125"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="126" style="v" sid="PSA 119:126"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:126">kolbaan seera keeti waan cassiteef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:126">yennaan ati waan tokko hujju amma.<verse eid="PSA 119:126"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="127" style="v" sid="PSA 119:127"/>Ani worqii caalaa, worqii qullittii caalaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:127">ajaja keeti jaaladha.<verse eid="PSA 119:127"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="128" style="v" sid="PSA 119:128"/>Tanaaf ajaji keeti martinuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:128">dhugaa akka te'e hin fudhadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:128">karaa dharaa mara jibba.<verse eid="PSA 119:128"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Halchaa Seera Mootii Waan Maraatiif Ajajamiisaa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="129" style="v" sid="PSA 119:129"/>Seerri keeti maade'e;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:129">tanaaf lubbuun tiyya isaaf ajajanti.<verse eid="PSA 119:129"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="130" style="v" sid="PSA 119:130"/>Hiiki jecha keetii ifa kenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:130">worra wollaala'aaf hubantii kenna.<verse eid="PSA 119:130"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="131" style="v" sid="PSA 119:131"/>Ani ajaja keeti waan halcheef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:131">afaan banee eegadha.<verse eid="PSA 119:131"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="132" style="v" sid="PSA 119:132"/>Akkuma worra maqaa keeti jaalatuuf gootu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:132">gara kiyya deebi'iitii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:132">naa marari.<verse eid="PSA 119:132"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="133" style="v" sid="PSA 119:133"/>Akka jecha keetiititti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:133">ideensa kiyya sooressi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:133">cubbuun akka na mootu hin lakkisin.<verse eid="PSA 119:133"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="134" style="v" sid="PSA 119:134"/>Akka ani ajaja keeti eegadhu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:134">cunqursaa namaa jalaa na wodi.<verse eid="PSA 119:134"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="135" style="v" sid="PSA 119:135"/>Ana tajaajilaa keetitti fuula ifi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:135">seera keetille na barsiisi.<verse eid="PSA 119:135"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="136" style="v" sid="PSA 119:136"/>Seerri keeti waan hin eegaminiif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:136">imimmaan ila tiyya keessaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:136">akka bisaanii yaati.<verse eid="PSA 119:136"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="137" style="v" sid="PSA 119:137"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:137">ati balcha'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:137">muraan teetille dhuga'a.<verse eid="PSA 119:137"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="138" style="v" sid="PSA 119:138"/>Ati balchumma'aa fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:138">addatamummaa guutu'uun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:138">seera keeti baacheerta.<verse eid="PSA 119:138"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="139" style="v" sid="PSA 119:139"/>Diinoti kiyya jecha keeti waan dedhaneef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:139">hinaaffaan tiyya na laalessite.<verse eid="PSA 119:139"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="140" style="v" sid="PSA 119:140"/>Jechi keeti guddoo qulqullicha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:140">ani tajaajilaan keetille isa jaaladha.<verse eid="PSA 119:140"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="141" style="v" sid="PSA 119:141"/>Ani nama diqqaa tuffatama'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:141">te'ulle ajaja keeti hin deenne.<verse eid="PSA 119:141"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="142" style="v" sid="PSA 119:142"/>Balchummaan teeti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:142">balchummaa haga bara baraa ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:142">seerri keetille dhuga'a.<verse eid="PSA 119:142"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="143" style="v" sid="PSA 119:143"/>Rakkinnii fi farri na dhaqqabeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:143">ajaji keeti ammoo na gammachiisa.<verse eid="PSA 119:143"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="144" style="v" sid="PSA 119:144"/>Ajaji keeti haga bara baraa dhuga'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:144">akka ani jiru'uun le'u hubantii naaf kenni.<verse eid="PSA 119:144"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="145" style="v" sid="PSA 119:145"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:145">ani gadhaa tokkochaan gara keeti iyya.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:145">Ati deebii naaf kenni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:145">anille seera keeti hin eegadha.<verse eid="PSA 119:145"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="146" style="v" sid="PSA 119:146"/>Ani gara keeti iyya; na baasi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:146">anille seera keeti hin eegadha.<verse eid="PSA 119:146"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="147" style="v" sid="PSA 119:147"/>Ani adoo boruun hin dayya'in ka'ee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:147">qarqaarsa dhaggatiisaaf gara keeti iyya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:147">jecha keetitti addii godhadha.<verse eid="PSA 119:147"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="148" style="v" sid="PSA 119:148"/>Jecha keeti itti deddeebi'ee yaadiisaaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:148">ani halkan guutuu ila wolitti hin qabanne.<verse eid="PSA 119:148"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="149" style="v" sid="PSA 119:149"/>Akka marartii teetiititti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:149">qoonqoo tiyya dhage'i;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:149">Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:149">akka seera keetiititti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:149">lubbuu tiyya hamburi.<verse eid="PSA 119:149"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="150" style="v" sid="PSA 119:150"/>Worri mala hamaa baafatanee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:150">na miidhanu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:150">natti dhikaataneeran;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:150">ammoo seera keeti irraa fagaataneeran.<verse eid="PSA 119:150"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="151" style="v" sid="PSA 119:151"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:151">ati dhikoo jirta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:151">ajaji keeti marti dhuga'a.<verse eid="PSA 119:151"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="152" style="v" sid="PSA 119:152"/>Bara baraan akka jiraatuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:152">akka ati seera keeti baache,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:152">yennaa dheertu'uun dura</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:152">seera keeti irraa baradheera.<verse eid="PSA 119:152"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Qarqaarsa Gaafatiisa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="153" style="v" sid="PSA 119:153"/>Ani seera keeti waan hin dedhiniif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:153">ati rakkinna kiyya ilaaliitii na baasi.<verse eid="PSA 119:153"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="154" style="v" sid="PSA 119:154"/>Haajaa kiyya naaf falmiitii, na wodi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 119:154">Akka waadaa keetiititti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:154">lubbuu tiyya hamburi.<verse eid="PSA 119:154"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="155" style="v" sid="PSA 119:155"/>Worri hamaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:155">seera keeti waan hin barbaanneef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:155">fayyinni isaan irraa fagaateera.<verse eid="PSA 119:155"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="156" style="v" sid="PSA 119:156"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:156">marartiin teeti guddo'o;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:156">akka seera keetiititti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:156">lubbuu tiyya hamburi.<verse eid="PSA 119:156"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="157" style="v" sid="PSA 119:157"/>Worri na miidhuu fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:157">diinoti kiyya heddu'u;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:157">ani ammoo seera keeti irraa hin gorre.<verse eid="PSA 119:157"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="158" style="v" sid="PSA 119:158"/>Worri hin addatanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:158">jecha keetii waan hin eeganneef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:158">ani isaan ilaalee diqadhe.<verse eid="PSA 119:158"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="159" style="v" sid="PSA 119:159"/>Ajaja keeti attam akka ani jaaladhu ilaali;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:159">Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:159">akka marartii teetiititti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:159">lubbuu tiyya hamburi.<verse eid="PSA 119:159"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="160" style="v" sid="PSA 119:160"/>Jechi keeti martinuu dhuga'a.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:160">Seerri keeti balchichi martinuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:160">ka haga bara baraa ti.<verse eid="PSA 119:160"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Seera Waaqaatiif Ajajamiisa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="161" style="v" sid="PSA 119:161"/>Qondaaltoti sababa malee na miidhan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:161">ani ammoo gadhaa sodaatuun</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:161">jecha keeti ulfeessa.<verse eid="PSA 119:161"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="162" style="v" sid="PSA 119:162"/>Akka nama boojuu guddoo dhaggatee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:162">ani jecha keetitti gammada.<verse eid="PSA 119:162"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="163" style="v" sid="PSA 119:163"/>Ani dhara jibba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:163">hin diqadhalle'e;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:163">seera keeti ammoo hin jaaladha.<verse eid="PSA 119:163"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="164" style="v" sid="PSA 119:164"/>Seera keeti balchaa saniif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:164">guyya'atti yennaa torba ani si leellisa.<verse eid="PSA 119:164"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="165" style="v" sid="PSA 119:165"/>Worri seera keeti jaalatu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:165">nageya guddaa qaban;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:165">wonni isaan dande'ee gufachiisulle hin jiru.<verse eid="PSA 119:165"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="166" style="v" sid="PSA 119:166"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:166">ani addi'iin fayyisiisa keeti eegadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:166">ajaja keetille hin muummessa.<verse eid="PSA 119:166"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="167" style="v" sid="PSA 119:167"/>Lubbuun tiyya seera keeti hin eegatti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:167">anille guddisee seera san jaaladha.<verse eid="PSA 119:167"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="168" style="v" sid="PSA 119:168"/>Hujiin tiyya martinuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:168">si duratti ifa waan teeteef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:168">ani ajaja keetii fi seera keeti hin eegadha.<verse eid="PSA 119:168"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Daadimata Qarqaarsa Dhaggatiisaaf Dhikaate</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="169" style="v" sid="PSA 119:169"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:169">iyyi tiyya si bira geettuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:169">akka jecha keetiititti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:169">hubantii naaf kenni.<verse eid="PSA 119:169"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="170" style="v" sid="PSA 119:170"/>Gaaffiin tiyya si bira geettuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:170">akka waadaa keetiititti na baasi.<verse eid="PSA 119:170"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="171" style="v" sid="PSA 119:171"/>Ati seera keeti waan na barsiittuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:171">afaan kiyya leellisa hin dhangalaasa.<verse eid="PSA 119:171"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="172" style="v" sid="PSA 119:172"/>Seerri keeti marti balchaa waan te'eef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:172">arrabi kiyya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:172">marroo waadaa keetii faarsuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 119:172"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="173" style="v" sid="PSA 119:173"/>Ani ajaja keeti waan filadheef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:173">harki keeti na qarqaariisaaf qophowuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 119:173"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="174" style="v" sid="PSA 119:174"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:174">ani fayyisiisa keeti halcha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:174">seerri keetille gammada kiyya.<verse eid="PSA 119:174"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="175" style="v" sid="PSA 119:175"/>Akka si leellisuuf ani lubbuu jiraadhuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:175">seerri keeti na qarqaaruu ti.<verse eid="PSA 119:175"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="176" style="v" sid="PSA 119:176"/>Ani akka hoolee baddee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:176">karaa irraa goreera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:176">ani seera keeti waan hin dedhiniif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:176">ati ana tajaajilaa keeti barbaadi.<verse eid="PSA 119:176"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 119"/>
  <chapter number="120" style="c" sid="PSA 120"/>
  <para style="s1">Daadimata Qarqaarsa Dhaggatiisaaf Dhikaate</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Ittiin ol bayanu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 120:1"/>Rakkinna kiyya keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:1">ani gara Mootii Waan Maraa iyye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:1">innille deebii naaf kenne.<verse eid="PSA 120:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 120:2"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:2">worra dhara dubbatuu fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:2">soba dubbatu jalaa na baasi.<verse eid="PSA 120:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 120:3"/>Ee isin worra dhara dubbatu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:3">Waaqi maan isin godha laati?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:3">Inni attam isin adaba laati?<verse eid="PSA 120:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 120:4"/>Daaya loltootaa ka qara qabuun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:4">kashila ibiddaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:4">ka muka dhaddachaatiin isin adaba.<verse eid="PSA 120:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 120:5"/>Ana ka lafa worra Mesheekiititti galee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:5">dunkaanii worra Qedaarii keessa le'uuf aanne'e!<verse eid="PSA 120:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 120:6"/>Worra nageya jibbu san odduu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:6">ani yennaa hedduu le'e.<verse eid="PSA 120:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 120:7"/>Ani nama nageyaa ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:7">yennaa ani marroo nageyaa dubbadhu ammoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:7">isaan lolaaf ka'an.<verse eid="PSA 120:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 120"/>
  <chapter number="121" style="c" sid="PSA 121"/>
  <para style="s1">Ka Nu Eegu Waaqa</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Ittiin Ol bayanu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 121:1"/>Ani ila tiyyaan gara koobaa ol ilaale;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:1">qarqaarsi kiyya eessaa dhufa?<verse eid="PSA 121:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 121:2"/>Qarqaarsi kiyya ka ol-gubba'aa fi lafa dade,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:2">Mootii Waan Maraa biraa dhufa.<verse eid="PSA 121:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 121:3"/>Inni miilli keeti akka mucucaatu hin lakkisu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:3">ka si eegu hin mugu.<verse eid="PSA 121:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 121:4"/>Dhugumaan, ka Israa'el eegu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:4">hin mugu; hin rafulle'e.<verse eid="PSA 121:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 121:5"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa si eega;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:5">Mootiin Waan Maraa gaaddisa keeti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:5">inni midda keeti jira.<verse eid="PSA 121:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 121:6"/>Guyyaa aduun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:6">halkan jiin si hin miidhu.<verse eid="PSA 121:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 121:7"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:7">Waan hantuu mara irraa si eega;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:7">inni jiruu teeti hin eega.<verse eid="PSA 121:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 121:8"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa bayaa fi gala keeti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:8">ammaa jalqabee haga bara baraatitti hin eega.<verse eid="PSA 121:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 121"/>
  <chapter number="122" style="c" sid="PSA 122"/>
  <para style="s1">Leellisa Yerusaalemii</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Daawitii, Ta Ittiin ol bayanu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 122:1"/>«Gara mana Mootii Waan Maraa dhandha!»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:1">yennaa isaan naan jedhane</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:1">ani gammade.<verse eid="PSA 122:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 122:2"/>Ee Yerusaalem, miilli keenna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:2">karra teeti keessa dhaabbateera.<verse eid="PSA 122:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 122:3"/>Yerusaalem qachaa wolitti hiiqee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:3">jabeeffamee ijaarameeru.<verse eid="PSA 122:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 122:4"/>Akkuma ajaja Israa'eliif kennameetitti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:4">achitti maqaa Mootii Waan Maraa leellisiisaaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:4">gosi Mootii Waan Maraa ol bayan.<verse eid="PSA 122:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 122:5"/>Achitti moototi sanyii Daawitii kolbaa bulchiisaaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:5">barcumaa mootumma'aa dhaabbatane.<verse eid="PSA 122:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 122:6"/>Nageya Yerusaalemiitiif daadimadha'a:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:6">«Worri isii jaalatu milkowuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 122:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 122:7"/>Dalleya isi'ii keessa nageenni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:7">mana mootumma'aa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:7">ta isi'ii keessa sarmiis jiraatuu ti» jedha'a.<verse eid="PSA 122:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 122:8"/>Ani sababa firootaa fi jaalota kiyyaatiif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:8">«Nageenni si keessa jiraatuu ti» hin jedha.<verse eid="PSA 122:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 122:9"/>Sababa mana Mootii Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:9">Waaqa keennaatiif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:9">ani waan dansaa si'iif hin halcha.<verse eid="PSA 122:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 122"/>
  <chapter number="123" style="c" sid="PSA 123"/>
  <para style="s1">Daadimata Marartii Dhaggatiisaaf Dhikaate</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Ittiin Ol Bayanu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 123:1"/>Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 123:1">ilti tiyya gara keeti, ol gubbaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 123:1">ka barcumaan mootumma'aa keeti irra jiruu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 123:1">ol ilaalti.<verse eid="PSA 123:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 123:2"/>Akkuma ilti garbootaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 123:2">gara harka goottaa ifii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 123:2">ilti garbitti'ii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 123:2">gara harka giittii ifii ilaaltu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 123:2">haga ati marartii nutti mudhittutti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 123:2">Mootii Waan Maraa Waaqa keenna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 123:2">ilti teennalle gara keeti ilaalti.<verse eid="PSA 123:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 123:3"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 123:3">waan akka malee tuffatanneef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 123:3">nuu marari! Nuu Marari!<verse eid="PSA 123:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 123:4"/>Murgoon worra qanani'ii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 123:4">tuffiin worra koorameeyyi'ii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 123:4">akka malee nutti bacatteerti.<verse eid="PSA 123:4"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 123"/>
  <chapter number="124" style="c" sid="PSA 124"/>
  <para style="s1">Waaqi Kolbaa Ifii Hin Eega</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Daawitii, Ta Ittiin ol bayanu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 124:1"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:1">nu woliin adoo jiraatuu dhabaatee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:1">Israa'el,<verse eid="PSA 124:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 124:2"/>«Yennaa diinoti keenna nu lolanu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:2">Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:2">adoo nu woliin jiraatuu dhabaatee,<verse eid="PSA 124:2"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 124:3"/>yennaa aariin isaanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:3">nu irratti bobeette san,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:3">silaa adoo jirruu nu liqinsaniiyyu;<verse eid="PSA 124:3"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 124:4"/>silaa bisaan nu haxowee dabaraayyu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:4">lolaan nu irra garagalaayyu;<verse eid="PSA 124:4"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 124:5"/>silaa bisaan hamaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:5">nu irra yaa'aayyu» jettuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 124:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 124:6"/>Ilkaan isaanii akka nu kukkutatu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:6">ka nu hin lakkisin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:6">Mootiin Waan Maraa leellifamuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 124:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 124:7"/>Akka sinbirrooti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:7">tiyyoo worra adansuu jalaa baatu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:7">nuutille tiyyoo isaanii jalaa baane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:7">tiyyoon ciccitte; nuutille jalaa baane.<verse eid="PSA 124:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 124:8"/>Maqaa Mootii Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:8">ol-gubba'aa fi lafa dadeen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:8">nuuti qarqaarsa dhagganne.<verse eid="PSA 124:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 124"/>
  <chapter number="125" style="c" sid="PSA 125"/>
  <para style="s1">Wobii Kolbaa Waaqaa</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Ittiin Ol Bayanu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 125:1"/>Worri Mootii Waan Maraatitti addatu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:1">akka gaara Xiyoonii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:1">ka ijjumaa hin tachoone,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:1">ka haga bara baraa jabaatee dhaabbatuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 125:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 125:2"/>Akkuma gaaroti Yerusaalem marsaneeranu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:2">ammaa jalqabee haga bara baraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:2">Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:2">kolbaa ifii hin marsa.<verse eid="PSA 125:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 125:3"/>Worri hamaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:3">lafa worra balchoole'ee hin bulchanu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:3">yoo bulchane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:3">kolbaan balchaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:3">waan hantuu hujiisaaf harka diriirfatti.<verse eid="PSA 125:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 125:4"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:4">worra dansaa te'eef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:4">worra gadhaa ifii keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:4">qajeelaa te'eefille dansaa godhi.<verse eid="PSA 125:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 125:5"/>Ammoo, Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:5">worra waan hantuu huju,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:5">worra karaa dabaalessa ifii gula deebi'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:5">woliin hin gata.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 125:5"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 125:5">Nageenni Israa'eliif te'uu ti.<verse eid="PSA 125:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 125"/>
  <chapter number="126" style="c" sid="PSA 126"/>
  <para style="s1">Faaruu Worra Boojuu Keessaa Deebi'ee</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Ittiin Ol Bayanu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 126:1"/>Yennaa Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:1">boojuu keessaa gara Xiyoonii nu deebise,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:1">oojjuu nutti fakkaatte.<verse eid="PSA 126:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 126:2"/>Afaan keenna kollaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:2">arrabi keenna ililleetti'iin guutame.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 126:2">Achiin duuba gosa biyya adda addaa oddu'utti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:2">«Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:2">waan guddoo isaaniif tolche» jedhante.<verse eid="PSA 126:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 126:3"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:3">waan guddoo nuuf godheera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:3">nuutille gammanne.<verse eid="PSA 126:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 126:4"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:4">Goomolee kibba Kana'aaniitiif<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">126:4 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Kibba Kana'aanii: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Afaan Ibrootaatiin Negeb </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jedha. </char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:4">akkuma bisaan deebittu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:4">akka dur jirrutti nu deebisi.<verse eid="PSA 126:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 126:5"/>Worri imimmaan dhangalaasaa facaasane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:5">ilillisaa haammatan.<verse eid="PSA 126:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 126:6"/>Worri sanyii facaasiisaaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:6">ba'atanee bowaa deemanu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:6">laddee ba'atanee ilillisaa hin deebi'an.<verse eid="PSA 126:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 126"/>
  <chapter number="127" style="c" sid="PSA 127"/>
  <para style="s1">Leellisa Arjummaa Waaqaatiif Dhikaate</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Solomoonii, Ta Ittiin Ol Bayanu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 127:1"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:1">mana yoo hin ijaarin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:1">worri mana ijaaru</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:1">akkasumaan itti elowan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:1">Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:1">qachaa yoo hin eegin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:1">eeddoti qacha'aa akkasumaan elowan.<verse eid="PSA 127:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 127:2"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:2">worra jaalatuuf foora waan kennuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:2">bari'iin ka'iis,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:2">turanee rafiis,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:2">bu'aa hin qabu.<verse eid="PSA 127:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 127:3"/>Ijoolleen kennansa Mootii Waan Maraa ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:3">midhaan gadaamessaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:3">eebba isaa ti.<verse eid="PSA 127:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 127:4"/>Ilmaan dargaggumma'aan uumatanu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:4">akka daaya harka loltootaa keessa jirtuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 127:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 127:5"/>Nami ilmaan akka daayaa mana guutate</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:5">gammaduu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:5">diinota ifii woliin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:5">karra qacha'aa keessatti yennaa wol falme,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:5">inni hin qaanowu.<verse eid="PSA 127:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 127"/>
  <chapter number="128" style="c" sid="PSA 128"/>
  <para style="s1">Gatii Nama Waaqaaf Ajajamuu</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Ittiin Ol Bayanu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 128:1"/>Nami Mootii Waan Maraa sodaatu marti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:1">ka karaa isaa ideemu ka gammade.<verse eid="PSA 128:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 128:2"/>Waan harka keetiin eloottee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:2">dhaggatte hin nyaatta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:2">ati hin gammadda; hin milkoottalle'e.<verse eid="PSA 128:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 128:3"/>Niitiin teeti mana keeti keessatti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:3">akka muka woyni'ii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:3">ka midhaan buusuu hin teeti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:3">ijoolleen teeti adaala qorii teetiititti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:3">akka lattuu muka ejersaa hin teeti.<verse eid="PSA 128:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 128:4"/>Nami Mootii Waan Maraa sodaatu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:4">akkana hin eebbifama.<verse eid="PSA 128:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 128:5"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:5">gaara Xiyoonii irraa si eebbisuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:5">bara jiruu teetii mara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:5">qananummaa Yerusaalemii dhaggi.<verse eid="PSA 128:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 128:6"/>Ijoollee ijoollee teetii dhaggi;</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 128:6"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 128:6">Nageenni Israa'eliif te'uu ti.<verse eid="PSA 128:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 128"/>
  <chapter number="129" style="c" sid="PSA 129"/>
  <para style="s1">Daadimata Diinota Xiyoonii Irratti Dhikaate</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Ittiin Ol Bayanu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 129:1"/>Kolbaan Israa'elii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:1">«Dargaggummaa tiyyaa jalqabanee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:1">diinoti guddoo na rakkisaneeran;<verse eid="PSA 129:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 129:2"/>«Isaan dargaggummaa tiyyaa jalqabanee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:2">guddoo na rakkisaneeran;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:2">te'uu malee na hin injifanne.<verse eid="PSA 129:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 129:3"/>Akka nama fichaa qotuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:3">dudda kiyya babbassanee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:3">babadhisanee dudda kiyya madeessane.<verse eid="PSA 129:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 129:4"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa ammoo balcha'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:4">inni wodaroo worra hama'aa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:4">na irraa kuteera» jettuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 129:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 129:5"/>Worri Xiyoon jibbu martinuu qaanowanee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:5">gara duubaa deebi'uu ti.<verse eid="PSA 129:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 129:6"/>Akka marra mana irratti latee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:6">adoo hin guddatin qooruu te'anuu ti;<verse eid="PSA 129:6"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 129:7"/>marri sun qabaa harka nama isa haamuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:7">yookiin hanqafoo isaa hin guutu.<verse eid="PSA 129:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 129:8"/>Worri achiin dabaru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:8">«Eebbi Mootiin Waan Maraa isiniif te'uu ti!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:8">Nuuti maqaa Mootii Waan Maraatiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:8">isin eebbinna!» isaaniin hin jedhin.<verse eid="PSA 129:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 129"/>
  <chapter number="130" style="c" sid="PSA 130"/>
  <para style="s1">Faaruu Qarqaarsa Dhaggatiisaaf Dhikaatte</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Ittiin Ol Bayanu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 130:1"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:1">ani qilee keessaa gara keeti iyya;<verse eid="PSA 130:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 130:2"/>Ee Gootta'a, qoonqoo tiyya naaf dhage'i!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:2">Gurri keeti gara iyya tiyyaa caqasuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 130:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 130:3"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:3">ati adoo yakkaa namatti laakkottee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:3">ee Gootta'a silaa eennutti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:3">si dura dhaabbatuu dande'a?<verse eid="PSA 130:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 130:4"/>Ammoo akka nuuti si sodaannuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:4">ati nu'uuf araaranta.<verse eid="PSA 130:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 130:5"/>Ani Mootii Waan Maraa eegadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:5">Lubbuun tiyyalle hin eegatti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:5">addi'iin jecha isaa eegadha.<verse eid="PSA 130:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 130:6"/>Eeddota bari'iisa eegatanu caalaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:6">ee, eeddota bari'iisa eegatanu caalaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:6">lubbuun tiyya Goottaa eegatti.<verse eid="PSA 130:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 130:7"/>Jaalalli bara baraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:7">Mootii Waan Maraa bira waan jiruuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:7">wodiisaaf hunni guddoolle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:7">isa bira waan jirtuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:7">ee Israa'el, Mootii Waan Maraatitti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:7">addii godhadhu.<verse eid="PSA 130:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 130:8"/>Inni yakkaa isi'ii mara irraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:8">Israa'el hin woda.<verse eid="PSA 130:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 130"/>
  <chapter number="131" style="c" sid="PSA 131"/>
  <para style="s1">Gad Ifi Qabanee Waaqatti Addatiisa</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Daawitii, Ta Ittiin Ol Bayanu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 131:1"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 131:1">gadhaan kiyya hin kooru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 131:1">mataa hin dhaabu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 131:1">waan gugurdoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 131:1">yookiin waan baasaa hin huju.<verse eid="PSA 131:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 131:2"/>Akka annuu harma irraa guutee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 131:2">haadha woliin jirtuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 131:2">ani lubbuu tiyya sarmisiisee cadhisiise;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 131:2">akka annuu harma irraa guutee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 131:2">lubbuun tiyya na keessatti cadhitte.<verse eid="PSA 131:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 131:3"/>Ee kolbaa Israa'elii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 131:3">ammaa jalqabiitii haga bara baraatitti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 131:3">Mootii Waan Maraatitti addii godhadhu.<verse eid="PSA 131:3"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 131"/>
  <chapter number="132" style="c" sid="PSA 132"/>
  <para style="s1">Leellisa Galma Waaqaa</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Ittiin Ol Bayanu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 132:1"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:1">Daawitii fi farra inni dhagge qaabadhu.<verse eid="PSA 132:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 132:2"/>Inni Mootii Waan Maraatiif kakuu kakatee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 132:2">Waaqa hunnaamessa Yaaqoobiitiif waadaa galee,<verse eid="PSA 132:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3-5" style="v" sid="PSA 132:3-5"/>«Haga Mootii Waan Maraatiif</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:3-5">addee qopheessutti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:3-5">Waaqa hunnaamessa Yaaqoobiitiif</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:3-5">haga mana ijaarutti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:3-5">mana kiyya hin seenu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:3-5">yookiin gara taqee tiyyaa hin dhaqu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 132:3-5">Ani hin rafu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:3-5">yookiin hin mugu» jedhe.<verse eid="PSA 132:3-5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 132:6"/>Nuuti Efraata'atti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:6">marroo Saanduqa Gondooro'oo dhageenne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:6">diida Yaa'ariititti isii dhaggine.<verse eid="PSA 132:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 132:7"/>Kowa'a, gara addee Mootiin Waan Maraa le'uu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:7">dhandhaa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:7">Ejjeta miila isaa jalatti isaaf sagannaa.<verse eid="PSA 132:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 132:8"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa, ka'i!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:8">Saanduqa Gondooro'oo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:8">ka hunna teeti mudhisu woliin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:8">gara addee foora keetii dhaqi.<verse eid="PSA 132:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 132:9"/>Hayyooti teeti balchummaa uffatanuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:9">Addatantooti teetille ilillisaa faarsanuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 132:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 132:10"/>Tajaajilaa keeti Daawitiif jedhiitii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:10">nama muudde hin lakkisin.<verse eid="PSA 132:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 132:11"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:11">kakuu dhuga'aa ta hin jijjiirane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:11">Daawitiif kakatee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 132:11">«Ilmaanuma sanyii teetii keessaa tokkocha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:11">ani barcumaa mootumma'aa keeti irra</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:11">hin teessisa.<verse eid="PSA 132:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 132:12"/>Ilmaan teeti Gondooroo tiyya yoo eegatane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:12">ajaja ani isaan barassiisu yoo eegatane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:12">ilmaan isaaniille haga bara baraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:12">barcumaa mootumma'aa keeti irra</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:12">hin tee'an» jedheera.<verse eid="PSA 132:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 132:13"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:13">Xiyoon waan filateef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:13">qe'ee ifii godhatiisaaf fedheera:<verse eid="PSA 132:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 132:14"/>Inni, «Tun haga bara baraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:14">addee foora kiyyaa ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:14">ani waan isii jaaladheef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:14">addee le'u isii hin godhadha.<verse eid="PSA 132:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 132:15"/>Waan nyaataatiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:15">baceessee isii hin eebbisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:15">hiyyeeyyii isi'ii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:15">sagalee hin quussa.<verse eid="PSA 132:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 132:16"/>Hayyoota isi'ii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:16">fayyinna itti hin uffisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:16">addatantooti isi'iille</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:16">ilillisaa hin faarsan.<verse eid="PSA 132:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 132:17"/>Maatii Daawitii keessaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:17">mootii hin muuda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:17">ka muude saniif akka inni bulchu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:17">karaa hin qopheessa.<verse eid="PSA 132:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 132:18"/>Diinota isaa qaanii itti hin uffisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:18">kallachi isa irraa ammoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:18">hin balaqqisa» jedheera.<verse eid="PSA 132:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 132"/>
  <chapter number="133" style="c" sid="PSA 133"/>
  <para style="s1">Jaalala Kolbaa Waaqaa</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Daawitii Ta Ittiin Ol Bayanu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 133:1"/>Kolbaan Waaqaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 133:1">tokkumma'aan yennaa woliin leetu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 133:1">attam attam dansa'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 133:1">attam attam nama gammachiisa!<verse eid="PSA 133:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 133:2"/>Tokkummaan tun</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 133:2">akka zayitii ejersaa ta gatii guddo'oo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 133:2">ta mataa irraa areeda irra gad yaatu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 133:2">areeda Aaronii irra,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 133:2">haga handaara woyaa isaa gad yaatuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 133:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 133:3"/>Tokkummaan tun</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 133:3">akka fixeensa gaara Hermoonii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 133:3">ka gaarota Xiyoonii irratti bu'uu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 133:3">eebbi jiruu bara baraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 133:3">achi irratti akka dhaggamu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 133:3">Mootiin Waan Maraa ajajeera.<verse eid="PSA 133:3"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 133"/>
  <chapter number="134" style="c" sid="PSA 134"/>
  <para style="s1">Waaqa Leellisa'a</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Ittiin Ol Bayanu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 134:1"/>Isin tajaajiltooti Mootii Waan Maraa marti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 134:1">worri halkan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 134:1">Galma Mootii Waan Maraa keessa tajaajiltanu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 134:1">Mootii Waan Maraa leellisa'a!<verse eid="PSA 134:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 134:2"/>Addee Woyyittii keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 134:2">harka keessan ol kaasa'aa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 134:2">Mootii Waan Maraa leellisa'a!<verse eid="PSA 134:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 134:3"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 134:3">ol-gubba'aa fi lafa dade,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 134:3">Xiyoon keessaa isin eebbisu ti!<verse eid="PSA 134:3"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 134"/>
  <chapter number="135" style="c" sid="PSA 135"/>
  <para style="s1">Faaruu Leellisaa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 135:1"/>Mootii Waan Maraa leellisa'a!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 135:1"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 135:1">Maqaa Mootii Waan Maraa leellisa'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:1">ee tajaajiltoota Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:1">isa leellisa'a!<verse eid="PSA 135:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 135:2"/>Isin worri</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:2">mana Mootii Waan Maraa keessaa fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:2">badhinna mana Waaqa keennaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:2">keessa tajaajiltanu isa leellisa'a.<verse eid="PSA 135:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 135:3"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:3">dansaa waan te'eef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:3">isa leellisa'a!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:3">Maqaan isaa gammachiisaa waan te'eef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:3">faaru'uun leellisa'a!<verse eid="PSA 135:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 135:4"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa Yaaqoob ifiif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:4">Israa'el qabeenna ifii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:4">ka addaa godhee filateera.<verse eid="PSA 135:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 135:5"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa guddaa akka te'e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:5">Goottaan keenna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:5">waaqota mara akka caalu ani hin beeka.<verse eid="PSA 135:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 135:6"/>Ol-gubbaa keessaa fi lafa irratti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:6">abbaaya'aa fi qilee isi'ii mara keessatti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:6">Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:6">waan fedhe mara godha.<verse eid="PSA 135:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 135:7"/>Inni duumensa qaccee lafaatii kaasee fida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:7">bokkeya woliin balaqqeettii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:7">mana kuusaa ifii keessaa qilleensa fida.<verse eid="PSA 135:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 135:8"/>Inni angafa ilmaan namaatii fi hori'ii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:8">ka biyya Gibxi'ii fixe.<verse eid="PSA 135:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 135:9"/>Ee biyya Gibxi'ii, inni si keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:9">Fara'oonii fi tajaajiltoota isaa mara irratti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:9">bilbaasaa fi waan maade'ee huje.<verse eid="PSA 135:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 135:10"/>Inni gosa biyya adda addaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:10">hedduu gad dhowee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:10">mootota hunnaameyyii,<verse eid="PSA 135:10"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 135:11"/>mootii Amoorotaa Sihoon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:11">mootii biyya Baashaanii Oog,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:11">mootummoota Kana'aanii mara ijjeese.<verse eid="PSA 135:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 135:12"/>Lafa isaaniille akka dhaalaatitti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:12">kolbaa ifii Israa'eliif dhaala kenne.<verse eid="PSA 135:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 135:13"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:13">maqaan keeti haga bara baraa jiraata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:13">Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:13">dhaloota mara keessatti hin qaabatanta.<verse eid="PSA 135:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 135:14"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:14">kolbaa ifiitiif muraa hin kenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:14">tajaajiltoota ifiitiifille marartii hin qaba.<verse eid="PSA 135:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 135:15"/>Waaqoti dharaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:15">ka gosa biyya adda addaa worqi'ii fi meetii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:15">harka namaatiin hujamane.<verse eid="PSA 135:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 135:16"/>Isaan afaan qaban malee, hin dubbatanu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:16">ila qaban malee, hin dhagganu.<verse eid="PSA 135:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 135:17"/>Isaan gurra qaban malee, hin dhage'anu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:17">afaan isaanii keessalle hafuurri hin jiru.<verse eid="PSA 135:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 135:18"/>Worri isaan hujuu fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:18">isaanitti dhugeeffatu martinuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:18">akkuma isaanii jiran.<verse eid="PSA 135:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 135:19"/>Ee kolbaa Israa'elii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:19">Mootii Waan Maraa leellisa'a!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 135:19">Ee hayyoota sanyii Aaronii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:19">Mootii Waan Maraa leellisa'a!<verse eid="PSA 135:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 135:20"/>Sanyii Lewwootaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:20">Mootii Waan Maraa leellisa'a!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 135:20">Isin worri Mootii Waan Maraa sodaattanu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:20">Mootii Waan Maraa leellisa'a!<verse eid="PSA 135:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 135:21"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:21">ka Yerusaalem keessa le'u,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:21">Xiyoon keessatti leellifamuu ti!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 135:21"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 135:21">Mootii Waan Maraa leellisa'a.<verse eid="PSA 135:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 135"/>
  <chapter number="136" style="c" sid="PSA 136"/>
  <para style="s1">Faaruu Galataa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 136:1"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:1">dansaa waan te'eef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:1">isa galateeffadha'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:1">jaalalli isa ka bara baraa ti.<verse eid="PSA 136:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 136:2"/>Waaqa waaqotaa galateeffadha'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:2">jaalalli isaa ka bara baraa ti.<verse eid="PSA 136:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 136:3"/>Goottaa goottotaa galateeffadha'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:3">jaalalli isaa ka bara baraa ti.<verse eid="PSA 136:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 136:4"/>Ka qofuu baasa guddaa huju,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:4">jaalalli isaa ka bara baraa ti.<verse eid="PSA 136:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 136:5"/>Ka qarummaa ifiitiin ol-gubbaa dade,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:5">jaalalli isaa ka bara baraa ti.<verse eid="PSA 136:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 136:6"/>Ka lafa bisaan gubbaa diriirse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:6">jaalalli isaa ka bara baraa ti.<verse eid="PSA 136:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 136:7"/>Ka ifa gugurdaa huje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:7">jaalalli isaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:7">haga bara baraa jiraata.<verse eid="PSA 136:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 136:8"/>Ka aduun guyyaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:8">baallii akka qabaattu godhe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:8">jaalalli isaa ka bara baraa ti.<verse eid="PSA 136:8"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 136:9"/>Ka Ji'aa fi urjooti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:9">halkan akka baallii qabaatanu godhe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:9">jaalalli isaa ka bara baraa ti.<verse eid="PSA 136:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 136:10"/>Ka angafoota ilmaan worra Gibxi'ii ijjeese,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:10">jaalalli isaa ka bara baraa ti.<verse eid="PSA 136:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 136:11"/>Ka Israa'eloota Gibxii keessaa baase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:11">jaalalli isaa ka bara baraa ti.<verse eid="PSA 136:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 136:12"/>Ka hunna ifii guddo'oo fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:12">jabeenna ifiitiin tana godhe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:12">jaalalli isaa ka bara baraa ti.<verse eid="PSA 136:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 136:13"/>Ka abbaayaa diintuu gargar kute,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:13">jaalalli isaa ka bara baraa ti.<verse eid="PSA 136:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 136:14"/>Ka kolbaan Israa'elii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:14">odduu isi'ii akka dabartu godhe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:14">jaalalli isaa ka bara baraa ti.<verse eid="PSA 136:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 136:15"/>Fara'oonii fi loltoota isaa ammoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:15">abbaayaa diintuu keessatti ka fixe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:15">jaalalli isaa ka bara baraa ti.<verse eid="PSA 136:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 136:16"/>Ka goomolee keessa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:16">kolbaa ifii sooresse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:16">jaalalli isaa ka bara baraa ti.<verse eid="PSA 136:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 136:17"/>Ka mootota gugurdoo ijjeese,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:17">jaalalli isaa ka bara baraa ti.<verse eid="PSA 136:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 136:18"/>Ka mootota hunnaameyyii ijjeese,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:18">jaalalli isaa ka bara baraa ti.<verse eid="PSA 136:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 136:19"/>Ka mootii worra Amoorotaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:19">Sihoon ijjeese,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:19">jaalalli isaa ka bara baraa ti.<verse eid="PSA 136:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 136:20"/>Ka mootii Baashaanii, Oog ijjeese,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:20">jaalalli isaa ka bara baraa ti.<verse eid="PSA 136:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 136:21"/>Ka lafa isaanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:21">dhaala godhee Israa'elootaaf kenne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:21">jaalalli isaa ka bara baraa ti.<verse eid="PSA 136:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 136:22"/>Israa'eloota</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:22">tajaajiltoota ifiitiif ka dhaalchise,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:22">jaalalli isaa ka bara baraa ti.<verse eid="PSA 136:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 136:23"/>Ka injifatama keenna keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:23">nu qaabate,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:23">jaalalli isaa ka bara baraa ti.<verse eid="PSA 136:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 136:24"/>Ka diinota keenna jalaa nu baase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:24">jaalalli isaa ka bara baraa ti.<verse eid="PSA 136:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 136:25"/>Ka dada maraaf sagalee kennu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:25">jaalalli isaa ka bara baraa ti.<verse eid="PSA 136:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 136:26"/>Waaqa ol-gubba'aa galateeffadha'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:26">jaalalli isaa ka bara baraa ti.<verse eid="PSA 136:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 136"/>
  <chapter number="137" style="c" sid="PSA 137"/>
  <para style="s1">Gadda Israa'elootaa Ka Boojuu Keessaa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 137:1"/>Nuuti laga Baabilonii bira teennee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:1">yennaa Xiyoon qaabanne boonne.<verse eid="PSA 137:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 137:2"/>Muka olaati'ii irratti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:2">kiraarota keenna gugurdaa san fafanninne.<verse eid="PSA 137:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 137:3"/>Worri booji'ee nu farrisiisu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:3">achitti faaruu isaan gammachiittu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:3">akka faarsinu nu gaafatanee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:3">«Faaruu marroo Xiyoonii keessaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:3">takkattii faarsa'a» jedhane.<verse eid="PSA 137:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 137:4"/>Lafa ormaa keessatti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:4">nuuti attam faaruu Mootii Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:4">faarsuu dandeenna ree?<verse eid="PSA 137:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 137:5"/>Ee Yerusaalem, yoo ani si dedhe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:5">harki kiyya middichi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:5">ogummaa ifii dedhuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 137:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 137:6"/>Yerusaalem, ani yoo si hin qaabatin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:6">waan itti gammadu mara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:6">yoo si hin caalchisin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:6">arrabi kiyya laagadaa kiyyatti goguu ti.<verse eid="PSA 137:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 137:7"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:7">guyyaa Yerusaalem diigante,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:7">worri Edoomii, «Diiga'a! Diiga'a!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:7">Haga hundee isi'iititti gad jissa'a!»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:7">attam akka isaan jedhane qaabadhu.<verse eid="PSA 137:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 137:8"/>Ee Baabilonii diigantu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:8">Waan ati nu irratti goote,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:8">ka deebisee si irratti godhu ka gammade.<verse eid="PSA 137:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 137:9"/>Ka daa'immaan teeti qabee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:9">rassaa irratti macalaasu ka gammade.<verse eid="PSA 137:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 137"/>
  <chapter number="138" style="c" sid="PSA 138"/>
  <para style="s1">Faaruu Galataa</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Daawitii</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 138:1"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:1">ani gadhaa tokkochaan si galateeffadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:1">waaqota duratti ani faaru'uun si leellisa.<verse eid="PSA 138:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 138:2"/>Ani gara Galma keeti woyyichaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:2">fuula galee sagada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:2">jaalala keeti ka bara baraatii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:2">addatamummaa keetiifille,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:2">maqaa keetii fi jecha keeti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:2">waan mara caalaa waan saaddeef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:2">ani maqaa keeti leellisa.<verse eid="PSA 138:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 138:3"/>Yennaa ani si waame,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:3">ati deebii naaf kennite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:3">ati na jabeessitee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:3">lubbuun tiyya hunna horatte.<verse eid="PSA 138:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 138:4"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:4">jecha afaan keetii yennaa dhage'ane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:4">moototi lafaa martinuu si leellisan.<verse eid="PSA 138:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 138:5"/>Ulfinni Mootii Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:5">guddaa waan te'eef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:5">isaan marroo karaa isaa hin faarfatan.<verse eid="PSA 138:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 138:6"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa ol aanaa te'ulle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:6">inni worra gad aanaa hin ilaala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:6">worra kooru ammoo fago'otti beeka.<verse eid="PSA 138:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 138:7"/>Ani rakkinna keessa yoo ideemelle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:7">ati jiruu tiyya hin eedda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:7">ati harka keeti diriirsitee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:7">mufii diinota kiyyaa mormita;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:7">harka keeti middichaan na hin baacha.<verse eid="PSA 138:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 138:8"/>Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:8">ati yaada keeti mara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:8">naaf hin muummessita;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:8">ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:8">jaalalli keeti ka bara baraa ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:8">hujii harka keetii ati hin lakkisin.<verse eid="PSA 138:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 138"/>
  <chapter number="139" style="c" sid="PSA 139"/>
  <para style="s1">Waaqa Waan Mara Beeku</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Daawitii, sooressa faarfattootaatiif.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 139:1"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:1">ati qorqortee na beetteerta.<verse eid="PSA 139:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 139:2"/>Ati teessoo tiyyaa fi ka'a tiyya hin beetta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:2">yaada kiyya fago'ottuu hubatta.<verse eid="PSA 139:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 139:3"/>Addee ani deemu fi itti foorfadhu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:3">hubattee beetta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:3">ati hujii tiyya mara hin beetta.<verse eid="PSA 139:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 139:4"/>Adoo dubbiin afaan kiyyaa hin bayin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:4">ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:4">ati dubbii san maraayyuu hin beetta.<verse eid="PSA 139:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 139:5"/>Ati duraa fi duuba kiyya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:5">harka keeti ana irra qaddeerta.<verse eid="PSA 139:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 139:6"/>Beekkumsi akkasii akka malee naaf baasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:6">akka malee hubantii tiyyaan ol.<verse eid="PSA 139:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 139:7"/>Ayyaana keeti duraa eessa deemuu dande'a?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:7">Fuula keeti duraa eessa baqatuu dande'a?<verse eid="PSA 139:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 139:8"/>Gara ol-gubba'aa yoo ol baye, ati achi jiraata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:8">addee worri du'e jiru keessa yoo irkadhelle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:8">ati achi jirta.<verse eid="PSA 139:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 139:9"/>Ani koola baasee akka dayya'a boru'uu ka'ee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:9">gara seensuma adu'uutitti yoo qubadhe,<verse eid="PSA 139:9"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 139:10"/>silaa achille'etti harki keeti na hin sooressa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:10">harki keeti middichi jabeessee na qabaayyu.<verse eid="PSA 139:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 139:11"/>Ani, «Dukkanti dhugumaan na hin golliti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:11">ifi adaala kiyyaalle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:11">halkan hin te'a!» yoo jedhe,<verse eid="PSA 139:11"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 139:12"/>dukkantinuu sitti hin dukkanoottu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:12">si'iif dukkanti akka ifaa waan teeteef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:12">halkan akka guyya'aa ifa.<verse eid="PSA 139:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 139:13"/>Keessa namummaa tiyyaa ka dade si'i;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:13">gadaamessa haadha tiyyaa keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:13">sittuu na dade.<verse eid="PSA 139:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 139:14"/>Ani baasa maso'oo te'ee waan dadameef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:14">ani si leellisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:14">hujiin teeti waan maade'ee ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:14">anille tana miidhassee beeka.<verse eid="PSA 139:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 139:15"/>Ani yennaa addee dhossa'aatitti dadame,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:15">qilee gadaamessaa keessatti dadame;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:15">lafeen tiyyaayyuu si duraa hin dhokanne.<verse eid="PSA 139:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 139:16"/>Gadhaa haadha tiyyaa keessatti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:16">adoo ani dhiigaatuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:16">ilti teeti na dhaggite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:16">dhaladhee barri jiruu tiyyaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:16">laakkowamiisa adoo hin jalqabin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:16">guyyooti naaf yaadamane marti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:16">kitaaba keeti keessatti barreeffamane.<verse eid="PSA 139:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 139:17"/>Ee Waaqa, yaadi keeti hubatiisaaf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:17">attam attam natti ulfaata!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:17">Guutumatti attam attam bacata!<verse eid="PSA 139:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 139:18"/>Ani laakkowiisaaf yoo wodhaane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:18">maansa caala hin bacata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:18">ani yennaa dammaqu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:18">ammalle sima woliin jira.<verse eid="PSA 139:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 139:19"/>Ee Waaqa, nama hamaa adoo ijjeettee!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:19">Isin worri dhiiga namaa dhangalaasu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:19">na irraa fagaadha'a!<verse eid="PSA 139:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 139:20"/>Isaan hammeennaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:20">marroo teeti dubbatan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:20">diinoti keeti akkasumaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:20">maqaa keeti kaasan.<verse eid="PSA 139:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 139:21"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:21">ani worra si jibbu hin jibba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:21">worra si irratti ka'ulle ani hin diqadha.<verse eid="PSA 139:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 139:22"/>Ani ijjumaa isaan jibba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:22">isaan diinota natti te'aneeran.<verse eid="PSA 139:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 139:23"/>Ee Waaqa, qorqoriitii gadhaa kiyya beeki;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:23">haga na ilaaliitii yaaddoo tiyya beeki.<verse eid="PSA 139:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 139:24"/>Hammeenni yoo na keessa jiraate ilaali!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:24">Karaa bara baraa irra na sooressi.<verse eid="PSA 139:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 139"/>
  <chapter number="140" style="c" sid="PSA 140"/>
  <para style="s1">Diinota jalaa Bayiisaaf Daadimata Dhikaate</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Daawitii, sooressa faarfattootaatiif</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 140:1"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:1">namoota hamaa jalaa na baasi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:1">worra hunnaan nama irratti ka'u</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:1">na irraa eegi.<verse eid="PSA 140:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 140:2"/>Isaan waan hantuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:2">qalbii ifii keessatti yaadan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:2">yennaa mara lola kaasan.<verse eid="PSA 140:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 140:3"/>Isaan arraba ifiitiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:3">akka dhudhuufa'aa nama iddan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:3">hidhii isaanii jala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:3">hadhaa buuti'iititti jira.<verse eid="PSA 140:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 140:4"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:4">harka worra hama'aa irraa na eegi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:4">worra hunnaan nama irratti ka'u,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:4">ka miila kiyya qaxafiisaaf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:4">mala dhowanu irraa na eegi.<verse eid="PSA 140:4"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 140:5"/>Worri kooru fonxoroo naaf afe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:5">isaan wodaroo caccoo ifii diriirsane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:5">tiyyoo karaa irratti naaf keyane.<verse eid="PSA 140:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 140:6"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:6">ani si'iin, «Ati Waaqa kiyya» jedha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:6">ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:6">iyya tiyya dhage'i.<verse eid="PSA 140:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 140:7"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:7">Goottaa kiyya, jabaa na baachu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:7">ati guyyaa lolaa mataa kiyya golliteerta.<verse eid="PSA 140:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 140:8"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:8">fedhii nama hama'aa hin muummessiniif;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:8">mala dhowelle hin milkeessiniif.<verse eid="PSA 140:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 140:9"/>Worra na marsee mataa togu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:9">sababi afaan isaanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:9">isaanuma irratti garagaluu ti.<verse eid="PSA 140:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 140:10"/>Kashilli ibiddaa isaan irra bu'uu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:10">ibiddatti yookiin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:10">boolla deebi'anee keessaa hin baane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:10">keessatti gatamanuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 140:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 140:11"/>Nami maqaa namaa balleessu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:11">biyya keessatti hin qubatin!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 140:11">Ka hunnaan nama irratti ka'ulle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:11">wonni hantuun isa adansituu ti.<verse eid="PSA 140:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 140:12"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:12">haajaa worra hiyyeeyyi'ii akka fixu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:12">worra rakkata'aaf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:12">haqa akka muru ani hin beeka.<verse eid="PSA 140:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 140:13"/>Dhugumaan worri balchooleen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:13">maqaa isaa hin leellisan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:13">worri qajeelaan fuula isaa dura hin le'an.<verse eid="PSA 140:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 140"/>
  <chapter number="141" style="c" sid="PSA 141"/>
  <para style="s1">Daadimata Cubbuu Akka Hin Hunyeef Dhikaate</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Daawitii</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 141:1"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:1">ani si Waammadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:1">ati ariifadhuu na bira koy!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 141:1">Yennaa ani si waammadhu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:1">qoonqoo tiyya dhage'i.<verse eid="PSA 141:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 141:2"/>Daadimati kiyya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:2">si duratti akka hixaana aarfamuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:2">harka ol kaasuun kiyya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:2">akka ciincaa galgalaa te'uu ti.<verse eid="PSA 141:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 141:3"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:3">afaan kiyyaaf eedduu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:3">hidhii tiyyaaf tissee tolchi.<verse eid="PSA 141:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 141:4"/>Hantuu hujiisaaf akka hin halchine,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:4">worra hantuu huju woliin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:4">qooda akka hin fudhanne na eegi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:4">worra hantuu huju woliin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:4">sagalee isaanii dansaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:4">akka nyaadhu na hin lakkisin.<verse eid="PSA 141:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 141:5"/>Nami balchaan na dhaaniis naaf dansa'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:5">na xixiis isaalle akka dhadhaa mata'aa ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:5">mataan kiyya dhadhaa hin jibbu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 141:5">Hujii worra hama'aa didiisaaf ammoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:5">ani yennaa mara daadimadha.<verse eid="PSA 141:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 141:6"/>Bulchitooti isaanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:6">yennaa bowwaa rassa'aatitti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:6">gad qolaanfamane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:6">wonni ani dubbadhe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:6">dhugaa akka teete hin beekan.<verse eid="PSA 141:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 141:7"/>Isaan, «Akkuma nami lafa qotee butuchu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:7">lafeen teennalle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:7">addee worri du'e jirutti bittinnootte»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:7">hin jedhan.<verse eid="PSA 141:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 141:8"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:8">Goottaa kiyya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:8">ilti tiyya gara keeti ilaalti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:8">ani gara keeti baqadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:8">akka ani du'u na hin lakkisin.<verse eid="PSA 141:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 141:9"/>Fonxoroo isaan naaf afane irraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:9">tiyyoo worra hantuu hujuu irraa na eegi.<verse eid="PSA 141:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 141:10"/>Ani nageyaan dabaree,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:10">worri hamaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:10">tiyyoo ifumaaf afeen qabamuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 141:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 141"/>
  <chapter number="142" style="c" sid="PSA 142"/>
  <para style="s1">Miidhaa Jalaa Bayiisaaf Daadimata Dhikaate</para>
  <para style="s2">Wolaloo Daawitii, ta yennaa inni gadda keessa jiruu; Daadimata.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 142:1"/>Ani qoonqoo ol qabadhee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:1">gara Mootii Waan Maraa iyya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:1">marartii dhaggatiisaaf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:1">Mootii Waan Maraa gaafadha.<verse eid="PSA 142:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 142:2"/>Komii tiyya mara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:2">isa duratti dhangalaasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:2">rakkinna kiyyalle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:2">isa duratti himadha.<verse eid="PSA 142:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 142:3"/>Yennaa ani addii kutatiisa geyeeru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:3">gara ani ideemaaru ati hin beetta.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 142:3">Daandii ani irra ideemu keessa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:3">isaan fonxoroo naaf dhossaneeran.<verse eid="PSA 142:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 142:4"/>Adaala kiyya ilaalii dhaggi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:4">nami naaf yaadatu hin jiru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:4">addeen ani itti baqadhu hin jirtu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:4">nami tokkolle haajaa kiyya hin qabu.<verse eid="PSA 142:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 142:5"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:5">ani gara keeti iyya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:5">ani, «Ati ka ani itti baqadhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:5">lafa worra jiraata'aa tana keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:5">ati qooda kiyya» jedha.<verse eid="PSA 142:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 142:6"/>Ani waan qarqaarsa hin qanneef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:6">iyya tiyya naaf caqasi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:6">worri na miidhu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:6">guddoo waan natti jabaataneef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:6">ati isaan jalaa na baasi.<verse eid="PSA 142:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 142:7"/>Maqaa keeti akka leellifadhu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:7">hidhaa keessaa na baasi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 142:7">Ati waan dansaa waan naa gooteef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:7">worri balchaan na hin marsan.<verse eid="PSA 142:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 142"/>
  <chapter number="143" style="c" sid="PSA 143"/>
  <para style="s1">Diinota Jalaa Bayiisaaf Daadimata Dhikaate</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Daawitii</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 143:1"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:1">daadimata kiyya dhage'i;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:1">gurri keeti iyya tiyya caqasuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:1">addatamumma'aa fi balchummaa teetiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:1">deebii naaf kenni.<verse eid="PSA 143:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 143:2"/>Si duratti nami balchaan waan hin jirreef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:2">ana tajaajilaa keeti mura'atti hin dhikeessin.<verse eid="PSA 143:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 143:3"/>Diinni kiyya na ari'iisatti jira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:3">lafatti na butuchee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:3">akka worra bara dheera'aan dura du'ee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:3">dukkana keessa akka tee'u na godhe.<verse eid="PSA 143:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 143:4"/>Maarre ani addii kutatiisa geyeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:4">gadhaa kiyya keessatti sodaadheera.<verse eid="PSA 143:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 143:5"/>Waan bara durii te'e hin qaabadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:5">waan ati goote mara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:5">itti deddeebi'ee hin yaada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:5">waan harki keeti huje hin herrega.<verse eid="PSA 143:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 143:6"/>Ani harka kiyya gara keeti badhisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:6">akka lafa goddee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:6">lubbuun tiyya si dheebotti.<verse eid="PSA 143:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 143:7"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:7">ani addii kutatiisa geyeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:7">ariifadhuu deebii naa kenni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:7">yookiin ani akka worra</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:7">gara boollaa gad bu'uu hin te'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:7">fuula keeti na duraa hin dhoffatin.<verse eid="PSA 143:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 143:8"/>Ani waan si addadhuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:8">ganama ganama bari'iin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:8">jaalala keeti ka bara baraa natti lallabi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 143:8">Lubbuun tiyya gara keeti waan yaadduuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:8">karaa ani irra deemu'uu male na barsiisi.<verse eid="PSA 143:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 143:9"/>Ani gara keeti waan baqadheef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:9">Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:9">diinota kiyya jalaa na baasi.<verse eid="PSA 143:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 143:10"/>Ati Waaqa kiyya waan teeteef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:10">fedhii teeti akka muummessu na barsiisi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 143:10">Ayyaanni keeti dansaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:10">daandii qajeelaa irra na sooressuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 143:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 143:11"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:11">maqaa keetiif jedhiitii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:11">lubbuu tiyya jiraachisi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:11">balchummaa teetiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:11">rakkinna keessaa na baasi.<verse eid="PSA 143:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 143:12"/>Jaalala keeti ka bara baraatiin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:12">diinota kiyya fixi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:12">ani tajaajilaa keeti waan te'eef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:12">nyaaphota na rakkisu mara balleessi.<verse eid="PSA 143:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 143"/>
  <chapter number="144" style="c" sid="PSA 144"/>
  <para style="s1">Daadimata Injifacha'aaf Dhikaatte</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Daawitii</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 144:1"/>Rassaan kiyya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:1">ka harka kiyya lolaaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:1">quba kiyya woraanaaf leenjisu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:1">Mootiin Waan Maraa leellifamuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 144:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 144:2"/>Inni Waaqa kiyya ka nama jaalatu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:2">kushee tiyya jadduu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:2">dalleya dhaka'aa kiyyaa fi fayyisaa kiyya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:2">wontee tiyya ta ani itti baqadhu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:2">ka kolbaa tiyya hedduu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:2">na jalatti akka ajajantu godhu.<verse eid="PSA 144:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 144:3"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:3">akka ati isa kunuunsituuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:3">nami maan inni?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:3">Yookiin akka ati isaaf yaadattuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:3">ilmi namaa maan inni?<verse eid="PSA 144:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 144:4"/>Nami akka baafata hafuuraa tokkochaa ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:4">barri jiruu isaaniille</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:4">akka gaaddisa dabaruu ti.<verse eid="PSA 144:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 144:5"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:5">ol-gubbaa dayyaasii gad bu'i;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:5">akka aarri keessaa bayu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:5">gaarota tuqi.<verse eid="PSA 144:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 144:6"/>Balaqqeettii balaqqisiitii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:6">diinota bittinneessi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:6">daaya keeti darbadhuutii isaan ari'i.<verse eid="PSA 144:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 144:7"/>Gubbaa irraa harka keeti gad diriirsi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:7">bisaan guddaa keessaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:7">harka ormaatii na baasiitii na hamburi.<verse eid="PSA 144:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 144:8"/>Afaan isaanii soba dubbata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:8">harka middicha ol kaasanee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:8">dharaan kakatan.<verse eid="PSA 144:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 144:9"/>Ee Waaqa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:9">ani faaruu haareya si'iif hin faarsa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:9">kiraara guddicha ribuu kudhan qabu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:9">dhowataa si faarfadha.<verse eid="PSA 144:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 144:10"/>Ati moototaaf injifachaa kennita;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:10">tajaajilaa keeti Daawitille</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:10">shallaagaa ijjeesu jalaa hin hamburta.<verse eid="PSA 144:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 144:11"/>Na hamburi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:11">harka worra ormaa keessaa na baasi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:11">afaan isaanii soba dubbata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:11">harka middicha ol kaasanee dharaan kakatan.<verse eid="PSA 144:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 144:12"/>Ilmaan teenna dargaggummaa ifiitiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:12">akka biqiltuu guddinna toltee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:12">ijoolleen durraa teenna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:12">akka utubaa mana mootumma'aa seesiisaaf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:12">bocamee te'anuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 144:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 144:13"/>Gootaraan keenna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:13">midhaan adda addaatiin guutamuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:13">hooloti teenna kumootaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:13">kumoota kudhaniin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:13">diida keenna keessatti hortuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 144:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 144:14"/>Horiin keenna dodorrobuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:14">gadha'aa gatiisi, sadheessiisi hin jiraatin.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 144:14">Booji'amiis hin jiraatin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:14">karaa keenna irratti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:14">iyyi gaddaa hin jiraatin.<verse eid="PSA 144:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 144:15"/>Kolbaan eebbi akkasii te'eef gammadduu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:15">kolbaan Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:15">Waaqa isi'ii te'eef gammadduu ti.<verse eid="PSA 144:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 144"/>
  <chapter number="145" style="c" sid="PSA 145"/>
  <para style="s1">Leellisa Waaqa Mootichaaf Dhikaate</para>
  <para style="s2">Faaruu Daawitii.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 145:1"/>Ee Waaqa mootii kiyya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:1">ani si hin saadadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:1">bara baraa haga bara baraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:1">maqaa keeti hin leellifadha.<verse eid="PSA 145:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 145:2"/>Guyyuma guyya'aan si hin leellisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:2">bara baraa haga bara baraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:2">maqaa keeti hin saadadha.<verse eid="PSA 145:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 145:3"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa gudda'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:3">guddoo leellifamuu male;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:3">guddinni isaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:3">qorqoramee bira hin geyamu.<verse eid="PSA 145:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 145:4"/>Dhalooti tokko hujii teeti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:4">dhaloota itti aanutti jaja;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:4">hujii teeti ta maade'ee hin lassa.<verse eid="PSA 145:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 145:5"/>Isaan marroo ulfinna keeti arnya qabeessaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:5">hin dubbatan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:5">anille marroo hujii teeti ta baasaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:5">itti deddeebi'ee hin yaadadha.<verse eid="PSA 145:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 145:6"/>Isaan marroo hunna hujii teeti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:6">ta baasaa hin dubbatan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:6">anille guddinna keeti hin odeessa.<verse eid="PSA 145:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 145:7"/>Isaan marroo arjummaa teeti baca'aa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:7">hin jilifatan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:7">Balchummaa teetiifille ililleetti'iin faarsan.<verse eid="PSA 145:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 145:8"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa marara'a; arjaalle'e;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:8">aari'iif hin ariifattu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:8">jaalalli isaalle gudda'a.<verse eid="PSA 145:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 145:9"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa nama maraaf dansa'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:9">inni waan ifii dade mara hin marara.<verse eid="PSA 145:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 145:10"/>Ee Mootii Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:10">wonni ati dadde marti si hin leellifatti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:10">kolbaan teeti marti si hin saadatti.<verse eid="PSA 145:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 145:11"/>Isaan marroo ulfinna mootummaa teetii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:11">marroo hunna teetii hin dubbatan.<verse eid="PSA 145:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 145:12"/>Akka kanaan namooti marti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:12">hujii teeti ta baasaatii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:12">mootummaa teeti</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 145:12">arnya qabeettii ulfinnaa hin beekan.<verse eid="PSA 145:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 145:13"/>Mootummaan teeti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:13">mootummaa bara baraa ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:13">ati haga bara baraa hin bulchita.<verse eid="PSA 145:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 145:14"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:14">worra jigaaru mara hin utuba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:14">worra jigelle ol kaasa.<verse eid="PSA 145:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 145:15"/>Ilti nama maraa gara keeti ilaalti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:15">atille sagalee isaanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:15">yennaa maltetti isaanii kennita.<verse eid="PSA 145:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 145:16"/>Ati harka keeti diriirsitee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:16">halchaa waan lubbuu qabu maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:16">hin quussita.<verse eid="PSA 145:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 145:17"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:17">karaa hujii ifii maraan balcha'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:17">waan huju maraan addatama'a.<verse eid="PSA 145:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 145:18"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:18">worra isa waammatu maraaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:18">worra dhuga'aan isa waammatu maraaf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:18">dhikoo jira.<verse eid="PSA 145:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 145:19"/>Inni halchaa worra isa sodaatuu hin guuta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:19">iyya isaaniille dhage'ee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:19">isaan hin baasa.<verse eid="PSA 145:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 145:20"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:20">worra isa jaalatu mara hin eega;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:20">worra hamaaleyyii ammoo hin balleessa.<verse eid="PSA 145:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 145:21"/>Afaan kiyya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:21">leellisa Mootii Waan Maraa hin dubbata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:21">ka foon uffate martille</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:21">bara baraa haga bara baraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:21">maqaa isaa woyyicha hin leellisa.<verse eid="PSA 145:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 145"/>
  <chapter number="146" style="c" sid="PSA 146"/>
  <para style="s1">Waaqa Fayyisaa Leellisuu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 146:1"/>Mootii Waan Maraa leellisa'a!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:1">Ee lubbuu tiyya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:1">Mootii Waan Maraa leellisi!<verse eid="PSA 146:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 146:2"/>Ani bara le'ii tiyyaa mara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:2">Mootii Waan Maraa leellisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:2">haga jiru mara Waaqa kiyyaaf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:2">faaruu leellisaa hin faarfadha.<verse eid="PSA 146:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 146:3"/>Worra isin baasuu hin dandeenne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:3">qondaaltota ilmaan namaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:3">itti hin addatina'a!<verse eid="PSA 146:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 146:4"/>Isaan yennaa du'anu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:4">gara biyye'ee deebi'an;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:4">guyyuma san karoorri isaanii hin bada.<verse eid="PSA 146:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 146:5"/>Nami Waaqi Yaaqoobii qarqaarsa isaa te'e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:5">ka Mootii Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:5">Waaqa ifii addii godhatu gammaduu ti.<verse eid="PSA 146:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 146:6"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa ol-gubba'aa fi lafa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:6">abbaaya'aa fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:6">waan isaan keessa jiru mara dade;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:6">inni haga bara baraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:6">addatamummaa ifii hin eegata.<verse eid="PSA 146:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 146:7"/>Inni worra cunqurfameef</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:7">haqaan mura;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:7">worra beeloteef sagalee kenna.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 146:7">Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:7">worra hidhame bilisa baasee,<verse eid="PSA 146:7"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 146:8"/>worra ballaa ila bana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 146:8">Worra gad jedhe ol qaba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:8">worra balchaa jaalata.<verse eid="PSA 146:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 146:9"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa alagaa hin eega;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:9">inni ijoollee abba'aa fi haadha hin qannee fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:9">haadhotii hiyyeessaa hin qarqaara;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:9">karaa worra hama'aa ammoo hin balleessa.<verse eid="PSA 146:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 146:10"/>Ee Xiyoon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:10">Waaqi keeti Mootiin Waan Maraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:10">dhalootaa haga dhalootaatitti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:10">haga bara baraa hin bulcha.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 146:10"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 146:10">Mootii Waan Maraa leellisa'a.<verse eid="PSA 146:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 146"/>
  <chapter number="147" style="c" sid="PSA 147"/>
  <para style="s1">Leellisa Waaqa Waan Mara Dande'uuf Dhikaatu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 147:1"/>Mootii Waan Maraa leellisa'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:1">Waaqa keenna fuuru'uun leellisiis</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:1">attam attam dansa'a!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:1">Isa leellisiis nama gammachiisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:1">dansaalle'e.<verse eid="PSA 147:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 147:2"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:2">Yerusaalem deebisee hin ijaara;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:2">namoota Israa'elii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:2">ka bittinnowanelle deebisee hin fida.<verse eid="PSA 147:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 147:3"/>Inni worra gaddaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:3">gadhaan isaanii madaye hin fayyisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:3">madaa isaaniille hin hidha.<verse eid="PSA 147:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 147:4"/>Inni laakkossa urjootaa haga beeka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:4">mara isaaniituu maqaa isaaniitiin waama.<verse eid="PSA 147:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 147:5"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa keenna gudda'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:5">akka malee hunna qaba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:5">beekkumsi isaalle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:5">hagana hin jedhamu.<verse eid="PSA 147:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 147:6"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:6">worra gad ifi qabu ol hin qaba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:6">worra hamaaleyyii ammoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:6">lafatti jissa;<verse eid="PSA 147:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 147:7"/>Faaruu galataa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:7">Mootii Waan Maraatiif faarsa'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:7">kiraara guddichaan Waaqaaf faarsa'a.<verse eid="PSA 147:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 147:8"/>Inni ol-gubbaa duumensaan golla;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:8">lafaaf rooba kenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:8">koobota irratti marri akka latu godha.<verse eid="PSA 147:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 147:9"/>Inni hori'iif waan nyaatanu hin kenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:9">ilmooleen harraaqessaa yennaa iyyitu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:9">inni isaan hin soora.<verse eid="PSA 147:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 147:10"/>Inni jabeenna fardaatiin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:10">yookiin jabaanna rukkee miila namaatiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:10">hin gammadu.<verse eid="PSA 147:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 147:11"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa worra isa sodaatu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:11">jaalala isaa ka bara baraatitti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:11">addii godhatuun gammada.<verse eid="PSA 147:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 147:12"/>Ee Yerusaalem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:12">Mootii Waan Maraa leellifadhu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 147:12">Ee Xiyoon, Waaqa keeti saadadhu.<verse eid="PSA 147:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 147:13"/>Inni danqaraa karra teetii hin jabeessa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:13">kolbaa si keessatti hin eebbisa.<verse eid="PSA 147:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 147:14"/>Meessaa keeti nageya hin godha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:14">qamadii dansa'aan si hin quussa.<verse eid="PSA 147:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 147:15"/>Inni ajaja ifii gara lafaa hin erga;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:15">jechi isaa ariiti'iin hin muummowa.<verse eid="PSA 147:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 147:16"/>Inni dhakaa roobaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:16">akka fuutta'aa diriirsa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:16">qorra akka daadha'aa facaasa.<verse eid="PSA 147:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 147:17"/>Inni dhakaa roobaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:17">akka katta'aa godhee gad buusa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:17">qorra isaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:17">eentu dura dhaabbatuu dande'a?<verse eid="PSA 147:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 147:18"/>Inni jecha ifii hin erga;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:18">dhakaan roobaa sun hin baqa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:18">qilleensi akka dhufu hin godha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:18">dhakaan roobaa sunille</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:18">bisaan te'ee yaa'a.<verse eid="PSA 147:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 147:19"/>Inni jecha ifii sanyii Yaaqoobiititti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:19">seera ifiitii fi qajeelcha ifii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:19">Israa'elitti hin hima.<verse eid="PSA 147:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 147:20"/>Inni gosa biyya dhibi'iitiif</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:20">akkas hin goone;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:20">isaan seera isaa hin beekanu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 147:20"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 147:20">Mootii Waan Maraa leellisa'a.<verse eid="PSA 147:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 147"/>
  <chapter number="148" style="c" sid="PSA 148"/>
  <para style="s1">Dadi Marti Waaqa Leellisanuu Ti</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 148:1"/>Mootii Waan Maraa leellisa'a!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:1">Ol-gubbaa keessaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:1">Mootii Waan Maraa leellisa'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:1">gubbaa olii keessatti isa leellisa'a.<verse eid="PSA 148:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 148:2"/>Ergantooti isaa marti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:2">loltooti isaa ta ol-gubba'aa marti isa leellisa'a.<verse eid="PSA 148:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 148:3"/>Ji'aa fi aduun isa leellisa'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:3">isin urjooti ifa kennitanu marti isa leellisa'a.<verse eid="PSA 148:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 148:4"/>Isin ol-gubbaan ol gubbootaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:4">isin bisaan ol-gubba'aalle isa leellisa'a.<verse eid="PSA 148:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 148:5"/>Isaan ajaja isaatiin waan dadamaneef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:5">maqaa Mootii Waan Maraa leellisanuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 148:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 148:6"/>Inni haga bara baraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:6">addee isaaniititti jabeessee isaan dhaabe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:6">seera hin jijjiiranne isaanii kenne.<verse eid="PSA 148:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 148:7"/>Bineensoti gugurdaan abbaayaa guddittii keessaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:7">qileen abbaayaa gudditti'ii martinuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:7">lafa irraa Mootii Waan Maraa leellisa'a!<verse eid="PSA 148:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 148:8"/>Isin balaqqeetti'ii fi dhakaan roobaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:8">qorrii fi hurriin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:8">hobonbolattiin ajaja isaa muummessitanu,<verse eid="PSA 148:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 148:9"/>Gaarotii fi kooboti martinuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:9">mukooti midhaan buusuu fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:9">birbirsooti martinuu,<verse eid="PSA 148:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 148:10"/>bineensaa fi horiin martinuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:10">bineensoti lafa irra lootanuu fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:10">koolaan kaatanu martinuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:10">Mootii Waan Maraa leellisa'a.<verse eid="PSA 148:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 148:11"/>Moototi lafaatii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:11">gosi biyya adda addaa martinuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:11">qondaaltotii fi bulchitooti lafaa martinuu,<verse eid="PSA 148:11"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 148:12"/>dargaggeeyyiin dhiiraatii fi durraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:12">jaarsole'ee fi ijoolleen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:12">Mootii Waan Maraa leellisa'a!<verse eid="PSA 148:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 148:13"/>Maqaan isaa callaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:13">ka saadame waan te'eef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:13">ulfinni isaa lafaa fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:13">ol-gubbaa irra waan jiruuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:13">isaan maqaa Mootii Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:13">leellisanuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 148:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 148:14"/>Kolbaan isaa Israa'elooti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:14">worri isatti dhikaatanu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:14">addatantooti isaa akka isa leellisanu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:14">jabeenna isaaniif kenne.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 148:14"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 148:14">Mootii Waan Maraa leellisa'a.<verse eid="PSA 148:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 148"/>
  <chapter number="149" style="c" sid="PSA 149"/>
  <para style="s1">Faaruu Leellisaa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 149:1"/>Mootii Waan Maraa leellisa'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:1">faaruu haareya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:1">Mootii Waan Maraatiif faarsa'a!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:1">Wolde'a kolbaa isaa keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:1">isa leellisa'a.<verse eid="PSA 149:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 149:2"/>Israa'elooti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:2">ka isaan dadeen firinxiixanuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:2">ijoolleen Xiyoonii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:2">mootii ifiitiin gammadanuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 149:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 149:3"/>Shubbisaa maqaa isaa faarsanuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:3">dibbe'ee fi kiraara guddichaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:3">isaaf faarsanuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 149:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 149:4"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:4">kolbaa ifiitiin waan gammaduuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:4">worra gad ifi qabu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:4">akka injifatanu godhee ulfinna kennaaf.<verse eid="PSA 149:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 149:5"/>Kolbaan isaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:5">ulfinna kanaan firinxiixanuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:5">taqee ifii irralle'etti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:5">ililleetti'iin faarfatanuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 149:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 149:6"/>Leellisi Waaqaa afaan isaanii keessa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:6">shallaagaan qara lamaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:6">harka isaanii keessa jiraatuu ti.<verse eid="PSA 149:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 149:7"/>Gosa biyya adda addaa haluu bayiisaaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:7">kolbaa hedduulle adabiisaaf,<verse eid="PSA 149:7"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 149:8"/>mootota isaanii wodaroo sibiilaatiin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:8">qondaaltota isaaniille,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:8">sibiila miilaan hidhanuun hidhiisaaf,<verse eid="PSA 149:8"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 149:9"/>muraa barreeffanteertu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:9">isaan irratti muunmmessiisaaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:9">tun kolbaa isaaf addatante maraaf ulfinna.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:9">Mootii Waan Maraa leellisa'a.<verse eid="PSA 149:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 149"/>
  <chapter number="150" style="c" sid="PSA 150"/>
  <para style="s1">Mootii Waan Maraa Leellisa'a</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 150:1"/>Mootii Waan Maraa leellisa'a!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 150:1"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 150:1">Addee Woyyittii isaa keessatti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 150:1">Waaqa leellisa'a!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 150:1">Ol-gubbaa isaa hunnaamettii keessatti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 150:1">isa leellisa'a!<verse eid="PSA 150:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 150:2"/>Hujii jadduu inni godheef isa leellisa'a.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 150:2">Guddinna isaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 150:2">ka waan mara caaluuf isa leellisa'a.<verse eid="PSA 150:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 150:3"/>Tultulla'aan isa leellisa'a.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 150:3">Kiraara guddichaa fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 150:3">maseenqo'oon isa leellisa'a.<verse eid="PSA 150:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 150:4"/>Dibbe'ee fi shubbisiisaan isa leellisa'a.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 150:4">Kiraaraa fi suusulle'een isa leellisa'a.<verse eid="PSA 150:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 150:5"/>Sibiila wolitti dhowamee qilillisuun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 150:5">isa leellisa'a.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 150:5">Sibiila wolitti dhowamee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 150:5">akka malee qilillisuun isa leellisa'a.<verse eid="PSA 150:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 150:6"/>Wonni hafuura baafatu martinuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 150:6">Mootii Waan Maraa leellisanuu ti!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 150:6"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 150:6">Mootii Waan Maraa leellisa'a!<verse eid="PSA 150:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 150"/>
</usx>
